window.FWN_ALCHEMY_EMPEROR_HEAD_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_ALCHEMY_EMPEROR_HEAD_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":2101,"title":"Chapter 2101: Attacking and Plundering the Monarch","paragraphs":["Chapter 2101: Attacking and Plundering the Monarch","Alliance Base","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","However, unlike others, Chu Yunfan only sneered when he saw the wealth. It was much less than he had expected. However, after thinking about it, it made sense. The encampment here was only used to provide resources for the","Destiny Sect’s prodigies in the central and core regions of the Prodigy Battlefield. Every once in a while, the wealth would be transferred. It was already quite good to have so much.","Chu Yunfan, whose eyes were like torches, had scanned all the wealth in just a moment. In particular, many of the medicinal herbs, heavenly and earthly treasures, divine materials, and so on were almost invisible to the outside world. Only by growing in an environment like the Prodigy Battlefield could it be brewed.","This was the fundamental reason why many ordinary prodigies would enter the Prodigy Battlefield. If there weren’t any benefits, just the path to godhood alone wouldn’t be enough to make these geniuses come.","There were only a few geniuses who could wander the core region. Most of the prodigies did not have such strength, or rather, they did not have such strength for the time being. However, there were still many good things that could be obtained in the outer region of the Prodigy Battlefield.","Other than the two million high-grade spirit stones, the other herbs and treasures added together were worth no less than a million high-grade spirit stones. In total, Chu Yunfan had robbed three million high-grade spirit stones.","“Not bad, but it’s not enough!” Chu Yunfan sneered.","Many of the spectators almost dropped their jaws when they heard this. Even for Minor Arcanes, this amount of wealth was something that they might not even be able to possess in their entire lives. Many Minor Arcanes were drooling at the sight of this, but it wasn’t enough for Chu Yunfan? How greedy was he?","However, they didn’t know that although this wealth was indeed a lot for Chu","Yunfan, it was far from enough for his cultivation. If he wanted to catch up to Jun Tianci in a short time and possess the strength to fight against Jun Tianci or even surpass him, there was only one way, and that was to rely on the godhead in his mind.","The amount of high-grade spirit stones needed to activate and operate the godhead was extremely shocking. This two million high-grade spirit stones was really not enough for him to do anything.","However, it should be enough for him to break through to Middle Arcana Stage. He had only broken through to the Minor Arcana Stage not too long ago, yet he had already done so. It was enough to prove how amazing his cultivation speed was. However, all of this was accumulated by various kinds of wealth. Basically, it was the effect that could only be obtained by burning spirit stones.","“It just so happens that the Monarch Alliance is also stationed in this city.” Chu Yunfan grinned.","The Monarch Alliance was split from the Destiny Alliance. Although it almost caused a civil war, after the Destiny Alliance tacitly agreed to the division of the Monarch Alliance, the two sides didn’t have any major conflicts. On the contrary, they chose to stay in the same city to take care of each other. It could be seen that although the two alliances seemed to have broken off, they were still connected.","Many people almost fainted when they heard Chu Yunfan’s words. Chu Yunfan was complaining that the wealth he had robbed from the Destiny Alliance wasn’t enough, and he was actually targeting the Monarch Alliance.","“Could it be that he has a grudge against someone from the Destiny Sect?” someone wondered aloud.","Everyone knew that the Monarch Alliance and the Destiny Alliance had an ambiguous relationship of both confrontation and cooperation. Chu Yunfan first robbed the Destiny Alliance and then targeted the Monarch Alliance. Many people looked at him and wondered if he had a grudge against someone in the Destiny Sect.","At this time, Chu Yunfan had just come to the battlefield not long ago. Many people still did not know what Chu Yunfan’s background was. Naturally, they were guessing many things. However, as Chu Yunfan was leisurely walking on the way to the Monarch Alliance’s encampment, the experts of the city learned of him through those who attended Lan Hao’s gathering.","A lot of information about Chu Yunfan fell into their hands. It was only now that they truly understood that Jian Wuchen seemed to have jumped out from a crack in a rock. When he first appeared, he had saved Chu Hongcai in","Zhongzhou City in the Central Plains and killed many Arcanes, including Li Yuanjia, the prodigy of the Destiny Sect. He had become famous throughout the Central Plains in one battle, but it had only been a short time, so news of it had not spread to the prodigies in the battlefield.","From the many clues, it was not difficult to guess that Chu Yunfan did not have a grudge against anyone in the Destiny Sect, but against Jun Tianci. Although Jun Tianci had established his own Monarch Alliance and parted ways with the Destiny Alliance, he was still a disciple of the Destiny Sect. Therefore, Chu Yunfan dealt with the two of them.","“Middle Arcane battle strength?” Someone looked at the information he had just received from Lan Hao’s gathering and could not help but gasp.","No wonder Cao Hongyi, who possessed the Golden Titan bloodline, was completely no match for Chu Yunfan. Cao Hongyi was a Minor Arcane. Although he could be considered a minor expert, he was still far from enough to face Chu Yunfan, who clearly had the battle prowess of a Major Arcane.","“The Monarch Alliance is in trouble now!” someone gloated.","There were many people in the city who didn’t like Jun Tianci.","“l don’t think so. The person in charge of the Destiny Alliance went to search for treasures and is not in the encampment. However, the person in the","Monarch Alliance is here.” Someone immediately raised a different opinion.","There was a person in charge in the outer regions of the Prodigy Battlefield. In their opinion, Chu Yunfan was able to succeed in the Destiny Alliance because no one expected someone would dare to attack the Destiny Alliance and was not afraid of the Destiny Alliance’s revenge. Whether it was the prestige of the Destiny Sect or the prestige of the Destiny Alliance, even if many people weren’t happy, they still had to be wary of them.","“A battle between two Middle Arcanes. This is going to be interesting!’","Many people were secretly looking forward to this clash. It was rare for a Middle Arcane to personally take action in the outer regions of the Prodigy Battlefield.","While everyone was discussing, Chu Yunfan had already arrived at the Monarch Alliance’s encampment. It was on a mountain peak in the city. The peak was like a sword that soared into the sky and slashed at the sky. It looked incomparably sharp.","Chu Yunfan didn’t speed up his pace. When he arrived, the entire Monarch Alliance had already received the news and were on guard against a formidable enemy.","In an instant, more than a dozen figures flew into the air and formed an array to block Chu Yunfan. Similar to the ones he had encountered in the Destiny Alliance’s encampment, these figures were all outstanding figures among the locals.","However, at this moment, their expressions were extremely cold. This seemingly ordinary fellow in front of them was a truly terrifying monster.."]},{"number":2102,"title":"Chapter 2102: Isn’t He Too Strong?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2102: Isn’t He Too Strong?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","With the strength of the experts in the city, it was naturally very fast to transmit information. While Chu Yunfan was still on his way, the news of him robbing the Destiny Alliance spread throughout the entire Monarch Alliance.","At the same time, the feud between Chu Yunfan and the Destiny Sect was also spread. After hearing about Chu Yunfan’s brilliant battle achievements, these local experts were secretly shocked. Although they grew up in the Prodigy Battlefield, it didn’t mean that they didn’t know about the Destiny Sect.","On the contrary, in the past, whenever the Prodigy Battlefield opened, many prodigies from the Destiny Sect entered. Some of these natives had been subdued by this generation to become followers, while some of their ancestors had already been subdued by these prodigies to become followers.","They knew how terrifying the Destiny Sect was. It was one of the top and most terrifying forces in the world. Just the prodigies of the past generations of the Destiny Sect had left an extremely deep impression on them.","The Destiny Alliance had a huge influence in the Prodigy Battlefield. The Destiny Sect had accumulated many prodigies over the years, and in addition, the affiliated forces and prodigy had subdued the locals and their descendants in the Prodigy Battlefield over the years. It could be said that the Destiny Alliance’s influence in the Prodigy Battlefield was rather huge. However, compared to the Destiny Sect’s influence outside, it was not even worth mentioning.","Jian Wuchen had dared to challenge the Destiny Sect outside and was still alive. This was a silent proof. However, no one knew why Chu Yunfan challenged the Destiny Sect. To them, this was undoubtedly a huge test.","The Monarch Alliance and the Destiny Alliance seemed to have parted ways, but in reality, they were still a family. Chu Yunfan had looted the Destiny Alliance’s base, so how could the Monarch Alliance let him off so easily?","Just as they had expected, Chu Yunfan had come, and he had appeared so brazenly.","“Kill him!” a loud shout came from the depths of the Monarch Alliance.","Immediately after, the local experts all attacked at the same time. A terrifying torrent of martial arts swept toward Chu Yunfan at an astonishing speed. With such a formation, they would not be afraid even if they faced a Middle Arcane.","However, what the experts in the city who followed closely behind did not expect was that Chu Yun was too powerful. In the face of these martial arts torrents that swept over, he only took a step. Immediately, countless thunderbolts turned into a huge lightning dragon around him. The lightning dragon surrounded him, and all the attacks turned into nothingness when they landed on his attack.","On the contrary, the local experts suffered a backlash, and they all coughed up blood and retreated frantically. The experts in the city who followed closely behind were dumbfounded. Was this Jian Wuchen a monster? This was one man against a thousand soldiers. It seemed that at Chu Yunfan’s level, it didn’t","matter how many people there were.","Before anyone could react, Chu Yunfan had already moved. He raised one of his arms high and countless lightning powers gathered in his hand. At this moment, he was like a god of thunder. In the next moment, the power of lightning transformed into countless spears that swept across the sky like a storm. Whether those local experts reacted or not, they were all no match for him and were directly nailed to the ground.","Boom!","The ground of the entire encampment was blasted into a mess. It was extremely terrifying. The blood of these experts flowed into the ground through the cracks. In an instant, they were wiped out.","“How terrifying! He’s way too strong! Is he really a Minor Arcane? It seems that in terms of battle prowess, even a Middle Arcane can’t match him!”","Many people looked at Chu Yunfan as if they had seen a ghost. Chu Yunfan was too powerful. Even the prodigies in ancient times did not have such strength. No wonder Chu Yunfan dared to attack them. He didn’t care about the Monarch Alliance or the Destiny Alliance. As expected, he had his own confidence.","“How dare you!” A figure flew out from the depths of the Monarch Alliance.","This person had a pair of wings on his back. He looked like a god. Chu Yunfan took a closer look and realized that it was a young man who looked about 27 or 28 years old. His face was ordinary, but his body carried a kind of power that was not angry.","At this moment, the young man was staring at Chu Yunfan as if he was looking at a dead man. Chu Yunfan had annihilated the local experts of the Monarch Alliance, which had completely angered him and forced him to come out.","“Who are you? How dare you do this!” The man looked at Chu Yunfan coldly.","“You don’t need to know!” Chu Yunfan sneered. “You’ll be a dead man soon anyway!’","When the young man heard Chu Yunfan’s words, he was instantly furious. Chu Yunfan simply had no respect for him. As the person in charge of the Monarch Alliance’s external affairs, he naturally had his strength and pride.","“Since you’ve offended the Destiny Sect, there’s no place for you in the world. No matter who you are, you’re dead!” the young man said with a dark expression.","Naturally, he had also obtained some information about Chu Yunfan, but he was still confused. This enemy seemed to have jumped out of the crack of a rock. He wasn’t even on the Prodigy List recorded in the Destiny Sect. However, he knew one thing. No matter who this person was, he couldn’t be allowed to live. He was a scourge.","“Isn’t he Lu Yuan from the Destiny Sect? I remember him. He has appeared on","the prodigy battlefield a few times, but he was active more than a thousand years ago. I didn’t expect to see him here.”","Some of the local experts suddenly remembered something and recognized this prodigy of the Destiny Sect. Many people knew that this invincible prodigy of the Destiny Sect had once suppressed the prodigies of an era and was one of the top few on the Prodigy List.","Although he was only in the top few and not the top, there were so many cultivators in each generation. Being able to stand out from the crowd and become one of the top few already proved Lu Yuan’s talent and strength. He was definitely a rare existence in the world.","“Cut the crap!” Chu Yunfan looked at Lu Yuan with a cold smile and couldn’t be bothered to talk nonsense with Lu Yuan.","Just as he finished speaking, Lu Yuan launched an attack.."]},{"number":2103,"title":"Chapter 2103: Can’t Do Anything to You? Who Said That?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2103: Can’t Do Anything to You? Who Said That?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Although Lu Yuan was very contemptuous of Chu Yunfan verbally, when he really attacked, he used his full strength. After all, although he was arrogant, he wasn’t stupid. Chu Yunfan had killed many experts on his way here. He was not an ordinary person.","In the blink of an eye, Lu Yuan disappeared. All of this took a long time to describe, but in reality, it had only happened in an instant!","Quick, quick, quick!","Lu Yuan’s speed was too fast. In the next moment, he had already appeared behind Chu Yunfan. In fact, before most people could react, he had already arrived behind Chu Yunfan.","On his back, a pair of wings formed by seven-colored flowing light was the source of all his speed. This wasn’t even a divine ability of the Destiny Sect. It was the inheritance of an ancient expert that he had obtained in a cave and cultivated with great difficulty.","Relying on this pair of wings, he possessed an astonishing speed that ordinary people could not imagine. Even ordinary prodigies who were on par with him were not his match in terms of speed. Just by relying on this astonishing speed, he was already in an invincible position.","“Die! Destiny Saber!”","Lu Yuan shot out a saber beam. What he executed was the supreme technique of the Destiny Sect, the Destiny Saber. Every saber slash was capable of tearing apart fate. The power of this slash reminded Chu Yunfan of Jun Tianci from more than ten years ago. At that time, Jun Tianci’s strength was only on par with Lu Yuan’s current strength. At that time, Chu Yunfan had no way to fight back against Jun Tianci’s attack. But now, everything was different.","Bam!","The Destiny Saber slashed down, but when it reached Chu Yunfan, it could no longer advance an inch. It was as if a mysterious force had blocked the stunning slash of the Destiny Saber. Only then did everyone see that a lightning dragon had appeared around Chu Yunfan. It was this lightning dragon that had appeared just now and blocked this stunning blade.","“How is this possible?” Lu Yuan’s eyes widened. It was fine if this saber attack failed to kill Chu Yunfan, but it should have at least heavily injured him.","But it failed to even break through the defense of the lightning dragon around Chu Yunfan. When his saber light hit the lightning dragon, it only left a faint white mark on its scales. In the next second, the saber light disappeared without a trace.","“What kind of defensive ability is this?” His eyes almost popped out of their sockets, and he was extremely shocked.","He was an ancient prodigy who had been active for more than a thousand years. It could be said that he was knowledgeable and had witnessed the vicissitudes of the world as time passed.","Although he was sealed most of the time and did not know the passage of time, this capital allowed him to have a deeper foundation than the current generation’s prodigies. He was knowledgeable and had seen all kinds of prodigies. He had even seen many ancient prodigies from a long time ago.","However, he had never met someone like Chu Yunfan who had an extremely terrifying defensive divine power. Even with his full-strength saber, he could not break the dragon’s scales. Those were not real dragon scales. They were merely things evolved from the power of lightning.","“Destiny Saber? That’s nothing.” Chu Yunfan casually punched out, and the fist force swept toward Lu Yuan.","Lu Yuan, on the other hand, flapped the wings on his back at the critical moment and disappeared without a trace, In the next moment, he appeared on Chu Yunfan’s right. This time, he slapped down directly. When this palm landed, the sky collapsed and the earth cracked. The air trembled violently. Everyone could even see that space itself began to tremble.","Bam!","However, the result was no different from the Destiny Saber. Chu Yunfan didn’t even dodge and let the palm hit him. However, this palm was no different. It could not destroy the lightning dragon around Chu Yunfan. It could only leave a shallow mark on the lightning dragon’s body.","This rendered all of Lu Yuan’s attacks useless. In the next moment, Lu Yuan disappeared from his spot again and Chu Yunfan’s follow up attack failed. Everyone’s eyes lit up as they watched this scene. The battle between the two had a huge significance for them to learn from.","The cultivators in the world today were all about being invincible, as long as they were fast. And these two people were people who had displayed these two key techniques to the extreme.","Chu Yunfan’s defensive divine power was terrifyingly powerful. No matter how Lu Yuan attacked, he couldn’t do anything to Chu Yunfan. On the other hand, Lu Yuan’s speed was too fast. Even if he couldn’t do anything to Chu Yunfan, he could still confidently dodge Chu Yunfan’s attack. Both sides had their own strengths and weaknesses, which was why they could not do anything to each other.","“If this goes on, a great battle for three days and three nights is unavoidable!”","“Three days and three nights? I don’t believe it. If Jian Wuchen can’t do anything to Lu Yuan, he has no other choice but to escape!’","“That’s right. Time is on Lu Yuan’s side. As time passes, the experts of the Monarch Alliance will come after receiving the information. At that time, it will be Jian Wuchen’s death. Chu Yunfan doesn’t have a background. When that time comes, he’ll be exhausted to death,” someone analyzed.","However, everyone agreed with his judgment. In comparison, Chu Yunfan’s foundation was too thin. At this time, the foundation of the Monarch Alliance was only the tip of the iceberg.","“Jian Wuchen, you can’t do anything to me today. If you don’t retreat, today will be the day you die!” Lu Yuan shouted. He was helpless against Chu Yunfan, but he didn’t want to continue fighting with him. He just wanted to force him away.","“Can’t do anything to you? Who said that?” Chu Yunfan chuckled.","“l said...” Before Lu Yuan could react, he saw Chu Yunfan’s fist arrive before him.","The endless power of thunder transformed into a long dragon of thunder that wrapped around Chu Yunfan!s fist. When this punch was thrown, the roar of this long dragon of thunder filled the world.","The light covered everything, turning everything else into a complete joke.","“When?”","Before Lu Yuan could react, he didn’t know when Chu Yunfan’s speed had suddenly increased by a lot. It was completely different from before.","Bam!","This punch landed on Lu Yuan, causing him to cough up blood and retreat. Only then did everyone realize that his chest had caved in and was almost pierced through by Chu Yunfan’s punch.."]},{"number":2104,"title":"Chapter 2104: Plundering Everything and Leaving","paragraphs":["Chapter 2104: Plundering Everything and Leaving","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Spurt!","Lu Yuan coughed up blood and retreated continuously. His eyes were filled with disbelief. The intense pain made his entire body tremble, and the expression on his face was completely distorted. An emotion called fear rose in his heart.","At this moment, he realized for the first time that death was so close to him. He thought that no matter how powerful Chu Yunfan was, he would at most be on par with him. owever, the truth was far beyond his imagination. He couldn’t even block Chu Yunfan’s punch.","With his strength, although he had sealed himself for many years, he was still confident that if he walked out, he would definitely be an expert. With his talent, given 20 years, he was confident that he could approach the top of the world. If his talent was not outstanding enough, he would not have been chosen to be sealed for the future.","Every seal required an astonishing amount of resources and wealth.","Otherwise, there was no way to save him for the future. If it wasn’t for the fact that Lu Yuan was sure that he had enough talent to compete on the path to becoming a god in the future, he wouldn’t have been able to stay.","He was a prodigy who suppressed an era. Almost all the prodigies of his era were defeated by him. There were only a few who could stand shoulder to shoulder with him.","Therefore, Lu Yuan was originally very confident. Even if he was temporarily inferior to the strongest people, he felt that this was only a matter of time. His cultivation period was shorter than theirs. He was confident that he would not lose to anyone if given time.","However, his confidence was now mercilessly beaten by Chu Yunfan. That’s right, he was completely beaten up. He was no match for Chu Yunfan. After his confidence collapsed, fear appeared in his eyes.","Chu Yunfan had not been serious with him before. He was just teasing him. After he really erupted with his strength, he instantly beat him up. In other words, it was all a joke.","Chu Yunfan looked at Lu Yuan and said indifferently, “You disappoint me. You’re not half as good as Jun Tianci.”","Chu Yunfan’s expression turned cold. From the very beginning, he had the intention to test Lu Yuan. This Lu Yuan’s cultivation realm was similar to Jun Tianci’s from more than ten years ago. However, in terms of combat strength, he was probably not comparable to Jun Tianci from back then.","This made Chu Yunfan’s plan to use Lu Yuan to deduce Jun Tianci’s strength go bankrupt. Although both of them came from the Destiny Sect, they were clearly completely different.","However, this also confirmed one thing. Even on the battlefield where prodigies were as numerous as weed, Jun Tianci’s talent should be among the strongest. It was obvious that there was a huge gap between him and a prodigy like Jun Tianci.","Of course, it was impossible for all 100,000 prodigies to be the same. In fact, the difference in talent between prodigies was obvious. As the difference in age increased, the difference also widened. Of course, Lu Yuan’s strength was not inferior to Li Qianyuan’s in the outside world, but that was all.","It was only enough to suppress a generation of prodigies. Clearly, those top geniuses could not only suppress a generation of prodigies.","“Do you think you’re very fast?” As soon as Chu Yunfan finished speaking, in the next moment, he had already pounced in front of Lu Yuan and slapped him.","Bam!","Lu Yuan was sent flying, and his head almost exploded. Compared to the current Chu Yunfan, his strength was still much weaker. They were existences on completely different levels.","Everyone in the city couldn’t help but suck in a breath of cold air. Regardless of whether they saw Chu Yunfan’s actions or not, they had to admit that Chu Yunfan was fast. It was even faster than Lu Yuan’s stunning speed earlier.","This meant that Lu Yuan’s only strength that could compete with Chu Yunfan was now gone. Lu Yuan, who didn’t have anything to rely on, had no chance of winning against Chu Yunfan. He was a character that could be killed with a single slap.","“If you kill me, the Destiny Sect won’t let you off!” Lu Yuan roared angrily.","He coughed up fresh blood and looked extremely miserable. He didn’t look like the person in charge of the Destiny Alliance in the Prodigy Battlefield outer region at all. He looked more like a stray dog.","“Just in time. I want to talk to them too!” Chu Yunfan laughed coldly. With a wave of his hand, a blue thunderbolt shattered the sky and hit Lu Yuan, shattering his entire head.","Lu Yuan was dead!","Chu Yunfan put Lu Yuan’s corpse away and began to sweep through the inventory in the base. At this moment, how could the natives dare to stay?","They all fled.","After a round of plundering, Chu Yunfan successfully took all the wealth. Just the high-grade spirit stones alone had already exceeded three million. There were also countless other precious medicinal herbs and various precious natural treasures.","“It’s enough for me to take another step forward!” Chu Yunfan looked at the many resources he had. It was enough for him to advance further.","Then, he stepped on the light and disappeared in the sky. The experts in the city finally heaved a sigh of relief. The pressure Chu Yunfan gave them was so strong that they almost couldn’t breathe.","Especially after Chu Yunfan beat up Lu Yuan and killed him, they felt an unprecedented threat. All kinds of battles were happening all the time in the Prodigy Battlefield, but none of them could compare to the battle where Chu Yunfan had robbed the two alliances today.","He became famous in one battle!","The news of Chu Yunfan looting the Destiny Alliance and the Monarch Alliance’s base spread like wildfire. When Lan Hao, Yang Dengxian, and the others, who had just wrapped up their gathering, heard the news, their eyes widened in disbelief.","Chu Yunfan’s actions were swift, decisive, and ruthless. They only had a short meeting, but Chu Yunfan had already robbed two alliances. What shocked them even more was Chu Yunfan’s courage. He was simply audacious.","The two alliances, regardless of which alliance it was, could be said to have extremely huge factions on the Prodigy Battlefield. Just the fact that he dared to attack was enough to shock everyone, let alone robbing them.","Everyone could imagine how furious the two alliances would be when they heard the news. At that time, they would definitely not let Chu Yunfan off. But at this time, they remembered that the two alliances would never let Chu Yunfan off anyway.."]},{"number":2105,"title":"Chapter 2105: That’s a Legend","paragraphs":["Chapter 2105: That’s a Legend","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Since they were mortal enemies, there was no need to be afraid.","“How audacious. His arrival will probably set off a storm in the Prodigy","Battlefield.” Yang Dengxian sighed. There was even a hint of envy in his tone.","After all, he was a prodigy as well. To be able to enter the Prodigy Battlefield and reach the Minor Arcana Stage, he was definitely not an ordinary person. Other than Chu Yunfan, who defied the heavens, he was already the limit that ordinary prodigies could reach.","With his age, such a cultivation was definitely not embarrassing. If he was willing to seal himself, the next time he entered the Prodigy Battlefield, he would probably become a relatively high-ranked existence among the many prodigies.","This was because there were always veteran prodigies who were unable to enter because their age exceeded the limit of the Prodigy Battlefield. There were always new prodigies who joined. The Prodigy Battlefield was in such a constant cycle, tempering these prodigies.","However, Yang Dengxian was destined not to be as reckless as Jian Wuchen because he had the Flying Celestials behind him. It was impossible for him to choose to seal himself. Therefore, this might be his only chance to enter the","Prodigy Battlefield. He would be the next sect master of the Flying Celestials. This was already decided internally.","The only person who could shake his position was Chu Yunfan, who was extremely talented back then. However, Chu Yunfan had disappeared for so long, and no one knew if he was dead or alive. Therefore, no one could shake his position, not even Chu Hongcai, the current number one on the Prodigy List. The gap between the two had already widened to a certain extent.","It was precisely because of this that he could not act so recklessly. With his status, if he targeted the Destiny Sect like this, it would involve the battle between the two giants, the Flying Celestials and the Destiny Sect.","“I don’t know why, but I have the same feeling!” Lan Hao nodded.","He naturally understood Yang Dengxian’s thoughts because he was the same. He could not be free and could not transcend. He had sealed himself from a thousand years ago to the present to open the path to becoming a god. For this reason, he had given up his family and friends a thousand years ago and sealed himself until now.","Those who were once beneath him were now among the strongest in the world. Some of them were already old. No one could resist the erosion of time, except for a god.","“However, this is also our chance. Destiny Sect is so powerful that it’s a huge threat to the Flying Celestials. Now that Jian Wuchen has made a move, he can help us get rid of our biggest threat,” Yang Dengxian said.","“However, after that, the Destiny Sect will definitely not let it go. At that time, they will definitely send experts to pursue us. It might even affect our Flying Celestial Alliance. I hope you will take charge, Brother Lan.”","Lan Hao nodded. Of course, he understood that if the Destiny Sect went crazy and did not recognize their relatives, the Flying Celestial Alliance might become the target.","Lan Hao paused for a moment and then said, “I heard that Jian Wuchen has a grudge against Jun Tianci, so he has repeatedly attacked the Destiny Sect. I’m a little interested in Jun Tianci. To be able to produce such a figure in the current world, Jian Wuchen is already considered to be an amazing talent. In our era, he would be a top figure. It would not be a problem for him to suppress several eras, but he seems to be below Jun Tianci. What kind of person is he?”","Lan Hao’s face was filled with interest. To these prodigies, there was also a difference in strength between them. To ordinary people, a person who could suppress an era was already an unimaginable genius. He was a legendary figure who stood out from countless living beings.","However, this was only ordinary in the Prodigy Battlefield. There were some who could suppress not just one era, but several. Every time they woke up from the seal, they would suppress all the prodigies of that era. Such people were the top figures among the prodigies.","Lan Hao said that Jian Wuchen could suppress several eras. This was a","supreme evaluation in itself because even he could not suppress several eras because there would be geniuses born in every era.","All sorts of king-level physiques were not rare. Suppressing several eras was easier said than done. It wasn’t news that all kinds of ancient prodigies were overturned by the current generation’s proeifies. Jun Tianci, who was called an ancient and unpresentable figure, was one of the best and representative figures.","“That’s a legend!” Yang Dengxian’s expression was extremely grave, He had thought that he was one step closer to Jun Tianci in terms of power after stepping into the Minor Arcana Stage.","However, after he had truly cultivated to this point, he truly understood that the gap between him and Jun Tianci had not been reduced. Instead, it had widened. Even if he had cultivated to the Minor Arcana Stage, he still had no chance of winning against Jun Tianci.","Jun Tianci had arrived in the Prodigy Battlefield a few years earlier than him. According to the estimations of the Flying Celestial Alliance, his current cultivation state was close to that of a Major Arcane.","When Yang Dengxian thought of the difference in strength, even he could not help but feel a sense of powerlessness. It was a tragedy to be in the same era as such a person.","Among his peers, there might be someone who could compete with him. Unfortunately, he had disappeared more than ten years ago. It was more likely that he had fallen.","“However, no matter how strong Jun Tianci is, the Flying Celestial Alliance is not to be trifled with. Didn’t that person seal himself up until now? Jun Tianci is still not his match.’","Lan Hao’s eyes sparkled. He thought of a person who could make the Flying Celestials confident that they could fight against Jun Tianci. That person was the most outstanding genius in the history of the Flying Celestials and was known as someone who had a chance of becoming a god.","Yang Dengxian nodded. Of course, he knew who Lan Hao was talking about. He was the chief disciple of the Flying Celestials, so he knew more than ordinary people. It was a person who could only be looked up to just by hearing about his deeds.","“In today’s world, the prodigies are rampant. It’s definitely not an era where one person can be invincible. We have to work hard too. We definitely can’t fall behind them,” Lan Hao said with a smile.","Especially him. Otherwise, what was the point of him sealing himself to this era?","In less than half a day, this news spread throughout the entire city and the entire Prodigy Battlefield. For a time, the entire battlefield knew that the two giants, the Destiny Alliance and the Monarch Alliance, had been provoked and even their bases had been looted. All the wealth that they had collected for a long time had been plundered.","It was said that the higher-ups of the Destiny Sect and Jun Tianci, the leader of the Monarch Alliance, were furious. In just a moment, these two giants took action.","That night, when night fell, the experts sent by these two behemoths arrived in the city.."]},{"number":2106,"title":"Chapter 2106: Investigating","paragraphs":["Chapter 2106: Investigating","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","As night fell, the city was once again filled with endless Yin energy. In the city, due to the protection of the barriers, the Yin energy could not invade the city. However, in the sky outside the city, more and more hero spirits of experts condensed in the air.","However, the experts in the city became excited. Many people came to the side of the city wall and began to attack these hero spirits. After destroying these hero spirits, they absorbed the Yin energy that formed these hero spirits into their body.","Just as Chu Yunfan had guessed, these geniuses who had entered the battlefield many times already knew about this matter. Therefore, they were not afraid of the hero spirits condensed after night fell.","If they encountered these hero spirits in the wild, they would probably die. They would be dragged down by these hero spirits. However, now that they had the support of the city, they could return to the city to recuperate if they could not hold on. Therefore, these hero spirits were no longer terrifying existences to them. Instead, they became a shortcut to increase their strength.","However, there were still many people who started to pay attention to the experts from the Destiny Alliance and Monarch Alliance. This matter spread to the core region of the Prodigy Battlefield as quickly as possible. It could be said to have shocked these two alliances.","Especially since the other party clearly didn’t put the two alliances in his eyes. On the contrary, he provoked the two alliances and even killed the top geniuses of the two alliances.","Any one of these prodigies could suppress an era. They had spent countless resources to seal and reach this era, but now, they had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands. It could be said that the death of one of them was enough to make the entire Destiny Sect feel extremely distressed.","“This time, the Destiny Alliance and the Monarch Alliance have sent many experts. However, I never expected that the leader would be Star Shatter!” Someone saw the figure that flashed past and recognized it.","“It’s actually him. Even he’s moving out? He’s a general in the Monarch Alliance. It was said that he was one of the best among the local geniuses. Later, he was subdued by Jun Tianci and became a general in charge of a region under the Monarch Alliance.”","“That’s right! I didn’t expect him to come here personally either! I heard that he had already broken through to the Middle Arcana Stage a long time ago, and he’s even close to reaching the Major Arcana Stage now! He’s been helping Jun Tianci out in the core region of the battlefield all this while! This time, even he’s been alerted! This is too scary!’","“He’s a killing god. The Monarch Alliance won’t let Jian Wuchen off so easily this time!”","Everyone discussed animatedly. All kinds of news had spread throughout the city in just a moment. Then, more news came,","After arriving in the city, the first thing Star Shatter did was to go straight to the Flying Celestial Alliance and interrogate them, demanding that they hand over Jian Wuchen. For a time, it could be said to have set off a thousand waves.","Many people knew that the Flying Celestial Alliance was backed by the Flying Celestials, and the Monarch Alliance and the Destiny Alliance were backed by the Destiny Sect.","The confrontation between the two behemoths had not been a day or two. Everyone knew about this matter. However, no one expected that Star Shatter to go straight to the Flying Celestial Alliance and ask them to hand over Jian Wuchen.","“He’s really too strong. Star Shatter actually went straight to the door. However, the Flying Celestial Alliance is not to be trifled with. I’m afraid they won’t let this matter rest in the end!”","“That’s right. This stupid Star Shatter is too bold. He’s just like Jun Tianci. He doesn’t put the heroes of the world in his eyes at all. Jun Tianci actually dares to say such things. He must have eaten the guts of a bear or a leopard!”","Everyone discussed non- stop. While they were fighting against the resurrected hero spirits that were invading, they were also paying attention to the development of the city.","“Star Shatter, why aren’t you investigating Jian Wuchen? Why have you come to the Flying Celestial Alliance base?” Lan Hao thundered as he looked at the overbearing figure in the sky.","It was a young man who looked about 27 or 28 years old. He emanated a terrifying aura as if he was a demon god walking in the world. It was extremely terrifying.","It was the general of the Monarch Alliance, Star Shatter.","Lan Hao had entered the Prodigy Battlefield earlier than Jun Tianci. Of course, he had heard about Star Shatter. He had not expected that Jun Tianci would actually send out this general.","It was obvious that both the Monarch Alliance and the Destiny Alliance placed great importance on this matter. Even two organizations that were faintly cooperating and opposing each other had joined forces and handed over the troops of both sides to Star Shatter to lead. The other prodigies or experts were under his control.","He had expected that the Destiny Alliance and Monarch Alliance would not let this matter go easily after suffering such a huge loss. Perhaps, it would affect their Flying Celestial Alliance. However, he still did not expect it to be so fast. After Star Shatter arrived here, the first thing he did was to find the Flying","Celestial Alliance.","He looked like he was questioning them.","This made Lan Hao feel extremely aggrieved. Not to mention that he did not know Chu Yunfan’s whereabouts, even if the Flying Celestial Alliance protected Chu Yunfan, so what? Others couldn’t afford to offend the Destiny Sect, but as a prodigy of the Flying Celestials, he couldn’t possibly be afraid. However, the other party’s unscrupulous gaze made him very depressed.","“You should know why I came to your base. Hand over Jian Wuchen, or the Flying Celestial Alliance will be in chaos!” Star Shatter said as his eyes flickered with a terrifying light.","“Jian Wuchen isn’t with the Flying Celestial Alliance,” Lan Hao said coldly.","Although Star Shatter’s strength gave him a great sense of oppression, he knew that he could not retreat. He represented the dignity of the Flying Celestial Alliance and even the Flying Celestials. He could not allow others to insult him.","“Whether or not he’s here, it’s not up to you or me. I want to search!” Star Shatter said indifferently. His eyes were incomparably indifferent, and he did not even have the intention of saying anything more to Lan Hao.","He didn’t have much information about Jian Wuchen at the moment, especially after he had robbed the two alliances. Jian Wuchen had disappeared without a trace.","Even the spies that the two alliances planted in the city could not find Jian Wuchen. It was as if he had disappeared without a trace. According to his estimation, if he was not in the city, it was very likely that he had already left the city.","There were many such cities on the battlefield. There were countless factions behind the 100,000 geniuses. Not all factions chose to set up their bases here. There were those who chose to stay in other cities.","However, he had no other choice. After all, the Destiny Alliance and the","Monarch Alliance weren’t the Destiny Sect.."]},{"number":2107,"title":"Chapter 2107: Unscrupulous","paragraphs":["Chapter 2107: Unscrupulous","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the outside world, the Destiny Sect could be said to be omnipotent. Their influence was huge and intertwined. With the power of the Destiny Sect, it might not be difficult for them to search for a person thoroughly.","However, there were only a few people in the Destiny Alliance, and even if they counted the affiliated forces, they didn’t have many people. It was impossible for them to search the entire city. There were countless experts in the city, and among them were many ancient prodigies. None of these ancient","prodigies were easy to deal with.","Their current strength might not be as strong as the Destiny Sect, but as long as they continued to grow, their future would be limitless.","If they completely offended these people, even the Destiny Sect would have a headache. Even if only one of them grew up, it would cause a huge loss to the Destiny Sect.","Facing so many experts, even the powerful Destiny Alliance and Monarch","Alliance had to retreat. Therefore, they went straight to the Flying Celestial Alliance’s base, which was the last place Jian Wuchen was said to have appeared.","Moreover, the conflict between the Destiny Sect and the Flying Celestials had already extended to the Prodigy Battlefield, and the Destiny Alliance had long wanted to find trouble to deal with the Flying Celestial Alliance.","“Search us?” Lan Hao’s face turned ashen. This was a humiliation to the entire Flying Celestial Alliance, and even more so to himself.","This feeling was as if someone had grabbed his neck and slapped him hard.","He was furious.","“Star Shatter, who do you think you are? How dare you wish to search the Flying Celestial Alliance base!” Lan Hao shouted. “Don’t think that you’re great just because you’ve relied on Jun Tianci and become his lapdog. It’s true that the Destiny Sect is very powerful, but you’re gravely mistaken if you think that you can do whatever you want with them. If the Flying Celestials wants to kill you, it will be as easy as blowing off dust!”","When Star Shatter heard Lan Hao’s words, a cold light flashed in his eyes and he said coldly,” Become a lapdog?”","These two words clearly angered Star Shatter. For an expert from a native world like him, he had almost no choice. Their ancestors were almost all prodigies from the outside world. For various reasons, they stayed on the Prodigy Battlefield. Later on, they multiplied and formed these natives.","This was because their ancestors were basically all prodigies. It could be said that their genes were very good. In addition, these prodigies basically all came with powerful inheritances, so there were many prodigies among their descendants.","The probability of prodigies appearing was much higher than in the outside world. The number of native prodigies in the entire Prodigy Battlefield added up was not much less than the prodigies accumulated over countless years in the outside world.","However, they had a very awkward place. That was, they could not leave the Prodigy Battlefield. No matter how amazing they were, they could not leave this world. It was as if laws had been carved into their blood.","There was once someone who tried to leave the Prodigy Battlefield, but he was quickly invaded by a mysterious force and died tragically. Therefore, there were not many choices left for them. Many people chose to rely on a foreign prodigy. Perhaps they could find a way to leave the Prodigy Battlefield in time.","Even though he had been defeated by Jun Tianci, he still felt a little indignant because he had no choice but to be trapped in the battlefield of the prodigies. At the same time, he was most afraid of others calling him a lapdog, even if in the eyes of others, this was not an exaggeration, but a reality.","“You overestimate yourself!” Star Shatters eyes emitted a terrifying light.","These two sharp lights were like two swords that tore through the sky and bombarded Lan Hao’s body.","Spurt!","Lan Hao spat out blood and retreated. He was instantly seriously injured.","“You... How dare you attack me!”","Lan Hao was incomparably shocked. Star Shatter did not put the Flying Celestial Alliance behind him in his eyes at all and launched an attack so brazenly. What made him even more shocked was that the gap between his strength and Star Shatter was actually so big. Star Shatter had severely injured him with just a glance. This was a huge difference in strength.","He had already stepped into the Middle Arcana Stage, but Star Shatter was far stronger than him. He was probably already at the peak of Middle Arcana Stage, or even infinitely close to the Major Arcana Stage.","If that was the case, then it would be terrible.","It had to be known that the people in charge of the various factions in the outer regions of the Prodigy Battlefield were only at the early stages of the Middle Arcana Stage. They had a certain level of power to intimidate, but their strength was not particularly strong. The most powerful elites were often in the middle region or the core region.","And Star Shatter’s cultivation state was close to a Major Arcane. This meant that there was probably no one in the entire outer region who could contend against him. They were both at the Middle Arcana Stage, but the difference was too great!","“That’s all. You overestimate yourself!” Star Shatter sneered. “Search the place!’","At this moment, hundreds of figures appeared behind him. All of them were extremely powerful, and the weakest of them had already stepped into the Minor Arcana Stage. They were all top-notch experts.","Not far away from Lan Hao, Yang Dengxian and the others had ashen faces and clenched their fists. However, there was nothing they could do. Among the masters of the Flying Celestial Alliance who had left a hand here, the strongest was Lan Hao. However, even Lan Hao could not survive one move under Star Shatter’s attack. If it were them, there would be no difference. Not to mention so many Arcanes.","In the outside world, it was very difficult to see all these Arcanes gathering at the same time. Any Arcane was a big shot. A stomp of their feet could shake the entire Flying Celestial Alliance.","But now, these Arcanes were well-trained. They started to search the place. The method of searching was very rough. They used their divine will and heavenly sight to search the entire Flying Celestial Alliance base.","“What are you guys doing?!” Lan Hao shouted. Along with this shout, he coughed out another mouthful of blood, affecting his injuries again.","“If you don’t want to die, you’d better not move!” Star Shatter sneered.","He stretched out his hand, and an octagonal bronze mirror with an ancient design appeared in his hand. As he injected his divine power, the bronze mirror emitted a dazzling light, like a small sun. Wherever the copper mirror’s light passed, nothing could be hidden, including some places hidden by barriers and formations.","After scanning the entire Flying Celestial Alliance, Star Shatter finally put away the bronze mirror unwillingly. He could not find Jian Wuchen.","“Consider yourself lucky. Let’s go!’","With that, Star Shatter and his men left the Flying Celestial Alliance base.."]},{"number":2108,"title":"Chapter 2108: Breakthrough, Intermediate Middle Arcana Stage","paragraphs":["Chapter 2108: Breakthrough, Intermediate Middle Arcana Stage","Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“This is crossing the line!” Lan Hao glared at the Destiny Alliance experts flying away, his face ashen as he gritted his teeth.","Star Shatter being so unrestrained was simply a great humiliation to him. Relying on the power of the Destiny Alliance, Star Shatter didn’t show them a shred of respect.","The other members of the Flying Celestial Alliance were also indignant.","“He’s just relying on Jun Tianci!” Yang Dengxian said coldly.","In the outside world, he was the chief disciple of the Flying Celestials, while Jun Tianci was the chief disciple of the Destiny Sect. Their statuses were almost the same. However, in the battlefield of the prodigies, there was a huge gap between him and Jun Tianci. This was because there was no system that could guarantee his identity and status on the Prodigy Battlefield. Only strength was the foundation that determined everything.","“Report to the alliance. The Monarch Alliance has humiliated the Flying Celestial Alliance. We won’t let this matter go!” Lan Hao said coldly.’","If it was the Destiny Alliance, then they would be a formidable opponent. However, the Monarch Alliance had only been established for a few years and had some experts. However, compared to the Flying Celestial Alliance, they were still far inferior.","At this time, the city was in a mess. Chu Yunfan had not been found in the Flying Celestial Alliance base. Star Shatter cast aside the last bits of restraint he had and began to search for Chu Yunfan throughout the city.","“Find him even if you have to dig three feet underground!” Star Shatter said coldly from up in the sky. He won’t escape. He’s in the city. Find him. I want to tear him into pieces!”","At this time, the sky was already dark, and there were countless hero spirits outside. If Chu Yunfan wasn’t stupid, he wouldn’t have run out of the city. Otherwise, he would only be buried among the endless hero spirits. It was very likely that he was hiding in the city.","With a wave of his hand, the copper mirror in Star Shatter’s hand once again burst out with dazzling light. In the darkness, it was like a small sun. Wherever it passed, nothing could be hidden and he saw everything.","Many forces and experts in the city revealed extremely dissatisfied expressions, but no one acted rashly. With the Monarch Alliance and Star Shatter’s strength, even if they wanted to seek justice, they couldn’t do anything. Moreover, everyone knew that the Monarch Alliance and the Destiny Alliance had just been robbed by Chu Yunfan. This was the time when they were flustered and exasperated. No one wanted to replace Chu Yunfan to become the Monarch Alliance and the Destiny Alliance’s punching bag.","The entire city was in chaos. However, what made Star Shatter very depressed was that even though he took out the bronze mirror, he still could not find Chu Yunfan. The effect of the bronze mirror was unquestionable. There was only one possibility, and that was that Chu Yunfan had already left the city.","“You ran away? It’s fine if you die outside, but if you don’t, I’ll make sure you die without a burial place!” Star Shatter said coldly.","“Issue a bounty throughout the city. Anyone who catches Jian Wuchen will receive a huge reward from both the Monarch Alliance and the Destiny Alliance. Anyone who provides information will also receive 100,000 high-grade spirit stones!”","Soon, Star Shatter’s order was spread out. When many people in the city heard this, they felt restless. After all, as long as the information was verified, they could get 100,000 high-grade spirit stones. This wasn’t a small sum. Even for a Arcane, it could be considered a fortune overnight. For a moment, many people did not have the mood to kill the hero spirits outside. Instead, they began to search for Chu Yunfan’s whereabouts.","At the same time, while everyone was searching for Chu Yunfan’s","whereabouts, Chu Yunfan sat cross-legged in the Mountain River Diagram. A rainbow light flickered around his body. Not far away from him, high- grade spirit stones were continuously shattered in the air as if they were pulled by a mysterious force, turning into a torrent of spirit energy that fused into his body.","All of this spirit energy surged into the godhead in his mind. With the support of the spirit energy, the godhead began to recover again. The countless laws that had been replicated outside the Prodigy Battlefield began to be analyzed again.","Chu Yunfan’s understanding of the Great Dao began to increase. Originally, Chu Yunfan did not dare to do this because he did not have enough wealth. He did not have so many high-grade spirit stones to support such a terrifying consumption. Now, after robbing two alliances, Chu Yunfan had become rich overnight. It was enough to support him for a period of time.","Chu Yunfan’s eyes were tightly shut. The rainbow light around him enveloped him, making him look like a god of the present age, Suddenly, Chu Yunfan opened his eyes and stretched out his hand, forming a large hand of spirit energy. He plucked a Brahma Fruit from the Brahma Tree on the herb mountain in the distance.","After plucking the Brahma Fruit, Chu Yunfan consumed it. Instantly, a surge of medicinal power was released from Chu Yunfan’s body like a flood. It broken through the restraints of the fledgling Minor Arcana Stage and charged straight into the intermediate Minor Arcana Stage.","As Chu Yunfan’s comprehension of the Great Dao had already far surpassed that of a fledgling Minor Arcana Stage, he had no difficulty in advancing to the next stage. After consuming the Brahma Divine Fruit, his cultivation base had skyrocketed. He had broken through to fledgling Minor Arcana Stage almost as if it was a matter of course, and his battle prowess had skyrocketed as a result.","Chu Yunfan didn’t stop. He continued to comprehend the information of the","Great Dao released from the godhead. With its help, the Great Dao that Chu Yunfan was originally unqualified to comprehend seemed to be written step by step in front of him, making him feel that his vision had broadened countless times.","His comprehension of the Great Dao had also reached an unprecedented level.","With the help of the Brahma Fruit, his cultivation base was also rising rapidly. Breaking through to intermediate Minor Arcana Stage was just the beginning. As he continued to charge forward, he was soon at full cultivation. He was only a step away from the late Minor Arcana Stage.","Just as he was about to step across the line, Chu Yunfan suddenly stopped. He opened his eyes, and all the strange phenomena around him disappeared without a trace as if they had never existed in the first place.","“Just a little bit more and I’ll be able to break through to the late Minor Arcana Stage. What a pity, just a little bit more!”","Chu Yunfan’s face revealed a look of pity. He was just a little bit away from breaking through to late Minor Arcana Stage, but right at this moment, his comprehension was interrupted.","He had used up all of his spirit stones. The high-grade spirit stones he had plundered from the Monarch Alliance and the Destiny Alliance had been used","up.."]},{"number":2109,"title":"Chapter 2109: One Doesn’t Become Rich Without Taking Risks","paragraphs":["Chapter 2109: One Doesn’t Become Rich Without Taking Risks","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan looked regretful. He was just one step away from breaking through. Unfortunately, the godhead consumed spirit energy too quickly.","He had just ransacked the Monarch Alliance and the Destiny Alliance bases, and now, all of them had been used up by the godhead. The godhead’s rate of consumption far exceeded Chu Yunfan’s expectations. If this news spread, the world would probably be in an uproar.","One had to know that the wealth collected by the Destiny Alliance and Monarch Alliance was meant to be used by the entire alliance. Now, it was not even enough for Chu Yunfan to use. One could imagine how shocking Chu","Yunfan’s consumption was.","It was far beyond the imagination of ordinary people. It was not an exaggeration to say that he was a prodigal, and he was a god-level prodigal. Chu Yunfan only spent half a month to spend all of this wealth.","However, Chu Yunfan did not regret it. He could feel the terrifying power exploding in his body. He was more than twice as strong as before, and his understanding of the Great Dao had reached an unprecedented level.","Because of the godhead, Chu Yunfan didn’t have to be like many people who chose a particular Great Dao to comprehend. It could be said that he comprehended whatever Great Dao there was, and he wasn’t picky. His comprehensive understanding of the Dao was something that even Major Arcanes would not be able to match up to, let alone Minor Arcanes.","Moreover, they did not just casually understand it. They all had a considerable degree of comprehension. If outsiders knew about it, they would probably shock the entire scene again.","Ordinary people would not choose to do this at all. The consumption required was a small matter. The key was that the difference between different Great Dao was like heaven and earth. There were even completely different laws such as Yin and Yang, water and fire, and even completely opposite laws.","The amount of time required to comprehend different laws was too shocking.","Although cultivators had long lifespans, they had not reached the point where they could squander them casually. Wasn’t the purpose of everyone’s cultivation for longevity?","This was because Chu Yunfan’s comprehension of the Great Dao far exceeded the imagination of ordinary people. At the same time, this allowed his combat strength to soar. He rushed from the fledgling Middle Arcana Stage to the","peak Middle Arcana Stage. Even when facing a late Arcane, Chu Yunfan was confident that he could protect himself and retreat safely.","Therefore, even though he had spent an endless amount of resources, which was far beyond the imagination of ordinary people, Chu Yunfan’s harvest was also far beyond the imagination of ordinary people. The more solid the foundation was now, the more amazing the height that Chu Yunfan could stand in the future.","It could even be said that breaking through in the future would be much easier than ordinary people. The obstacles that ordinary people faced on the path of cultivation were not a big deal for Chu Yunfan. Many people might need to spend years or even decades to break through the obstacles. For Chu Yunfan, it was as simple as eating and drinking because his understanding of the Great Dao was too firm and solid. With a solid foundation, cultivation would naturally be smooth sailing.","‘Trading resources for time?’ This thought flashed through Chu Yunfan’s mind. Although he was also in short supply of cultivation resources, there was something even more lacking than this, and that was time.","His cultivation time was far less than Jun Tianci’s, and he had more than ten years to recuperate, which further made his cultivation time extremely tight. However, based on the amount of resources he needed to cultivate, if he wanted to exchange resources for time, the amount of resources he needed was simply an astronomical figure.","“It looks like it won’t work to develop slowly. Sure enough, windfalls come the fastest. A horse doesn’t get fat without grass at night!”","Chu Yunfan thought to himself that if he hadn’t robbed the Monarch Alliance and the Destiny Alliance of their wealth, it would have taken him at least a few months to reach this level. That was enough time for him to miss out on many things.","However, he could imagine that after this incident, the Monarch Alliance and the Destiny Alliance wouldn’t be so careless. They would gather so much wealth but not send experts to guard it. Therefore, plundering wealth from these two alliances was no longer the most feasible strategy.","“But apart from these two alliances, aren’t there the Blood-Clothes Tower and the Evil Path Alliance?” Chu Yunfan sneered.","Besides the Monarch Alliance and the Destiny Alliance, there were also the Blood-Clothes Tower and the Evil Path Alliance. These two factions also had many prodigies entering the Prodigy Battlefield. There were many experts and outstanding people among them. They also needed to consume a lot of cultivation resources.","This was a heaven-sent opportunity.","“Let’s go take a look first!”","Chu Yunfan appeared in the outside world in a flash. However, he had turned into an ordinary middle-aged man. No one could recognize him as Jian Wuchen. Soon, he found out from the passersby what had happened during two weeks he had been in seclusion.","In the beginning, to capture Chu Yunfan, Star Shatter had thrown the city into chaos, but he had not found any trace of Chu Yunfan. After a few days, Shat Shatter gave up. Everyone thought that Chu Yunfan must have left the city. Otherwise, with the Destiny Alliance and the Monarch Alliance digging three feet into the ground, it was impossible for them not to find Chu Yunfan.","There were no traces of Chu Yunfan in the other cities, so many people guessed that Chu Yunfan had probably fallen in the wilderness. After all, every night in the wilderness, there would be countless hero spirits. Even the most powerful experts would find it difficult to survive in the wilderness.","After all, even the Arcanes who were known for their boundless divine power would have their divine power exhausted. However, these hero spirits were endless. Moreover, many of these hero spirits had been re-born their own intelligence, recovering the memories and strength of their previous lives. Each of them was more terrifying than the last.","There were many Destiny Sect spied in every city. It was impossible for them to not find out if Chu Yunfan appeared in any city. The only possibility was that he had fallen in the wild. This was the guess of many people. Even many people in the Monarch Alliance and the Destiny Alliance believed this. Even if Star Shatter was very unhappy, he could only let it go.","However, after learning his lesson, Star Shatter personally guarded the Monarch Alliance base to prevent it from being robbed again. What happened to Chu Yunfan once was enough. There must not be a second time.","In a corner that no one noticed, a streak of light rose from the ground and left the city, disappearing into the horizon.."]},{"number":2110,"title":"Chapter 2110: Getting Rich Again","paragraphs":["Chapter 2110: Getting Rich Again","Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","On the Prodigy Battlefield, many cities were densely packed like stars. The majority of the people in each city were naturally the locals. Other than them, there were also many foreign prodigies. There were more than 100,000 local and foreign prodigies, which was a huge number.","Many alliances had set up bases in different cities to gather resources from the battlefield. The Evil Path Alliance was one of the strongest alliances in the Prodigy Battlefield. They were said to be all-encompassing. From ancient times to modern times, almost all the elites of the evil path had chosen to join this alliance.","From ancient times until now, the inheritance of the evil path had never stopped. One could imagine how powerful this evil path was. Such a colossus was rare in the entire Prodigy Battlefield. Logically speaking, no one should dare to provoke such a colossus. However, a piece of news spread throughout the Prodigy Battlefield overnight.","The Evil Path Alliance base had been ransacked, and it was exactly what had happened to the Destiny Alliance and the Monarch Alliance when they were robbed.","A name entered everyone’s vision once again. It was Jian Wuchen, who everyone thought had fallen. He appeared once again, and as soon as he appeared, he robbed the Evil Path Alliance. This shocked hocking the world.","For a time, the entire Prodigy Battlefield was in an uproar. After all, the","Destiny Sect, which represented the Destiny Alliance and the Monarch Alliance, could cover the sky with one hand in the outside world. It could be said that their power was monstrous. It was already very bad enough to offend such a behemoth, not to mention that Jian Wuchen had attacked the Evil Path Alliance.","On the prodigies Battlefield, there were countless evil prodigies from the Evil Path Alliance. Each of them was more arrogant than the last, and in terms of strength, they were even stronger than the Destiny Alliance, No ordinary person would dare to provoke any one of them, but Jian Wuchen gave the two behemoths a tight slap.","The Evil Path Alliance base in the city was broken through, and all the experts in the encampment were slaughtered. All kinds of wealth were looted.","“Could the Blood-Clothes Tower be next?”","Many people suddenly remembered something. If there was someone who had a grudge against Jian Wuchen, everyone knew that other than the Monarch Alliance, the Destiny Alliance, and the Evil Path Alliance, it should be the Blood-Clothes Tower.","Because of the uniqueness of the path of assassins, the Blood-Clothes Tower did not form an alliance with other forces. Instead, it was a separate group. However, because the Blood-Clothes Tower had an endless stream of assassins, and they were all the most talented assassins in the Blood-Clothes Tower’s history, although the Blood-Clothes Tower did not have many experts, it was a force that countless people were particularly afraid of.","This was because one could only be a thief for a thousand days. There was no such thing as guarding against a thief for a thousand days. Once they were targeted by the Blood-Clothes Tower, they would fight to the death. The","Blood-Clothes Tower would torture the person they were chasing to death.","This was the fundamental reason why the Blood-Clothes Tower was feared by people until now. No one could bear the wrath of the Blood-Clothes Tower’s","crazy revenge. That was unless the entire Blood-Clothes Tower was uprooted.","Just as many people had guessed, after the Evil Path Alliance was robbed, the Blood-Clothes Tower was next. Their base was located in a manor in the city. It was not eye-catching at all. If one did not know about it, one would not know that it was actually the famous Blood-Clothes Tower base.","Unlike the other bases that appeared openly, the Blood-Clothes Tower had many enemies. Thus, their base was well hidden, and it was impossible for ordinary people to know. However, at this moment, the Blood-Clothes Tower base was in a mess, akin to a river of blood.","The corpses of the Blood-Clothes Tower’s experts in red uniforms could be seen everywhere. Not all of them were the experts of the Blood-Clothes Tower from the outside world. They were the experts that the Blood-Clothes Tower had developed among the locals.","It was not the first time that the experts of the Blood-Clothes Tower had entered the Prodigy Battlefield. Naturally, they had left behind their own orthodoxy. Therefore, although the experts of the Blood-Clothes Tower were much fewer than the other forces, they still had enough experts to command it.","Unlike the native experts recruited by other forces who would scatter when they saw that something was wrong, the native experts of the Blood-Clothes Tower were fearless and attacked one after another. In the end, they were all killed.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan killed an expert of the Blood-Clothes Tower with a single punch. At this moment, there was no longer an expert of the Blood-Clothes Tower in the entire Blood-Clothes Tower base.","“You overestimate yourself!” Chu Yunfan shook his head.","The experts of the Blood-Clothes Tower approached Chu Yunfan one after another, trying to assassinate him. However, in front of Chu Yunfan, these actions were meaningless.","He stepped into a pool of blood, his expression cold and indifferent. However, he did not seem to be affected at all. These experts of the Blood-Clothes Tower were all Creator and Minor Arcanes. It could be said that they had slaughtered countless innocent living beings to cultivate the art of assassination to such a high level. Their hands were stained with the blood of countless innocent creatures. They deserved to die, and Chu Yunfan’s heart did not waver after killing these people.","“The Blood-Clothes Tower’s wealth is too little!” Chu Yunfan’s eyes narrowed.","He had just robbed the Blood-Clothes Tower of all its wealth. The","Blood-Clothes Tower only had a million high- grade spirit stones and nothing else. They didn’t have any medicinal herbs or other treasures. Clearly, they had just handed over a batch. Chu Yunfan was a step late.","However, Chu Yunfan managed to loot a lot of wealth from the Evil Path Alliance. In addition to more than five million high-grade spirit stones, there were also many precious treasures. Their value was more than two million high-grade spirit stones, which made up for the regret in Chu Yunfan’s heart.","Now, he had more than six million high-grade spirit stones that he could use. These were originally used to supply the cultivation of many experts, but now they all fell into Chu Yunfan’s hands. One could imagine how much wealth this was.","‘It’s enough for me to break through to the late Minor Arcana Stage,’ Chu Yunfan thought. If he was given some more time, breaking through to the fledgling Minor Arcana Stage would be on the horizon.","In the Mountain River Diagram, the Brahma Tree bore another Brahma Fruit. It was tender and alluring, and was already close to ripening. It would not be long before it could help him break through.","‘l should be able to catch up to Jun Tianci soon. I’ll take his head to vent my anger!’ Chu Yunfan thought of Jun Tianci, and his eyes flashed with an extremely cold expression.","Suddenly, there was a violent fluctuation in the sky, and a blood-colored figure swept over from afar.."]},{"number":2111,"title":"Chapter 2111: Retreat in One Piece","paragraphs":["Chapter 2111: Retreat in One Piece","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan instantly became vigilant. However, he saw the blood light dissipate and a figure appeare before him. It was a young man dressed in a blood-red robe. There was a hint of arrogance between his brows, and his entire body erupted with blood-red divine power.","“How are you massacre the Blood-Clothes Tower base, Jian Wuchen!”","The blood-red-clothed young man stared at Chu Yunfan. His eyes were like a ferocious beast, bursting with a fierce light. His tone was anxious and angry. He had never expected Chu Yunfan to be able to find the Blood-Clothes Tower base and massacre everyone in it.","The Blood-Clothes Tower was a world-renowned assassin organization. Over the countless years, it had killed countless people. Countless elders of prodigies or people of the same generation had been killed by the","Blood-Clothes Tower. It could be said that they had a deep hatred for each other.","But why was the Blood-Clothes Tower still able to live well on the Prodigy Battlefield? It was because of their good concealment skills. Even though they were in the same city, the other major forces did not notice that the Blood-Clothes Tower’s members were here and they managed to deceive many people.","But now, the Blood-Clothes Tower base was exposed before Chu Yunfan. Although he didn’t know how he did it, it didn’t stop the red-robed youth from burning with anger.","The entire Blood-Clothes Tower base was under his management, but now, everyone was being slaughtered before him. He had seen many scenes of people being killed, but in the past, it was only when the Blood-Clothes Tower attacked others that such a scene would occur. When had the Blood-Clothes Tower been targeted like this?","“There’s one that slipped through the net?” Chu Yunfan sneered.","“Slipped through the net? You want to kill me?” The blood-red-clothed young man was instantly enraged. The blood-red divine power from his body surged out crazily, turning into a monstrous blood wave that covered the entire sky.","The young man stood on the crest of the blood wave and looked at Chu Yunfan coldly. “Jian Wuchen, you’re lucky that the Blood-Clothes Tower didn’t kill you. Yet, you dared to do such an outrageous thing. You won’t escape death today. I will kill you and turn you into a puppet. I will make you suffer for the rest of your life!”","The eyes of this youth flickered with a terrifying light. It was obvious that he hated Chu Yunfan to the core.","“Fearless Blood, I’m afraid you’re not strong enough to kill me!”","Chu Yunfan immediately recognized this red-robe youth. When he was investigating the Blood-Clothes Tower’s wealth, he also found out that the person in charge of this Blood-Clothes Tower base was none other than a prodigy assassin named Fearless Blood. There was some information about Fearless Blood in the base. Although it wasn’t much, it was enough for Chu Yunfan to understand how powerful this Fearless Blood was.","This was another terrifying prodigy who had once shone in the ancient times. During his era, Fearless Blood suppressed almost all the other prodigies so much that they couldn’t raise their heads. They didn’t even dare to casually walk outside because they might be assassinated by him.","Even prodigies of the same generation as him would find it difficult to resist such an assassination. Those who were stronger than him had a record of falling at his hands. He was definitely a rare prodigy of the Blood-Clothes Tower, which was why he was sealed by the Blood-Clothes Tower for the future.","“You know my name, yet you still dare to be so impudent. Do you think that you are invincible just because you killed a few pieces of trash?” Fearless Blood said coldly.","He was originally outside, but when he heard the news that the Evil Path","Alliance had been robbed, he immediately felt that something was wrong. Because of Jian Wuchen’s lawless behavior, it was very likely that he would target the Blood-Clothes Tower, so he hurried back.","However, he was a step too late. The entire Blood-Clothes Tower had already been ransacked. These were all his painstaking efforts, especially those native experts. They were native experts who had been developed by the orthodoxy he had left behind when he entered the Prodigy Battlefield the last time. That was why they were willing to be used by him.","Such a force had only appeared after countless years of development. Now, it had all returned to its original state overnight, and many years of hard work had been in vain. Thinking of this, he wished he could tear Chu Yunfan into pieces.","“The late Middle Arcana Stage?” Chu Yunfan smiled.","Fearless Blood was definitely the strongest opponent he had ever met. He was even stronger than Chu Yunfan.","‘l can’t get entangled with him. Otherwise, things will be quite troublesome,’ Chu Yunfan decided.","Fearless Blood seemed to have seen through Chu Yunfan’s intentions at a glance. In an instant, he had already made his move. An astonishing killing intent swept toward Chu Yunfan.","At that moment, Chu Yunfan seemed to see a monstrous wave of blood sweeping over. It was the materialization of the killing intent in Fearless Blood’s body. Even the masters with slightly weaker willpower might be affected and waver.","This was also one of Fearless Blood’s methods. He controlled Chu Yunfan with his killing intent to prevent him from escaping. With Fearless Blood’s killing intent covering the sky and covering the earth, even Chu Yunfan’s movements were as if he was stuck in a swamp.","“Die!” Fearless Blood shouted. As soon as he finished speaking, he had already arrived before Chu Yunfan. A blood-red dagger appeared in his hand, and the dagger swept across the sky, leaving a long blood-red light.","The red light swept across and pierced through Chu Yunfan.","“What?” Fearless Blood suddenly realized that Chu Yunfan had disappeared without a trace. He had completely disappeared from his sight. This made him incredulous. Under his murderous aura, it was impossible for Chu Yunfan to escape. However, Chu Yunfan had disappeared right under his eyes. How could he not be shocked?","“Where did he go?” Fearless Blood immediately sent out his divine will, but there was not a single figure in the entire base.","“A spatial equipment?” Fearless Blood suddenly thought of something.","With his cultivation and knowledge, he guessed that Chu Yunfan was hiding in","some kind of spatial equipment. Although spatial equipments that could store living creatures was rare, it was not unheard of. He had seen one in the distant past. This kind of similar disappearing scene, without a trace of leaving, made him instantly think of something.","“l don’t believe that you won’t come out for the rest of your life!” With a sneer, Fearless Blood raised the defensive barrier around the base and disappeared into thin air.."]},{"number":2112,"title":"Chapter 2112: Breakthrough, Late Arcana Stage","paragraphs":["Chapter 2112: Breakthrough, Late Arcana Stage","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Inside the Mountain River Diagram, Chu Yunfan heard what Fearless Blood had said. He was not surprised that Fearless Blood could guess why Chu Yunfan had disappeared.","These top-notch prodigies had knowledge that ordinary people could not compare to. Although there were very few spatial equipment that could store living things, they did exist. Of course, there was probably nothing that could compare to the power of the Mountain River Diagram.","But even if Fearless Blood knew of it, so what? Chu Yunfan didn’t care.","Knowing was one thing, but being able to do anything to him was another.","Chu Yunfan wasn’t in a hurry. After all, Fearless Blood couldn’t do anything to him in the Mountain River Diagram. However, he knew that Fearless Blood was definitely waiting at the side. He never looked down on these prodigies who cultivated the assassination path. Waiting was just a piece of cake. If necessary, they could wait for ten or twenty years without moving, just for that fleeting opportunity to assassinate someone.","This was the most terrifying part about these assassins. They could only be thieves for a thousand days, and there was no such thing as guarding against thieves for a thousand days. Once they offended these people, they had to be prepared to guard against thieves for a thousand days. It could be said to be extremely difficult to deal with.","However, that was only for others. Chu Yunfan had never been afraid. And now, he had just robbed the savings of two alliances. It was time for him to cultivate.","Using the resources and wealth of his enemies to water his own body, just thinking about it made him feel refreshed. Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan didn’t hesitate and reconnected to the godhead in his mind. Countless soirit energv began to flow into the godhead.","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan entered a mysterious state of enlightenment again as if he was immersed in a journey. Fortunately, Chu Yunfan was prepared. An ordinary person might not encounter an epiphany in their lifetime, but Chu Yunfan, who had a godhead, had an epiphany as simple as a meal.","Even more spirit energy poured into the herb mountain. The Brahma Tree grew faster, and time sped up crazily. A Brahma Fruit matured and flew directly into Chu Yunfan’s hand. Just this step alone had already consumed millions of high-grade spirit stones.","It was completely used to speed up the flow of time in the mountain. It only sped up the area where the Brahma Tree was located. If one wanted to speed up the growth of the medicinal herbs in the entire mountain, the amount of spirit energy needed would be astronomical.","Even so, this was still a shocking thing. This could lay the foundation of a supreme inheritance. As long as there was spirit energy, it could continuously produce enough medicinal herbs. In a very short time, it was enough to bring up a powerful inheritance.","After Chu Yunfan swallowed the Brahma Fruit, the divine power in his body, which was already bursting, surged even more, forming a monstrous tide. It even washed through the barriers of his meridians, like waves washing against the shore, with a sonorous sound.","At the same time, Chu Yunfan’s power soared at an astonishing speed along with his comprehension, breaking through to a higher level bit by bit. He had just broken through. It was really dangerous to break through again so soon.","However, his comprehension was much firmer than everyone had imagined.","Breaking through so soon could not shake his Dao foundation in the slightest. With both methods, Chu Yunfan’s strength broke through at a speed visible to the naked eye.","Time passed in cultivation, and no one knew how much time had passed. When Chu Yunfan finally came to an end from his state of enlightenment, two golden lights shot out from his eyes and shot into the sky.","“l broke through again!” Chu Yunfan could feel that the divine power in his body had increased several times from its original foundation.","He had broken through to the late Minor Arcana Stage!","His battle prowess had soared to the late Middle Arcana Stage, and he could do whatever he wanted now. At this rate of cultivation, it wouldn’t be long before he reached the lesser celestial full cultivation state. By then, he would be able to break through to the Middle Arcana Stage with ease. By then, he might even be able to compete with Jun Tianci in battle prowess.","Chu Yunfan didn’t have any more information about Jun Tianci, so he didn’t know exactly what level Jun Tianci had reached. However, he was certain that he had at least stepped into the Major Arcana Stage.","Therefore, if Chu Yunfan wanted to fight against him, he would have to cultivate to the Middle Arcana Stage at the very least. At that time, even if Jun Tianci came personally, he would be confident that he could protect himself.","Although Jun Tianci had improved very quickly over the past few years, from the Middle Arcana Stage to the Major Arcana Stage, Chu Yunfan’s improvement was faster. The gap between the two of them was shrinking at an astonishing rate.","“Just a little more. Jun Tianci, your head will stay on your neck for now!” Chu Yunfan said coldly. “It’s time to go out!”","Chu Yunfan’s thoughts flashed, and he appeared outside the Mountain River Diagram. It was also in the Blood-Clothes Tower base. At this moment, it had been half a year since he had ransacked the Blood-Clothes Tower base. His breakthrough this time had taken him such a long time.","However, the Blood-Clothes Tower had no intention of restoring this base. After all, it had been discovered by Chu Yunfan and looted once, so it was no longer safe. The Blood-Clothes Tower was different from other alliance bases, after all. They had too many enemies. There were countless forces in the world that wanted to destroy the Blood-Clothes Tower. Even those who had given them missions hoped to uproot this force. After all, such a force was a threat to everyone. Other than choosing to maintain their dignity through endless slaughter, they would constantly find a safe place to hide, like bugs in the shadows.","“You’re finally out. Time for you to die!”","In the next moment, Chu Yunfan heard an excited voice. A blood-red light came even faster than the sound, aiming to chop down on Chu Yunfan’s head.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at it. He waved his hand, and the blood-red light was instantly shattered. He saw that the person behind the sharp light was none other than Fearless Blood.","“It really is you. You haven’t left yet!” Chu Yunfan looked at Fearless Blood coldly.","On the other hand, Fearless Blood seemed to be still immersed in the fact that Chu Yunfan could easily block his attack.","“I won’t be at ease until I kill you!” Fearless Blood’s eyes turned blood-red as if there was a sea of blood in them that was about to boil.","In the next moment, Fearless Blood disappeared, completely merging with the air. Just as he was about to sneak up on Chu Yunfan, a big hand suddenly grabbed him.."]},{"number":2113,"title":"Chapter 2113: Killing Fearless Blood","paragraphs":["Chapter 2113: Killing Fearless Blood","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“What is this?!”","Fearless Blood was shocked. He exited from his invisible state and frantically ran back. After flying for more than a thousand meters, he finally escaped the pursuit of this huge hand.","At this moment, he looked at Chu Yunfan in shock, because that big hand was pulled out by Chu Yunfan. Although it was only a big hand, he could feel that if Chu Yunfan’s big hand caught him, he would die.","“How did your strength increase so much?”","Fearless Blood could feel that Chu Yunfan’s strength had increased several times in just half a year. Under normal circumstances, half a year was not enough to increase so much. And there was even less possibility that one would break through a stage, and this was a major leap. His eyes were filled with shock as if he still could not believe that Chu Yunfan’s strength had increased so much in just half a year.","“What’s the point of knowing so much? You’ll be dead soon anyway.” Chu Yunfan grinned and didn’t explain further.","At this moment, Fearless Blood’s expression was solemn. He looked at Chu Yunfan and said, “Don’t be too arrogant. So what if your strength has improved? The strength of the Blood-Clothes Tower is beyond your imagination. There is a supreme existence who can kill you like an ant!”","“So what? You’re not them. No matter how strong they are, they can’t control this place. Today, even a god can’t save you!” Chu Yunfan said indifferently as he sneered.","The Blood-Clothes Tower was able to form an independent alliance. They could dominate the battlefield without forming alliances with other forces. Their strength was naturally unquestionable. There must be terrifying assassin path prodigies among them.","However, so what? Distant water could not quench the thirst of the present!","“You...” Fearless Blood made a decision. He would run away and escape thousands of miles away if he missed. Chu Yunfan’s strength was not something he could easily deal with.","Back then, he had stayed here because he thought that his strength was far superior to Chu Yunfan’s. Who would have thought that in half a year, Chu Yunfan’s strength had undergone an earth-shattering change? ‘I’he assassin path was not good at fighting head-on, otherwise, there was no need for assassination.","“Let’s go!” Fearless Blood spat out a mouthful of blood essence, which transformed into a terrifying beast. The beast pounced at Chu Yunfan as he himself fled into the distance. He wanted to spread the news and let the truly terrifying assassin path prodigy from the Blood-Clothes Tower personally kill Chu Yunfan.","“Petty tricks!” Chu Yunfan sneered and roared. A terrifying bolt of lightning shot out from his mouth and instantly blasted the ferocious beast into pieces. Then, he stomped his foot and caught up with Fearless Blood with lightning speed.","Fearless Blood’s speed was very fast. This was a life-saving secret art of assassination. However, he was not as fast as Chu Yunfan.","“Flying Celestial Palm Strike!” Chu Yunfan slapped out with one hand. This hand turned into a huge palm print, and the huge palm print slammed down.","“The Flying Celestial Palm Strike? You’re from the Flying Celestials?” Fearless Blood was shocked because he knew that the Flying Celestial Palm Strike was the ultimate technique of the Flying Celestials. Only the direct descendants of the Flying Celestials would be taught this technique.","If an outsider learned it in secret, they would face the endless pursuit of the Flying Celestials. Therefore, it was impossible for ordinary people to learn the Flying Celestial Palm Strike. However, this huge palm print did not give him much time to think.","“l have to go all out!” Fearless Blood stopped in his tracks. Since he couldn’t escape anymore, he might as well go all out. “Boundless Blood Sea!”","Fearless Blood roared. Suddenly, a boundless sea of blood appeared in the sky. All kinds of attacks appeared in the sea of blood. They were all martial arts techniques learned by the experts he had killed. Now, they were all integrated into his sea of blood. For a moment, blood-colored attacks were everywhere, covering the sky and destroying everything.","“Hmph!” Chu Yunfan snorted coldly.","The Flying Celestial Palm Strike emitted a rainbow light. All the attacks that surged out of the sea of blood were instantly blasted into pieces. The originally endless sea of blood was evaporated under the illumination of the rainbow","Bam!","In the next moment, the Flying Celestial Palm Strike landed on Fearless Blood’s body.","Fearless Blood screamed and his body exploded, turning into a rain of blood that filled the sky. Chu Yunfan kept him in the Mountain River Diagram.","“Too weak!” Chu Yunfan shook his head.","Before he had broken through, Fearless Blood was still very strong and difficult to deal with. Even he could only protect himself half a year ago.","However, to him, whose strength had increased by several times, Fearless Blood was now an existence that could be casually slapped to death.","However, he knew that it was not that Fearless Blood was too weak, but that he was too strong. To enter the Prodigy Battlefield, a king-level physique was just the foundation. One with a king physique could grow to the limit in the outside world and become a king. Such people were definitely not weaklings.","It was a pity that Fearless Blood had encountered a freak like Chu Yunfan. With his strength, things should not have ended for him this way. However, his best assassination was useless in front of Chu Yunfan. Even a sneak attack could not seriously injure Chu Yunfan. Unless his strength was far above Chu Yunfan’s, it would be meaningless. If it were other experts of the same level, no one would be able to ignore an assassin path prodigy like Chu Yunfan.","‘l want to see more powerful experts. There are too many prodigies on the battlefield. Only by fighting with these prodigies can I further sharpen my Dao heart!’ Chu Yunfan thought that the path he was going to take was an unprecedented one. This path was destined to be paved with bones, and he did not know how many people would lie on it.","Because of the godhead, it could be said that all the prodigies were his potential enemies. If he did not want to be killed, there was only one way, and that was to become stronger, stronger, and stronger.","Chu Yunfan left the Blood-Clothes Tower base. At this time, after half a year, the entire Prodigy Battlefield had changed compared to half a year ago. He quickly learned about the changes that had occurred in the Prodigy Battlefield over the past six months.","Half a year ago, he appeared in a flash and robbed the Evil Path Alliance and","Blood-Clothes Tower of their legacies. It was a shocking battle.."]},{"number":2114,"title":"Chapter 2114: Chief of the Flying Celestial Alliance, Huangfu Longhao","paragraphs":["Chapter 2114: Chief of the Flying Celestial Alliance, Huangfu Longhao","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The Monarch Alliance and the Destiny Alliance, who had thought that Chu Yunfan was dead, were furious. It could be said that this was a humiliation to them. They had thought that Chu Yunfan was already dead, but who would have thought that he was still alive?","To them, this was simply a slap in the face. Although they didn’t know how","Chu Yunfan survived, almost immediately, the Monarch Alliance and the Destiny Alliance took action.","They searched everywhere for Chu Yunfan’s whereabouts. However, in the past six months, Chu Yunfan had been cultivating in the Mountain River Diagram and had not appeared in the outside world. Therefore, even though the alliances had turned the entire periphery of the Prodigy Battlefield upside down, they had not been able to find him. They couldn’t find any trace of Chu Yunfan.","In fact, it wasn’t just the Monarch Alliance, the Destiny Alliance, the Evil Path Alliance, and a few other alliances that were looking for Chu Yunfan. There were many alliances that were interested in Chu Yunfan.","Some were greedy for the reward, while others wanted to rope in Chu Yunfan.","Many forces were interested in this expert who did not have clear ownership. However, after half a year of searching, no one could find Chu Yunfan’s whereabouts. At this point, even the dumbest person understood that Chu Yunfan must have a special concealment technique.","There were even methods to isolate the divination of other factions. Some factions, like the Mysteries Pavilion, had powerful divination abilities. Ordinary people would not be able to avoid the Mysteries Pavilion’s divination without some means.","However, this time, the Destiny Alliance, Monarch Alliance, and other forces had come to the Mysteries Pavilion, but they were unable to find Chu Yunfan’s whereabouts. It was as if all the information about Chu Yunfan was covered by layers of fog, and it was impossible for anyone to deduce it. Forcefully deducing would only result in a backlash.","But even so, in the past half a year, the Destiny Alliance and the Monarch Alliance had never given up on searching for Chu Yunfan. They had even mobilized many native forces, and the forces that were originally hidden among the locals had been mobilized. But even so, they knew nothing. The only one who knew Chu Yunfan’s whereabouts was Fearless Blood. For various reasons, he did not spread the news. It seemed that he wanted to take Chu Yunfan!s head to get the reward.","Who would have thought that in just half a year, Chu Yunfan’s strength had undergone an earth- shattering change? Not only did he surpass Fearless Blood, but he also had the strength to easily kill him, turning the situation around in one fell swoop.","However, Chu Yunfan also heard something very interesting. Just two months ago, Star Shatter, who was originally in charge of tracking down Chu Yunfan, was severely injured. To put it simply, he was defeated in the Monarch Alliance base and was severely injured. After that, he left.","A name entered Chu Yunfan’s ears—Huangfu Longhao! This person was the top prodigy of the Flying Celestials and the alliance chief of the Flying Celestial Alliance.","Following Huangfu Longhao’s shocking attack, many pieces of news regarding Huangfu Longhao began to spread around the Prodigy Battlefield outer region. He was a peerless prodigy who had once appeared in the Flying Celestials thousands of years ago. When he was alive, he had completely suppressed several generations of prodigies.","Ever since he was born, he was different from ordinary people. A strange phenomenon descended from the sky and alarmed a passing elder of the Flying Celestials. From then on, the Flying Celestials began to pay attention to","Huangfu Longhao’s growth. Later, Huangfu Longhao entered the Flying Celestials and tied with all the fringe disciples in the first year. Within three years, he was already an outstanding inner disciple. In less than five years, he had become a true disciple of the Flying Celestials. In ten years, he had already crushed his peers.","Whether it was the people of the same generation from the Flying Celestials, the Destiny Sect, or the other people of the same generation in the Central Plains, he crushed everyone on the Prodigy List. Ever since he ascended to first place on the Prodigy List, no one had been able to pose a threat to him in the slightest.","Huangfu Longhao’s strength was publicly acknowledged in the current world. Even the previous batch of prodigies who were much older than him, and even the number one of the previous batch of prodigies, had been defeated by him. At that time, he had reached the peak of his life, and then he disappeared at an even faster speed.","He completely disappeared from everyone’s eyes overnight. The Flying Celestials had also kept this a secret and never mentioned it again. Thousands of years passed since then, and many people only heard of Huangfu Longhao’s glory. However, they were not too clear about what had happened back then. Huangfu Longhao did not appear even once after the Prodigy Battlefield opened, not until the legendary path to godhood appeared.","Huangfu Longhao then reappeared. The moment he appeared, he appeared before everyone as the current leader of the Flying Celestial Alliance. Only then did everyone know that Huangfu Longhao did not disappear. Instead, he chose to seal himself till this era, waiting for the opportunity to become a god to open.","The official members of the Flying Celestial Alliance were all the top masters of the Flying Celestials. Every generation had to at least reach the level of the current Yang Dengxian before they were qualified to be sealed for the future.","All of them were the elites of the Flying Celestials in each generation. However, Huangfu Longhao was undoubtedly the number one among these prodigies. With his absolute strength, the other prodigies recognized his status and treated him as the leader. One could imagine how difficult of a feat this was.","Not long after Huangfu Longhao entered the Prodigy Battlefield, he went to the core area of the Prodigy Battlefield and never appeared outside. His opponents were the top prodigies of the various large factions. They were also very rare among many prodigies, and there were very few people who could sweep the world. It was just that no one had expected Huangfu Longhao to personally appear this time to find trouble with Star Shatter.","Many people thought of Star Shatter humiliating the Flying Celestial Alliance. The Flying Celestial Alliance was not indifferent but was waiting for the alliance chief of the Flying Celestial Alliance to personally make a move.","Many people naturally wouldn’t be so superficial when it came to problems.","With Star Shatter’s strength, there were plenty of experts in the Flying Celestial Alliance who could suppress him. Huangfu Longhao had personally made a move, and his target was Jun Tianci of the Monarch Alliance.","“Huangfu Longhao is so powerful. Star Shatter was beaten to a dying state by him in one move. He almost didn’t make it.’","“This is the top ancient prodigy. Star Shatter’s strength is not enough to make","Huangfu Longhao personally fight. The only reason for him to do so is Jun Tianci!”","“That’s right. I’ve also heard that Jun Tianci had once disregarded his status and ambushed the current number one on the Prodigy List of the Flying Celestials. This had infuriated the entire Flying Celestials. That incident had happened more than ten years ago, but its influence has not been cleared up until now! ”","“That’s right.. After Huangfu Longhao heard about this matter, he attacked Jun Tianci many times!”"]},{"number":2115,"title":"Chapter 2115: I’ll Kill Them All in One Go","paragraphs":["Chapter 2115: I’ll Kill Them All in One Go","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“However, Jun Tianci seems to know this as well. That’s why he avoided Huangfu Longhao many times. He’s obviously trying to gain more time to grow. After all, his cultivation time is much shorter than Huangfu Longhao’s. Even if his talent is not inferior to Huangfu Longhao’s, he still needs time to grow! ”","“The competition between these major forces is really too terrifying. They are targeting each other’s talented prodigies. Jun Tianci relied on his cultivation age to surpass Chu Yunfan and kill him. Now, Huangfu Longhao has also targeted Jun Tianci a few times!”","“Outside, the two sides still show control. But on the battlefield, the grudge between the two sides has completely erupted. No one can control them!” “However, I heard that Jun Tianci still hasn’t appeared. He allowed Star Shatter to be severely injured. However, it’s said that Jun Tianci is in closed-door cultivation. When he comes out of closed-door cultivation again, he will be able to contend with Huangfu Longhao once he has mastered his divine technique!’","All kinds of information poured into Chu Yunfan’s ears. In particular, the matter of Huangfu Longhao made Chu Yunfan’s eyes light up. He had not expected there would be such a powerful prodigy in the Flying Celestials, far superior to Yang Dengxian and the others.","Huangfu Longhao was a peerless figure who could compete with many prodigies on the battlefield. He was almost invincible. Even Chu Yunfan was somewhat fascinated and wanted to meet such a person.","“However, I’m afraid that Huangfu Longhao doesn’t have much time to care about Jun Tianci now. After all, the Destiny Alliance isn’t dead. Even if the Destiny Alliance and the Monarch Alliance aren’t on good terms, they originated from the Destiny Sect, so they won’t just stand by and watch. It’s said that the chief of the Destiny Alliance has already set off to find trouble with Huangfu Longhao. I’m afraid that there will be another series of battles. I’m afraid that the Destiny Alliance and the Flying Celestial Alliance will have to fight again!’","“However, what’s really interesting is the battle between the two Gushe Princesses. In the past half a year, the two Gushe Princesses have fought three times, each more intense and brutal than the last!”","“That’s right. I was there in the first match. I saw the first Princess Gushe severely injure Tang Siyu and almost kill her!”","“The difference between the two is obvious. After all, Tang Siyu’s cultivation years are less than half of that of the first Princess Gushe. It’s normal for there to be such a big gap between the two!”","“However, Tang Siyu had the ability to protect herself in the second round.","Her strength could be said to have undergone an earth-shattering change. Although she was still no match for her, it was not as dangerous as the first round!”","“It’s said that the third match was the most exciting. In recent times, Princess Gushe and her followers had set up a trap for Tang Siyu and lured her into it. However, she sensed that something was wrong and left after killing an expert! ‘","Among them, information about Tang Siyu was quickly collected by Chu","Yunfan, letting him know about Tang Siyu’s situation in the past six months.","Tang Siyu had entered the battlefield to avenge Chu Yunfan. Her goal was to kill Jun Tianci. Who knew that she would encounter a great enemy? She had fought three life-and-death battles for the title of Princess Gushe.","From being severely injured at the beginning to being able to easily break through the encirclement, it was obvious that Tang Siyu had used these battles to complete a huge transformation in the past six months. Otherwise, she would not have been able to do it so easily.","However, as time passed, the battle between the two sides became more and more intense. In the past half a year, they had fought three times. It could be imagined that Princess Gushe had probably lost all her patience and wanted to get rid of Tang Siyu.","Judging from the news from all sides, Princess Gushe in recent times was powerful. She had entered the Prodigy Battlefield more than once in the distant era and left behind many trump cards. Many of them had grown into top-notch experts among the natives. Comparatively speaking, Tang Siyu had almost no power. Behind her was Serene Immortal Mountain. However, before Serene Immortal Mountain, only the Elder Princess had entered the Prodigy Battlefield. It hadn’t been long since then, and Tang Siyu!s foundation wasn’t deep enough. She could only rely on herself to fight her way out. One could imagine how difficult this was!","Chu Yunfan didn’t want to help Tang Siyu because he knew that this was her own fated battle. Unless she was willing to give up the title of Gushe Princess, a decisive battle between the two sides was inevitable unless one side fell or retreated. Once Tang Siyu retreated, her Dao heart would no longer be stable. Without the will to be invincible, she was destined to not be able to walk to the end.","“Let’s kill Star Shatter first, then meet up with Siyu!’ Chu Yunfan!s eyes narrowed, and a terrifying light flashed through them.","Star Shatter could be said to be flamboyant and domineering. Previously, he said that he would investigate the Flying Celestial Alliance and it could be said that he was extremely arrogant. In the end, he even attracted an invincible prodigy like Huangfu Longhao.","Although Huangfu Longhao’s ultimate target was Jun Tianci, his actions aroused public outrage in the Flying Celestial Alliance. Now, Star Shatter was even more fanatical, looking for Chu Yunfan’s whereabouts everywhere, wanting to tear Chu Yunfan into pieces.","How could Chu Yunfan just let this go?","Even Star Shatter didn’t expect that Chu Yunfan would not give up even in such a disadvantageous situation. On the contrary, he was also scheming against Star Shatter.","“With my strength, I’m afraid that I might not be a match for Star Shatter. Two months ago, Star Shatter was severely injured and on the verge of death. However, no one knows how much he has recovered. If I want to win without losing, I have to be lenient.”","Based on the information he had gathered, Chu Yunfan could estimate that Star Shatter’s strength was probably at the peak Middle Arcana Stage. He was only half a step away from stepping into the Major Arcana Stage. The moment one stepped into the Major Arcana Stage, they would be considered as a top existence in the entire Prodigy Battlefield.","Although Star Shatter had been severely injured by Huangfu Longhao, Chu","Yunfan did not know how much he had recovered in the past two months. Chu Yunfan would rather overestimate his strength than underestimate it.","“With my strength, it’s probably impossible for me to advance further in the short term!” Chu Yunfan narrowed his eyes. It was unlikely for him to improve continuously in a short period like this. Even he had to stop and strengthen his foundation before making a breakthrough. Therefore, there was only one way to defeat the strong.","Chu Yunfan suddenly had an idea, and that was an array. Only by relying on the power of an array could the weak defeat the strong and defeat existences stronger than themselves. Not to mention, Chu Yunfan’s goal wasn’t just Star Shatter. He wanted to kill all the experts of the Monarch Alliance and the Destiny Alliance in one fell swoop.","“I’ll kill them all in one go!"]},{"number":2116,"title":"Chapter 2116: Primordial Immortal Slaying Array, the Heroes Gather","paragraphs":["Chapter 2116: Primordial Immortal Slaying Array, the Heroes Gather","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Before he entered the central region of the Prodigy Battlefield, he wanted to kill them on the spot. The center of the battlefield was the true battlefield. The environment was much worse than the outer region. There were many cities where locals gathered.","However, the center of the battlefield was filled with steep training grounds. Naturally, there was no so-called battlefield because there were battlefields everywhere. Ordinary Minor Arcanes would never enter this place, as that would be courting death. It was a completely chaotic world!","‘The Primordial Immortal Slaying Array’ This term flashed through Chu Yunfan’s mind. At this point, not many people had heard of this array.","However, in ancient times, this array was once like thunder, because this Primordial Immortal Slaying Array was once a peerless array that the Array Emperor laid across the world.","From the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, Chu Yunfan knew that this peerless array had once killed more than ten emperors in one breath. It could be said to have a glorious record and was known as one of the three great vicious arrays in ancient times.","The Array Emperor became famous overnight with this array, letting everyone know how fierce and powerful he was. Before this, the Array Emperor and the Alchemy Emperor were similar, both relying on the auxiliary path to vindicate their Dao.","In the eyes of many people, although their understanding of various Great Daos would increase at the same time after vindication, there was still a gap in combat.","However, this battle made everyone realize that although the Array Emperor’s combat strength was basically at the bottom in a head-on confrontation, it was still extremely terrifying once it was used properly. The battle where ten emperors were killed in one battle was extremely shocking.","Later on, this array map ended up in the Alchemy Emperor’s hands and was recorded in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book. Of course, with Chu Yunfan’s understanding of arrays, it was impossible for him to set up a complete Primordial Immortal Slaying Array. It was even more wishful thinking to kill ten emperors.","Besides the fact that Chu Yunfan’s attainments in array formations were miles apart from the Array Emperor’s, more importantly, such an array formation could not have grown naturally in the world. It required a huge price to be laid out. The various heavenly and earthly treasures used in it were the complete","Primordial Immortal Slaying Array. Any one of them was enough to make Chu Yunfan bankrupt. Even if it was a weakened and simplified version, the resources needed to kill so many experts would still be an astronomical figure.","Fortunately, Chu Yunfan had recently looted four alliance bases. The spirit stones had been used up by Chu Yunfan, but other than some spirit herbs that Chu Yunfan had eaten as food, the rest were still intact. It was enough for Chu Yunfan to set up a weakened version of the Primordial Immortal Slaying Array.","After making his decision, Chu Yunfan began to look for a place to set up an array. Not every place could be set up with an array. Chu Yunfan had not reached that level yet, let alone the complexity of the Primordial Immortal Slaying Array. It was impossible to set it up in an instant. Only by relying on the geographical advantage could the power of this array be completely unleashed.","As Chu Yunfan began to appear without hiding his actions, everyone on the battlefield knew that Chu Yunfan, who had disappeared half a year ago, had reappeared. The forces that had been looking for him, especially the Monarch Alliance, the Destiny Alliance, the Blood-Clothes Tower, and the Evil Path Alliance, began to search for Chu Yunfan like crazy.","Chu Yunfan would appear from time to time, but he would soon disappear again, stumping the experts of the various large forces. But even so, the major forces did not let Chu Yunfan off. On the contrary, they mobilized more experts to the outer region.","This was not the first time these factions had entered the Prodigy Battlefield, and it was not the first time for the various prodigies to enter the Prodigy Battlefield either. They had buried many foreshadowing among the locals of the Prodigy Battlefield.","Many of the locals in the Prodigy Battlefield obeyed these prodigies. Some of them were even the descendants of these prodigies. It was only because these prodigies had sealed themselves for many years that they would be in the same hall as their descendants countless years later. These forces were usually hidden and would not be mobilized. However, at this critical moment, no one cared so much. All the hidden spies were activated.","Many people marveled at how well these major powers had hidden themselves. Usually, these major powers didn’t have many alliance members. After all, those who could join these alliances were either prodigies who were once famous or outstanding experts among the indigenous experts, such as Star Shatter. Of course, there weren’t many of such top figures. However, when these alliances were truly activated, their power was actually so shocking.","As these alliances went all out, more and more experts appeared, and more and more locals joined the search for Chu Yunfan. Not to mention the fact that the alliances had jointly offered a high price of five million high-grade spirit stones in order to find Chu Yunfan’s whereabouts. One could imagine how crazy everyone on the entire Prodigy Battlefield was.","“The Monarch Alliance is really generous this time. It’s said that the Monarch Alliance has paid three million high-grade spirit stones out of the five million high-grade spirit stones offered!”","“That’s right. Jian Wuchen has stirred up a hornet’s nest. I wonder what he’s thinking. He’s all alone, yet he dares to offend so many powerful alliances!”","“Someone saw Crown Prince Demonic Sky of the Evil Path Alliance in the outer region. It’s said that he’s a powerful figure in the central region. Now, he’s back in the outer region. This is a big deal!”","“Crown Prince Demonic Sky? I’ve heard of him before! He’s a Major Arcane! He’s famous even in the central region! Many prodigies have been hiding under his feet and becoming his followers!”","“l saw it with my own eyes. Yesterday, outside the Destiny Alliance base, someone rode a pegasus into the Destiny Alliance base. According to the rumors, that person was none other than the peerless prodigy of the Destiny Alliance 10,000 years ago. He was the one who made a name for himself in","Grand Xia. I didn’t expect that even he would be alarmed this time!”","“l don’t know what kind of person the Blood-Clothes Tower has sent out. The Blood-Clothes Tower has always been low-key. Besides themselves, who knows what kind of person they have sent out this time? However, they definitely won’t be ordinary people!’","“This time, Jian Wuchen is finished!”"]},{"number":2117,"title":"Chapter 2117: Scholar Serene","paragraphs":["Chapter 2117: Scholar Serene","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Because of Chu Yunfan, many experts and forces from various alliances and forces appeared. For a moment, a huge net enveloped Chu Yunfan, and as time passed, it became tighter and tighter. There were even a few times when it almost collided with Chu Yunfan.","Although Chu Yunfan had deliberately let them discover him, it meant that this big net was getting tighter and tighter. More and more people joined the hunt for Chu Yunfan under the temptation of five million high-grade spirit stones.","One day, a young man wearing Confucian-style robes with a devilish smile on his face strode into the Destiny Alliance base.","“Halt!","A loud shout rang out, and divine will swept over the young man in the Confucian robe.","After being robbed by Chu Yunfan, the Destiny Alliance had to be much more careful. There were crazy people in the world who didn’t put their Destiny Sect in their eyes. Chu Yunfan had even slaughtered the experts of their Destiny Sect as if they were ants. Moreover, this madman had not been caught yet.","Before that, everyone in the Destiny Alliance was extremely nervous. No one knew when Jian Wuchen would reappear and rob the Destiny Alliance again. With that guys arrogance, it was not impossible. It could even be said that it was very possible. Therefore, as long as any suspicious person came to visit, they would be paid attention to. Once something went wrong, they would immediately take action.","“l am Scholar Serene. I’ve come to inform you of Jian Wuchen’s whereabouts!”","This young scholar’s words caused a commotion in the Destiny Alliance. The major forces had joined forces to offer a bounty of five million high-grade spirit stones for Jian Wuchen’s capture. However, there was no news about Chu Yunfan. Although there was news of Chu Yunfan from time to time, they had never met him. They had brushed past him several times. Therefore, when the young scholar said that he knew where Jian Wuchen was, the entire Destiny Alliance was in an uproar.","“Is that true?” Suddenly, a loud roar came from within. Immediately after, a figure flashed across the sky and arrived before the young scholar.","Scholar Serene focused his gaze and saw that it was a young man who seemed to be in his thirties. This young man was burly and wore armor. He carried a somewhat conquering aura. One look and it was obvious that he was a decisive person who had walked down from the battlefield.","“Are you Marquis Tianma?” A devilish smile appeared on Scholar Serene’s face.","“That’s right, I am Marquis Tianma!” The young man’s expression was cold. He stared at the young man in the Confucian before him. However, the corners of his mouth revealed a cold smile as he said, “Your name is Scholar Serene? Why haven’t I heard of you before?”","“Titles are just a title. There are countless prodigies on the battlefield, from ancient times to the present era. There are countless prodigies. It’s normal for you to not know about one or two of them!” Scholar Serene looked at Marquis Tianma before him. Under Marquis Tianma’s intense gaze, he was calm and did not panic.","“What a sharp tongue. You really are a Confucian!” Marquis Tianma sneered as if he didn’t have high hopes for Scholar Serene. “However, I only want to know about Jian Wuchen. I’m not interested in your background!”","Marquis Tianma didn’t like Confucian scholars, especially when they were from the Virtuous Academy. The Destiny Sect was the number one sect in the world while the Virtuous Academy was the number two. Naturally, there was competition from all sides.","In that era, he had directly suppressed his peers in the Virtuous Academy.","Even after so many years, his peers had died of old age, but he was still young. However, he didn’t care if Scholar Serene came from the Virtuous Academy or if he had some other connections. He only cared about Jian Wuchen’s whereabouts.","Jian Wuchen’s existence was a bone to the Destiny Alliance and even the Destiny Sect. This was a huge insult to the Destiny Sect, and it was also a huge humiliation to him. He would feel ashamed if he didn’t catch Jian Wuchen.","“If you want to know about Jian Wuchen, give me 5 million high-grade spirit stones!” Scholar Serene’s eyes glimmered as he stared at Marquis Tianma.","“5 million high-grade spirit stones isn’t a problem.” Marquis Tianma frowned.","“But I’ll only give it to you when I see Jian Wuchen!”","“No, you have to give me 5 million high-grade spirit stones before I tell you the location!” Scholar Serene shook his head. “I’ll only feel at ease when I get my reward! ”","“Are you threatening me?” Marquis Tianma’s expression became even colder. No one had ever dared to threaten him before. “ lf I capture you instead, I can use the Soul Search Technique to find Jian Wuchen’s whereabouts!”","“But if that’s the case, who would dare to provide information to the Destiny","Alliance and Destiny Sect in the future? Everyone will know that the Destiny","Alliance will do anything to achieve their goals!” The corners of Scholar Serene’s mouth curled up into a smile, carrying a hint of evil charm. It was as if he was certain that Marquis Tianma would not turn hostile.","Marquis Tianma’s face was filled with uncertainty. The words of Scholar","Serene had indeed caught his sore spot. Although he could capture Scholar Serene now and use the Soul Search Technique to find what he wanted, their Destiny Alliance would never be able to offer any rewards in the future. Who would dare to provide information to such a treacherous force?","Everyone would be afraid of getting captured and having the Soul Search Technique used on them. The impact and consequences were far more severe than the value of a mere five million yuan.","No matter how angry he was, Marquis Tianam wouldn’t say such a thing so easily. He was only one of the big shots in the Destiny Alliance and wasn’t the true alliance chief. Otherwise, he wouldn’t be so conflicted.","“How do I know if the information you provide is correct?” Marquis Tianma said coldly. At this moment, killing intent surged in his heart. No one had ever been able to easily retreat after threatening him. He had already made up his mind. Once this matter was over, he would kill this arrogant scholar. Regardless of whether he was from the Virtuous Academy or not, he must not be allowed to live.","“Simple. 1 can go with you. If something goes wrong, you can just attack me. Isn’t that fine? But I need those spirit stones first. Otherwise, if you don’t keep your word, I won’t be able to get them.” Scholar Serene insisted on getting the spirit stones first.","Marquis Tianma thought for a moment and agreed that this was a good idea. If he didn’t see Jian Wuchen, he would just kill Scholar Serene. The latter wouldn’t dare to pull any tricks.."]},{"number":2118,"title":"Chapter 2118: Four Major Arcanes","paragraphs":["Chapter 2118: Four Major Arcanes","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","With his cultivation base, Marquis Tianma could tell that this Scholar Serene was only a Minor Arcane. With such cultivation, Scholar Serene could only muddle along in the outer region of the Prodigy Battlefield. If he entered the central region, he would not be able to muddle along at all. He would only die.","Therefore, Marquis Tianma was very confident that Scholar Serene would not be able to cause any trouble no matter what. As long as he wanted to, he could slap Scholar Serene to death.","“You can take the reward first, but don’t you dare insult the Destiny Alliance’s reputation. Otherwise, I will kill you,” Marquis Tianma said coldly.","Scholar Serene looked at Marquis Tianma. He could tell that Marquis Tianma’s killing intent was not fake. It was obvious that Marquis Tianma wanted to kill him. Even if he agreed to give him 5 million high-grade spirit stones now, he would still kill him if he turned hostile. It was only because he was still useful now. Otherwise, he would have died long ago.","“However, this bounty isn’t paid by the Destiny Alliance alone. I’ll find the other parties and have them come over now. Please wait here for a moment!” Marquis Tianma said coldly.","“Of course, but you’d better hurry up. As far as 1 know, Jian Wuchen won’t stay there for long. If you’re too late and can’t find him, don’t blame me!” Scholar Serene fanned the folding fan in his hand, looking elegant and graceful.","“I’ll make it quick,” Marquis Tianma said indifferently and then sent out a signal.","In just an hour or so, the sound of something breaking through the air could be heard from the horizon. A group of people appeared before everyone. Scholar Serene looked up and saw a group of figures with shocking evil energy. The evil energy on each of them was extremely shocking, and the weakest was at the Middle Arcane.","Most of them were locals, but there were also a few who were clearly prodigies of this era. And these people were led by one of them. This person unleashed his cultivation state without restraint, revealing his Major Arcana Stage without a doubt.","The barriers and formations in the Destiny Alliance base were instantly activated, protecting the entire base. This person was dressed in a luxurious robe and looked somewhat evil. His entire person seemed to be hidden in layers of void space. He looked to be about 27 or 28 years old and was quite handsome. However, this handsome appearance had a bit of a demonic appearance, It was obvious that he had cultivated an evil technique to a peak.","“Young Master Demonic Sky?” Scholar Serene gasped as he studied the people before him.","It was obvious that the leader of the group was none other than Young Master","Demonic Sky, the man who had been causing a ruckus recently. He was also a Major Arcane who was on par with Marquis Tianma, and behind him should be many experts from the Evil Path Alliance,","“That’s right. You actually recognize me? Not bad!” Young Master Demonic","Sky said with a sinister smile. “l heard that you have news about Jian Wuchen. It better be true, otherwise, I will personally rip off your head!”","“You’ll know later when you follow me!” Scholar Serene didn’t take Young Master Demonic Sky’s threat to heart. He just smiled faintly.","At this moment, another group of people appeared not far away. The person in the lead was none other than Star Shatter. These people were also emitting extremely powerful auras, each more extraordinary than the other.","“What?” Star Shatter arrived before Scholar Serene. “You have news about Jian Wuchen?” he shouted.","“That’s right. Why else would I be here?” Scholar Serene frowned slightly and casually dispersed the terrifying aura released by Star Shatter.","To his surprise, Star Shatter had broken through to Major Arcana Stage. The news he had received before was that Star Shatter was only at the Middle Arcana Stage. Yet, in just half a year, Star Shatter had already broken through to the Major Arcana Stage, becoming one of the strongest beings in the world.","At this moment, Scholar Serene suddenly understood why the Monarch Alliance did not send any other experts to deal with this matter. It was because Star Shatter alone was enough.","Star Shatter sneered and said, “You better be right. Otherwise, not only will you not be able to get a single cent of the 5 million high-grade spirit stones reward, but you will also have to pay with your life. The dignity of an expert cannot be easily humiliated! ”","Even though he had only just broken through to the Major Arcana Stage, Star Shatter was already putting on airs as a powerful being. Major Arcanes could roam freely even in the Prodigy Battlefield’s central regions. With his cultivation base, there was no need for him to be polite to Scholar Serene who seemed to only be a Minor Arcane. The two of them were not on the same level.","“Why is it that every single one of you has the same question? If you don’t believe me, I’ll just leave!” Scholar Serene said coldly as if he was dissatisfied with everyone’s attitude.","“You want to leave? Do you think you can do that? Be a good boy and lead us to Jian Wuchen. Otherwise, today will be the day you die!”","A blood-red light appeared in mid-air. Then, a person appeared before Scholar Serene. This person was wrapped in a ball of blood-colored energy, making it impossible to see his appearance clearly. One could only see that it was a blood-colored figure.","“Another Major Arcane!”","Everyone present could instantly sense a terrifying aura that only Major Arcanes could sense from this blood-red figure.","“A Major Arcane of the Blood-Clothes Tower. You are Xue Yinzi, aren’t you?” Marquis Tianma seemed to have suddenly thought of something. “You debuted 100 years earlier than me, and you once killed the chief disciple of the Destiny Sect. After I debuted, I wanted to kill you to regain the face that my sect had lost. Who knew that you would disappear without a trace at that time? I didn’t expect you to choose to seal yourself till this era. The heavens are really helping me! ”","“You want to kill me?” Xue Yinzi sneered and looked at Marquis Tianma. “You are welcome to give it a try!”","Seeing that everyone was about to start fighting, Star Shatter said, “The two of you, regardless of your grudges, the first thing we need to do now is to find","Jian Wuchen and get rid of him. Everything else has to come after that. If anyone disrupts this alliance, Young Master Demonic Sky and I will kill that person!”","“That’s right. This is also my opinion. We want to kill Jian Wuchen first!” Young Master Demonic Sky said after a pause.."]},{"number":2119,"title":"Chapter 2119: Wind and Clouds Surge in the City","paragraphs":["Chapter 2119: Wind and Clouds Surge in the City","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Young Master Demonic Sky keenly watched the two people who were about to explode. This was a very common situation in the Prodigy Battlefield. The prodigies on the Prodigy Battlefield came from the ancient era until the modern era. The grudges between them were complicated, and ordinary people could not understand them. The grudges between them had never stopped.","In addition, during the process of awakening many times, the grudges formed on the Prodigy Battlefield were everywhere. To him, both Marquis Tianma and Xue Yinzi were extremely difficult to deal with. It would be best if both sides suffered heavy losses.","However, he quickly remembered why he had come. He was here to deal with Jian Wuchen, who had dared to provoke the Evil Path Alliance. It had always been the evil path elites in the Evil Path Alliance who were lawless. They could kill whoever they wanted and target whoever they wanted. Since when was it someone else’s turn to find trouble with them? It was already good enough that they did not find trouble with others!","Therefore, Young Master Demonic Sky suppressed his desire to see both sides clash and suffer. He immediately spoke up and supported Star Shatter.","As for Marquis Tianma and Xue Yinzi, they only snorted coldly. They knew that this wasn’t the time to engage in a huge battle. Both sides were Major Arcanes. Experts of this level would be considered the pinnacle existences in the Prodigy Battlefield.","How could it be so easy to kill each other? In the end, they would only let a third party benefit from the fight.","“All right, let’s kill Jian Wuchen. But this guy wants 5 million high-grade spirit stones first. What do you think?” Marquis Tianma nodded his head, reluctantly agreeing not to start an internal war. However, he immediately turned his gaze to Scholar Serene, his gaze carrying a cold killing intent.","On the other hand, Scholar Serene was indifferent. Clearly, he did not take the killing intent in Marquis Tianma’s eyes to heart.","“Then give it to him,” Xue Yinzi said slowly. His voice was hoarse and had a hint of vicissitudes.","“That’s right. We have to kill Jian Wuchen first!” Young Master Demonic Sky nodded.","Although 5 million high-grade spirit stones was a lot, it was not as important as killing Jian Wuchen. Besides, he could get the 5 million high-grade spirit stones back later.","Young Master Demonic Sky even had a plan in his mind. After killing Jian","Wuchen, he would immediately send someone to deal with Scholar Serene, After all, he had such a shocking amount of wealth. It was only natural for him to kill him. On the Prodigy Battlefield, being weak was the original sin.","“Since you’ve reached an agreement, give me 5 million high-grade spirit stones.” Scholar Serene revealed a somewhat impatient expression.","When the others looked at him, it was as if they were looking at a dead man. Now, Scholar Serene, who was in a hurry to get 5 million high-grade spirit stones, was simply courting death.","If he wasn’t in such a hurry, he might still have a way out. However, if he was in such a hurry to take it, he was simply courting death. No matter who was present, they wouldn’t let him off. A mere Minor Arcane dared to act so brazenly in front of so many experts. He was simply courting death.","“Here, 5million high-grade spirit stones!” Marquis Tianma then threw a spatial bag to Scholar Serene.","Scholar Serene opened the spatial bag. It was an ownerless spatial bag, so anyone could open it. With a sweep of his divine will, he confirmed that it was indeed 5 million high-grade spirit stones.","A satisfied smile immediately appeared on his face. He said with a smile, “Since everyone is straightforward, then I will also be straightforward. Let’s set off immediately. However, you are the only one from the Blood-Clothes Tower. Aren’t you going to send more experts?”","A voice came from Xue Yinzi’s bloody shadow. “No need. 1 alone am enough. If I can’t solve it, it doesn’t matter how many people I bring!’","“Is that so? That’s a pity!” Scholar Serene pouted.","“What did you say?” Star Shatter shouted.","“Nothing. I said its enough. This many people are enough!” Scholar Serene said, “Let’s go!” He stepped out of the light and disappeared.","“Let’s go!’","Everyone looked at each other and followed the direction of the disappearing Scholar Serene.","At the same time, the various major forces in the city, who were initially curious as to why so many top-notch experts had gathered together, finally received the news. The four forces attacked, wanting to kill Jian Wuchen. One stone caused a thousand ripples. Recently, Jian Wuchen’s news had undoubtedly attracted the most attention.","How many people could not care about the reward of 5 million high-grade spirit stones? This was a bounty that even Major Arcanes would be envious of. If it wasn’t for the fact that Jian Wuchen had done such a terrible thing, robbing four huge alliances in a row, he probably wouldn’t have been given such a shocking bounty.","Many people were frantically searching for Jian Wuchen’s whereabouts in order to obtain the reward of 5 million high-grade spirit stones. Who would have thought that they would be informed that the major powers had already received news of Jian Wuchen and were on their way to find him?","Many people were shocked. They immediately made a decision and chased after Jian Wuchen. They wanted to see Jian Wuchen being killed. It was a rare sight. It was a terrifying thing for the top experts of the four forces to attack together.","Lan Hao, Yang Dengxian, and the others in the Flying Celestials base also received the news.","“What? They found Jian Wuchen?” Yang Dengxian said in shock.","Lan Hao’s expression was serious as he said, “With the strength of the four major alliances, if they want to find a person, theywill search through the entire battlefield. Unless he’s not in the Prodigy Battlefield, it’s only a matter of time before they find him. It’s just that I didn’t expect it to be so fast!”","“If they really find him, Jian Wuchen is dead meat. Let’s find a way to inform him and tell him to leave!” Yang Dengxian said.","“How? He didn’t leave a way for us to contact him. He’s clearly guarding against us. It’s impossible for us to contact him now!” Lan Hao shook his head.","“Let’s go over and take a look. Although Jian Wuchen will not be able to escape death even if he has three heads and six arms under the siege of these four experts, there is still a chance. If there is hope, I hope to save him. It’s not for anything else. It’s enough to disgust the Destiny Sect!”","Yang Dengxian quickly nodded. Jian Wuchen had saved his life before, so he would not sit idly by.","After the two of them discussed, they instantly disappeared into the horizon.."]},{"number":2120,"title":"Chapter 2120: Ambush, Activating the Array","paragraphs":["Chapter 2120: Ambush, Activating the Array","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The news that Jian Wuchen had been found caused a huge commotion in the city. Many people followed the tracks and chased after the experts of the major forces who had left first. Everyone had their own thoughts. It could be said that they had their own ulterior motives and plans.","The group that had left first had already arrived at a valley. In the lush valley, all kinds of trees and vegetation flourished and large trees soared into the sky.","“You’re saying that Jian Wuchen is hiding in this valley?” After everyone stopped their flight, Star Shatter frowned.","He looked at the valley with a sharp murderous look. He had been severely injured by Huangfu Longhao and almost died. If it wasn’t for the fact that Jun Tianci, the alliance chief, had found him some healing medicine, he would have died a long time ago.","Even though he had managed to break through to Major Arcana Stage with the help of the sacred medicine, and had become one of the strongest fighters in the battlefield of the prodigies, he was still a prodigy.","However, that had still been a great humiliation for him. Even if the person who attacked him was Huangfu Longhao, it would not affect him at all. He now had a clear understanding of the difference in strength between himself and Huangfu Longhao. He was a terrifying existence that even Jun Tianci, the supreme prodigy he followed, had to avoid.","Even if he was a Major Arcane now, Star Shatter would still be unable to escape death when facing such a terrifying existence. He might not even be able to withstand a single strike from Huangfu Longhao.","Therefore, he blamed all the grudges on Jian Wuchen. If it wasn’t for Jian Wuchen, he wouldn’t have suffered such humiliation. Thinking of this, the killing intent in his eyes became even sharper.","“That’s right. He’s recuperating in this valley. I don’t know who injured him previously, so he’s been here all this time. I found him by accident.” Scholar Serene nodded.","“This looks like a trap though. This place is too suitable for setting up an array formation!” a young elite behind Marquis Tianma spoke. He had astonishing attainments in array formations. With just a glance, he felt that the terrain here was not quite right. It was too suitable for setting up array formations.","Such a place was rare. Even if no one had set up a formation in such a place, after a long time of evolution, there was a chance that it would evolve into a natural formation. At that time, its power would be shocking.","“A trap? So what?” Young Master Demonic Sky sneered. “We are here. No trap can hurt us!”","Young Master Demonic Sky didn’t care about any trap. He was morbidly confident in his own strength. He was not inferior to anyone in the world, and his cultivation base was earth-shattering. If he hadn’t cultivated for long enough, he would have even wanted to fight for the position of the chief of the Evil Path Alliance.","When everyone heard this, they felt that it was indeed so. In the Prodigy Battlefield, such situations were really very common. How many of the prodigies felt that they were worse than others?","Each of them felt that they were unparalleled in the world, which was why they sealed themselves up and waited for the godhood path to open up and fight for the opportunity to become a god. With so many experts here, even if someone were to plot something, it would be impossible for them to succeed. In the face of absolute strength, any scheme was too weak.","“Very well. Search for him. We must find Jian Wuchen!”","As soon as Marquis Tianma gave the order, many Destiny Alliance experts behind him began to search with their divine wills.","“Find Jian Wuchen and tear him into pieces!” Star Shatter also gave out an order.","“Catch him, don’t let him escape!’","“I’d like to see if this is a man with three heads and six arms,” Young Master","Demonic Sky said slowly, “How dare he provoke the Evil Path Alliance!”","The experts of the Evil Path Alliance behind Young Master Demonic Sky also started to search. Every single one of these experts was a Middle Arcane. As for Minor Arcanes, they weren’t sent here at all.","From the battle that Jian Wuchen had fought earlier, it could be seen that he had definitely surpassed the Minor Arcana Stage and entered the Middle Arcana Stage. Even if a Minor Arcane was sent here, it would be a dead end. All the alliances hated Chu Yunfan to the core and wanted to tear him into pieces. Every force sent their elite experts.","Looking at everyone’s actions, Scholar Serene revealed a cold smile and casually began to form a seal.","“What are you doing?” Marquis Tianma was the first to notice Scholar Serene’s actions.","However, Scholar Serene did not stop. Instead, he sped up the seals in his hands. Soon, the surrounding area, which was originally filled with birds and flowers, and the lush green valley instantly changed. Waves of terrifying killing intent were released from the valley, and endless killing intent pervaded the entire valley. It turned into a gust of cold wind and howled.","“D*mn it! Kill him!”","Young Master Demonic Sky was the first to react. He was about to kill Chu Yunfan, but his face was red. With his cultivation and experience, how could he not see that he had clearly fallen into someone else’s trap? The entire valley was part of the array.","Thinking back to how he had confidently said that he did not care about any traps, this was simply a slap in the face. Just as he finished speaking, it had ruthlessly slapped his face. He was both embarrassed and angry. His first reaction was to kill Scholar Serene.","However, there was no time for that. In a flash, Scholar Serene had already appeared ten miles away. He flew high in the sky and looked at the people who were aggressive before, but were now completely dumbfounded.","“Who are you?” Star Shatter said with a cold expression.","At this moment, even the dumbest person could see that something was wrong. This was a trap from the beginning to the end. It was to lure them in and then use the array to kill them. They could already imagine the arrangements in between.","“Why did you help Jian Wuchen deal with us? Do you know what kind of power we have? If you offend us, you won’t be able to move an inch!” Star Shatter said coldly.","“That’s right. I don’t care who you are. If you offend the Destiny Sect, even if you’re an ancient prodigy, you won’t be able to escape death. The place you sealed yourself will be found by the Destiny Sect, and your sect will be uprooted. Don’t make a mistake!” Marquis Tianma said coldly. His words were filled with threats.","In reality, this was not a threat. If the sects of ancient and modern times were discovered, they would most likely die and be completely wiped out.."]},{"number":2121,"title":"Chapter 2121: It’s More Than Enough to Deal With You","paragraphs":["Chapter 2121: It’s More Than Enough to Deal With You","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","And such a thing did not happen occasionally. On the contrary, it had happened many times since ancient times. Many of these self-proclaimed prodigies had been sealed for many years. The sects or families that sealed them back then had long been destroyed, and the rest were basically alone.","It could even be said that they were the last inheritance of their sects. There were many resources and wealth in it, and many of the sect’s inheritance books were there. Therefore, many people liked to look for the bases of these sects that had already been destroyed. Generally speaking, these prodigies were sealed in these places.","Since ancient times, when these ancient sects were found, a large number of experts would invade them on a large scale, divide up the resources and wealth, and plunder all the inheritance manuals, divine techniques, and secret techniques.","To the ancient prodigies, they were not afraid of anything. What they were afraid of was that their nest would be uprooted. Unlike the current ten great sects of Grand Xia, the ten great sects were extremely powerful and had countless experts. In the Grand Xia Empire, they had the power to cover the sky with one hand and possessed unimaginable power.","The prodigies from these forces could completely seal themselves in the core area of the ten great forces and would not be harassed. Unless Grand Xia was destroyed one day, and the ten great sects were destroyed, then they would not be threatened.","Since ancient times, many prodigies had been sealed like this, and the sect they were already gone. These prodigies sealed themselves. Other than waiting for the future path to godhood, they were also a backup plan left behind by the ancient sects. If the sect was destroyed, these prodigies would be the seeds of revival.","It could be said that these prodigies were entrusted with the ancient sects’ hope to revive their sects and revive their great era.","Under such circumstances, these ancient prodigies often did not dare to choose to contend with the current powerful factions. This was because once these factions were furious and destroyed their nests, they would be finished. They would become rootless duckweed and have no hope of becoming a god.","“That’s right. I don’t care who you are. If you don’t kneel down and explain yourself, you won’t be able to escape death!” Young Master Tian Xie said coldly. The evil smile on his face was gone, and he looked like a cold noble young master from the evil path.","“Kill them!” Xue Yinzi was simpler. The blood-red figure only uttered one word, and that was the word “kill.”","“Hahahahaha! You still don’t understand?” Scholar Serene laughed. “I’m the Jian Wuchen you’re looking for.”","All of a sudden, under the watchful eyes of the crowd, Scholar Serene turned into Jian Wuchen, whom they hated so much that they gritted their teeth. Everyone understood that from the very beginning, this was a huge trap, a trap that lured them in. From the start, Scholar Serene didn’t exist. It was Jian Wuchen in disguise. His goal was obvious—he wanted to kill all of them here.","“What a big move! What great ambition!” Star Shatter was so angry that his entire body was trembling.","He finally understood why Chu Yunfan had said that Xue Yinzi being the only one from the Blood-Clothes Tower was a pity. It turned out that Chu Yunfan had also included the Blood-Clothes Tower in his plan. Who knew that the Blood-Clothes Tower would only send Xue Yinzi and not many other experts to die? It was really a pity.","Xue Yinzi had also thought of this, and his face was ashen with anger. No one had ever dared to underestimate him and the Blood-Clothes Tower like this. It was simply preposterous.","Jian Wuchen, no, Chu Yunfan just smiled faintly as he looked at the people in front of him. After he had set up this array, he would think of a way to lure these people over. The reason he had disguised himself as Scholar Serene to trick them into coming in was naturally for the 5 million high-grade spirit stones. Even he was envious of so many high-grade spirit stones. With so many high-grade spirit stones, it was enough for his cultivation to advance.","His strength far exceeded that of experts of the same level. Naturally, the resources he needed far exceeded those of experts of the stage level. This 5 million high-grade spirit stones could be said to solve his urgent needs.","Similarly, Scholar Serene that he had transformed into pretended to be greedy in order to make them trust him more and attract more experts. Of course, Chu Yunfan could not hide what these people were thinking. They would only think of a way to kill him after the matter was over and take back the 5 million high-grade spirit stones. At that time, they wouldn’t have to destroy the reputation of each family, and they could also recover their losses. It was really killing two birds with one stone.","However, they had never thought that Scholar Serene was Jian Wuchen, who was also Chu Yunfan. This was the only thing they had missed out on, and this was their fatal weakness. What they didn’t expect was that Chu Yunfan, who was being chased, didn’t think about avoiding them. Instead, he wanted to set a trap to kill them. Chu Yunfan’s series of unconventional methods had duped these people, and they fell into his trap.","“You actually came personally. How audacious!” Young Master Demonic Sky said coldly.","“If not for that, why would you obediently fall into my trap?” Chu Yunfan grinned. If he hadn’t come personally, it would have been good enough to attract half of these people.","“You’re both shrewd and scheming, but it’s a pity that you’re too weak. I don’t care how strange or powerful this formation is. As long as I kill you, everything will be over! ”","Suddenly, a hoarse voice sounded in Chu Yunfan’s ears. A blood-red light sq.rept across the sky and pierced into Chu Yunfan’s body. It was Xue Yinzi.","Bam!","Chu Yunfan’s body dispersed on the spot. It was actually a spirit energy incarnation, not the original body.","“Hahahaha, do you think I won’t be wary of this? You’re too naive!” Chu Yunfan’s laughter came from outside the valley. “Now, it’s time to witness a miracle. It’s your honor to die under this Primordial Immortal Slaying Array!’","Chu Yunfan’s hands kept changing, forming seals one by one. As he formed different seals, the entire array began to slowly kick into gear. In an instant, the array turned into endless chaos, and shocking killing intent raged everywhere.","The terrifying killing intent started to materialize and float in the air, causing the terrifying experts who had already stepped into the Middle Arcana Stage and even Major Arcane Stage to feel as if they were about to suffocate. “Although it’s only a simplified version, it’s more than enough to deal with you!”"]},{"number":2122,"title":"Chapter 2122: Absolute Killing Array","paragraphs":["Chapter 2122: Absolute Killing Array","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan looked on coldly at these people. To set up this trap, he had put himself in danger. Although he was confident of protecting himself, he could also figure out the thoughts of these people, so the risk factor was not as high as he imagined.","But even so, he still took a huge risk in order to kill all these people and make the hearts of the major factions ache. Not only were there Middle Arcanes, but there were also many Major Arcanes as well. To any faction, this was a force that they would not give up so easily.","When everyone saw Chu Yunfan’s confident look, their expressions changed slightly. How could they not understand that this was Chu Yunfan’s trump card? The trump card that Chu Yunfan was so confident of dealing with them was not ordinary.","In this short time, the weather between heaven and earth had changed. The world became chaotic as if it had returned to the time before the creation of the world. It was chaotic and boundless. The terrifying killing intent had already taken form and began to patrol in the air. It was like a group of sharks that had smelled blood and began to attack crazily. Several Middle Arcanes who could not dodge in time instantly died to this terrifying killing intent.","“Let’s join hands and form a battle formation to resist this array! I don’t believe that this array can run endlessly. When our alliance chief gets the news, he will come and kill the b*stard himself!” Young Master Demonic Sky shouted.","Under the pressure of the materialized killing intent, he was in a sorry state. He had never been in such a state before. Now that Chu Yunfan had forced him to this point, how could he not be angry? He was burning with anger.","However, at this moment, they experienced the power of this killing array. It far exceeded everyone’s imagination. These materialized killing intent were actually so fierce, like a terrifying attack. Every killing intent that materialized seemed to contain a certain kind of will behind it.","Young Master Demonic Sky and the others were even more depressed to find that they had never heard of this killing array before, let alone seen it and understood its flaws.","Currently, the only way was to endure the operation of this array. To operate such a large array, the consumption of resources was extremely terrifying. Unless there was a huge support behind it, it was impossible for it to last for too long.","Everyone nodded and began to join forces to form a battle formation. No matter how discord they had previously, in the face of survival, everything was fleeting clouds. Chu Yunfan was not surprised that Young Master","Demonic Sky had discovered the biggest weakness of the formation so quickly. After all, although the formations were different, they all had something in common. It was not strange for them to realize this with their knowledge.","However, being able to realize it and being able to solve the problem were two different things.","“Yeah, it’s impossible for it to last forever, but it’s enough to kill you!’","As he spoke, Chu Yunfan continued to make hand seals. The Primordial Immortal Slaying Array began to operate faster and faster. The killing intent formed a terrifying will that kept bombarding the formation formed by Young Master Demonic Sky and the others.","With Young Master Demonic Sky, Star Shatter, Marquis Tianma, and Xue Yinzi as the leaders, Young Master Demonic Sky and the others formed a formation with the four of them as the formation’s core and tried to stop them.","“What kind of killing array is this?”","Soon, everyone was shocked to discover that after the Primordial Immortal Slaying Array circulated more and more rapidly, the terrifying killing intent actually transformed into a human figure. Behind these human figures, they actually transformed into powerful martial arts experts. These martial arts experts attacked their battle formation. They evolved into different attacks and attacked the battle formation from all directions.","Spurt!","Among the four of them, Star Shatter, who had just broken through to Major Arcane, spat out a mouthful of blood. His eyes were filled with disbelief. He could not believe that this killing intent could actually evolve into different martial arts experts.","“This killing array can obtain the marks of experts from the world and revive them. From there, it can achieve a certain degree of rebirth for these experts to obtain a portion of their power when they were alive!” Marquis Tianma said in shock.","Originally, he didn’t really care about the Primordial Immortal Slaying Array. It was just a killing array, but the Destiny Sect’s killing array was also famous throughout the world world. However, the Destiny Sect’s killing array was simply incomparable to the killing array in front of him.","The killing array in front of him could actually achieve the same effect as the Prodigy Battlefield. Weren’t the heroic spirits on the Prodigy Battlefield born in this way? The marks of those experts who had fallen were forcefully revived. In the night of the Prodigy Battlefield, they were revived and their bodies were rebuilt with Yin energy.","The effect of this killing array was similar, but the marks of these revived experts were even more terrifying. He could see all kinds of attacks with his naked eyes. Many of the attacks were unheard of and had never been seen before. It was obvious that they were attacks from an extremely ancient era. It was completely different from the current cultivation system.","They did not know that this was just a weakened version of the Primordial Immortal Slaying Array. The true complete form could even summon the marks of those fallen emperors from a distant era, recondense their physical bodies, and then use them. Once, the battle of the Primordial Immortal Slaying Array shocked the world. They relied on this method to beat several emperors trapped in it to death.","Just that one time, the Primordial Immortal Slaying Array became famous all over the world. However, as time passed, the ancient legend had become a myth to the present. They did not understand the power of the Primordial Immortal Slaying Array.","Spurt!","A Middle Arcane spat out a mouthful of blood. Finally, he couldn’t resist anymore. He took a step back and spat out blood. A human figure formed by killing intent pierced through his chest with a sword, ending his life.","And this was only the beginning. As this person was killed, more and more Middle Arcanes could no longer resist. They were killed one after another, and their corpses were collected by Chu Yunfan into the Mountain River Diagram.","At the same time, the followers of Marquis Tianma, Young Master Demonic Sky, and the other experts from various forces in the city arrived at the battlefield. However, when they arrived at this battlefield, everyone was shocked and stunned. Unlike what they had imagined, the experts of the major forces were trapped by Jian Wuchen’s killing array and could not even protect themselves.."]},{"number":2123,"title":"Chapter 2123: The Cunning Chu Yunfan, the Dumbfounded Heroes","paragraphs":["Chapter 2123: The Cunning Chu Yunfan, the Dumbfounded Heroes","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Everyone stared at this scene with their mouths agape. It was completely different from what they had imagined. They had never even dreamed that there would be such an outcome.","Everyone had witnessed the strength of the major forces. Even the Flying Celestial Alliance, which was a behemoth, did not dare to provoke these four behemoths at the same time.","However, Jian Wuchen had done it. In everyone’s eyes, the only thing Jian Wuchen could do was to be chased like a rat on the street until the day he was caught. After all, Jian Wuchen didn’t have the ability to fight back.","However, reality had given them a big slap in the face. The Jian Wuchen, who they thought could only run around like a stray dog, had trapped these experts of the various forces that thought were sure of victory in the killing array.","“What kind of killing array is that? How come I’ve never heard of such a terrifying killing array!","Many people tried their best to recall what they knew about battle formations in their memories. Many of these people were top prodigies who had suppressed an era. Their knowledge was naturally not something that ordinary people could compare to. Even so, they still felt that they had gained nothing and did not obtain the information they wanted.","There was no need to doubt how terrifying this killing array was. So many great and Middle Arcanes had been trapped in the killing array by Jian Wuchen, whose cultivation level was far inferior to theirs.","In the short time they had rushed over, they had already seen two Middle Arcanes killed by killing intent. Only now did this peerless killing array finally reveal the tip of the iceberg.","“Jian Wuchen definitely can’t be a solo cultivator that have cultivated to this extent. He must have inherited some kind of legacy!’","Many people couldn’t help but have this thought. However, from the ancient times to the present day, who knew how many years had passed. It was impossible to calculate how many forces had risen and fallen. There were countless inheritances that specialized in the array path. It was almost impossible to find out what kind of legend Jian Wuchen had.","However, they knew that with the terrifying power of the killing array, the inheritance that Jian Wuchen had obtained was definitely not simple. Many people were even more curious as to how such a person had become enemies with Jun Tianci.","“Jian Wuchen, do you not have the courage to fight us? Do you only dare to borrow the power of an array?” Marquis Tianma roared. Under the attacks of all kinds of experts formed from killing intent, he could be said to be suffering miserably.","These masters who were formed from killing intent were all top-notch masters who had left their illustrious reputation in history. That was why they were able to leave their mark in the world and be revived by the Primordial Immortal Slaying Array.","Although there was only a little bit of consciousness left, it was still terrifying. All that was left was the will to fight. It was willing to sacrifice its life and death, not caring about life and death. This was the most terrifying part.","If this continued, he would die in this killing array sooner or later. He could only anger Chu Yunfan and force him to fight. That was his only chance.","The only chance to kill Chu Yunfan!","Once Chu Yunfan was killed, the array would naturally stop. Everyone could see that the array was maintained by Chu Yunfan. He suspected that the entire array would naturally stop operating. Although the chance was slim, he still wanted to grab it.","“Hahahaha! Marquis Tianma, I know you’re just goading me, but I’ll do as you wish!” Chu Yunfan laughed loudly, his eyes flashing with a fierce fighting spirit.","Of course, he wasn’t angered by Marquis Tianma’s words. If he was so easily angered, then he was being underestimated.","It was because he noticed that as the array moved faster and faster, the killing intent experts born from it became more and more powerful. At the same time, the consumption of resources became faster and faster. At this rate, it would not be long before the formation stopped operating. At that time, all his efforts would be in vain and they would escape. Therefore, Chu Yunfan had no choice but to take action personally.","It would be the safest to watch them being ground to death by the array from afar. At this time, the so-called honor of an expert, unless he was stupid, he would not be provoked by such a simple provocation.","“Come!” Marquis Tianma roared. A sharp light flashed in his eyes. As long as Jian Wuchen came down, he would be able to kill him with one strike. As long as he was given a chance, even if it was just for a moment, it would be enough to decide the outcome.","At that time, the array would naturally stop!","He didn’t know why Chu Yunfan wanted to personally participate in the battle. Although he guessed that the operation of this array required too many resources and Chu Yunfan couldn’t last forever, he didn’t dare to bet on whether he could last.","Young Master Demonic Sky and the others’ eyes lit up as they thought of the same thing. They all began to help Marquis Tianma block the spirits of the experts formed by the killing intent. This would allow Marquis Tianma to deal with Chu Yunfan!","“I’m coming!” Chu Yunfan shouted and joined the battlefield.","A huge ball of lightning power was grabbed in his hand, turning into a spear. The spear swept across the sky as if it was the first flash that tore through the night sky, instantly blasting into the brain of a Middle Arcane.","The brain of this Middle Arcane exploded. Before he died, he looked like he had died with grievances. He never expected that Chu Yunfan would attack him the moment he joined the battlefield.","Hadn’t he agreed to fight Marquis Tianma?","Chu Yunfan’s sudden attack and killing of a Middle Arcane shocked everyone in the array. Everyone outside the formation was also shocked by the power that Chu Yunfan had suddenly displayed. After all, according to the rumors, Chu Yunfan should only have the combat strength of an ordinary Middle Arcane. However, looking at Chu Yunfan’s attack, it was simply sweeping through the Middle Arcana Stage.","They were completely speechless. They did not expect that when everyone thought that Chu Yunfan had joined the battlefield to fight with Marquis Tianma, he would take advantage of the chaos to kill that Middle Arcane.","The Major Arcanes were holding back their strength, making them the hardest to deal with. However, those Middle Arcanes were much easier to deal with. First, he had to deal with these Middle Arcanes!","Chu Yunfan was really too sneaky!"]},{"number":2124,"title":"Chapter 2124: Crazy Slaughter, You’re All My Whetstones","paragraphs":["Chapter 2124: Crazy Slaughter, You’re All My Whetstones","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","There was actually such a move. After everyone saw Chu Yunfan’s combat technique, this was the only thought left in their minds. There was actually such a move. It was simply too cunning.","Even Marquis Tianma, who had been waiting to deal Chu Yunfan a fatal blow, was dumbfounded. He did not expect to be fooled by Chu Yunfan like this.","“Jian Wuchen, you despicable man. Come and fight me if you can!” Marquis","Tianma roared angrily as a terrifying divine power swept out from his body.","The terrifying pressure that belonged to a Major Arcane was completely unleashed at this moment. Even the pegasus beneath him was roaring furiously. It was actually a Middle Arcane as well. Only such a pegasus could support Marquis Tianma’s cultivation and battle.","Marquis Tianma emitted a peerless fighting spirit. At this moment, there was actually a power that could swallow mountains and rivers as he charged directly at Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan instantly dodged and came to the other side of the array. He only said coldly, “Your turn will come. You don’t have to rush to die!”","When Marquis Tianma was about to pounce on Chu Yunfan again, many experts transformed from killing intent appeared before him. Those faint figures blocked his way, making him feel as if he had fallen into a swamp.","Of course, Chu Yunfan knew how powerful Marquis Tianma was. He had already stepped into the Major Arcana Stage. Naturally, he wasn’t someone he could deal with right now. At most, Chu Yunfan had the ability to protect himself.","Without even looking, Chu Yunfan charged toward another Middle Arcane, and with a backhand punch, he blew this Middle Arcane into pieces. This Middle Arcane had been struggling to hold on, and now that Chu Yunfan had joined the battle, he couldn’t hold on any longer and died instantly.","After killing him, Chu Yunfan kept the body away. Then, without stopping, he charged toward another Middle Arcane. At this moment, all the Middle Arcanes were in danger. They had seen how Chu Yunfan had killed them, so they naturally understood. Chu Yunfan might not be able to take care of those Major Arcanes, but it was more than enough to take care of them.","Chu Yunfan was too fast. The people outside the array could see that Chu","Yunfan could reap a head in a flash. With such a swift harvest, it didn’t take long for all the Middle Arcanes belonging to the various forces in the array to be killed.","“How terrifying!” Some people gasped.","Whether they were on Chu Yunfan’s side or on the side of the four forces, they were all shocked by Chu Yunfan’s shocking slaughter. Those were all elites of the Middle Arcana Stage. Any one of them had the strength to become the actual person in charge of the various large factions in the Prodigy Battlefield outer region.","But now, they were killed as if they were mowed down. There was no lack of Middle Arcanes among them, but they could not display their cultivation at all. Under the continuous attacks of the experts transformed from killing intent, they were injured one after another.","Facing Chu Yunfan, none could display a single bit of theur strength. They were killed by Chu Yunfan in a single move. It could be said that they died in an extremely aggrieved manner. If it was a collision under normal circumstances, they would definitely not be so aggrieved. However, this world was just so cruel.","There was no fairness at all. They had surrounded Chu Yunfan and had never thought about fairness. Even so, Chu Yunfan’s astonishing combat strength was still unanimously recognized by everyone, even though he had borrowed the power of the battle array.","“He has actually reached this stage. He clearly wasn’t here half a year ago, but he has improved too much in this half a year!” In the distance, Yang Dengxian and Lan Hao also arrived one after another and saw this shocking battle.","They were shocked by Chu Yunfan!s amazing strength, especially Yang Dengxian. Although he had never figured out Chu Yunfan’s bottom line, he could feel that Chu Yunfan’s strength had increased by a lot.","In the past half a year, his strength had improved by quite a bit. From the initial stage of Minor Arcana Stage, he had already stepped into the intermediate Minor Arcana Stage. Such progress could not be said to be slow, but compared to Chu Yunfan’s progress, it paled in comparison.","Everyone also noticed that as the killing continued, Chu Yunfan’s eyes became more and more indifferent as if he had lost his emotions. The killing became more and more standard, and at the same time, the aura on his body was faintly strengthening.","“He’s reaching enlightenment!” Someone suddenly seemed to understand something.","His words immediately ignited the crowd. Many people looked as if they had seen a ghost. In such an intense battle, Chu Yunfan actually entered a state of enlightenment.","Most importantly, when Chu Yunfan was enlightened, he didn’t lose his fighting strength, nor did he leave the battlefield. Instead, he was using this Primordial Immortal Slaying Array to temper himself.","“Look, he’s charging toward Marquis Tianma!” someone shouted in surprise.","Then, everyone saw that after Chu Yunfan killed all the Middle Arcanes, he didn’t hesitate and charged straight at Marquis Tianma.","“Just in time. Die!” Marquis Tianma roared. Countless divine power was released around his body, like the scattering of starlight. Thousands of rays of light made him look like a peerless god.","The pegasus under Marquis Tianma exerted its strength. His entire body was like a bolt of lightning as the large saber in his hand slashed at Chu Yunfan. A peerless fighting spirit emanated from his body, as if he was about to transform into a god of war.","Chu Yunfan’s expression became colder and colder. There was no emotion in his eyes, only cold calculation. Just as many people had guessed, Chu Yunfan was reaching enlightenment and threw a punch.","Boom!","With a terrifying collision sound, the two sides collided fiercely.","Chu Yunfan took a few steps back, blood flowing out of the corner of his mouth. Marquis Tianma’s body was also covered in many wounds, which were left on his body by the experts transformed from killing intent.","Chu Yunfan wasn’t the only one who had attacked. Fair? There had never been such a thing.","Chu Yunfan only rested for a while before he charged forward again. A terrifying battle erupted, and the two sides crossed paths again. Both sides were severely injured at the same time. More blood flowed out of Chu Yunfan’s mouth, and many bloody wounds appeared on Marquis Tianma’s mount. His own injuries were even more serious.","Chu Yunfan became even faster. Each punch was stronger than the last. He turned into a peerless war god and fought with blood.","“I’ll finish you with one punch!” Chu Yunfan shouted and charged forward like a peerless god of war.."]},{"number":2125,"title":"Chapter 2125: Killing Marquis Tianma","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan was bathed in blood. It had been too long since he had a big battle like this. Prodigies of the same level were not his match at all. When he faced a top prodigy who was far stronger than him could he bathe in blood.","There were Marquis Tianma’s and his own.","With the restraint of the Primordial Immortal Slaying Array, Marquis Tianma was unable to unleash his full strength. He actually fought with Chu Yunfan and suffered heavy losses.","Then, Marquis Tianma noticed that Chu Yunfan’s injuries were recovering at an astonishing speed. As soon as he realized that he couldn’t hold on any longer, he would retreat to the side and recover for a while. Then, his injuries would mostly recover. Then, he would rejoin the battle!","Marquis Tianma was being held back by the Primordial Immortal Slaying","Array and had no time to develop. He kept coughing up blood and retreating.","He had completely understood that Chu Yunfan wanted to drag him to death.","“He must be a lunatic!” someone outside the battle formation said.","He felt as if he was facing a ghost!","“That’s a Major Arcane we’re talking about! How dare he throw a punch at a Major Arcane! If he isn’t a lunatic, then what is he?” many people roared.","Many of the people present were Minor Arcanas, the lowest level of the Arcana Stage. Major Arcanes were the highest level of the Arcana Stage. They naturally understood what it meant to be a Major Arcane. Even if it was just the aftershock of the battle, it was enough to heavily injure them or even kill them.","In front of a Major Arcane, their numbers were useless. Experts of their level could be said to be awe-inspiring in the outside world. However, against a Major Arcane, it would only take a single punch. Furthermore, a single punch could kill a whole bunch of them.","As for Chu Yunfan, his battle prowess was naturally astonishing. However, he was only a Minor Arcana in essence. Even if he had the battle prowess of a","Middle Arcana, he would still be vulnerable against a Major Arcane.","Chu Yunfan was beaten until he coughed up blood and retreated. Even with Chu Yunfan’s astonishing combat strength, if it were them, they would probably die. If he wasn’t careful, Chu Yunfan might even die. Under such circumstances, Chu Yunfan still dared to punch. This was already unimaginable to them!","Many people felt a little ashamed. They did not lack the courage to punch at","the strong, but if they were not forced to a dead end, they might not have tried so easily. Some people didn’t even have the courage to do so. They had no chance of winning and only death awaited them.","“He’s comprehending the Dao! He’s using these Major Arcane experts to temper himself!” Lan Hao narrowed his eyes. He had already calmed down. He had seen through Chu Yunfan’s goal.","However, even if they could see it, there were not many people who had the guts to do so. Chu Yunfan’s entire body was glowing like a golden god. He punched again and again. Every time he punched, he could even feel that he was transforming and becoming stronger.","Boom!","With a loud boom, Chu Yunfan!s punch, which was wrapped in endless lightning power, pierced through the pegasus under Marquis Tianma. This pegasus, which had already reached the peak of the Middle Arcana Stage, had its head shattered by Chu Yunfan’s punch.","At that moment, Chu Yunfan’s cultivation entered a new level.","“He broke through!’","Many people muttered to themselves in disbelief. Looking at the golden light that was constantly emitting from Chu Yunfan’s body, everyone was stunned.","That pegasus was no ordinary pegasus. It had the title of the Marquis’ Pegasus, which was directly related to the pegasus he was riding. Many people who knew all of this knew that this was a pegasus that Marquis Tianma had accidentally tamed when he was young. Later, he rode on this pegasus to battle everywhere, and there was no one who could match him. Although this pegasus was only a mount, its strength was still top-notch.","No one present would be able to withstand a single stomp from this pegasus. A single charge would be enough to kill an ordinary Middle Arcane. This was the terrifying power of this pegasus. Now, Chu Yunfan had actually smashed its head into pieces with a single punch. Blood sprayed out and turned into a rain of blood.","Chu Yunfan’s eyes gradually regained their clarity because he had already broken through to the next level, the peak of the Minor Arcana Stage. After stepping into this level, Chu Yunfan’s strength had undergone an earth-shattering change. He had stepped into the peak of the Minor Arcane Stage in one breath, and he was invincible in this realm.","This pegasus was extremely powerful among peak Middle Arcanes. It had kicked many Middle Arcane elites to death, but it was still killed by Chu Yunfan with a single punch. One could imagine how powerful Chu Yunfan was now.","Originally, he had been repeatedly knocked back by Marquis Tianma, but now that he had finally killed this pegasus with a single punch, the pressure on him was greatly reduced.","“How dare you!” Marquis Tianma’s eyes turned red, and endless killing intent burst out from his eyes. Chu Yunfan actually dared to kill his pegasus.","Rage erupted in an instant. Terrifying flames erupted from his entire body, and a peerless fighting spirit pervaded the air. The cold battle robe on his body was also boiling, so powerful that it made people feel oppressed.","The pegasus had grown up with him, and they were like siblings. They were closer than the closest people, especially since he had sealed himself from a distant era until now. He no longer had any relatives or friends. Only this pegasus was a witness to that distant era.","“It’s just a beast. So what? It’s your turn next!” Chu Yunfan replied coldly. Having just broken through to Minor Arcana Stage, his control over his power had reached a pinnacle level.","“It’s your turn next. You dare to be the hero at the end of your rope!” Chu Yunfan roared, and a powerful aura swept out like a flood, sweeping directly toward Marquis Tianma.","Swoosh!","In the next moment, Chu Yunfan appeared in front of Marquis Tianma. He once again swung his fist, and endless lightning power surged out from between his fingers, shaking the sky. With just one punch, it swept toward Marquis Tianma.","“I’m just relying on my superior cultivation level. Killing you is as easy as slaughtering chickens and dogs!’","Chu Yunfan’s words shocked countless people. Marquis Tianma’s strength was well-known among many peerless prodigies, but he was ignored and underestimated by Chu Yunfan.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan’s punch was too fast. It pierced through Marquis Tianma’s chest in an instant. Marquis Tianma’s body exploded into pieces as blood spurted out.","Marquis Tianma was dead!"]},{"number":2126,"title":"Chapter 2126: Xue Yinzi’s Death, Fighting Till Madness","paragraphs":["Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Everyone was shocked as they looked at the scene before them with their mouths agape. Marquis Tianma was pierced through by a single punch, and","his entire body exploded. This terrifying figure who had entered the battlefield of the prodigies many times and left behind an illustrious reputation had actually died just like that.","“How is this possible? How did he do it?”","Many people felt that it was completely unbelievable, This kind of thing had clearly exceeded the limits of what they could accept. For a Major Arcane to die at the hands of a Minor Arcana, was there anything more ridiculous than this?","“It’s an internal injury. Marquis Tianma didn’t have time to heal his internal injuries. They’ve been accumulating continuously. Marquis Tianma suppressed them with his absolute strength before, but now that Chu Yunfan’s punch pierced through them, his injuries couldn’t be suppressed anymore and he died,” Lan Hao said indifferently as he looked at the scene before him.","However, he was extremely shocked in his heart. With his cultivation far surpassing these experts present, he could naturally see why. Marquis Tianma had been heavily injured by the Primordial Immortal Slaying Array many times. His injuries had always been there, but he had forcefully suppressed them. In fact, his injuries were only the last straw that broke the camel’s back. Chu Yunfan’s punch was the last straw.","Chu Yunfan clearly understood this point. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have said such words.","“What kind of shocking judgment is this? It’s already very difficult for me to analyze the specific situation just by watching from the side. He can still see this while fighting. He’s simply a monster!” Lan Hao was extremely shocked.","“Jian Wuchen is injured!” someone shouted.","At this moment, everyone saw that Chu Yunfan’s body had also been pierced by a spear. Many people instantly understood why Marquis Tianma didn’t dodge earlier. It was because he estimated that Chu Yunfan would definitely not fight him to the death. Although Chu Yunfan could pierce through him, he could also pierce through Chu Yunfan. Who knew that Chu Yunfan would be so ruthless, trading injuries for injuries, and even risking his life to kill Marquis Tianma?","“This is a peerless and ruthless man. Not only is he ruthless to others, but he is also ruthless to himself!” Yang Dengxian was shocked.","Using a Major Arcane to temper himself? This was a plan that only a lunatic would come up with. If it were him, he would rather use this peerless vicious array to grind these people to death than choose to personally go down. After all, the remaining four weren’t Middle Arcanes. They were the legendary Major Arcanes.","It was a stage that even he had to look up to. The aftershocks of any random battle were enough to kill him. Although he firmly believed that he would definitely be able to reach such a level in the future, that was the future, not the present. The more he compared himself to Chu Yunfan,","the more he could see how ruthless Chil Yunfan was.","‘Such a person can only be roped in, not offended!’ Many people couldn’t help but have such a thought.","In the array, Chu Yunfan expressionlessly pulled out the spear in his chest. The spear was attached with powerful energy, trying to stop Chu Yunfan’s injuries from recovering.","However, Chu Yunfan’s body constitution was a combination of three completely different emperor-level physiques. His body constitution was so strong that it was unique in the world. In just a moment, he had already recovered 70 – 80% of his strength.","Chu Yunfan took out a healing elixir from the Mountain River Diagram and swallowed it. He had almost recovered from the battle just now.","“Ah, I can’t accept this!”","Suddenly, Xue Yinzi, who had been fighting with the phantom formed by the killing intent in the Primordial Immortal Slaying Array, let out a miserable cry. Everyone turned around and saw that he had been blown up. His body was torn into pieces and his physical body collapsed.","At this moment, everyone finally remembered that Chu Yunfan was definitely not the only one who could kill people. This peerless vicious array was the most terrifying. If it weren’t for this peerless vicious array, even Chu Yunfan would have to run away from these people.","Unrivaled!","With the peerless fierce array, even if Chu Yunfan did not make a move, these people would not be able to escape the fate of being obliterated. It was only a matter of time.","Without the restraint of others, the attacks of the Primordial Immortal Slaying Grand Array all landed on the remaining three people. Among them, Xue Yinzi, who had the worst head-on combat ability, was the first to be unable to resist. His body shattered and he was killed.","The remaining two people were not in a better situation. They were forced to retreat under all kinds of attacks. However, even so, they were still fighting desperately because they had no way to retreat. They were surrounded by killing intent.","“Jian Wuchen, you’ll die a horrible death if you do this. The four alliances won’t let you off!” Star Shatter roared.","This local expert had been holding on until now and was already on the verge of collapse. Among the four of them, his cultivation was the weakest. If Xue Yinzi was not good at fighting head-on, he would have been the first to die.","At this moment, he was still struggling on the verge of death. His entire body was emitting an extremely terrifying aura. His divine power was boiling like a","vast ocean, extremely dazzling.","However, his words were met with","indifference. This world was like this. Previously, Star Shatter was high and mighty and wanted to capture him and tear him into pieces. He had no intention of letting him go.","Chu Yunfan sneered. He did not let go of this once-in-a-lifetime opportunity.","With a loud roar, the entire sky moved with him. He pounced toward Star Shatter like an eagle pouncing on its prey. This was a chance to attack a Major Arcane without any restraint. It could be said that there would never be another chance like this.","These Major Arcane experts were being held back, unable to unleash their full strength. Furthermore, they had been severely injured before, so their combat strength was no longer at its peak. But even so, life and death could be decided in an instant!","This made Chu Yunfan’s blood boil.","Boom, boom, boom!","Chu Yunfan’s attack speed was too fast. It seemed like only one punch swept across the sky, but in fact, he had punched out hundreds of times in an instant. The full strength of a top expert was so fast that it was beyond the line of sight.","Opposite him, Star Shatter was also going crazy. Chu Yunfan’s attack landed on his body and sparks flew. He was forced to retreat step by step and kept coughing up blood. He was enduring unparalleled attacks.","At the same time, all kinds of murderous entities in the world were still attacking him.","Opposite him, Chu Yunfan was also coughing up blood. Both sides were fighting crazily.."]},{"number":2127,"title":"Chapter 2127: All Destroyed, End of the Scene","paragraphs":["Chapter 2127: All Destroyed, End of the Scene","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“This is a lunatic!” A hint of fear finally flashed across Star Shatter’s eyes. He had seen top-notch experts and prodigies like Jun Tianci, who were extremely ruthless in their attacks.","However, none of them could make him feel moved. Today, Chu Yunfan did it. Chu Yunfan’s level was clearly far inferior to his, but Chu Yunfan dared to punch him. It was the style of a lunatic who did not care about his life!","Those who were arrogant were afraid of being stunned, and those who were stunned were afraid of people who did not care about their lives.","was like this, completely disregarding his own life. He could have used the Primordial Immortal Slaying Array to grind them to death as long as he could stall for time, but he personally attacked them.","‘I, the mighty Star Shatter, actually became his whetstonefor him to sharpen himself!’ Star Shatter was completely speechless.","If someone had told him before today that a Minor Arcane would dare to use him as a whetstone to sharpen his body, he would have thought that the other party had gone crazy. How could such a thing be possible?","But Chu Yunfan did it!","Chu Yunfan coughed up blood as he retreated. At the same time, he took out a healing spirit herb and ate it. What made Star Shatter feel even more depressed was that this was a healing spirit herb he had found. Later, it was placed in the treasure vault of the base and was robbed by Chu Yunfan.","Even he himself was reluctant to consume this spirit herb, so he wanted to leave it for Jun Tianci. It could be refined into a powerful healing elixir. But now, Chu Yunfan was eating it like a cow chewing on a peony. It made him furious. He had worked so hard to make someone else’s wedding dress.","“Again!” Chu Yunfan roared. His body had a shocking aura and divine might.","There was actually an aura of supremacy in the world. This was an invincible belief. Among the 100,000 prodigies on the Prodigy Battlefield, not many people had such a new year.","Perhaps they originally had it, but if they encountered someone even more talented and monstrous than them, as long as they failed once, all their invincible ambitions would be completely ruined. Only a very small number of people retained such an invincible will. This was an aura that could only be cultivated by killing countless opponents.","It had nothing to do with one’s strength, but with one’s invincible heart. And if he wanted to walk to the end and finally vindicate dao and become a god, he believed that such an invincible heart was a necessary condition.","Time did not allow Star Shatter to think too much. At that moment, Chu","Yunfan had already pounced on him again. Star Shatter slashed down with his sword, and his cultivation was reflected in this sword.","Boom!","Another terrifying collision ensued. Both of them were injured by the other party and retreated continuously.","“Jian Wuchen, you can’t kill me. As long as there’s a chance, I’ll kill you!’","Star Shatter had also gone mad. He had gone mad. After fighting until now, he had long gone mad. He could not care less about so many things.","“Killing you is enough!” Chu Yunfan didn’t care. He bit the healing spirit medicine in his mouth and rushed over.","Boom!","The two sides fought, and the world trembled. Divine light from both sides flourished, and killing intent surged into the sky. A terrifying aura spread, shaking the entire Primordial Immortal Slaying Array.","On the other side, Young Master Demonic Sky, who was the only one left, was wielding his Sky Wicked Saber and slashing out with a terrifying saber light. His cultivation base had reached the peak of perfection. Among everyone present, his cultivation base was the most shocking. In fact, he had even reached intermediate Major Arcane.","However, he had been hiding his cultivation level all this time. No one could force him to reveal his strength. Who knew that Chu Yunfan would force him to reveal it now?","However, it was useless. He was still heavily injured and was not much better than the others. He did not understand how Jian Wuchen had managed to get his hands on such a terrifying array.","He wanted to support Star Shatter, but there was no way at all. After the others died, most of the attacks of the Primordial Immortal Slaying Array fell on him and Star Shatter, which made his situation even more difficult. Blood continued to pour out as they retreated. They were already at the end of their rope.","However, he was burning his divine power and even his lifespan. The saber light in his hand was more and more shocking, reaching thousands of feet high. If it was an ordinary array, it would have been shattered long ago.","However, all his attacks were swallowed by the Primordial Immortal Slaying Array and disappeared without a trace. They were even absorbed and reflected back.","Terrifying saber light bounced back and swept toward him. Many of his injuries were caused by his own attacks. Such an array was invincible. There was no way to resist at all. Young Master Demonic Sky felt despair in his heart!","Suddenly, he heard a loud scream. He saw Star Shatter scream out of the corner of his eye. Star Shatter coughed up blood and retreated. When he retreated halfway, his body exploded and he died.","“It’s the same technique again!” Young Master Demonic Sky’s eyes turned cold, and his pupils contracted slightly.","It was the same method that Chu Yunfan used to kill Marquis Tianma. It was to trigger the injuries on their bodies and let them die on their own. If they were in their peak condition, they would naturally not be afraid of Chu Yunfan. He should be afraid of them.","However, they were no longer in their peak condition. The injuries on their bodies kept piling up. It was just that their martial arts were more terrifying and they could suppress them. However, once someone triggered their injuries, there was really no other way than death.","Just as Young Master Demonic Skt was letting his imagination run wild, Chu Yuntan had already collected Star Shatter’s body. He turned it into a pool ot blood along with Xue Yinzi and Marquis Tianma’s corpses and poured it into the Brahma Tree,","At the same time, within the Mountain River Diagram, countless streams of spirit energy transformed into a long river of spirit energy that surged into the herb mountain, accelerating the flow of time in the area where the Brahma Tree was located. The Brahma Fruits were forming at an astonishing speed.","Chu Yunfan himself did not hesitate and pounced at Young Master Demonic","Sky.","“I was waiting for you!”","The Sky Wicked Saber in Young Master Demonic Sky’s hand suddenly slashed out a terrifying saber light that was over 100,000 feet long. It was an attack that had exhausted all of his blood, sweat, and tears. After this attack, half of his hair turned white.","“Even if I die, I’ll bury you with me. Hahaha!” Young Master Demonic Sky laughed. Although he was burning his lifespan, he was still extremely happy. At the last moment, he wanted to drag Chu Yunfan down with him.","However, just as his saber light was about to hit Chu Yunfan, Chu Yunfan disappeared from the Primordial Immortal Slaying Array. In the next moment, when Chu Yunfan reappeared, he was already in front of Young Master Demonic Sky and easily took his life.","Young Master Demonic Sky was dead!"]},{"number":2128,"title":"Chapter 2128: Shocking the Prodigy Battlefield","paragraphs":["Chapter 2128: Shocking the Prodigy Battlefield","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","‘How did he dodge that?!’","Young Master Demonic Skys eyes revealed this information. He had been hiding this attack for a long time. He knew that Chu Yunfan would not let him go in the end, so he had already thought of pinning all his hopes on the last attack. He had burned half of his life force to unleash such a shocking attack. If he was hit, Chu Yunfan would definitely die. Unless one was a Major Arcane, escape was impossible.","Chu Yunfan looked coldly at Young Master Demonic Sky, who had died at his hands. After burning half of his life, Young Master Demonic Sky had become extremely weak. Chu Yunfan could easily take his life.","Young Master Demonic Sky was betting on the last strike. If he won, he could survive. Once the Primordial Immortal Slaying Array collapsed, and he had hope of survival. Although he suffered heavy losses, it was better than death. However, Chu Yunfan had easily destroyed all his hopes.","Chu Yunfan was a little scared. Fortunately, at the most critical moment, he hid in the Mountain River Diagram. Although the saber light was terrifying, it could not do anything to the Mountain River Diagram. Otherwise, he might really die in the hands of Young Master Demonic Sky. This told him that he could never underestimate anyone, or else he might fail miserably.","The Major Arcanes had underestimated him, and had lost his life in his hands. If he hadn’t coincidentally hidden himself within the Mountain River Diagram, he would have died as well.","A Major Arcane burning half of his life force to unleash such a terrifying attack. There was no doubt that it had almost destroyed the entire Primordial Immortal Slaying Array. Once Chu Yunfan got involved, he would die!","However, this was also because the Primordial Immortal Slaying Array had already reached the end of its rope. With Chu Yunfan’s wealth, the grand array was already at the end of its rope. The energy contained in these heavenly resources had almost been exhausted. After Chu Yunfan killed Young Master Demonic Sky, the heavenly resources placed in the array turned into powder and disappeared without a trace.","The entire formation was reduced to nothingness, revealing a messy battlefield in the valley. The entire battlefield was in a mess as if it had been bombarded by hundreds of missiles. The ground was crystallized. One could imagine how terrifying the attack was.","Just as everyone was exclaiming in amazement, Chu Yunfan disappeared into the horizon on a streak of light. Many people rushed into the valley. Many of them had attainments in arrays and wanted to check the traces left behind by the Primordial Immortal Slaying Array. They tried to use these traces to restore such a terrifying vicious array.","They had all witnessed the terrifying power of the Primordial Immortal Slaying Array with their own eyes. The formation set up by Chu Yunfan, who was only a Minor Arcana, was actually able to defeat even several Major Arcanes. It was an astonishing battle formation!","As for consuming a lot of resources, it might be a problem for a lone ranger like Chu Yunfan. However, for those prodigies who stood behind a huge force, this was not a problem. Everyone could see the power of this array, and it was obvious that it could not be the complete version. If it could be developed, its power would be earth-shattering.","But soon, their faces revealed a somewhat depressed expression, because it was completely different from what they had imagined. They could not see any tricks at all. With their knowledge, they could not understand the layout of the array. Even if Chu Yunfan did not take away the damaged treasures, they could not understand it.","Without Chu Yunfan’s godhead or memories of the Alchemy Emperor, they couldn’t understand such a grand array. An array was definitely not something that could be set up with an array diagram. Otherwise, array masters would not be so rare. They were even rarer than alchemists.","This was because they had to take into account the actual situation. Even if there was just one more mountain peak in the array, it would make the array that they had set up fall short of success. Only by thoroughly understanding this array could it be used.","If they could understand it just by looking at it, this Primordial Immortal Slaying Array would not be one of the three great vicious formations of the ancient times.","“Where did Jian Wuchen come from? I’m afraid the entire battlefield will be shocked by him after this battle!”","“The outer region of the Prodigy Battlefield won’t be his end. He should soon enter the central region of the Prodigy Battlefield. That’s where the true core prodigies fight!’","“But if he enters the central region, Jun Tianci will not let him go. Will he survive?”","While many people were discussing, the results of this battle spread throughout the entire Prodigy Battlefield in the shortest time possible.","“What? Jian Wuchen killed four Major Arcanes?!”","The moment the news was out, the entire battlefield was in an uproar. Those were Major Arcanes! Even in the entire battlefield, a Major Arcane was one of the strongest beings. It could be said that they stood at the top of the entire Prodigy Battlefield. Any one of them appearing outside the battlefield would cause endless guesses. No one knew what kind of huge thing had happened for a Major Arcane to appear. Yet now, four Major Arcanes had fallen right outside the battlefield. One could only imagine how shocked the entire battlefield was.","After that, more news was revealed. A peerless killing array was made known to everyone. Chu Yunfan had relied on this peerless killing array to kill four powerful Major Arcanes, as well as a large group of Middle Arcanes.","It could be said to be monstrous!","Many people couldn’t help but feel suffocated. Even with the help of the array, Chu Yunfan’s actions still sent chills down everyone’s spine. Chu Yunfan provoked the four forces. When everyone thought that he would die, he did the opposite. Instead of running away, he personally set up a trap and killed many experts of the four forces. Such methods and such a vicious will, even many prodigies could not help but feel terrified.","After this news spread, the four alliances were enraged. They had never been provoked like this before. In other words, no one had ever been able to survive","after provoking the four forces.","For a moment, a large number of experts from the four forces were mobilized, frantically searching for Chu Yunfan’s whereabouts in the outer region.","However, not long ago, someone saw Chu Yunfan cross the void and enter the","Prodigy Battlefield central region.."]},{"number":2129,"title":"Chapter 2129: Again! I Will Fight Ten of You!","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The central region of the Prodigy Battlefield was a place that many prodigies yearned for but could not enter because even they didn’t dare to enter. Although they had shocking talent, the weakest was a king-level physique. It could be said that the strongest and most outstanding talents of all time were here,","However, it was not possible to survive in the central region just because of talent. It could even be said that only those above the Middle Arcana Stage dared to enter the central region and barely had the ability to protect themselves.","This was because there were no large- scale cities in the central region, so there was no place to hide. In addition, the Yin energy that spread out in the central region was even more shocking. The ancient prodigy hero spirits that revived there were even more terrifying, far more terrifying than those in the outer region.","There was no room for the weak to survive here. Even if they were prodigies, they were no exception. Unless they matured and entered the Middle Arcana Stage, they would not dare to enter. Moreover, in the central region, Middle Arcanes could only barely protect themselves.","With Chu Yunfan’s strength, no one doubted that he had the strength to enter the central region. However, many people did not think that he could survive there. After all, those were two completely different.","“He didn’t leave the Prodigy Battlefield. Instead, he entered the central region.","I think this must be a huge mistake. That’s the central region of the Prodigy","Battlefield. It’s not a place where he can be impudent!”","“That’s right. There are too many experts in the central region. The rules of the battle are completely different from the outer regions. He is not outstanding there, There are too many people who can kill Jian Wuchen!”","“I heard that Jun Tianci has been alerted by this matter. He has personally left the core region and is heading to the central region just to kill him!”","“It’s not just Jun Tianci. His behavior is too arrogant. Many famous prodigies have expressed that if he appears in the central region, they will kill him!”","Everyone was discussing animatedly, but Chu Yunfan didn’t know about this. He had already entered the central region, and night had fallen. The endless night was filled with endless Yin energy. This Yin energy transformed into terrifying hero spirits that covered the sky and covered the earth as they attacked endlessly. The weakest of these hero spirits were peak Minor Arcanes, and there were even many Middle Arcana spirits among them. They were a terrifying lineup that could drown everything.","In a mountain range, an incomparably huge Black- scaled Horned Eagle roared into the sky, continuously using shocking divine powers. Endless storms swept up, destroying groups of prodigy hero spirits. Not far from him, Chu Yunfan watched everything expressionlessly.","Although the Black- scaled Horned Eagle’s battle blood was boiling, it was in a very miserable state. Although it could devour a group of hero spirits in one gulp, there would be even more hero spirits coming for it. Even though he had reached the Middle Arcana Stage, he was still beaten until his entire body was covered in blood. He was extremely miserable, but he did not dare to retreat. Over half a year later, under Chu Yunfan’s guidance and the effects of the","Brahma Fruit, the Black- scaled Horned Eagle had successfully entered the Middle Arcana Stage. It was at least twice as strong as when it had just broken through. But even so, such an intense battle still left him covered in injuries.","Chu Yunfan didn’t care about this. He let the Black- scaled Horned Eagle train itself in the endless battles. Only when there was an expert who surpassed the Black- scaled Horned Eagle that he would personally take action.","Black- scaled Horned Eagle didn’t attack many times, but every time, he could accurately hit the vital points. Even if there were existences above Middle Arcana Stage hidden among the countless hero spirits, they couldn’t pose any threat to the Black- scaled Horned Eagle.","After entering the center of the battlefield, Chu Yunfan realized that the biggest difference between this place and the outer region was that the battles there were too frequent. There wasn’t even a city or a foothold to help one their recovery. There was only fighting—endless fighting until dawn. If he was tortured to death by these hero spirits, then no matter how great his talent was, it would be useless. Weren’t these hero spirits also part of these prodigies when they were alive?","“Again! I will fight ten of you!” the Black- scaled Horned Eagle roared.","At this moment, it had really gone crazy from fighting. With Chu Yunfan protecting it, it had no worries, even if it was often attacked by the hero spirits and was forced to a dead end.","However, it was in this kind of dead end that he constantly transformed his body. He felt his bloodline being activated bit by bit, becoming more and more terrifying. There were even faint golden feathers growing out of his scale-covered wings.","This was the irrefutable evidence that his bloodline was constantly transforming. The growth of demons was a leap in the level of life, and the Great Celestial Demon Art was such a technique that allowed these Acquired demons to reach the Innate Stage and obtain extremely terrifying power.","This Black- scaled Horned Eagle went mad since he was being escorted by Chu Yunfan. He looked like a peerless expert, but his entire body was covered in blood. He was all his own, and he looked a little ridiculous.","At the same time, Chu Yunfan couldn’t stand it anymore. He joined the battle. He too was surrounded by these hero spirits. However, unlike the Black- scaled Horned Eagle’s bloody battle, his battle was much easier. A single punch from him could shatter a group of hero spirits, and he absorbed their Yin energy for his own use.","Chu Yunfan could even feel that his divine power was getting stronger bit by bit. Although it wasn’t much, for Chu Yunfan who had boundless divine power, such a speed of strengthening could be said to be extremely precious.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan truly understood that the outer region was completely different from the central region. In the central region, there was no real way out, only a bloody battle to the death. And this kind of endless tempering was the only way to allow these prodigies to have a shocking breakthrough in the shortest amount of time, No wonder Jun Tianci’s cultivation had improved by leaps and bounds in just a few years. This place was hell for the weak, but for Chu Yunfan, it was a holy land for cultivation.","Chu Yunfan’s opponent was much stronger than the Black- scaled Horned Eagle’s opponent. The weakest was at the late Middle Arcana Stage, or even at the peak Middle Arcana Stage. However, Chu Yunfan was not afraid. He kept blowing them up. His every move was like a grandmaster. He wanted to use the training on this battlefield to push his cultivation into the Middle Arcana Stage.","At that time, his cultivation stage would take another leap, and his strength would be the same as well, reaching the Major Arcana Stage.."]},{"number":2130,"title":"Chapter 2130: Killing a Peak Middle Arcane in One Punch","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The moment one stepped into the Major Arcane-level of battle prowess, they would be considered a powerful existence in the entire Prodigy Battlefield. At that time, he would be able to face Jun Tianci fearlessly.","Right now, he needed this endless battle to deepen his understanding of the Great Dao. And why did so many prodigies flock to the Prodigy Battlefield? Even the prodigy hero spirits that appeared after nightfall did not seem to be a threat to many people. On the contrary, this was the best whetstone to sharpen themselves.","Other than on the Prodigy Battlefield, under normal circumstances, where could you find so many experts of the same level to temper yourself? One had to know that prodigies were not endless. If they were killed, they were killed.","How could they withstand such an almost endless life-and-death battle? Only on the Prodigy Battlefield could such a thing be done. Everyone could experience countless shocking battles.","In any case, these hero spirits could be resurrected after they died. At the same time, the prodigies could absorb the hero spirits’ Yin energy and refine it for their own use. It could be said to be an unprecedented opportunity. Therefore, every time the Prodigy Battlefield opened, countless prodigies would risk their lives to enter the Prodigy Battlefield. Everyone knew very well that this was a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity. If they missed it, they would completely miss it.","Just as Chu Yunfan was fighting with these countless hero spirits, a stream of light suddenly broke through the sky in the distance. It looked like a ball of fire. Wherever it passed, the hero spirits exploded and turned into boundless Yin energy, which was absorbed by the ball of fire. In a moment, the fireball arrived before Chu Yunfan and transformed into a huge flaming lion. All the fur on the flaming lion’s body was made of flames. It looked like it was flowing with light and color. The power emitted from its body was like a mountain.","“Are you the audacious Jian Wuchen?” the lion asked, staring at Chu Yunfan with its huge eyes.","“Yes, I am!”","Chu Yunfan looked coldly at the flaming lion in front of him. It was a peak Middle Arcane, and its aura was many times stronger than the peak Middle Arcanes Chu Yunfan had encountered in the outside world. Though at the same cultivation level, the lion was several times stronger. This was the terrifying power of a king-level physique. Humans had king and emperor physiques, and so did the demons. And this flaming lion was a monster with a","king-physique.","“Why? Are you here to kill me for those alliances?” Chu Yunfan asked as he stared down the flaming lion.","“What right do they have to invite me?” the flaming lion said coldly, “l heard you were strong, so I came to kill you to reach enlightenment.”","The flaming lion had a proud expression on its face. The few alliances did not have the ability to invite it. It only had one goal in chasing after Chu Yunfan, and that was to use the pressure of killing Chu Yunfan to help it break through to Major Arcane.","It was only a step away from being a Major Arcane, and the effects of ordinary training had already greatly diminished. If he were to break through normally, who knew how much time he would have to spend? This reason alone was enough. In fact, there were many people looking for Chu Yunfan on the battlefield. He was not the only one.","‘I’m really lucky!’ the lion thought.","Chu Yunfan’s face was expressionless. He only had a faint sneer on. From the words of this flaming lion, Chu Yunfan completely understood that the central region of the Prodigy Battlefield and the outer region of the Prodigy Battlefield were completely different.","In the outer region, the various large factions were clearly divided. There was competition and hostility between them, but they would not easily fight.","Unless the hostility reached a certain level, even the Destiny Alliance and the Flying Celestial Alliance, which had already fought to a certain extent in the outside world, would maintain a peaceful situation.","This was because the outer region was a place for many prodigies to obtain resources. It was a place for many prodigies to obtain stable cultivation resources. It was their logistics headquarters. The environment there could be considered relatively peaceful compared to the central and core regions of the Prodigy Battlefield. The battles there paled in comparison to the central region. Without absolute benefits, they would not easily make a move.","However, in the central region, this flaming lion had tried everything to find him and kill him just to break through. This was a world where the strong preyed on the weak. All the prodigies worked together to increase their strength and win the final chance to reach enlightenment and become a god.","“Kill me to reach enlightenment? Not a bad idea, but it depends on whether you have the strength!” Chu Yunfan sneered.","“Roar!” This flaming lion roared toward the sky, and the flames on its body erupted like lava. In an instant, the entire world turned into a sea of fire, and countless hero spirits were burned into nothingness.","“Ah, it hurts!” the Black- scaled Horned Eagle screamed as it retreated. More than half of its scales and feathers were burned off. Just a portion of the flames had burned off all its feathers.","However, when the flames were about to reach Chu Yunfan, they were cut apart by a shocking sword intent. There were no outsiders present at the moment, so Chu Yunfan could display other martial arts without hesitation. It was not limited to Jian Wuchen’s set of unique skills.","Suddenly, this incomparably huge flaming lion pounced down. The earth shook and the mountains shook. The entire mountain range shook as if an entire world had been trampled and shattered.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at him. He clenched his fists and a terrifying fist intent boiled from his body, forming a terrifying blood energy pillar.","“Eight Astonishing Punches! ”","Chu Yunfan’s punch transformed into the eight heavenly dragons and instantly shattered the flaming barrier on the lion’s body. Then, he punched into the lion’s chest.","Spurt!","Blood spurted out of the lion’s mouth. The flames on its body were extinguished in an instant. It was shattered by this punch.","“How could this be?” The flaming lion’s huge eyes were filled with disbelief. He was just one step away from becoming a Major Arcane! How could he be so weak? He couldn’t even block Chu Yunfan’s attack!","Chu Yunfan was ten times more terrifying than the rumors.."]},{"number":2131,"title":"Chapter 2131: In a Year, His Ferocious Name Shocked the Battlefield","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This was Chu Yunfan’s true combat strength. He was much more terrifying than when he appeared as Jian Wuchen.","Chu Yunfan’s expression didn’t change. It was just killing a flaming lion. With the strength of his three emperor-level physiques, if he couldn’t kill the flaming lion, then there would be a problem with his cultivation.","However, the lion’s words ignited his fighting spirit. On the battlefield, there were 100,000 prodigies. Of course, not all of them only had king physiques. Some of them had emperor physiques too. And these people with emperor physiques were Chu Yunfan’s targets.","He was improving, but Jun Tianci was also improving. Therefore, Chu Yunfan had to improve faster in order to catch up and surpass Jun Tianci. Among them, using one peerless battle after another to force oneself to improve was undoubtedly a very good method. Otherwise, these prodigies would not use this as a stepping stone to advance.","Within the Prodigy Battlefield, all kinds of battles and competitions were incomparably intense, Ordinary prodigies would only die here. Chu Yunfan felt that this was like a huge forest. Countless prodigies were like countless animals, and those who could climb out of it were the kings of the animals, earth- shattering existences.","“Let me meet the many prodigies of the world.” Chu Yunfan made up his mind. Then, he threw himself into the battle of the endless night.","Time passed quickly. In the blink of an eye, Chu Yunfan had been cultivating in the central region for more than a year. During this year, Chu Yunfan truly came to understand the cruelty of the central region.","100,000 prodigies soared into the sky at the same time, making for an","astonishing scene. Even if only half of them could enter the central region, this was still an extremely shocking number.","During this year, Chu Yunfan had only been fighting nonstop. The blood rain drifted, and there was almost no day when he was not fighting. The more he fought, the more Chu Yunfan understood how cruel the battlefield was.","There were no fixed alliances here. The prodigies of the humans, the demons, the marine folks, the Hus, and the Barbarians all fought against one another. The wars between the various races were endless. Even between the various races, there was no lack of wars between them. Compared to the central region, which was in a mess, the outer region was a peaceful place.","Here, Chu Yunfan could see famous prodigies from unknown eras die silently on the battlefield at any time. Such scenes were happening at any time and anywhere. Everyone was using each other to sharpen their blades, but many people could not withstand it and were killed by the blades.","Many people could not hold on and were about to go crazy from this endless battle. They could only withdraw from the battle in the central region and retreat to the outer region.","Other than the many who couldn’t hold on any longer and ended up becoming stepping stones for others to transcend, there were quite a few who broke free and stepped into the Major Arcana Stage. They left the vortex in the central region and headed toward the core region.","That place held the harshest test in the Prodigy Battlefield. It was the final transformation stage before the fish jumped over the dragon gate. It was also crueler and more intense than anywhere else.","Countless king physiques that were marveled by people in the outside world, and even the ten great factions treated them like treasures, were like trash on the side of the road here. No one cared if they were dumped on the side of the road.","Within a year, Chu Yunfan’s reputation rose. It could even be said that he was too famous. In this one year, he had killed more than 300 experts. Among the many rising stars, he was undoubtedly the fastest one.","Chu Yunfan had established his reputation through the battles. He was not like what many people thought. He did not dare to provoke the overconfident people of the alliances just because he had some fortuitous encounters.","In the eyes of many, Chu Yunfan definitely had the potential to step into the Major Arcana Stage, becoming one of the few supreme beings who stood above all the prodigies. There was no exaggeration in this battle record. It was all achieved by his own punches and kicks.","In the beginning, Chu Yunfan would still encounter relatively weak Middle Arcanes. However, as he encountered more Middle and Major Arcanes in a row, he was able to kill them all. In a short period, his reputation had risen.","Previously, many prodigies in the Middle Arcana Stage on the Prodigy","Battlefield wanted to find trouble with Chu Yunfan and use him to train","themselves. There were even some people with ill intentions who wanted to kill Chu Yunfan and then receive rewards from the major alliances.","The reward for him had been raised to 10 million high-grade spirit stones.","Although this was not the highest reward on the battlefield, Chu Yunfan was the weakest among the 10 million reward figures and was seen as the easiest to achieve. However, these people could not escape death in the end.","The four alliances had never stopped hunting Chu Yunfan down. One after another, famous figures in the central region joined in the hunt. One after another, Chu Yunfan fought a bloody battle. He killed more and more until he went crazy.","In the end, Chu Yunfan killed everyone who dared to find trouble with him, no matter if they were human or from another race. Those who wanted to use him to train themselves had all died in his hands. His fierce reputation had caught up with Jun Tianci’s, who had also left his fierce reputation in the central region.","In the later stages, those who dared to join in the pursuit were all peak Middle Arcanes. There were even Major Arcanes who had returned from the core region to try and kill Chu Yunfan. There were also those who did not have any grudges against Chu Yunfan. They only came to challenge him after hearing that he was powerful. Someone as powerful as Chu Yunfan would inevitably be bathed in blood many times.","To kill Chu Yunfan, these people used all sorts of methods and schemes. Not to mention, there were even Major Arcanes who had joined in the pursuit. Chu","Yunfan had used the Primordial Immortal Slaying Array to kill several Major Arcanes, but that was only because of the formation. He was still far from being a Major Arcane.","Almost none of these people were easy to provoke. Even Chu Yunfan could only escape from the battlefield after the bloody battle. In the eyes of many people, after being targeted repeatedly, Chu Yunfan would not choose to stay in the central region if he had a normal IQ. This was because no one knew when he would fail and die in the central region.","However, Chu Yunfan managed to take root in such a terrible situation.."]},{"number":2132,"title":"Chapter 2132: Sweeping the Battlefield, Supreme Youth","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Only Chu Yunfan himself knew the reason. Compared to others, his weakness","was that he improved too quickly. There was a gap of more than ten years in between. Although his strength had improved quickly in these ten years, it was mainly used to heal his injuries. His foundation was solid, but he wanted to be even stronger. His future could not be uncertain.","In the past year, he had fought all kinds of battles to consolidate his foundation, so he naturally would not choose to leave easily. In fact, Chu","Yunfan wasn’t even in a hurry to break through to the Middle Arcana Stage. He could feel that his Great Dao was perfected. When the time came, he wouldn’t need to forcefully break through to the Middle Arcana Stage. It would be like grinding water, and he would break through to the Middle Arcana Stage naturally.","That would be the most perfect. In this year, Chu Yunfan built his foundation and resolved all future problems. At this point, he could finally relax and break through to the Middle Arcana Stage.","In this one year, Chu Yunfan became a peerless fierce god because he was often merciless. No matter what kind of physique the other party had, what kind of force he had, or what kind of expert stood behind them, anyone who had evil intentions and wanted to kill him would die in his hands.","Ordinary Middle Arcanes dared to cause trouble for Chu Yunfan. After half a year, no ordinary Middle Arcanes dared to cause trouble for him any longer. Whether it was to spar or to collect the reward, everyone knew that this man was not someone to be trifled with.","The only person who dared to appear in front of Chu Yunfan after half a year was the person he liked—a peak Middle Arcane. Not only did he not dare to find trouble with Chu Yunfan, but he also avoided Chu Yunfan when he saw him, not daring to fight him.","A few months later, someone with an emperor physique came to challenge Chu Yunfan. However, there was only one result, and that was to be suppressed by Chu Yunfan. In this realm, Chu Yunfan had honed himself for too long and was too strong. His foundation was so deep that it was unimaginable for ordinary people.","Ordinary emperor physiques couldn’t even last one move from Chu Yunfan before being defeated. Emperor physique was even more terrifying than ordinary king physiques. Those with king physique could only become kings, while those with emperor physiques could become emperors. The difference between them couldn’t be calculated.","Even against Chu Yunfan, who was as strong as a demon god, this emperor physique could only exchange a hundred moves with Chu Yunfan before being defeated. Chu Yunfan didn’t kill the challenger in the end, not only because he didn’t have any killing intent toward Chu Yunfan, but also because he didn’t have the heart to challenge Chu Yunfan.","On the battlefield, there were 100,000 prodigies with king physiques. Even if they didn’t, they were comparable to king physiques. A rare physique in the outside world was worthless here. However, those with emperor physiques were different. Among the many prodigies, those who had emperor physiques were as rare as phoenix feathers and qilin horns.","A prodigy with an emperor physique was a peerless prodigy who could suppress several generations. For such a character to appear in an era, it could be called a glorious era. Although not everyone could become an existence at the level of the emperor, any one of them could at least become an outstanding figure among the kings.","It was rare for such a person to appear. If they did not choose to seal themselves, they might not even be able to meet each other. It was a situation where the emperor never mets the other emperor. Only in a place like the Prodigy Battlefield would there be more than one. Unless it was absolutely necessary, Chu Yunfan didn’t want to end such a talented person.","After Chu Yunfan defeated or killed several emperors, he became one of the few supremes in the central region. This was no small feat. Other than a small number of Major Arcanes, almost all of them were Middle Arcanes. A small portion of them were even peak Middle Arcanes. One could imagine how shocking the number of them was.","Almost all of these prodigies had the same thoughts as Chu Yunfan. They were not in a hurry to break through. They wanted to polish their bodies and make their foundations extremely firm. Even if it was an ordinary king physique, breaking through to Major Arcana Stage would be a matter of pushing the boat along with the current. The only difference was time,","As such, their goal had never been to become a Major Arcane. Instead, it was to strengthen their foundations and walk further in the future. Only when one felt that they had already reached the state of perfection would they choose to enter seclusion and break through to the Major Arcana Stage before entering the core battlefield.","Among these peak Middle Arcane prodigies, there were people who far surpassed everyone and were above them. These people had already surpassed the level of prodigies and were called the Supreme Youths.","These Supreme Youth referred to the future supreme martial artist. Their battle prowess was not inferior to that of a supreme martial artist in his youth. Only those with emperor physiques had the possibility of stepping into it. Only if one’s bloodline underwent another transformation and stepped into the level of an emperor could one become a Supreme Youth.","Every Supreme Youth could easily defeat dozens of experts in the same level as them. In the central region of the Prodigy Battlefield, Chu Yunfan stood out and become one of the Supreme Youths. This was recognized by everyone. They had to admit that Chu Yunfan was probably one of the strongest among the Supreme Youths.","In this year, Chu Yunfan not only had a fierce reputation, but he also killed or defeated many prodigies. At the same time, he had made many good friends. Not everyone tried to kill Chu Yunfan. Some people were friendly to Chu","Yunfan, and Chu Yunfan took them in as confidants. Although this number","was not much compared to his enemies, it was still considerable.","What made many people look at Chu Yunfan in a new light was that in addition to himself, Chu Yunfan gained ten followers in the past year. It was the nature and instinct of all creatures to follow the strong. Chu Yunfan swept across the entire battlefield, and his performance was getting stronger and stronger.","In the beginning, there were even those with emperor physiques who could fight with him for more than 100 rounds. By the time Chu Yunfan defeated the last expert emperor, it had been less than 30 moves. Chu Yunfan’s improvement was too shocking, and it left an unfathomable impression in everyone’s eyes.","Under such circumstances, there were countless people who wanted to become Chu Yunfan’s followers. These ten were chosen by Chu Yunfan.."]},{"number":2133,"title":"Chapter 2133: Unprecedented Strength","paragraphs":["Chapter 2133: Unprecedented Strength","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Each of these ten followers had an outstanding king physique. They were kings among kings, and their cultivation had reached peak Middle Arcana","Stage. Any one of these people could be said to be the top prodigies below the Supreme Youth. They were not afraid of fighting several people of the same level. If Chu Yunfan’s performance was not too stunning, even ordinary Supreme Youths could not subdue these people.","There were humans, demons, barbarians, and marine folks among them. They were all-inclusive. They had all been defeated by Chu Yunfan and were convinced by him. Chu Yunfan let them go, but they volunteered to become his followers. There were countless other ordinary prodigies who wanted to follow Chu Yunfan, but he rejected them. Although he could form a huge alliance almost immediately if he accepted these people, it was meaningless to him.","These prodigies felt miserable. Those who could appear on the battlefield, whether they were locals or prodigies from the outside world, were all prodigies who had suppressed an era. However, not only had they been defeated, they were no match for others. It was even difficult for them to become followers. How could these prodigies not feel sad?","“Prodigy” was the most worthless term here. Even the locals were the descendants of the former prodigies. They were just stuck in the Prodigy Battlefield and could not leave.","The prodigies and the descendants of the prodigies were naturally extremely talented. Almost everyone was an elite, and there were countless prodigies. The probability of producing prodigies far exceeded that of the outside world. Therefore, prodigies who were considered extremely precious in the outside world were ignored here. They either kept a low profile or fought their way out like Chu Yunfan.","They were prodigies, but there was always someone stronger among the strong. There were even stronger existences that overshadowed their radiance. It made them lose the belief that they would eventually reach the top. Otherwise, as long as there was still a new year when they reached the top and became gods, it would be impossible for them to become followers of others.","From the moment they became a follower, there was no possibility of them reaching the top. Therefore, one could imagine how difficult it was to subdue these top-notch prodigies.","Of course, they had chosen to follow Chu Yunfan, and they also received many benefits from him. Chu Yunfan was not stingy with his followers. Many of","these followers were backed by a giant, and they did not lack cultivation resources. What they really lacked was someone to guide them.","With Chu Yunfan’s understanding of the Great Dao, coupled with the help of the Alchemy Emperor’s memories and the godhead, he was in a strategic position on the path of cultivation. When they encountered problems in their cultivation, Chu Yunfan could easily point out the key points and let them gain a lot.","The shortest period these followers spent with Chu Yunfan was a month, but they felt that they had gained more than they had cultivated alone for more than a year. For prodigies like them, wasn’t the purpose of sealing themselves from the distant eras to the present to make themselves stronger?","Many people had a premonition that if Chu Yunfan could rise, he would become a true supreme martial artist. Following such a person, even if they couldn’t become a true supreme martial artist themselves, they could still use Chu Yunfan’s success to achieve the Dao. In the future, their achievements will be limitless. They could even surpass the limits of their physiques and bloodlines.","Chu Yunfan’s followers weren’t the only ones who had such thoughts. His enemies thought this as well. Jun Tianci and the others felt that Chu Yunfan was extremely troublesome to deal with. After a year of killing, all sorts of experts had suffered heavy casualties when they encountered Chu Yunfan.","Middle Arcanes were no match for him, and even Major Arcanes could not do anything to him. Unless someone like Jun Tianci personally made a move, it was impossible for them to do anything to Chu Yunfan. But these people had interests in the core region of the Prodigy Battlefield, so it was impossible for them to leave.","This left them with no vvay to deal with Chu Yunfan. They had used all kinds of assassination, open killing, ambush, and all kinds of methods. In the end, other than losing soldiers and generals, they had obtained nothing. How could they not be shocked?","Based on Chu Yunfan’s rate of growth, he would definitely break through to the Major Arcana Stage sooner or later and step into the core region of the Prodigy Battlefield. At that time, he would become their mortal enemy.","After this idea was put forward, it was quickly accepted by all the major forces.","Now that Chu Yunfan was in the central region, they could do nothing to him. However, once Chu Yunfan stepped into the core of the Prodigy Battlefield, it would be his death. They had entered the core region of the battlefield, a place they had worked hard for a long time. How could a mere newcomer like Chu Yunfan compete with them?","If Chu Yunfan refused to appear and never stepped into the core region, there would be no danger in their eyes. If he didn’t have the courage to step into the core region, even if his talent was amazing, his future achievements would be limited.","As top-notch prodigies that countless prodigies looked up to, and even young supreme beings, they knew very well that to become an overlord in the future and truly dominate the world, talent, bloodline, divine power, and physique were indispensable. However, the most important thing was an invincible heart. Without invincible confidence, Chu Yunfan would be crippled.","But soon, all kinds of news spread. Everyone knew that there was a shocking treasure in the core region, causing experts from all over the world to fight. This was why the four forces couldn’t take advantage of the situation to pursue Chu Yunfan.","It was almost as if they had tacitly agreed that Chu Yunfan had become the Supreme Youth in everyone’s hearts.","Of course, it was not a tacit agreement. The four forces had never stopped their joint attack on Chu Yunfan. It was just that they could not hurt Chu Yunfan. In the process, they lost soldiers and generals, which made the four forces stop a little. Chu Yunfan knew that once Jun Tianci pulled his hand out, it would be a thunderous blow aimed at him.","In the central region, in a mountain range, Chu Yunfan’s incarnation, Jian Wuchen, was talking about his understanding of the Great Dao. In front of him was a group of people dressed in strange clothes. The leader of these ten people was a human-shaped giant crocodile with a dragon head.","If outsiders saw it, they would definitely be shocked. This was a dragon-headed ferocious crocodile with the bloodline of a true dragon. It had once left a fierce reputation among the royal tribes of the demons. For some time, it was even known as the number one royal tribe.","However, many years ago, his clansmen withered and disappeared without a trace. This might be the only clansman who walked the world. However, the dragon-headed crocodile was listening attentively to Chu Yunfan’s lecture.."]},{"number":2134,"title":"Chapter 2134: The Critical Point of Breakthrough, Supreme Youth Challenge","paragraphs":["Chapter 2134: The Critical Point of Breakthrough, Supreme Youth Challenge","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The dragon-headed crocodile listened to Chu Yunfan’s explanation of the Great Dao in a daze. Many of the things that he had not understood were explained. It was as if he had been enlightened.","With his arrogance, he even dared to compete with the Supreme Youths. To bow down to Chu Yunfan meant that he was completely subdued by Chu","Yunfan.","Half a year had passed since he started following Chu Yunfan. He could feel that his cultivation had improved by leaps and bounds. Although he had yet to step into the Major Arcana Stage, he was at least twice as strong as before. One could only imagine how surprised he was. Even though he had yet to break through to the Major Arcana Stage, it was still more surprising than being a Major Arcane.","Because the further one went a level, the deeper one’s potential was. He was at the peak of the Middle Arcana Stage, but he was twice as strong as before. This meant that his potential had been further developed by Chu Yunfan. This also meant that his future achievements would be even more shocking. This was what he was most surprised about. With his bloodline and aptitude, breaking through to Major Arcana Stage was not a goal at all. It was only a matter of time. However, if he wanted to go further in the future, he would have to build a stronger foundation at this stage.","He understood this point, but there was no way to further develop his potential. His aptitude and bloodline had already been developed to the extreme. It was easier said than done to break through. However, with Chu Yunfan’s help, he easily became twice as strong. Chu Yunfan was not stingy and taught him the Great Celestial Demon Art.","The Great Celestial Demon Art was a technique created by the Demon Emperor. The Demon Emperor’s bloodline was not shocking, but it had repeatedly created miracles. He surpassed his bloodline and continuously transformed, finally becoming a Demon Emperor.","In the current generation of demons, bloodlines were respected. Those with royal blood were naturally kings. Their starting point was much stronger than human martial artists. But at the same time, it was also easy to be bound by the bloodline. The upper limit of the bloodline was their upper limit. How could it be so easy to break through the bloodline?","The bloodline of the dragon-headed crocodile was naturally extraordinary, and it could become a king. This dragon-headed crocodile was one of the best among them, and its bloodline was unleashed to the extreme, but that was all. The limit of his bloodline was his limit.","If he didn’t have the Great Celestial Demon Art, he wouldn’t have been able to break through the limits of his bloodline. One could imagine the marvel of this Great Celestial Demon Art.","In addition to the dragon-headed crocodile, there were two other top demon elites among Chu Yunfan’s followers. They were also taught the Great Celestial Demon Art by Chu Yunfan.","He also taught them different ultimate techniques according to different situations. Chu Yunfan was not stingy in this aspect, because the techniques he knew far exceeded their imagination. Even the techniques that were like treasures to them were only so-so to Chu Yunfan.","The most important thing wasn’t what cultivation method they were cultivating, but who was cultivating what cultivation method. Of course, Chu Yunfan wasn’t completely defenseless. He had only taught them a portion of the cultivation method, which was enough for them to become Major Arcanes.","If they had any ill intentions, it would be easy for Chu Yunfan to counter them. Of course, if they remained loyal to him, Chu Yunfan would not mind passing on the subsequent cultivation techniques.","In addition to imparting the ultimate techniques, Chu Yunfan also explained many difficulties in cultivation to them. It was not only the dragon-headed crocodile, but the others also gained a lot. Just like the dragon-headed crocodile, their combat strength had increased greatly. Although there was still a gap between them and the Supreme Young Master.","However, there was no longer such a huge gap between them. They could even fight against the other Supreme Youths. Moreover, the more they cultivated the methods passed down by Chu Yunfan, the more their potential would be developed. In the future, they might even be able to defeat those Supreme Youths.","“Alright, today’s lecture ends here.” Chu Yunfan stopped preaching.","“Thank you, Master!” A few of them stood up and bowed to Chu Yunfan.","“Cultivate diligently. It’s about time for you guys to try breaking through to Major Arcana Stage!” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","None of them were overly excited. With their talents, it was only a matter of time before they broke through to the Major Arcana Stage. Not to mention, with Chu Yunfan’s guidance, their cultivation bases and foundations were more than twice as strong as before. Breaking through to Major Arcana Stage was just a matter of pushing the boat with the current.","“Master, do you need us to stay in the Middle Arcana Stage and cultivate for a while?” the dragon-headed crocodile asked. He looked extremely ferocious, but at this moment, he looked a little solemn.","Chu Yunfan shook his head. “With your cultivation and the upper limit of your aptitude, you’ve already reached the Great Fulfilment. Although your foundation needs to be firm, you still have to walk up step by step. It’s impossible to become a big fat man in one bite!”","Everyone was convinced without the slightest doubt. During this period, they had already submitted to Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan had proven his innocence countless times.","“When the time comes, you should find a secluded place to break through!’","Chu Yunfan said.","At this moment, he had already planned to take another step forward and truly break through to the peak of the Middle Arcana Stage. In a year, his foundation would be completely consolidated, and he would not have to worry about it being unstable in the future.","“But Master, what do you think about the marine folk, Green Wave’s, challenge?” the dragon-headed crocodile asked Chu Yunfan.","Green Wave mentioned by the dragon-headed crocodile was a Supreme Youth of the marine folks. Green Wave’s origin was very mysterious. Even the marine folk prodigies among Chu Yunfan’s followers did not know his background. They only knew that Green Wave’s strength was extremely terrifying. He had entered the Prodigy Battlefield several times, and each time, he had made a name for himself. He was invincible in the central region. He was one of the top young supreme beings in the central region.","10 days ago, Green Wave issued a challenge to Chu Yunfan. The reason was very clear. Green Wave was on the verge of breaking through to the Major Arcana Stage, and he wanted to use this battle with Chu Yunfan to break through. He wanted to use Chu Yunfan as his whetstone, but Chu Yunfan had not responded.","If Chu Yunfan chose to go into secluded cultivation to break through on his own, then this battle would be meaningless. After all, the next time they met, it would be at the core region of the Prodigy Battlefield. Both sides might have Major Arcane battle prowess.","Suddenly, at this moment, an astonishing sound of air being torn apart came from afar. In the next moment, an incomparably huge golden eagle appeared before everyone.."]},{"number":2135,"title":"Chapter 2135: Chu Hongcai Is in Danger","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This golden eagle had golden feathers all over its body and a golden horn on its head. It looked extremely handsome. However, he looked quite miserable at this moment. More than half of the golden feathers on his body had fallen off, and there were many cracks on his body. Blood was flowing out, and his situation did not look good.","“l bring bad news, Master!” the golden eagle said.","This golden eagle was none other than the black-scaled horned eagle, Black Eagle, that Chu Yunfan had tamed before, However, its appearance was completely different from more than a year ago. It had undergone earth- shaking changes.","Originally, his body was covered in black scales, but now those scales had long turned into golden feathers. His entire body was bright gold, and only a few places still had black scales. This meant that his transformation was not complete.","During this year, the eagle had cultivated the Great Celestial Demon Art, constantly breaking through his limits and stimulating the bloodline of the Great Golden Roc in his bloodline. That was a terrifying ferocious beast whose name had spread throughout the world since the immemorial era. This ferocious beast was ranked among the top ten ferocious beasts. Just how terrifying it was could be seen from the fact that they fed on the legendary powerful dragons. In their eyes, even the extremely powerful dragons were just food.","In ancient times, the bloodline of the Great Golden Roc and the dragons had not been completely severed. Chu Yunfan had found a scene of a battle between the Great Golden Roc and the dragons in the Alchemy Emperor’s memories.","It was an adult Great Golden Roc. Its wings were like clouds that covered the sky, endless. The dragon was also over ten thousand meters long. It was the king of the dragons. The two sides fought until the sky collapsed and the earth shattered. In the end, the dragon was killed by the Great Golden Roc and became its food.","Chu Yunfan had only seen it once, but he had a deep impression of it. He then deliberately guided the eagle to continuously stimulate the bloodline of the Great Golden Roc in his body.","After all, unlike his followers, the eagle was completely subdued by him. It was one of his own people that he could completely trust. He could not betray Chu Yunfan as Chu Yunfan could kill him with a single thought. Therefore, Chu Yunfan was most unconcerned about the eagle.","After a year, the eagle could no longer be considered a Black-scaled Horned Eagle. He could barely be considered a Great Golden Roc, but his bloodline was still mixed and impure. However, this was much stronger than the Black-scaled Horned Eagle’s bloodline that was so thin that he was almost invisible. As long as he was given enough time, he would definitely continue to purify his bloodline and transform again and again. In the future, he was very likely to transform into a true Great Golden Roc.","As his bloodline continued to transform, his cultivation base also rose again and again. Now, he had also risen to the Major Arcana Stage. Compared to a year ago, there was a huge improvement. He was only a step away from the peak Arcana Stage.","Under such circumstances, with his cultivation, Great Golden Roc could even run amok in the central region. If he encountered an ordinary peak Middle","Arcane, they might not be his match. Even if he encountered a peak Middle Arcane like the dragon-headed crocodile, he could still escape with absolute speed.","“What’s wrong? Didn’t I ask you to protect Chu Hongcai in secret? How did you end up like this?” Chu Yunfan asked with a frown.","“It’s all my fault!” the Golden-Winged Roc said. He didn’t dare to snow any disrespect to Chu Yunfan. “Young Master was ambushed. The situation is extremely critical,” the Great Golden Roc said anxiously.","“How is that possible? Shouldn’t he be staying in the Flying Celestial Alliance base? How could there be danger? Someone dared to attack the Flying","Celestial Alliance’s base? Do they have a death wish?” Chu Yunfan frowned.","They were talking about Chu Hongcai. Half a year ago, Chu Hongcai had also entered the Prodigy Battlefield. As the number one prodigy of this generation, he should not have been able to enter the Prodigy Battlefield. After all, he was too young and his cultivation was too weak. If he was not careful, he would die in the Prodigy Battlefield.","However, the Flying Celestials wanted him to experience the atmosphere of the Prodigy Battlefield in advance. The spirit energy in the Prodigy Battlefield was extremely dense, and the cultivation effect was not inferior to the sacred land of the Flying Celestials. Therefore, Chu Hongcai, who had just reached the Creation Stage, entered the battlefield half a year ago and stayed in the Flying Celestial base.","Chu Yunfan felt that the Flying Celestials was overdoing it. Chu Hongcai was barely able to enter the battlefield. Anyone could easily kill him. However, since the Flying Celestials had already made such a decision, Chu Yunfan could only choose to turn a blind eye. Under the circumstances where he could not expose his identity, he could only choose to send the Great Golden Roc to protect Chu Hongcai in secret.","After all, Chu Hongcai was the treasure of the Flying Celestials in the outside world, the pillar of the next generation, and had a limitless future. However, on the battlefield of the prodigies, almost all the streets were filled with such people. Not were their strength superior to Chu Hongcai’s, but there were also countless people who were as talented as Chu Hongcai. The Flying Celestial","Alliance might not care too much about such a junior. If he was careless, Chu Hongcai might die.","After sending the Great Golden Roc, Chu Yunfan felt much more at ease. Chu","Hongcai had stayed in the Flying Celestial Alliance base, and with the Great Golden Roes secret protection, his safety should be foolproof. With the Great Golden Roes cultivation, it was simply invincible in the outer region.","Who knew that he would see the Great Golden Roc almost beaten to death?","“It’s the marine folks. Their Supreme Youth, Green Wave!” the roc said hurriedly.","“How could Chu Hongcai offend someone at his level?” Chu Yunfan frowned slightly.","In his opinion, this was simply unbelievable. To put it bluntly, to a Supreme Youth like Green Wave, Chu Hongcai was no different from an ant. He wouldn’t even look at him. How could he offend him? However, he had just mentioned Green Wave, and now he had bumped into him. Enemies really met on a narrow road.","“It’s said that it’s related to Green Wave’s son in the outside world. His son was one of the top prodigies on this generation’s Prodigy List. Later, he challenged the young master and was killed by the young master. Green Wave attacked the Flying Celestial Alliance base to avenge his son,” the roc recalled the information he had received.","However, everything had happened too suddenly. Green Wave had personally asked for Chu Hongcai, so the Flying Celestial Alliance naturally wouldn’t hand him over. They thought that it would be another round of wrangling. Who would have thought that Green Wave would attack the Flying Celestial Alliance, catching everyone off guard.."]},{"number":2136,"title":"Chapter 2136: Challenge Accepted","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan was shocked by Green Wave’s boldness. The consequences of attacking an alliance base could be seen from the fact that the four alliances were still chasing after Chu Yunfan and using all kinds of underhanded methods. It was as if they had pressed the face of this force to the ground and rubbed it with all their might. It was very easy to break into the Flying","Celestial Aliiance base, but the real crisis was to face the revenge of the Flying Celestial Alliance later.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even need to think to know that the Flying Celestial Alliance wouldn’t let Green Wave go. Even if Green Wave was a Supreme Youth with a different status, he still had to pay a price for doing such a thing.","“I’m afraid that the Flying Celestial Alliance base won’t be able to hold on any longer. It won’t be long before it’s breached,” the Great Golden Roc said.","“With Green Wave’s strength, it shouldn’t take long for him to break into the Flying Celestial Alliance base.” Chu Yunfan narrowed his eyes and realized that something was wrong. He knew the strength of the Flying Celestial","Alliance. The strongest was Lan Hao. With Lan Hao’s strength, if he met Green Wave, he would be killed in one move.","“It just so happens that today is the day when the Flying Celestial Alliance sends people to escort the treasures of heaven and earth into the central and core regions. Therefore, there are only three elites of the Flying Celestial Alliance at the peak of the Middle Arcana Stage present. They activated the barrier in time and prevented Green Wave from breaching. However, I don’t think they can hold out for long.","“Besides Green Wave, his followers have also arrived,” the roc said, “When I broke out of the encirclement, I was surrounded and almost died!”","“Hahaha, you feathered beast! Where are you going? My master needs a mount. Although your bloodline is not pure enough, you can barely qualify. Don’t resist, you can’t escape. I have already left a tracking mark on you. Even if you run to the ends of the earth, you can’t escape my pursuit!”","A completely unrestrained voice came from afar.","Immediately after, a tall middle-aged man barged into the mountain range. This middle-aged man had a cold aura about him, and his entire person was like an ice blade that had left his body.","However, he soon discovered that there were more than ten figures beside the Great Golden Roc. He immediately felt that this was a bad situation. This was something he had not expected. From the looks of it, they were the Great Golden Roes reinforcements.","“You guys better mind your own business. You can’t afford to meddle in Supreme Green Wave’s business!”","He didn’t put these people in his eyes. After all, he had the backing of a person who could do whatever he wanted in the central region.","“Kill him!” Chu Yunfan frowned slightly, his eyes flashing with a cold gaze.","How could he not see that this guy was the one who had chased the Great Golden Roc all the way, and some of the injuries on its body were caused by him? From his appearance, it was obvious that he was not a young prodigy from the outside world. He should be an expert from the locals. However, his cultivation was very powerful. Compared to the prodigy from the outside world, he was not inferior. Otherwise, he would not be able to chase the Great Golden Roc to such a sorry state.","“On it!” The dragon-headed crocodile nodded and stood up.","“You want to kill me? Stop joking!” The middle-aged man realized that something was wrong. The name of the master behind him could not scare people.","His face became extremely fierce. In an instant, not only did he not escape, but he attacked first. His divine power surged out, instantly turning the entire mountain range into a world of ice and snow.","An ice blade that emitted a terrifying cold air appeared in his hand. The ice blade slashed down from the sky and grew larger and larger. In an instant, it exceeded 10,000 feet and was about to kill Chu Yunfan and the others.","“Petty tricks!” the dragon-headed crocodile shouted and sneered.","A terrifying sound wave swept out, and the terrifying ice blade turned into ice flowers that filled the sky. It shattered inch by inch, but it could not pose any threat to Chu Yunfan.","“What?” The middle-aged man finally realized how terrifying these people","Just the aura of the dragon-headed crocodile alone was enough to make his heart palpitate, not to mention Chu Yunfan, who didn’t attack from behind, but was obviously more unfathomable.","‘l have to run!’ He instantly decided to escape. He turned into a streak of light and fled into the distance.","“You’re not getting away.” The dragon-headed crocodile sneered. With a flip of his hand, a huge crescent-shaped saber appeared. The saber light cut through the sky and slashed at the middle-aged man.","Spurt!","The middle-aged man spat out a mouthful of blood and retreated in defeat. The ice armor on his body was instantly broken. His eyes flickered with fear. It was the first time he was threatened to this extent and was about to die a tragic death. In the next moment, the dragon-headed crocodile had already arrived before him. The crocodile tore the middle-aged man apart with his hands.","“Trash!” The crocodile sneered, his eyes filled with boundless coldness.","Even though they were both at the peak Middle Arcana Stage, there was still a huge difference in their cultivation levels. This middle-aged man was at most on par with ordinary prodigies. The crocodile was a top prodigy, the king of kings. Now, his cultivation level had more than doubled, and he was almost on par with those Supreme Youths. Killing this middle-aged peak Middle Arcane was as easy as lifting a finger.","He brought the corpse back and handed it to Chu Yunfan.","“Good. Just now, we were discussing whether we should accept the battle or not. Now, we have no other choice.” Chu Yunfan took the corpse, crushed it into a ball of flesh and blood, and poured it under the Brahma Tree.","Then he said coldly, “Let’s go. Let’s meet this Supreme Youth of the marine folks!” He disappeared into the mountain range with everyone,","In a moment of desperation, Chu Yunfan used the Prismatic Traveller divine art. At this time, his cultivation was many times stronger than when he had just cultivated. His speed was also incomparable to before. In just a moment, he had already left the central region and was flying in the direction of the Flying Celestial Alliance base.","The city where the Flying Celestial Alliance was located was in a panic. Since Chu Yunfan attacked without any restraint more than a year ago, this was the second time someone dared to attack the base of a powerful alliance.","After figuring out the identity of the person who had come, the various large factions in the entire city were speechless and did not dare to interfere in this matter. Not to mention the powerful Marine Folk Alliance behind him, just Green Wave himself was one of the few Supreme Youths who ran amok in the central region.","Who dared to provoke such a person?"]},{"number":2137,"title":"Chapter 2137: A Close Call","paragraphs":["Chapter 2137: A Close Call","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Facing such a peerless existence, even those prodigies who were equally arrogant knew that they should not provoke him. However, when many people found out the reason for Green Wave’s anger, they were somewhat surprised. They didn’t expect that it was actually because of his son.","‘Why does he do this for a descendant? As long as he’s here, there will be more descendants sooner or later. It’s just a descendant!’ many people wondered in confusion.","These prodigies left behind countless descendants. In fact, as time passed, many of their descendants formed huge families. However, since they were all self-sealed, they woke up after an extremely long era. It could easily be hundreds or thousands of years.","The descendants that were left behind often withered away. They would have some remaining descendants, but they did not have much affection for these descendants who were older than them. Therefore, they didn’t know why Green Wave was so furious. For just a son, he wanted to start a war with the entire Flying Celestial Alliance.","Even the Marine Folk Alliance that he belonged to would not easily start a war with a behemoth like the Flying Celestial Alliance. Unless it was absolutely necessary, they would naturally hide as far away as possible.","“It is said that this is not an ordinary descendant. This has something to do with the cultivation method he cultivates. Although the cultivation method he cultivates is invincible, it is very difficult to have an heir before he succeeds. For so many years, he has walked in different eras, but he only has one heir. Moreover, it’s said that this son has perfectly inherited his talent and has high hopes for him!”","As time passed, more and more news spread. Chu Hongcai had killed that marine folk prodigy. It wasn’t a big secret. That battle was earth-shattering, and everyone in the world knew about it. Otherwise, Green Wave wouldn’t have known about it. As long as they were willing to spend a little more time, they would naturally be able to easily understand.","“This Green Wave is too much. Where does he think he is?” a human prodigy said indignantly.","No matter what, it seemed like Green Wave, the prodigy of the sea, was targeting Chu Hongcai, the prodigy of the human race. This aroused the dissatisfaction of many human elites.","“Even so, there are not many Supreme Youths who can match him in our human race. They are all in the central region. Who would offend such a figure for a mere Chu Hongcai? Huangfu Longhao of the Flying Celestial Alliance is possible, but can he make it in time?” Someone sneered.","Chu Hongcai was a treasure that everyone in the sect was anxious about, but in this place where geniuses were everywhere, this was nothing. A prodigy was cheap here.","As everyone was discussing, a man stood tall like a mountain in the sky. This man clearly looked like a member of the marine folk. His body was covered in scales, but unlike the pitch-black scales of the marine folk, the scales on his body were a faint golden color as if they were cast from gold. He was like a golden god of war. Every scale of his contained the principles of the Great Dao.","This man was the focus of everyone’s attention. It was the supreme prodigy of the marine folk, Green Wave. His eyes were cold as he looked at the tottering Flying Celestial Alliance base.","He didn’t attack directly, but his dozens of followers attacked. There were strong and weak followers, but the weakest was at the late Middle Arcana","Stage. The best among them had already reached the peak Middle Arcana","Stage. Those with lower cultivation were simply not enough to enter his eyes. Some of them were local experts, while some were foreign prodigies. They were convinced by him and used by him.","This was the main reason why all the major factions in the city were collectively silent. The weakest of the dozens was at the late Middle Arcana Stage, and the strongest was at the peak Middle Arcana Stage. Any one of them could easily sweep through the entire city. After all, this was the outer region of the Prodigy Battlefield, not the central region. The top experts here had only reached the Middle Arcana Stage. There was clearly a huge gap between them and those in the central region.","Dozens of followers bombarded and attacked crazily. Under their precise attacks, the barrier of the Flying Celestial Alliance was on the verge of collapse. Inside the enchantment, in addition to Lan Hao, who was stationed at the Flying Celestial Alliance base, there were also prodigies such as Yang Dengxian. They injected their divine power into the barrier of the Flying Celestial Alliance to maintain them.","However, the leader was not Lan Hao. On the contrary, it was three slender and handsome young experts in luxurious clothes. Their bodies carried extremely terrifying auras. At this time, they couldn’t care less. They frantically poured their divine power into the barrier of the Flying Celestial Alliance to maintain it.","Their faces revealed a bit of anger. They were all the best of the best in the","Flying Celestial Alliance. Other than the Major Arcane leaders, they were already at the top of the pyramid. They came from different eras, and they were all geniuses of the Flying Celestial Alliance. They were originally here to escort all kinds of natural treasures collected by the Flying Celestial Alliance during this period.","They had thought that someone might have designs on this batch of wealth and were prepared to fight. However, they had never expected that it would be such a terrifying existence.","How could they not have heard of Green Wave’s fame? With their cultivation, they had already reached the peak Middle Arcana Stage. Outside, they could easily beat up dozens of ordinary people of the same level. However, when facing Green Wave, they were weak.","Green Wave was known as Supreme Youth. In the countless years of history of the Flying Celestial Alliance and the Flying Celestial Sect, Huangfu Longhao was the only Supreme Youth. However, if they were to count on Huangfu","Longhao to come and rescue them now, it would undoubtedly be too late.","If it wasn’t for the fact that Huangfu Longhao had personally set up the barrier of the Flying Celestial Alliance and reinforced it, the barrier they had set up wouldn’t have lasted until now and would have collapsed.","“Damn it. What do they take the Flying Celestials for? First, Chu Yunfan was killed by Jun Tianci, and now, even Green Wave wants to kill our sect’s geniuses!”","The leader of the group was a prodigy from the Flying Celestials. His face was ashen. Green Wave had attacked without any restraint. It was obvious that he didn’t put them or the Flying Celestials in his eyes. To them, who had always been high and mighty, this was no different from giving them a slap in the face.","Suddenly, at this moment, Green Wave, who had been watching, couldn’t bear to wait any longer. He snorted coldly and struck out with his palm. In an instant, the entire sky was filled with golden light. These lights turned into a big hand and instantly hit the barrier above the Flying Celestial Alliance base.","The barrier shattered!"]},{"number":2138,"title":"Chapter 2138: The Flying Celestials Die Standing Up, Not Live on Their Knees","paragraphs":["Chapter 2138: The Flying Celestials Die Standing Up, Not Live on Their Knees","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“The barrier is broken. The Flying Celestial Alliance can’t hold on anymore. It’s over!”","Many people’s pupils constricted slightly. Green Wave was indeed worthy of being able to make a name for himself in the Prodigy Battlefield. He was a young prodigy who could sweep through the central region. His strength was on a completely different level from the others.","Dozens of his followers had attacked for so long but had not been able to break the barrier. The moment he attacked, the barrier collapsed. Although the result was similar to the attack of his dozens of followers, Green Wave’s strength shocked everyone.","‘This is a Supreme Youth who stands at the peak of many prodigies?! many people couldn’t help but have this thought.","“He’s too terrifying. Prodigies of the same cultivation level are probably no different from children in front of him!” someone said in a trembling voice.","Even geniuses of the same level were far inferior to him, let alone ordinary peak Middle Arcanes. No amount of people would be of any use in front of him.","“A Supreme Youth is what they call him when they are young. 1 1 m afraid that these Supreme Youth have the possibility of reaching enlightenment. Their future is limitless. With his strength, as long as he is given some time, even if the entire Flying Celestial Alliance flies into a rage, they won’t be able to do anything to him! ”","“That’s right. With his strength, as long as he hides and cultivates for some time, who else in the Flying Celestials can defeat him except Huangfu","Longhao? Moreover, there’s not only this Supreme Youth in the Marine Folk Alliance. The other Supreme Youths of the marine folks won’t just sit back and watch Huangfu Longhao kill!”","Some people sounded like they lamented this fact. No matter how powerful the Flying Celestials were, it could be said that they could cover the sky with one hand in the outside world. However, that was only in the outside world. In the Prodigy Battlefield, they were weakened to the extreme. Only Huangfu Longhao could intimidate the powerful enemies in all directions. How could they compare to the Marine Folk Alliance? They were still far from it.","The only organization that could compare to the Marine Folk Alliance was the Human Alliance. If the various human forces joined forces, that force would be able to sweep through the Marine Folk Alliance. However, it was also because they were too powerful. There were too many Supreme Youths and too many leaders. It was simply impossible to unify them. No one had the ability to subdue others. Even though they were scattered into various factions, they were still not to be underestimated.","After the barrier broke, the elites of the Flying Celestial Alliance who were responsible for maintaining the barrier spat out blood and flew backward. In an instant, it was a mess.","“D*mn it!”","The three leading elites of the Flying Celestials were shocked. Although they knew there was a gap, they didn’t know that the gap was so great. This was even with the protection of the barrier, which offset a portion of Green Wave’s power. Otherwise, if it were them, they would have been instantly injured or even killed.","‘How is he so powerful?’ the three of them wondered.","“You overestimate yourself and are stubborn!” Green Wave’s eyes were filled with endless coldness, without any emotion. His gaze was like a torch as he locked onto Chu Hongcai.","Instantly, Chu Hongcai felt a terrifying pressure pressing down on him. This was a terrifying pressure that he had never felt before. Even his master in the Flying Celestials was far inferior to Green Wave. There was no one who could be compared to him.","However, he knew that there were experts in the Flying Celestials. It was just that they were all cultivating in the depths of the Flying Celestials. He had never seen them before. Even a world-renowned genius like him was not enough to make these people step forward.","Crackling sounds came from Chu Hongcai like beans being fried. It was the pressure of Green Wave forcing him. Even his bones were colliding.","“Kneel!” Green Wave said coldly. He didn’t have the slightest bit of pity for the person who killed his only son. As for whether it was a fair battle or not, he didn’t care. He only saw his only son die tragically.","As soon as he received this news, Green Wave was furious and rushed to the Flying Celestial Alliance base. As for the Flying Celestial Alliance, he didn’t put them in his eyes. In the huge Flying Celestial Alliance, only Huangfu Longhao could enter his eyes.","Now, there was naturally a gap between his cultivation and Huangfu Longhao’s. However, as both of them were Supreme Youths, the only difference between him and Huangfu Longhao was their cultivation time. As long as he was given time, it was only a matter of time before he could stand shoulder-to-shoulder with Huangfu Longhao.","“You can kill me, but you won’t force me to kneel!” Chu Hongcai’s body faintly erupted with waves of sword intent. These waves of sword intent were trying to break through this huge pressure.","Chu Hongcai had never encountered such a strong enemy, but it did not mean that he would easily admit defeat. He had learned a lot from Chu Yunfan, and the most important thing was that he would never admit defeat in the face of any strong enemy. He dared to draw his sword at the strong!","The weak punched the weaker, while the strong swung their swords at the stronger! He would always remember what Chu Yunfan said to him. “Hmph!” Green Wave’s eyes flashed with a hint of mockery. As for Chu","Hongcai’s so-called pride, it was worthless in his eyes. He increased the pressure.","Chu Hongcai started bleeding as his muscles cracked. He was only in the Creation Stage. Facing a terrifying existence like Green Wave, who had already dominated the Middle Arcana Plane, all he could do was die with some dignity.","“Green Wave, 1 was able to kill your son back then. If 1 had time, I could easily kill you too!” Chu Hongcai gritted his teeth. Blood flowed from the corner of his mouth. His internal organs and his entire body were bleeding.","A golden light burst out from his body. It was actually boundless sword intent. The pressure that could break through the blue waves erupted.","“Well said! Those of the Flying Celestials die standing up, not live on their knees!” the few elites of the Flying Celestials shouted.","Even when facing Green Wave, they didn’t cower or fear. After healing themselves, they stood in front of Chu Hongcai. The pride in their hearts was stimulated by Chu Hongcai. They could die standing, but they couldn’t live kneeling.","“Hmm?” Green Wave’s face revealed a bit of malevolent killing intent. He could see that Chu Hongcai had actually used his pressure to complete the transformation of his physique.","Chu Hongcai was clearly on a higher level than before. Compared to him, there was only a difference in strength, not in essence.","“l will not let you live past today!” Green Wave’s eyes were filled with killing intent. “Die!”","Green Wave made his move, and a large golden hand smashed toward Chu Hongcai and the others.."]},{"number":2139,"title":"Chapter 2139: The Battle of the Supreme Youths","paragraphs":["Chapter 2139: The Battle of the Supreme Youths","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The terrifying giant hand crushed down. In an instant, it had torn everything apart. Waves of intense fluctuations erupted in the air. The entire city was immersed in this terrifying fluctuation. It twisted the entire sky into a ball.","Green Wave’s eyes were filled with killing intent. Chu Hongcai’s existence had made him feel threatened. On the Prodigy Battlefield, many prodigies had differences in strength, but there was not much difference in essence. It was only a matter of the length of cultivation. Thus, when he saw Chu Hongcai using his pressure to complete such a shocking transformation, killing intent instantly rose in his heart.","The Indestructible Sword Physique that Chu Yunfan had imparted to Chu Hongcai was a technique that turned from Acquired to Innate. In the beginning, it was not obvious, but the more one cultivated it, the more terrifying the sword bones formed by the Indestructible Sword Physique became.","Chu Hongcai’s performance was mediocre in the beginning, but he became stronger and stronger until he was able to compete with Xiang Feiyun for first place on the Prodigy List ten years later. The further he went, the stronger the Indestructible Sword Physique became.","When Green Wave saw this, the killing intent in his heart intensified.","“That’s the potential of a Supreme Youth!”","The remaining three elites of the Flying Celestials saw Chu Hongcai’s body glowing with golden light. The sword bone of the Indestructible Sword Physique had undergone a shocking transformation under Green Wave’s pressure.","They were shocked. This was already a king-level physique. After the transformation, it was now an emperor physique. In the Flying Celestials, after so many years, only Huangfu Longhao had an emperor physique. Now, he was the leader of the Flying Celestial Alliance. He led the Flying Celestial Alliance to fight against the other major forces.","Even with their arrogance, they had no choice but to submit to Huangfu Longhao. Even if they were unwilling to give up and wanted to catch up to Huangfu Longhao, they had to admit the difference between a king and emperor physique.","They were the cream of the crop among millions of people, and there were not many of them in an era. However, emperor physiques were even rarer. In some dark eras, there might not even be one in an entire era.","The gap between the two sides was huge. Their cultivations were similar to","Green Wave, but they were no match for him. This was the difference between king and emperor physiques.","“Protect him! Don’t let him die!”","The few of them looked at each other and almost immediately made the same choice. Compared to them, Chu Hongcai was the future hope of the Flying Celestials, just like Huangfu Longhao.","The Flying Celestials were having a tough time. Although they were one of the top ten sects, it had always been at the bottom of the list. It was a disgrace to geniuses like them.","This was because the development of a sect was largely determined by a group of top-notch figures. The Flying Celestials’ inability to rise to prominence was proof of their incompetence. Huangfu Longhao had to fight against so many Supreme Youths by himself without any helpers. It was extremely difficult.","Now that another Supreme Youth had appeared, they definitely could not let him die here. However, they couldn’t move. They were restrained by Green Wave’s aura and couldn’t move for a moment because of the backlash from the broken array.","Suddenly, an earth-shattering bolt of lightning descended from the sky and shattered the huge hand that was slapping down.","“Who is it?” Seeing that his attack had been broken, Green Wave shouted.","He looked over and suddenly, a group of people appeared in front of him. When he saw who it was, his pupils constricted slightly. He recognized the identity of the person who came.","“Jian Wuchen?”","He had issued a challenge to Chu Yunfan before, so it was impossible for him not to recognize his appearance. Although he was conceited, he was not so arrogant that he thought he could easily defeat or even kill Chu Yunfan. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have challenged Chu Yunfan because it was unnecessary.","It was precisely because he felt that it was extremely difficult to deal with that when he saw Chu Yunfan appear, he immediately felt a little wary.","“Senior Jian Wuchen?” Chu Hongcai exclaimed when he saw who it was.","This was the second time he had met Jian Wuchen. The first time, he had been saved by Jian Wuchen. He did not expect to be saved by Jian Wuchen a second time.","At first, he thought that Jian Wuchen was just average. After all, there were too many experts on the battlefield. Who would have thought that after he came, he would truly know that even on the Prodigy Battlefield, Jian Wuchen was a famous big shot. He was known as the Supreme Youth and had the chance to become a supreme figure.","“Why are you here, Jian Wuchen?” Green Wave said coldly to Chu Yunfan. He could feel that Chu Yunfan had come with ill intentions. Immediately, a faint aura appeared on his body.","“Didn’t you want to challenge me? I’m here to fight!” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","“It’s not the time for a battle.” Green Wave frowned. “If you want to fight me, wait until I finish this little b*stard!”","“What if I have to fight you now?” Chu Yunfan raised his eyebrows.","“Then I might as well send you on your way!” Green Wave’s expression was proud. His eyes were deep as if the stars of the universe were born and destroyed in them.","He had his pride and was confident in winning against Chu Yunfan, but he didn’t want Chu Hongcai to have the chance to escape. If Chu Hongcai was originally a grudge for killing his son, then to him now, Chu Hongcai was an existing threat in the future. He might catch up to his current cultivation in the next 20 years. Chu Hongcai would definitely be a powerful enemy in the future.","The experts of the various major forces in the city could not help but suck in a breath of cold air. This was definitely the battle of the Supreme Youths. Green Wave was a veteran Supreme Youth who had entered the Prodigy Battlefield many times. However, Chu Yunfan was different. He was a newly risen Supreme Youth.","Both of them had swept through the central region. Any one of them was enough to sweep through an entire city. Now, a huge battle had erupted between the two sides. Many people who knew that Chu Yunfan had once saved Chu Hongcai were also muttering in their hearts. They did not know what the relationship between Chu Yunfan and Chu Hongcai was. Only a fool would believe that Chu Yunfan was just passing by.","At the same time, they started to pay attention to Chu Hongcai. Not only did he have an emperor physique and shocking potential, but he also had Huangfu Longhao and Chu Yunfan behind him. They were not to be trifled with.","“Who do you think you are, Jian Wuchen? How dare you speak to the Supreme that way!” A person walked out of the crowd.."]},{"number":2140,"title":"Chapter 2140: Show Might, Sweeping Across","paragraphs":["Chapter 2140: Show Might, Sweeping Across","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","It was a young man in his thirties. His body was as strong as an iron tower","and his face was rough and wild. He seemed to be full of valiant aura. He tried to suppress Chu Yunfan with his aura from afar.","“Isn’t that the descendant of the Great Force Demon Sect, Li Yuan?” Someone recognized the person’s identity and background. “That’s the successor of the Great Force Demon Sect. This sect was once glorious. I didn’t expect him to submit to Green Wave.’","“What’s there to be surprised about? You’ve all received the news too late, As far as I know, Li Yuan was subdued by Green Wave during the opening of the Prodigy Battlefield!” Someone obviously knew more and told more information.","“Li Yuan is Green Wave’s number one general. He has fought for him. Many top talents who wanted to challenge Green Wave weren’t Li Yuan’s match. Green Wave didn’t even need to do anything to defeat them!”","Many people thought of a lot of news. If an expert like Li Yuan was placed outside, he would naturally be the focus of countless people’s attention. To be able to suppress an era, he would at least be in the top three on the Prodigy List. Even in the Prodigy Battlefield, he was enough to be ranked among the few top-notch prodigies. It was impossible for ordinary people to subdue such a figure. Thanks to Green Wave’s earth-shattering cultivation, he defeated Li Yuan, and Li Yuan submitted to him.","As soon as he finished speaking, Li Yuan made his move. His fists were like terrifying twin hammers, causing the entire world to tremble violently. The terrifying aura was like a flood breaking through a dam and charging directly at Chu Yunfan.","Behind him, Green Wave’s expression remained unchanged. He didn’t move. It was obvious that he silently approved of Li Yuan’s attack.","“You dare to be impudent before me with your insignificant skills!” Chu Yunfan sneered.","Li Yuan might be powerful enough compared to others. He might not even be considered weak among the top geniuses. However, he had no chance of winning against Chu Yunfan.","In the next moment, Chu Yunfan made his move. He didn’t make any big movements, but he simply slapped down.","Bam!","One of Chu Yunfan’s hands turned into a terrifying giant hand that hit Li Yuan head-on. Before Li Yuan’s fists could hit Chu Yunfan, Chu Yunfan had already hit him.","Spurt!","Li Yuan screamed and spat out a mouthful of blood. There was no way for him to resist the attack. His body was torn into pieces on the spot and he died tragically.","Silence! The entire city was dead silent!","Many people didn’t even know what had happened. They only saw Li Yuan suddenly attack. Then, before they could react, he had already died at Chu Yunfan’s hands. It was just a simple slap, but in the eyes of many people, it was simply awe-inspiring. The invincible Li Yuan had died tragically.","Li Yuan was a human prodigy, but after submitting to Green Wave, he had been loyal. Even if he was tasked with attacking other human prodigies, he would not hesitate to do so.","However, in the end, he was still far inferior to Chu Yunfan. He was killed with a single slap. Compared to a year ago, Chu Yunfan had become stronger. He was so much stronger that he was invincible.","“This is too scary. Jian Wuchen’s slap has such power!”","“A Supreme Youth... Is this the strength of a Supreme Youth?”","Many people widened their eyes and were almost scared to death. At this moment, on the Prodigy Battlefield, there were already a few clear levels.","Other than some ordinary locals, there were the levels of ordinary prodigies. For example, Yang Dengxian was at such a level. Each of them could be ranked in the top 20 to 30 of the Prodigy List of an era.","Above these ordinary geniuses were the top geniuses. These people were the limits that ordinary people could look up to. Not only did they have king physiques, but they could also be ranked in the top few of every generation’s Prodigy List. Even the lowest was in the top five. These prodigies were the best among prodigies. They were top-notch prodigies.","Above the top geniuses were the Supreme Youths who were above all the prodigies. These people were simply invincible against those of their cultivation level. Even three to five top-notch prodigies would not be their match.","It was just that although they had heard of it, there were too few Supreme Youths, unlike 100,000 prodigies, who had almost reached the point of being cheap. Although many people had heard of it, they had never seen a Supreme","Youth in action.","Chu Yunfan’s attack stunned everyone. The title of Supreme Youth was indeed not given for nothing. It far exceeded the powerful level that ordinary people could imagine. Some of the top prodigies were pale and terrified as if they had seen a ghost.","“You’re courting death!” Green Wave was instantly enraged. A terrifying killing intent swept out like a monstrous sea. The entire city was covered in this terrifying killing intent.","“You’re the one who’s looking for death. You think you can challenge me? You overestimate yourself!” Chu Yunfan’s expression was calm, but it contained an extreme coldness.","“Kill them!” Green Wave roared.","Behind him, dozens of followers took the lead. The weakest of these followers were late Arcanes. Any one of them was enough to sweep through the entire city. Dozens of people collectively erupted with killing intent. What a shocking scene.","However, just as everyone was trembling in fear, an even more terrifying scene happened. Opposite them, behind Chu Yunfan, the dragon-headed crocodile and the others also burst out with shocking killing intent. Although they were only a fraction of the people on the other side, the killing intent they burst out was not weaker, or even stronger. Although Chu Yunfan’s followers didn’t number as many as Green Wave’s, the quality was much higher. This was a confrontation between quantity and quality.","In the next moment, the followers of both sides took the initiative to attack. The weakest of both sides were late Middle Arcanes, and the strongest were peak Middle Arcanes. As soon as they started fighting, the barrier and formation in the city activated, separating them from the entire city.","However, to everyone’s surprise, almost as soon as the battle began, the situation was one-sided. Facing the powerful dragon-headed crocodile and the others, Green Wave’s followers couldn’t withstand a single blow. Although there were many of them, they were like a tiger slaughtering a flock of sheep.","The weakest late Arcane prodigy was killed by the dragon-headed crocodile with a single punch. The rest of the peak Middle Arcanes were also forced to retreat, struggling to hold on.."]},{"number":2141,"title":"Chapter 2141: Your Legend Ends Here","paragraphs":["Chapter 2141: Your Legend Ends Here","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Everyone was stunned. No one had expected that the two followers of the Supreme Youth would have already decided the victor so quickly. The difference was too great. Even the blind could see the difference.","Green Wave had many followers, but in terms of combat strength, they were no match for Chu Yunfan’s followers. The difference between them was like the difference between clouds and mud.","Green Wave’s followers were just ordinary followers, but Chu Yunfan’s followers were different. Every one of them had shocking combat strength, and even Green Wave’s eyelids twitched when he saw them. The dragon-headed crocodile and the others had shocking battle strength, and they could even fight him without being defeated. One could even call these people almost supreme youths. Even though they weren’t on that level, they weren’t far away.","This made Green Wave feel extremely shocked. If it was just one of them, it could be said that this person was extremely talented, although different levels of physique determined the upper limit of cultivation. There were always a few freaks who could break through the limits of their bloodline, but there were not many of them. Now, all ten of Chu Yunfan’s followers were such existences.","To be able to exchange blows with a Supreme Youth for even a short time was an astonishing thing. It was even more astonishing than Chu Yunfan becoming a Supreme Youth.","Green Wave didn’t know how Chu Yunfan had trained them. In fact, it was very difficult for these Supreme Youths to train their followers further. This was especially true for the prodigies among these followers. These people were basically the best in terms of their own inheritances, various resources, and their own talent.","One’s strength might be far superior to one’s followers, but in terms of realm and comprehension of the Great Dao, one might not be much stronger. At most, one could give these followers some fortuitous encounters. Most of it depended on the development of these prodigy followers.","It was impossible for these people to break through their own limits. At the height he stood at, it was impossible for Green Wave to do such a thing. Therefore, he couldn’t figure out how Chu Yunfan had done it to such an amazing extent.","If Chu Yunfan didn’t have the memories of the Alchemy Emperor and the help of the godhead, he wouldn’t have been able to achieve such a shocking level. Not only did it stimulate their bloodlines to the extreme, but it also raised their bloodlines to another level, allowing them to fight against Green Wave.","“Stop!’","Green Wave was startled. His entire body was bursting with waves of blue light. It was as if he was an ancient water god that had been revived. His body was filled with an aura that could swallow mountains and rivers. However, just as he was about to save his followers, he was stopped by Chu Yunfan. Green Wave was stopped by Chu Yunfan. He immediately understood that if he couldn’t defeat Chu Yunfan first, then it would be impossible for him to save the others.","“You’ve come to die!” Green Wave said coldly.","Chu Yunfan didn’t move. He just watched coldly, waiting for the dragon-headed crocodile and the others to kill all of Green Wave’s followers.","Green Wave’s followers were strong, of course. Otherwise, they wouldn’t have been taken in by Green Wave. As followers, they all had the potential to become emperors. However, compared to the dragon-headed crocodile and the others, there was a huge gap. This gap made the battle between the two","sides one-sided.","“Kill them!”","Green Wave knew that Chu Yunfan wanted to buy time, so he immediately took the lead. After a loud shout, he charged toward Chu Yunfan. The entire sky shook with his movements. In an instant, he was already in front of Chu Yunfan.","“Dragon Claw!” Green Wave attacked in an instant, bursting out with a green immortal light. His energy and blood swept in all directions.","At this moment, many experts in the city finally realized how terrifying Green Wave was. Even though Green Wave had attacked before, it was just a small fight. It was not worth mentioning at all. Only now was he truly going to attack. He was completely above the peak Middle Arcana Stage and was almost approaching the power of a Major Arcane. This was the strength of a Supreme Youth.","His attack turned into a terrifying giant claw. It was like a green dragon’s claw that was about to scratch a huge rip in the entire world.","Clang!","This attack landed on Chu Yunfan’s body, but Chu Yunfan didn’t dodge.","Instead, he allowed Green Wave to grab him, causing sparks to fly everywhere. It was as if Chu Yunfan was instantly enveloped by a terrifying attack, enduring an extremely terrifying attack. The sky was about to explode in an instant.","Everyone was shocked by Green Wave’s shocking attack and Chu Yunfan’s terrifying body.","Green Wave’s expression changed slightly. This was the first time he had encountered such a powerful opponent. When his attack landed on Chu Yunfan, it actually couldn’t do anything to him. Sparks flew everywhere on his body. This was the most terrifying part.","This meant that Chu Yunfan’s physical body was unbelievably strong. His attack could even tear apart a high-quality magic weapon, and Chu Yunfan!s physical body was even stronger than a magic weapon. He was a human-shaped magic artifact!","Chu Yunfan’s black hair was fluttering in the wind. His gaze was sharp and his fighting spirit was high. There was no fear in them. On the contrary, there was only an astonishing fighting spirit boiling in his eyes. He had originally planned to use Green Wave as his last battle to break through.","Green Wave was the same. He had made Chu Yunfan his challenge target. Of course, he also wanted to use Chu Yunfan’s death to elevate himself and complete his final breakthrough. This was much more powerful than an ordinary breakthrough.","“Green Wave, we will fight to the death today. Your legend will end here!” Chu","Yunfan shouted.","At this moment, he finally moved. With a roar, his entire body emitted golden light. This golden light was like a golden flame that burned fiercely. His hand grabbed at the air, and endless lightning energy gathered to form a lightning spear. Wherever the spear pointed, the starry sky would shatter.","What a shocking scene!","A trident appeared in Green Wave’s hand. The golden trident made him look like a god. Endless waves appeared under Green Wave’s feet, while on the other side, the power of lightning was under Chu Yunfan’s feet. Like a monstrous wave, both sides rushed toward each other.","Swoosh!","Both sides were as fast as lightning. In an instant, they had exchanged more than a hundred moves. No one in the city could see what was happening clearly. They could only see blood staining the sky. “Whose is it? Green Wave? Or Jian Wuchen?”"]},{"number":2142,"title":"Chapter 2142: Killing a Supreme Youth","paragraphs":["Chapter 2142: Killing a Supreme Youth","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Many people were shocked. These two Supreme Youths had fought with their full strength and someone was already injured. Was it Green Wave? Or Chu Yunfan? Or perhaps, both sides?","They had no way to judge because the speed of the exchange between the two sides was too fast. This was what it meant to say that speed was the only thing that could not defeat martial arts in the world. When the speed of the two sides’ exchange reached an extreme, the others did not even have the possibility of keeping up.","Many people were terrified. If any one of these two wanted to deal with them, just this peak speed was enough to make them all kneel. There was no way to resist such a top speed. Unless one had a body as hard as a magic artifact like Chu Yunfan, one would not be able to resist such speed.","As the long string of blood fell, the two figures intertwined, and their movements finally slowed down, escaping from the attack speed that exceeded the speed of sound. Only then did everyone realize that the injured person was Green Wave!","Chu Yunfan’s spear pierced through Green Wave’s waist, and a large piece of flesh was crushed.","“l can’t imagine that Green Wave is at a disadvantage in this battle.”","When many people saw this scene, they felt as if they had seen a ghost. It was completely unbelievable. Chu Yunfan’s attack was too terrifying.","Although both of them were Supreme Youths, in many people’s hearts, Green Wave’s strength should be stronger than Chu Yunfan’s. After all, Green Wave’s reputation was even more resounding. He had entered the Prodigy Battlefield many times, while Chu Yunfan was only entering the Prodigy Battlefield for the first time. Before this, they had never even heard of such a person.","However, under such circumstances, Chu Yunfan managed to severely injure Green Wave. This was completely out of everyone’s expectations. The battle between the two sides ended with Green Wave being at a disadvantage.","“What about Jian Wuchen? Is he not injured?”","Many people were concerned about this, but Chu Yunfan’s body did not have a single wound. It was obvious that he was unharmed from the collision just now. Everyone sucked in a breath of cold air. They didn’t know if Green Wave had missed or if he had missed but couldn’t break through his defense. Either way, it meant that Chu Yunfan had at least reached the peak of one of the two paths.","“A Supreme Youth? You’re nothing!” Chu Yunfan’s lips curled into a cold smile as he looked at Green Wave coldly.","Green Wave’s expression was even colder. He circulated his healing technique and healed the wound that Chu Yunfan had caused. His face was as cold as ice.","Ever since he started cultivating, he had never been injured before. He had always swept away his peers, even those who had cultivated for much longer than him.","He didn’t even get injured. Of course, this was also because he hadn’t fought with other truly powerful Supreme Youths. His first target was Chu Yunfan, but he was severely injured by him. If it was just a serious injury, it would not be a big deal. The key was that he could not hurt Chu Yunfan, but he was hurt by him. In the eyes of others, it was obvious who was better.","“Are you trying to provoke me?” Green Wave said coldly, “But I’m different from the others. No matter how many times you provoke me, I only need you to die once. Just one death is enough!”","Green Wave raised the golden trident in his hand and pointed it in Chu Yunfan’s direction. A terrifying aura was released from the trident, and the entire sky trembled violently.","Many people were shocked. How could this be the battle prowess that a Middle Arcane? Even the followers of the two sides who were fighting were intentionally or unintentionally avoiding the battlefield. This was not a battle that they could participate in.","In an instant, the two sides disappeared from where they were and collided again. At this moment, the things that the two sides had learned completely collided. It had only been an instant, and the two sides had collided countless times. No one could clearly see the situation of the two sides fighting. The dazzling light from the collision of the two sides caused the entire city to be extremely dazzling, like a huge sun.","A terrifying aura spread out, forming a terrifying tornado that covered everything.","All of a sudden, a figure fell out. Everyone saw a figure wrapped in blue light retreat. When they looked closely, who else could it be but Green Wave?","This time, Green Wave was in a much worse state than before. His body was cracking and blood was spraying out. He had suffered a great loss in the battle","with Chu Yunfan.","In the next moment, a figure rushed out and came over bathed in blood. His body was covered in blood, but everyone could see that the blood on his body was not his own, but Green Wave’s.","“The victor was decided so quickly?”","Many people’s expressions changed. In their opinion, even if there was a gap between the Supreme Youths, it should only be a difference of half a move. Even if the gap was a little bigger, it was very likely that it would take a day and a night to determine the winner. This was very normal among those top-notch experts. However, the battle between Chu Yunfan and Green Wave could even be described as crushing.","Green Wave’s terrifying strength had been witnessed by all the experts in the city. Even the top prodigies of the Flying Celestials, who were on the same level as him, were no match for him. The title of Supreme Youth could be said to be well-deserved. In the future, he might even become an emperor.","However, even under such circumstances, he was completely no match for Chu Yunfan. He was completely crushed from the beginning to the end. This didn’t mean that Green Wave was useless. It only meant that Chu Yunfan was more terrifying and stronger.","“Roar!” Green Wave was pushed to the limit. His eyes were filled with hatred. His body was covered in mist as he tried to heal himself.","He tried to dodge. However, he found that no matter how he moved, he could not avoid Chu Yunfan’s kick. Chu Yunfan’s foot descended from the sky and instantly kicked Green Wave.","Boom!","Green Wave was kicked out of the city and landed on the ground outside the city, creating a huge hole in the ground.","Spurt!","Green Wave spat out a mouthful of blood.","As for Green Wave’s followers, they were extremely loyal and wanted to come forward to rescue him. However, they were unable to break through the dragon-headed crocodile and the others’ obstruction. Instead, they took the","opportunity to kill a few of them.","Just as everyone was shocked, a terrifying spear light swept out and instantly blasted into Green Wave’s face, killing him.","Green Wave was dead!"]},{"number":2143,"title":"Chapter 2143: Enlightenment, Breakthrough on the Spot","paragraphs":["Chapter 2143: Enlightenment, Breakthrough on the Spot","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In front of everyone, Green Wave had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands. There were no twists and turns. Green Wave could not even pose an effective threat to Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan was bathed in blood, but what he was bathed in was the blood of Green Wave.","The entire city was dead silent. If Chu Yunfan had killed an ordinary prodigy or even a top-notch prodigy, many people would not have felt so strange. After all, Chu Yunfan had also displayed his might this year and was widely regarded as a true Supreme Youth. However, the person he had killed was another Supreme Youth, an existence that should be on par with him.","“It turns out that the Supreme Youths aren’t always at a stalemate. There’s actually such a huge gap between them!”","Finally, someone spoke. This was the first time they knew that there was a huge gap between the many Supreme Youths. In fact, the difference between them was that one side could easily be killed by the other side.","“What kind of physique does Jian Wuchen have? Why is he so terrifying?” “He’s invincible! He’s the number one person among the Supreme Youths!”","“I’m afraid that Jun Tianci from before is also far inferior to him!” Very soon, the crowd burst into a frenzy of discussion.","“Look, Jian Wuchen seems to be in a state of enlightenment.” Someone suddenly pointed at Chu Yunfan in the sky.","Sure enough, Chu Yunfan sat down cross-legged in front of everyone. His body flickered with a shocking golden light. In this golden light, lightning energy flickered, and it turned into a domain around him.","“This power...” In the crowd below, Chu Hongcai’s face suddenly flashed with excitement. He finally remembered why Jian Wuchen felt so familiar to him.","However, he had never thought about it before. Now, he finally remembered.","Who else could it be but Chu Yunfan? Others might not know the essence of Chu Yunfan’s cultivation method, but Chu Hongcai had experienced it many times, so he suddenly remembered. It was highly possible that Jian Wuchen was his cousin, Chu Yunfan.","At this moment, Chu Hongcai finally understood why Jian Wuchen had saved him twice. It was not a coincidence, but a deliberate attempt to save him. How could there be such a coincidence in the world? Everything had its reason behind it.","If that was the case, then everything made sense. Why did Jian Wuchen save him time and time again? Also, many people were puzzled by Jian Wuchen’s background. They had never heard of such a person before. He had suddenly appeared and had a deep hatred for Jun Tianci. Even Jun Tianci himself didn’t know when he had offended such a character. But now, everything was clear.","It was none other than Chu Yunfan.","However, Chu Hongcai’s expression immediately returned to normal because he knew that this was not the time to acknowledge each other. If he came forward to acknowledge Chu Yunfan now, it would bring huge trouble to Chu Yunfan. If Jun Tianci only saw Jian Wuchen as a threat, then once his true identity was exposed, he would definitely receive a thunderous blow from Jun Tianci. Jun Tianci would never allow such a scourge to exist.","Chu Hongcai feigned calm, but there was no hiding the excitement in his eyes. Fortunately, at this moment, everyone was looking at Chu Yunfan in the sky, so no one noticed his abnormal behavior.","“Is he going to break through right here and now?” a peak-level prodigy from the Flying Celestials said in disbelief.","In his opinion, even if Chu Yunfan had gained something, he shouldn’t have chosen to break through here. This was because breaking through wouldn’t happen in a short time. As time passed, the news would spread very quickly. When that happened, many of Chu Yunfan’s powerful enemies would come after hearing the news. In this year, Chu Yunfan had not only taken in ten followers but also a group of powerful enemies. There were several alliances that threatened to tear Chu Yunfan into pieces.","“It’s really unwise for him to break through here at this time!” Lan Hao said.","He instantly thought of how dangerous it was. At this time, there were probably many people in the city who had spread all kinds of information.","“Protect the master!” the dragon-headed crocodile roared.","The ten followers formed an array and protected Chu Yunfan. There was a hint of helplessness in their eyes. With their intelligence, they naturally knew how dangerous this was. But there was nothing they could do. Chu Yunfan had done this, so they had no choice but to protect him.","Everyone could see that above the city, the light on Chu Yunfan’s body was getting brighter and brighter. Behind him, there was the faint shadow of a huge divine tree. It was none other than the Brahma Tree. At the same time, the blood essence in his body began to surge wildly, sweeping out like a monstrous sea. Everyone could even hear the sound of seawater washing against the shore.","Every time, everyone could feel a burst of resonance in the sky. They could even feel the air freeze. Even the peak Middle Arcanes found it difficult to breathe. They did not dare to imagine what kind of shocking scene it would be if Chu Yunfan were to break through.","“What technique is he cultivating? Could it be the inheritance of an ancient emperor?” someone exclaimed in shock.","Looking at Chu Yunfan’s technique, the phenomenon formed by it covered the entire city. With such power, it was very difficult for them to believe that this was not an inheritance of an ancient emperor.","“Once he breaks through, he won’t be considered weak even amongst Major Arcanes!” one of the top Flying Celestial prodigies said.","“No, it doesn’t look like he’s breaking through to the Major Arcana Stage. He’s breaking through to the Middle Arcana Stage!” another top-notch Flying Celestial prodigy countered.","Everyone was instantly shocked. Everyone seemed to have come to their senses at once because they had discovered something shocking. The phenomenon of Chu Yunfan’s breakthrough was not a breakthrough to the Major Arcana Stage, but a breakthrough to the Middle Arcana Stage.","There was a fundamental difference between the two. Even though the phenomenon Chu Yunfan experienced when he broke through was even more shocking than the phenomenon of an ordinary person breaking through to the Major Arcana Stage, the Middle Arcana Stage was still the Middle Arcana Stage, not the Major Arcana Stage.","Everyone was stunned, and there was a deathly silence. No matter how crazy a person was, they would never have thought that Chu Yunfan, who could beat a peak Middle Arcane to death, wasn’t even at the peak Middle Arcana Stage,","He was just a peak Minor Arcane?"]},{"number":2144,"title":"Chapter 2144: Chu Yunfan Is a Freak, a Strong Enemy Arrives","paragraphs":["Chapter 2144: Chu Yunfan Is a Freak, a Strong Enemy Arrives","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Everyone was going crazy. If Chu Yunfan had killed Green Wave while being at","the same cultivation level, then everyone would have been shocked, but they could still accept it. But now, Chu Yunfan had killed Green Wave while he was one stage lower than him. That was even rarer, and it made them feel fear! This was an extremely rare thing!","Under what circumstances would people be afraid? That was to feel fear when one did not understand anything, something that was beyond one’s comprehension. With the knowledge and experience of these peerless geniuses, there were very few things that exceeded their understanding. Even those young prodigies, they could understand. To a large extent, that was only because of the difference in their physiques.","However, they couldn’t understand why Chu Yunfan, who was just a cultivation stage higher than them, could succeed far more than them. If Green Wave was just an ordinary peak Middle Arcane, they might be able to comfort themselves with the difference between a Supreme Youth and an ordinary person.","However, Green Wave and Chu Yunfan were both Supreme Youths. It was completely unreasonable for Chu Yunfan to be able to do this. He was a","complete monster. He was an existence that could be considered a monster even among the Supreme Youths.","“If such a monster were to be found out by others, I’m afraid they would kill him immediately! ”","“That’s right. Even we feel a chill run down our spines when we see such a monster, let alone his enemies. Whether it’s those who have a deep hatred for him or those who simply don’t want to see him rise, I’m afraid they’re going to go completely crazy!’","“There’s not much time left for him. If he can’t break through in the shortest time possible, I’m afraid blood will splatter.”","“That’s right. Those Major Arcanes were a little arrogant before. But if they knew that Jian Wuchen was such a monster, the first person that would have attacked him would be Jun Tianci!”","Everyone was discussing animatedly. Jun Tianci had caused a sensation before, but his existence was still understandable. However, Chu Yunfan was different. His existence made it impossible for everyone to understand. He was a monster that was beyond everyone’s understanding—a freak.","At the same time, the light on Chu Yunfan’s body continued to grow stronger. Everyone even discovered that these lights were not ordinary rainbow lights, but the light of the Great Path. Each light contained an extremely powerful light of the Great Path. All these strange phenomena caused Chu Yunfan to become extremely shocked in everyone’s eyes.","“Oh no! I feel someone coming!’","The first to react were the three top-notch Flying Celestial prodigies. The dragon-headed crocodile and Chu Yunfan’s other followers also sensed it. They sensed the fluctuation of energy and blood in the distance.","A top-notch expert was approaching.","At this time, it had only been an hour since Chu Yunfan had started his secluded cultivation.","“They came so quickly!’","The dragon-headed crocodile and the others were shocked. They naturally knew that the person who dared to cause trouble at this time was definitely not an ordinary person.","After all, when he received the news, he would also be able to get the information on the earlier battle. How could Chu Yunfan easily kill the powerful Green Wave? If he didn’t have any strength, he wouldn’t dare to take the chestnuts from the fire.","In the distance, they could even feel terrifying blood energy that was like a vast ocean approaching them. It was the aura of a terrifying supreme expert. It instantly crushed down. Even the array formation set up by the dragon-headed crocodile and the others leaped into action. The surface of the formation was like boiling water, crazily fluctuating.","“The master is trying his best to comprehend and break through. We can’t let others delay him!” the dragon-headed crocodile roared, and everyone nodded.","After a year, everyone was convinced by Chu Yunfan. They also believed that only by following Chu Yunfan could they continuously break through the limitations of their bloodline and achieve incredible achievements in the future. This was something that was impossible to do with others, so they could not abandon Chu Yunfan now.","Moreover, they had chosen to follow Chu Yunfan and become his followers. If they abandoned Chu Yunfan now, they would probably have no place in the world in the future. No one would be willing to accept such traitors.","“We’ll do our best to defend until the master comes out of seclusion!” another follower said.","Suddenly, at this moment, terrifying energy and blood swept out, turning into a raging wave that almost blew away the array formation of the dragon-headed crocodile and the others. Immediately after, an endless sea of blood was approaching. On the sea of blood, a blood-colored figure stepped out on a wave of blood. It looked like the ruler of this sea of blood, a blood-colored god in the world.","“So scary. Who is that? In terms of aura, he’s not inferior to Green Wave in the slightest!” someone exclaimed.","“It’s another Supreme Youth! That’s the Blood Prince, the descendant of the Royal Bloods from ancient times!” Someone recognized this blood-colored figure.","“The Royal Bloods was once a glorious sect in recent ancient times. However, they were eventually destroyed. Their successor managed to survive by sealing himself though. It’s this Blood Prince. He was already famous when he first entered the Prodigy Battlefield. Now that the Prodigy Battlefield has opened,","I’m afraid he’s only one step away from breaking through to the Major Arcana Stage!’","Some people knew about the history of the Royal Bloods. It was a behemoth that was not inferior to the current top ten sects. Later on, they offended a powerful enemy and were exterminated. However, they managed to pass down their legacy to a descendant who made a name for himself in the Prodigy Battlefield. This descendant became one of the Supreme Youths.","“That’s right. This Supreme Youth is the Blood Prince. It’s said that his physique is a terrifying physique called the Indestructible Royal Blood Physique. It’s said that he won’t die as long as the blood sea around him doesn’t dry up. As long as the blood sea doesn’t dry up, he won’t die and can be reborn continuously. This is basically an undying being. Therefore, ordinary people are not willing to offend such a freak!”","“No wonder he brings his blood sea with him when he travels. As long as the blood sea doesn’t dry up, he can be reborn countless times!”","Many people were shocked as they looked at the Blood Prince, who was stepping on the blood waves.","Suddenly, the Blood Prince made his move. With a cold snort, he casually grabbed out, and a blood-red light appeared, turning into a blood-red battle spear. This spear was flickering with an extremely terrifying aura. The aura spread out and directly radiated to a radius of hundreds of miles. It was extremely terrifying.."]},{"number":2145,"title":"Chapter 2145: Supreme Youths Flock In","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Everyone understood that the Blood Prince had come personally at this time.","Of course, he was not here to congratulate Chu Yunfan on killing Green Wave. Clearly, he had the same thoughts as many people. He felt that Chu Yunfan would become a huge threat when he grew up.","Under normal circumstances, with such a valiant battle record of killing Green Wave, even a peerless and fierce person like the Blood Prince would not rush to find trouble with Chu Yunfan. After all, although he was arrogant, he was not stupid.","However, the news he received now was that Chu Yunfan had fallen into some kind of epiphany on the battlefield and was in seclusion on the spot. This was undoubtedly a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity.","“Get out of the way or I’ll kill you all!” The Blood Prince looked at the dragon-headed crocodile and the others. Although they were a little too strong as king physique possessors, he did not care for them.","The Blood Prince raised the spear in his hand, and a terrifying aura spread out. This was no ordinary battle spear. When he raised the spear in his hand, it was as terrifying as lifting a mountain range.","Boom!","The Blood Prince did not even look and stabbed out with his spear. The terrifying attack hit the formation formed by the dragon-headed crocodile and the others. It instantly blasted a big hole in the formation, instantly it. The Blood Prince then attacked again. The blood-red spear in his hand stabbed out again.","“Rrragggh!","The dragon-headed crocodile let out a shocking roar. In an instant, it turned into a flood dragon and charged at the Blood Prince’s blood-red spear.","Boom!","The blood-red spear collided with the flood dragon and transformed into a figure. It was the dragon-headed crocodile that retreated continuously.","Spurt!","The dragon-headed crocodile spat out a mouthful of blood before he barely stopped. This attack had directly injured him. However, the dragon-headed crocodile didn’t take it to heart. His eyes flickered with an astonishing fighting spirit.","After following Chu Yunfan for so long, the crocodile had learned most of Chu Yunfan’s fighting spirit. Such a good opportunity was not common for them. This was because the opponents they could usually fight against were only some king physique possessors. They didn’t have emperor physiques.","After all, there were far too few Supreme Youths. Not to mention, there were Minor Arcanes among them who had yet to mature. They were people whom they disdained to fight against. There were also Major Arcanes who had already matured. They were not people they could afford to provoke.","Therefore, they had only been practicing in simulations before, but they had never been able to fight an expert of this level, let alone take advantage of such an opportunity to undergo a world-shaking transformation. At their level, there were not many experts who could give them enough pressure without killing them in an instant.","Chu Yunfan could give them enough pressure, but the difference in strength between them and Chu Yunfan was too great. When they sparred with Chu Yunfan, it could only be one-sided. It was precisely because Chu Yunfan had taught them a lesson so many times that they were so convinced. It was because Chu Yunfan could preach to them and help them break through to a higher stage and break through the restrictions of their bloodline.","“Kill them!” the crocodile roared.","At this moment, another top prodigy of the marine folks stood out. He was also Chu Yunfan’s follower. The two of them charged at the Blood Prince at the same time. None of them was a match for the Blood Prince, but the two of them could fight him together.","This made the Blood Prince somewhat stunned. None of these people could be his opponent, but they could actually fight him together. One had to know that he was a Supreme Youth. At his level, it was not difficult for him to fight dozens of experts of the same cultivation stage at the same time.","If he couldn’t suppress a hundred experts of the same level at the same time, he wouldn’t even dare to say that he was a Supreme Youth. But now, Chu Yunfan!s two followers could actually fight him together. Although he had absolute confidence that he would obtain the final victory, it was strange enough.","Rumble!","The three peak Middle Arcanes began a fierce battle in midair. Although the dragon-headed crocodile and the marine folk were forced to retreat, they were in a state of pain and joy. In such an intense battle, Chu Yunfan’s teachings in the past were highlighted. Many things that were originally only theoretical had the opportunity to be put into practice.","The people in the city were even more shocked. What was going on today? Could it be an auspicious day? Why were there three Supreme Youths who were usually rare to see?","What shocked them even more was that Chu Yunfan’s two followers could actually fight with a Supreme Youth. Although they were still at a disadvantage, there was no doubt that they were at least close to the same level of strength. This was something that had never happened before.","At this moment, from the west, another terrifying aura approached. In just a","moment, it arrived above the city. It was a demon Supreme Youth. His energy and blood were exuberant to a terrifying extent. Standing from afar, he looked like a divine mountain standing between heaven and earth.","It was a snow-white demon ape. It was tall and sturdy, more than three meters tall, and its strength was extremely terrifying.","“In this era, there can only be one person who can attain Dao, and that person can only be me. All those who obstruct my Dao must die!” The demon ape laughed coldly. His face was extremely ugly. He had a green face and fangs, and his ferocious aura was extremely terrifying.","“It’s the Sanctified Snow Ape!” Someone gasped, recognizing the origin of this snow-white demon ape. “It’s a Supreme Youth of the monsters, and I heard that he has already broken through to the Major Arcana Stage. He should be fighting in the core region of the battlefield by now. Now, I realize that the rumors are wrong. He hasn’t broken through vet. But even if he hasn’t. he’s almost there. This is too scary!’","Everyone in the city’s expression changed drastically. One after another, Supreme Youths appeared one after another like cabbages. It was too shocking.","Three of Chu Yunfan!s remaining eight followers stepped out and fought with the Sanctified Snow Ape. The ape displayed his shocking strength. He used ice-type spells to freeze the world and could turn the entire city into a world of ice and snow with his strength. At the same time, he used his long staff to beat the three people until they complained endlessly. He suppressed the three of them single-handedly, and his cultivation was earth-shattering.."]},{"number":2146,"title":"Chapter 2146: Eliminating the Opponents on the Godhood Path in Advance","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","More and more enemies were coming, and the powerful Supreme Youths were coming one after another. Each of them was a master who had reached the peak of this path.","The dragon-headed crocodile and the others had been guided by Chu Yunfan for a long time. Their combat strength had exceeded the limit of their bloodline and were not ordinary. However, facing these Supreme Youths who had reached the peak of their cultivation among those of the same stage was still very difficult. It took two or three people to resist one of them. Therefore, Chu Yunfan’s followers could only be considered as pseudo-Supreme Youths and could not truly fight one-on-one with the real Supreme Youths.","But even so, the performance of these followers made everyone in the city look at Chu Yunfan in a new light. Chu Yunfan was not only powerful, but even his followers were also stronger than one another. Even if it wasn’t a one-on-one fight, being able to fight with a Supreme Youth was already something that 99% of people didn’t even dare to think about.","“Jian Wuchen defied the heavens. He deserves to die today!”","A cold voice rang out. As soon as it finished speaking, boundless darkness spread throughout the entire city. Everyone’s hearts trembled because they knew that another Supreme Youth had arrived.","At this time, ordinary top talents did not dare to participate in the battle.","What a joke. Although Chu Yunfan had fallen into seclusion, people were still determining the exact situation. If he woke up, he could kill a top talent with a casual slap. That was not a battle they could participate in. If they rashly joined, they would die without knowing how. They were not even a match for the dragon-headed crocodile.","The person who rushed over to participate in the battle was definitely a Supreme Youth. The endless darkness seemed to have filled the entire sky, like venomous snakes that swept toward Chu Yunfan. In an instant, a figure swept across the sky, hiding in the darkness and launching the most terrifying attack.","“Protect the master!” three of Chu Yunfan’s remaining five followers roared and stepped forward to stop the figure.","After being intercepted by the three of them, the person in the darkness finally revealed himself. It was a figure that was completely wrapped in darkness as if he was born from the darkness. He had an unimaginable terrifying deterrence.","“It’s Viscount Darkness!” someone shouted, recognizing the person.","“l didn’t expect him to enter the Prodigy Battlefield. It’s said that he’s a figure who entered before the opening of the Prodigy Battlefield hundreds of times. Recently, he hasn’t appeared in the close to a hundred times the Prodigy Battlefield has opened. Now that he’s appeared, it’s obvious that he’s also here for the Godhood Path!”","Many people’s faces were as dark as water. It was obvious that all the Supreme Youths had appeared together for so many years. Of course, it was impossible that they all had a grudge against Chu Yunfan. Then there was only one possibility. They wanted to eliminate their competitors in advance.","In the past, when the Prodigy Battlefield opened, at most, only one or two Supreme Youths entered. These Supreme Youths seemed to have a tacit understanding. They staggered the time and did not choose to fight each other to the death.","In this life, according to rumors, the legendary path to becoming a god was about to appear. Everyone was qualified to become a supreme god, but only one could become a god in the end. However, there were quite a few who were qualified. Therefore, it was obvious that these people had already begun to eliminate some competitors in advance.","With the strength that Chu Yunfan had displayed, he had undoubtedly become a thorn in their eyes. A Supreme Youth was even more terrifying than a prodigy. Each of their names had once shaken the entire Prodigy Battlefield.","Lan Hao and the others who were on Chu Yunfan’s side looked even more solemn. Chu Yunfan’s real danger was not here. Because they were now in the outer region of the Prodigy Battlefield, because of the time constraint, the people who received the most news were the Supreme Youths in the central region. As time passed, this news would sooner or later spread to the core region. At that time, even those Major Arcanes would not be able to sit still","anymore. Among them, Jun Tianci, who had already stepped into the Major Arcane Stage, was one of the Supreme Youths. That was the real death—the real danger!","Viscount Darkness was blocked, but his attack was even more terrifying. With a wave of his hand, boundless darkness engulfed everything. Even three of Chu Yunfan’s followers were complaining. Unlike the other Supreme Youths, Viscount Darkness’s strength was even more unpredictable, and his attack techniques were even more unpredictable.","The battle was going on fiercely. In the distance, a terrifying figure rushed in like a ball of intense flames. It was too fast, like a missile, and rushed toward","Chu Yunfan.","“Who are you?”","Chu Yunfan’s last two followers stood in front of the ball of fire and forced it to stop. The two sides erupted into a terrifying collision. They were forced back by this attack and even coughed up blood. This attack was really terrifying.","At this moment, everyone finally saw clearly who it was. It was not a person at all, but a fist-sized bird. This little bird looked like it was only the size of a fist, but it had an unimaginable power. The flames on its body swept out in all directions like a huge wave.","“Is that the legendary Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow?” someone exclaimed as he recognized the fist-sized, scarlet-red bird. Every feather on its body seemed to be burning with flames.","“That’s right. It should be the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow. Who else can be so terrifying?”","The others immediately confirmed that this was indeed the Supreme Youth who had shaken the entire Prodigy Battlefield—the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow. This race was extremely rare. It was said that they were not ordinary creatures, but fire spirits born in the endless land of flames.","They were born with terrifying abilities to control flames. This kind of elemental spirit had always been an extremely powerful race, not to mention that the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow was the most terrifying among them. He might even have the chance to become an Elemental Emperor in the future!","When this Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow had just entered the Prodigy Battlefield, it had swallowed hundreds of top-notch prodigies in one gulp. It was known as Supreme Sky Devourer. With such a name, one could imagine how ferocious this Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow was.","With the addition of this Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow, the battle became even more intense. The boundless flames seemed to be about to boil the sky, and the raging flames instantly drowned everything. Only Chu Yunfan’s two followers were left to resist.."]},{"number":2147,"title":"Chapter 2147: Everyone’s Envy, Jealousy, and Hate Toward Chu Yunfan’s Followers","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The expressions of the people in the city turned grave. If this continued, if another Supreme Youth came, the defense line of Chu Yunfan’s followers would immediately collapse. There was no way to stop them.","Even so, if this continued, it was only a matter of time before Chu Yunfan’s followers were defeated. After all, they were only pseudo-Supreme Youths and not real Supreme Youths. Even if they had an absolute advantage in numbers, they were not a match for these Supreme Youths. It was only a matter of time before they lost. Even if they had fought to the point of madness and bathed in their own blood, the gap between them could not be made up for just like this.","Many people’s faces turned pale because the aftermath of the terrifying collision kept falling into the city. Although the barriers and formations in the city blocked most of it, just a little bit of the aftermath was enough to let them feel what kind of destructive power it was.","A hint of envy flashed in the eyes of the three top elites of the Flying","Celestials. As far as they knew, whether it was the dragon-headed crocodile or Chu Yunfan’s followers, their strength should have been similar to theirs. Even if they were slightly stronger than them, it was very limited. All in all, they could be considered existences on the same level.","But now, Chu Yunfan’s followers could throw punches at the Supreme Youths. This was something that they did not even dare to think about. It was not a matter of how high their ambitions were, but the gap between them and the Supreme Youths. Even if they were in the same cultivation stage, the difference was like heaven and earth.","Any Supreme Youth could easily beat them up. Previously, Green Wave had beaten them up so easily. On the other hand, the dragon-headed crocodile and the others could fight against these Supreme Youths. Even if they had the absolute advantage in numbers, their transformation and growth in strength could be seen with the naked eye.","This kind of transformation and breakthrough was definitely not an ordinary situation. After following Chu Yunfan, they received Chu Yunfan’s guidance and experience to be able to advance to this level. Seeing these people’s breakthroughs, even their hearts began to waver.","Originally, with their pride, even Huangfu Longhao, who was from the same sect, could not subdue them. They could cooperate with Huangfu Longhao and even follow his lead, but they would not lower their noble heads to submit to Huangfu Longhao and become his followers.","This was because they were top-notch prodigies and would be able to become kings in the future. Be it inheritances or resources, they were all top-notch. Even if they submitted to Huangfu Longhao, Huangfu Longhao would not give them more and would not allow them to break through their limits. But now, they saw another hope. They could use Chu Yunfan’s strength to complete the breakthrough.","The dragon-headed crocodile and the others had only followed Chu Yunfan for less than a year, but they had already undergone such an astonishing transformation. If they were to follow Chu Yunfan for another ten years, they wouldn’t find it strange even if these people could fight with the Supreme Youths. They couldn’t help but think that if they were in Chu Yunfan’s follower’s shoes, their future would also be limitless. Perhaps becoming Chu Yunfan’s follower was also a good idea.","On the other side, Chu Hongcai saw the scene in front of him and couldn’t help but feel extremely anxious. However, he still had to maintain his composure. This kind of battle was not something he could participate in. The aftermath of any battle was enough to kill him.","Originally, he still had the pride of being number one on the Prodigy List.","Now, that pride had been completely wiped out. In a place like the Prodigy Battlefield, the most worthless thing was being a prodigy. Just the number one on the Prodigy List of a certain era alone was unknown. A person like him would definitely be a heaven-sent prodigy that everyone valued in the outside world. But here, it was no different from the cabbages on the roadside.","Above those prodigies were the Supreme Youths. No matter which one of them, they could suppress several eras. They were extremely terrifying. And his cousin, Chu Yunfan, was fighting against these monsters. It was something he could never imagine. He was both excited to reunite with Chu Yunfan and worried that Chu Yunfan would be surrounded.","While everyone was discussing, the battle in the sky had already entered a white-hot stage. These Supreme Youths and Chu Yunfan’s followers divided the entire battlefield into different areas. Different battles were all set in these areas, and they did not interfere with each other.","However, as time passed, the battlefield gradually shrank. This meant that","Chu Yunfan’s followers were constantly retreating. Under the attacks of the Supreme Youths, they coughed up blood and retreated. Even if they kept stimulating the fighting spirit in their hearts, they still had no way to fight against these terrifying monsters.","Suddenly, at this moment, a blood-colored figure appeared beside Chu","Yunfan.","“Oh no! There’s an assassin!” someone shouted.","Everyone looked up and saw a blood-colored figure suddenly barge into the place where Chu Yunfan was cultivating. It brought with it a blood-colored light and ruthlessly fell on Chu Yunfan’s head. Everyone could vaguely see that it was a blood-colored dagger. That blood-red light was extremely fast!","In an instant, the sky was torn apart like a piece of paper. Then, it pierced into the phenomenon around Chu Yunfan. In an instant, the phenomenon around Chu Yunfan collapsed. The phenomenon of the divine tree and the phenomenon of the sky full of lightning was nothing against this bloody attack.","Just as everyone was exclaiming in surprise, and many of them did not even have time to exclaim, Chu Yunfan suddenly moved. His palm instantly slapped out and hit the blood-red light.","Bam!","There was a terrifying collision sound that sounded like metal colliding. Everyone only saw the blood-red light crack inch by inch. Then, everyone saw who this blood-colored figure was. It was a young man in a blood-colored robe. This blood-colored young man had a handsome face, but his skin was a little too fair. It was as if he had not seen the sun for a long time. His body carried an extremely terrifying killing intent as if he were the reincarnation of a legendary killer god.","“That guy...”","Many people narrowed their eyes and frantically tried to recall. Finally, someone remembered.","“It’s the Supreme Youth of the Killer-God Sect, the Killer-God Child!”"]},{"number":2148,"title":"Chapter 2148: Showing Might, Killing a Supreme Youth With One Punch","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After someone called out the identity of the person who had come, everyone was in an uproar. In particular, the expressions of many prodigies from the recent ancient times changed drastically. It was obvious that they had a very good understanding of the Killer-God Sect.","“l didn’t expect that it to be the Killer-God Child from the Killer-God Sect!” One of the prodigies was shocked, and his face was even a little pale.","“Is this Killer-God Sect very powerful? More powerful than the Blood-Clothes Tower?”","Some people clearly didn’t understand what kind of inheritance this","Killer-God Sect was. They could only tell that it should be an inheritance that walked the path of assassination. It was just that such an inheritance and an existence like the Blood-Clothes Tower did exist today, but it was not like those prodigies in recent times who would change their expressions when they mentioned the Killer-God Sect.","Of course, they were somewhat afraid of the Blood-Clothes Tower and other assassin forces, but it was not to the point where their expressions would change at the mention of it.","One of the prodigies from the recent past sighed and said, “None of you know what kind of terrifying power the Killer-God Sect was in the past. It had an extremely glorious period. For nearly a thousand years, the entire Central Plains was shrouded in the deterrence of the Killer-God Sect!”","Everyone couldn’t help but suck in a breath of cold air. To be able to envelop the entire Central Plains, just how terrifying was this? Most likely, only Grand Xia was capable of doing so. Of course, the might of an assassin force and the might of Grand Xia were two completely different concepts. They shouldn’t be on par with Grand Xia.","However, even if it was just an exaggeration, it was enough to scare people, because a force like the Blood-Clothes Tower could never be described as enveloping the entire world in the terror it created.","“In the past, the Killer-God Sect was unimaginably rampant. They even established their own headquarters openly and were not afraid of being surrounded. Not only did they train assassins, but they also had their own army to conquer the world. It can be said that in that era, no one would refute the Killer-God Sect’s claim that they were the number one inheritance in the world!” someone said with lingering fear.","Although these things were from many years ago for the entire world, they were probably from more than ten years ago or even decades ago for the self-proclaimed people.","“Later on, the Killer-God Sect’s unbridled massacre finally aroused the anger of all the sects. They were jointly besieged by various major forces. Overnight, the Killer-God Sect was destroyed. The remaining people were also jointly pursued and intercepted by the major forces of the continent. I guess there should still be people left, but there should be some remnants!","“And among the assassins of the past generations, only the most outstanding was named the Killer-God Child. This person was the best of the best and can be called a legend of his generation. You might not know this, but he slaughtered everyone on the Prodigy List except for himself. He killed a group of people on the Prodigy List, and in the end, no one dared to be on it. In his era, he was the only one on the list!”","When everyone heard the battle achievements of Killer-God Child, they could not help but suck in a breath of cold air. No wonder he could become the Supreme Youth. Other than the Supreme Youth, who else could do it to such an extent? Even the top prodigies, such as Li Qianyuan, could not be more powerful than the remaining masters on the Prodigy List combined. What kind of monster was this?","After his attack was blocked, Killer-God Child didn’t show any emotion. He seemed to have turned into a cold robot. He looked at Chu Yunfan with an extremely cold gaze that didn’t look like a living person. He didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to be able to block his attack while he was in a state of enlightenment.","‘l miscalculated!” Killer-God Child thought.","In an instant, he had an idea and wanted to escape a thousand miles away. Since he couldn’t kill Chu Yunfan with one strike, he had lost the best opportunity. He could only leave first and wait for the best opportunity. However, he did not expect Chu Yunfan to suddenly move.","He shouted, “Die!”","However, Chu Yunfan suddenly retracted his fist to his abdomen and punched. There was nothing fancy about this punch. It was just an upright punch. However, just this punch made Killer-God Child lose his mind instantly as if it could shatter the entire sky at once.","What kind of punch was this? It was too terrifying!","“Run!” Killer-God Child instantly fled.","Killer-God Child disappeared without a trace, but Chu Yunfan’s punch seemed to have eyes. It only shattered the void with one punch, and Killer-God Child reappeared.","Killer-God Child did not expect that his concealment technique would lose its effect in front of Chu Yunfan. He could only turn around and point his finger. This finger pointed out, bringing out a monstrous blood sea. The wails of countless vengeful souls in the blood sea shook the entire city.","Everyone could see that the vengeful souls in this blood sea had not evolved from the martial arts intent realm, but real vengeful souls. They were shocked. How many people did Killer-God Child kill to be able to condense so many years of vengeful souls?","Countless vengeful souls floated out of the blood sea, roaring. They formed groups and flew toward Chu Yunfan. These vengeful souls were all enemies or opponents of Killer-God Child when they were alive. Many of them were people who had once dominated the Prodigy List. However, they were driven by their enemy after their death. How sad was that?","Swoosh!","Chu Yunfan’s fist swept out and instantly vaporized these vengeful souls. Then, the fist force swept out with lightning speed, and no one could resist it. This punch hit Killer-God Child head-on.","Bam!","The defensive inner armor worn by Killer-God Child was shattered by Chu Yunfan’s punch, and his entire body was penetrated in an instant. He struggled crazily, and his eyes were filled with disbelief. He had dominated several eras and crushed the prodigies of several eras. But now, he was dying at the hands of someone he had never heard of before.","“l can’t accept this!” Killer-God Child roared. His body gradually stiffened, and the life force in his body flowed away crazily.","A moment later, he died tragically. His body fell from the sky and was taken into the Mountain River Diagram by Chu Yunfan’s big hand. All of this took a long time to describe, but in reality, it only took a blink of an eye for both sides to determine the victor.","“How could this be? Killer-God Child e s strength is definitely not inferior to Green Wave’s. Chu Yunfan even spent a lot of effort to defeat Green Wave. How could he kill Killer-God Child with only one move?”","Everyone was stunned and looked at the scene in front of them in a daze.."]},{"number":2149,"title":"Chapter 2149: Invincible? I Don’t Think So!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2149: Invincible? I Don’t Think So!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This scene completely stunned everyone. The current Chu Yunfan was too terrifying. He killed Killer-God Child with a single punch—a terrifying figure who had intimidated several generations.","In the past, when the Prodigy Battlefield opened, there would not be too many Supreme Youths coming in. It was already extraordinary for two or three to come in at once. Moreover, there was no king among them.","The era that the Killer-God Child had entered was practically a sweep. There was no opponent at all, and he had made a huge name for himself in the Prodigy Battlefield. Not to mention those prodigies from the same era as him or a little later than him, they had more or less heard of his terror. He was a figure who had ruled an era, but he was killed by Chu Yunfan so easily.","Even if Killer-God Child was not good at direct combat, this was only relative to the Supreme Youth of the same stage. If it was an ordinary top-notch prodigy, he could easily beat those top-notch prodigies even if he attacked them head-on.","However, when they really fought, Killer-God Child was killed by Chu Yunfan with a single punch. With such terrifying strength, could Chu Yunfan really be a Deified Youth who walked the world?","Many people couldn’t help but have such thoughts in their hearts. Being a Supreme Youth was already a supreme evaluation. It could even be said that there was nothing more to say. However, if one were to say that he was more terrifying and powerful than a Supreme Youth, then wouldn’t he be a Deified Youth?","Even those with emperor physiques would fight for such an opportunity. It was only natural for a Deified Youth to be above a Supreme Youth.","While everyone was still shocked by Chu Yunfan’s punch, Chu Yunfan moved again. However, this time, his entire body was covered in an extremely dazzling light, and the blood and energy in his body surged. It was like a","raging wave hitting the shore, extremely terrifying.","He turned his gaze to the Blood Prince, who had appeared first.","The Blood Prince was the first to appear among the many Supreme Youths. His combat strength was astonishing, and the shocking blood waves that he set off crushed down. If it weren’t for the powerful array and barrier that bore the weight, he would have collapsed under the pressure of the blood sea.","The dragon-headed crocodile trio was forced to retreat step by step, struggling to hold on. At this stage, they had already done their best. After all, they were only pseudo-Supreme Youths and not the real Supreme Youths. They were two completely different things. It was already not easy for them to last until now. How could they continue to resist such a powerful existence?","Therefore, Chu Yunfan took the lead and targeted the Blood Prince. Boom!","Chu Yunfan punched out. In an instant, the sky and earth shook, and the world boiled. The punch pierced through the boundless blood sea in an instant. The fist swept across the sky and headed straight for the Blood Prince.","The Blood Prince noticed Chu Yunfan’s unusual movements. After all, with his cultivation, he could suppress the dragon-headed crocodile and the other two while observing Chu Yunfan’s movements. However, when he saw Chu Yunfan kill Killer-God Child with a single punch, he felt terrible.","He knew that Killer-God Child had never fought with Chu Yunfan before. However, they were both Supreme Youths with similar cultivation levels. How could he not be afraid of such an expert who was good at assassination? Although he had absolute confidence in himself, he could not guarantee that he could defeat or even kill Killer-God Child so easily. It could be said that Chu Yunfan was a great enemy in this state.","“Hmph!’","Facing Chu Yunfan’s shocking punch, the Blood Prince didn’t say anything. He just snorted coldly and a blood-red flag appeared in his hand. This flag swelled up in the blood sea. In a moment, it formed a huge flag with a radius of thousands of meters.","The Blood Prince looked a little smug because it was his favorite weapon, the Blood Kill Flag. It was a top-notch weapon that he had refined after accidentally obtaining an ancient refining method. To refine the Blood Kill Flag, he had consumed countless precious materials and slaughtered countless living beings to meet the basic requirements. With the protection of the Blood Kill Flag, no matter how strong Chu Yunfan was, he was invincible.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan’s punch landed on the flag, and the flag shook violently. It was like the surface of the water, fluctuating violently.","Thud!","The Blood Prince retreated, his eyes filled with disbelief. He coughed up blood as he retreated as if he had seen a ghost. This punch actually caused him to suffer a backlash.","‘What kind of monster is this person?’ He could not imagine that he could still be injured by Chu Yunfan under the protection of the Blood Kill Flag. This was something he had never thought of.","Even those Major Arcanes were nothing more than this. In his eyes, those Major Arcanes weren’t even as terrifying as Chu Yunfan. He was an existence that could be called a monster even among Supreme Youths.","However, before the Blood Prince could react and retrieve the Blood Kill Flag, a pair of large hands suddenly grabbed out. The indestructible Blood Kill Flag was actually torn apart from the middle.","Spurt!","The Blood Kill Flag was destroyed, and the Blood Prince spat out a mouthful of blood. He was severely injured.","The Blood Kill Flag was unable to stop Chu Yunfan in the slightest. Chu Yunfan then appeared in the blood sea. A terrifying fog rose from his body. It was a terrifying scene of countless blood waves in the blood sea hitting him and being evaporated.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan was too terrifying in the eyes of the Blood Prince. He was clearly just an ordinary human, but his every move made the entire sky tremble.","“How is this possible? How are you doing this? I’m the invincible one! My origin source is so strong that it’s comparable to a Major Arcane! Even 1 can’t do this!” the Blood Prince said in horror.","“Invincible? I don’t think so. Invincible means that you have no opponents. The other Supreme Youths are your opponents, so you can’t be called invincible. Since you’re not invincible, then what’s so strange about failure!” Chu Yunfan said as he stood in the boundless fog like a peerless war god.","The Blood Prince was about to explode from anger. Chu Yunfan’s tone was cold and indifferent. He did not even put him in his eyes. What made him even more afraid was that this guy in front of him was only a Minor Arcane. To be able to beat him—a peak Middle Arcane—to such a level was what he feared the most.","It was why cultivators had been coming here for so many years. As time passed, more experts would come.."]},{"number":2150,"title":"Chapter 2150: The Blood Prince’s Fancy Deaths","paragraphs":["Chapter 2150: The Blood Prince’s Fancy Deaths","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The reason was very simple. This was to pull out the weeds and eliminate the strong enemies that they might encounter on the Godhood Path in the future. The stronger they were, the more likely they would be besieged by many Supreme Youths. Just like how Jun Tianci had once attracted the attention of the Supreme Youths.","All sorts of assassinations had been launched against him. Jun Tianci had also displayed his terrifying talent and cultivation base. In a short time, he had reached the Supreme Youths level and stepped into the Major Arcana Stage.","At that time, these Supreme Youths would reduce their targeting of him. It was not because they did not want to kill him, but because they could not kill him. All of them were Supreme Youths. Once one of them stepped into the Major Arcana Stage, they would all be invincible existences.","And now, Chu Yunfan’s performance was even more shocking than Jun Tianci’s. He was only a Minor Arcane, yet he was able to kill a Supreme Youth at the peak Middle Arcana Stage.","Fighting across levels, these Supreme Youths were not unfamiliar with this. They had also killed cultivators of a higher cultivation level than themselves more than once. However, no one expected that they would become the target. To them, this was a great humiliation. They couldn’t let such a person live, otherwise, their hopes of vying for the Godhood Path would be a huge joke— an impossible joke.","“Jian Wuchen, do you think you can kill me? I won’t die if the blood sea doesn’t dry up!” the Blood Prince roared.","The sky shattered and his blood boiled. This was a great humiliation for him. As a Supreme Youth, who would dare to look down on them? Only Chu Yunfan dared to do so.","“The Undying Physique huh?” Chu Yunfan sneered.","In the next moment, his figure disappeared from where he was and appeared before the Blood Prince. A terrifying lightning power pierced through everything.","Bam!","The Blood Prince exploded in the air, turning into a rain of blood that filled","the sky. He couldn’t even withstand Chu Yunfan’s attack.","“I told you, you can’t kill me!” the Blood Prince said through gritted teeth as his body condensed in the distance.","His expression was a little solemn because he sensed a terrifying fact, that was, Chu Yunfan had become stronger. This punch was clearly stronger than the previous one. In other words, Chu Yunfan was in the middle of a breakthrough, and the process was quite smooth. His combat strength was constantly rising.","Back then, when he heard that Chu Yunfan was in secluded cultivation, he had immediately planned to come and kill him. A monster who could kill a peak Middle Arcane Supreme Youth with just a Minor Arcane cultivation base... He had to take note of Chu Yunfan.","In his opinion, Chu Yunfan was undoubtedly at his weakest when he was in seclusion, so he could take advantage of it. Even if it was only to interrupt Chu Yunfan’s breakthrough, it was still good. It would delay his breakthrough and allow himself to break through first. Once he broke through to the Major Arcana Stage, the first thing he would do would be to kill Chu Yunfan.","However, the truth was completely beyond his expectations. Not only was Chu Yunfan strong, but he also had very powerful followers. Although they were not his match, they could slow him down.","It had bought Chu Yunfan enough time to come out of seclusion. Although his seclusion had been interrupted, the process of breaking through continued. It would not be interrupted by Chu Yunfan’s attack.","What did this mean?","This meant that Chu Yunfan’s foundation had already reached a shocking level. Most people’s cultivation breakthroughs were more or less due to luck. Every breakthrough needed to be made in one go. Otherwise, it would be very difficult to break through again.","However, Chu Yunfan was different. His foundation was too solid. Any breakthrough was just pushing the boat with the current. The Blood Prince could even feel that Chu Yunfan was getting stronger bit by bit. He was breaking through to the Middle Arcana Stage bit by bit, and it was not unexpected at all.","This was the most terrifying part!","Chu Yunfan’s combat strength was constantly increasing. Every second, the","Blood Prince would face a new Chu Yunfan. It was laughable that the Blood Prince hadn’t realized this before. He had even traveled thousands of miles to kill Chu Yunfan, thinking that Chu Yunfan was the prey and he was the hunter. But now, Chu Yunfan had used his absolute strength to tell him who was the hunter and who was the prey.","“Jian Wuchen, I was wrong today. I’m willing to back down and give you compensation,” the Blood Prince said, “You can’t kill me anyway. This is the best choice for both of us.’","When the crowd heard this, they were in an uproar. Of course, they could tell that the Blood Prince was trying to scare Chu Yunfan earlier. However, it was obvious that he had already lowered his head to Chu Yunfan.","Since ancient times, this was the first time that a Supreme Youth had lowered his head in front of another Supreme Youth of the same cultivation level, or even an entire level apart. If he wanted these powerful and proud Supreme Youths to lower their noble heads, there was only one possibility. Chu Yunfan had already threatened his survival. He had no choice but to lower his head!","Many people looked at Chu Yunfan, who was like a god of war in the sky, and were shocked. This might create a history. In the past, when two Supreme Youths met, they rarely fought, let alone fall. That was very rare since ancient times. However, because of the uniqueness of the opening of the Prodigy Battlefield this time, the Supreme Youths met their king. The probability of this was high.","And Chu Yunfan was likely to be the one who made history.","“l can’t kill you? How would we know if we don’t try!” Chu Yunfan replied coldly.","“Why you...” The Blood Prince was shocked by the coldness in Chu Yunfan’s words. That kind of high and mighty gaze that did not put him in his eyes stung his self-esteem. He had already lowered his head, but Chu Yunfan still refused to let him go.","“Then let’s fight!” the Blood Prince roared.","A blue lightning spear then pierced through him. In an instant, he died tragically. He was stabbed to death by the lightning spears in the blood sea. But in the next moment, he condensed out of the blood sea again.","“l told you, you can’t kill me!” the Blood Prince said coldly, but as soon as he finished speaking, he was stomped to death.","The crowd was overwhelmed by the scene. They saw the Blood Prince being resurrected continuously, but Chu Yunfan kept killing him. It was simply an eye-opener. They had never thought that there was actually such a fighting method, especially against the Undying Physique. It was really invincible.","If he hadn’t encountered a monster like Chu Yunfan who possessed terrifying combat strength, even if an ordinary Supreme Youth could defeat the Blood Prince once and kill him once, it would be impossible for him to kill him countless times.","Next, they saw the Blood Prince die in various ways. He was beaten to death, trampled to death, stabbed to death, beheaded, and split in half.."]},{"number":2151,"title":"Chapter 2151: Killing Two Supreme Youths Consecutively","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","All kinds of strange ways of dying appeared in front of everyone. They were terrified. Such a confrontation was too terrifying, especially when the Blood","Prince kept trying to counterattack. All kinds of attacks were equally shocking. All kinds of divine arts and martial arts of the Royal Bloods were executed by him.","As the future seed of the Royal Bloods, he naturally knew a lot about the techniques of the sect. However, it was useless. No matter how he struggled, no matter what kind of attack he used, he could not do anything to Chu Yunfan. With a simple blow, he was killed.","That feeling made people despair. The Blood Prince constantly resructed from the endless blood sea because of his Undying Physique. His various offensive methods were slightly inferior to the other Supreme Youths. However, he had completely reached the level of a Supreme Youth. He was not as powerful as they could imagine, but such an attack could not do anything to Chu Yunfan. Instead, he was killed time and time again!","This was because the Blood Prince had an endless blood sea and could be resurrected continuously. If it were them, they would only need one attack to die. Many people could not help but record this person’s name on the list of people who absolutely could not be provoked.","Previously, there were still many people who were not optimistic about Chu Yunfan’s fate. The four forces had joined forces to hunt him down, and he had no future at all. But now, many people quietly changed their minds. Chu Yunfan was so powerful that he might be able to kill his way out. His growth speed was too fast. Not long after he arrived at the Prodigy Battlefield, he had already crazily improved himself.","“Look, the blood sea is almost dried up!” someone cried out in surprise.","Only then did everyone break away from their various fantasies. At this moment, they saw that the originally endless blood sea had completely dried up. Chu Yunfan’s every attack seemed to be useless. No matter how many times he killed the Blood Prince, the Blood Prince could be reborn many times.","However, in reality, each of his attacks would evaporate a large blood sea. After this series of attacks, the blood sea had unknowingly dried up.","“How could this be?” The Blood Prince could not believe it. Not only had he been defeated, but he had also been beaten up by someone who was an entire stage lower than him.","“This is the last strike! I will take your life!” Chu Yunfan said coldly. Shocking waves of power swept out from his body like ripples. He gathered all his strength into a single point and blasted it out.","Boom!","Even the sky was shattered by this attack.","“Let’s go all out!”","The Blood Prince also knew that it was time for the last attack. His entire body was burning with power, and he sent out an earth-shattering blood-colored tide. However, this blood-colored tide was shattered by Chu Yunfan’s punch, and then the punch blasted into the Blood Prince’s body.","Bam!","The Blood Prince’s body exploded and he died instantly. However, this time, he could not be resurrected.","Chu Yunfan put away the Blood Prince’s corpse and narrowed his eyes. He didn’t expect the Blood Prince to be so difficult to deal with. It was much more difficult than killing the Killer-God Child.","He had killed Killer-God Child with a single punch. Although the Blood Prince was not necessarily stronger than Killer-God Child, this undying divine power gave Chu Yunfan a headache. If it were any other Supreme Youth, it would be impossible for them to do anything to the Blood Prince. Only Chu Yunfan could kill the Blood Prince and evaporate his blood sea.","“Thank you for saving us, Master!”","The dragon-headed crocodile and the others came forward to pay their respects to Chu Yunfan. They had many wounds on their bodies, and even their bodies were almost shattered by the Blood Prince. If it weren’t for their extraordinary physiques, they would have died at the hands of the Blood Prince. If Chu Yunfan had attacked later, they would have been defeated and killed.","Chu Yunfan nodded and didn’t say anything else. He was very satisfied with the performance of his followers. They didn’t flee just because it was Supreme Youths who attacked them. After all, everyone knew how terrifying Supreme Youths were. Not everyone had the courage to attack them.","“Let’s talk after I kill them all!” Chu Yunfan said.","He could feel that the divine power in his body was increasing at every moment, constantly breaking through in the direction of the Middle Arcana","Stage. It wouldn’t be long before he completed his transformation from Minor Arcane to Middle Arcane.","He didn’t even need to continue his secluded cultivation to complete it. It was just that it took him a little longer. This was the achievement of his continuous consolidation of his cultivation over the past year.","If it wasn’t for the fact that he had been constantly consolidating his foundation during this year, he wouldn’t have been able to break through to the Middle Arcana Stage while fighting.","Chu Yunfan looked at the Sanctified Snow Ape. The battlefield between the","Sanctified Snow Ape and Chu Yunfan’s other followers was covered in ice and snow. Not only was the Sanctified Snow Ape’s staff technique earth-shattering, but he was also proficient in the use of ice and snow spells. It had only been a short time, but the battlefield had already been transformed into an environment suitable for him to use. Chu Yunfan’s followers were struggling to hold on, and they were about to give up.","“Die!” the Sanctified Snow Ape roared, its eyes filled with anger.","Chu Yunfan had dealt with two Supreme Youths in a row, making the","Sanctified Snow Ape uneasy. He had to deal with these followers of Chu Yunfan. The long staff in his hand swept out, and Chu Yunfan’s followers were sent flying. They were seriously injured and could not even get up. Countless bones in their bodies were broken, and they all vomited blood.","Just as the Sanctified Snow Ape was about to charge forward and kill these people, a huge handprint suddenly descended from the sky and smashed into his staff.","Boom!","The terrifying collision formed a shocking sound wave, tearing a huge crack in the entire world of ice and snow. The thumb and forefinger of the Sanctified","Snow Ape had been torn apart, and it was a bloody mess. His arms were numb. He almost lost control of the staff and let it fly out of his hand.","“Who is it?” the Sanctified Snow Ape roared loudly.","However, a figure swept past at lightning speed, setting off a blazing light. This shocking light hit the chest of the Sanctified Snow Ape.","Spurt!","The Sanctified Snow Ape let out a muffled groan and flew backward. In front of him were countless broken arrays and barriers. The arrays and barriers that he had set up around his body were instantly broken. Immediately after, another shocking sword light accompanied by a bolt of lightning streaked across the sky.","In the next moment, the head of the Sanctified Snow Ape was removed.."]},{"number":2152,"title":"Chapter 2152: Enslaving the Enemy, Nurturing the Force, Invincible","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After killing two supreme youths in a row, Chu Yunfan’s aura rose to its peak at the same time. He was only a step away from the middle empyrean realm.","Everyone was shocked to find that Chu Yunfan’s aura rose to a higher level every time he killed a supreme youth.","“This is killing people to nurture their strength!” Someone seemed to have thought of something.","Many people’s expressions changed immediately. It wasn’t that they hadn’t heard of this method before. In fact, some people had tried it before.","After all, there were many outstanding people in the city among their peers. Some were even top-notch geniuses who could suppress an era or even several eras.","It wasn’t that they hadn’t done this kind of killing method before, but they had to kill a relatively powerful enemy in order to raise their invincible force.","If they killed ordinary people, it would be meaningless.","Of course, a person’s aura and invincible confidence could not be produced out of thin air. Only by continuously defeating experts of the same realm or even stronger could such confidence be produced.","By continuously defeating strong enemies, his aura could be nurtured to the extreme.","These prodigies did the same. However, after they came to the prodigy battlefield, their invincible confidence was more or less dealt a blow.","This was because there were even more powerful people among the strong. They were young prodigies, but there were existences that were even more talented than them. Above ordinary prodigies, there were still top-notch prodigies who dominated the top three of the prodigy roll every time.","Above the top geniuses, there was still the supreme youth who dominated everything!","He had thought that was the fixed point, but now there was a monster like Chu Yunfan who could beat up the supreme youth.","As the saying went, there was always someone better than you.","Many people had to admit it even if they didn’t want to. Their invincible hearts had been broken. Before Yang Dengxian and the others entered the prodigy battlefield, they only felt that they were lacking in cultivation time.","As long as they could catch up in cultivation time, they could be compared to those big shots who were currently roaming the prodigy battlefield.","However, reality had mercilessly slapped them in the face.","If he encountered someone like Chu Yunfan, not to mention someone who had cultivated for a similar amount of time as him, even if he had cultivated for several times longer than him, it would still not be enough to beat such a monster.","That invincible heart had already been broken!","However, the degree of damage was different for everyone.","Perhaps only the supreme youths could still maintain that invincible heart.","However, after today, even if the remaining Viscount of Darkness and the Sky-devouring Flaming Sparrow could still survive, that invincible Dao heart had already been broken.","Only those who had absolute confidence in themselves would dare to kill the enemy and nurture their strength. This was because the people who were killed were each stronger than the other. If they were not strong enough, they might be killed instead.","“No wonder his aura is getting stronger and stronger. So he used this method!”","Someone said in shock.","“Is he planning to use this method to reach the Middle Arcana Plane?” Some people were even more shocked. If they were to charge into the middle empyrean realm like this, it was clearly much stronger than ordinary methods.","If not for his absolute confidence in himself, ordinary people would not even dare to think about it.","Any supreme youth among them had the ability to overturn the world. Their light was enough to shake the entire era.","But now, Chu Yunfan had slaughtered them so easily.","If they hadn’t seen it with their own eyes, they wouldn’t have believed it.","Some people even had an even more terrifying thought in their minds.","“Could it be that this was his plan from the beginning? If not, why would he start to cultivate here for no reason?” Someone seemed to have thought of something, and fear flashed in their eyes.","Chu Yunfan’s ability to kill enemies and nurture his power was already very shocking. If he did this on purpose, then it would be even more terrifying.","This was because there was a huge risk involved. Even though Chu Yunfan could easily slaughter the Supreme Young Masters, not all of them were at mid celestial pinnacle cultivation state. There were also some who had stepped into greater celestial cultivation state.","If those existences heard the news and rushed over, there was no doubt that Chu Yunfan would be in great danger.","Hence, this meant that Chu Yunfan was pushing himself to the limit. He was absolutely confident that he would be able to kill all the other Supreme Youths before the greater celestial beings in the core of the Heaven’s Favorite Battlefield arrived.","This was a sign of how confident he was in himself. It could even be said that if he did not have such absolute confidence, Chu Yunfan would not have made such a plan.","The more they thought about it, the more fearful they felt.","The supreme youth treated them like grass and killed them as he wished, but Chu Yunfan treated them like grass and killed them as he wished.","What kind of astonishing boldness was this?","‘ However, his actions are too arrogant. He treats the young supreme beings like grass and treats them as prey. I’m afraid he will arouse the hostility of these young supreme beings!’","Someone asked in confusion.","“Is he not afraid of becoming the enemy of the world? Although there are many forces in the world, and although there are countless experts, they are vaguely dominated by those supreme youths. If those supreme youths are hostile, I’m afraid that there will be no place for him in the world!”","” What do you think?” someone sneered.” Look at Jian Wuchen. Does he look like he cares?”","For a moment, everyone was speechless. Judging from Chu Yunfan’s behavior, he was not afraid of making enemies with the world.","If he didn’t have the momentum to be enemies with the world, how could he reach the top?","At this time, while everyone was discussing, Chu Yunfan had already attacked again.","His target was the Viscount of Darkness.","“Damn it!”","In the endless darkness, the Viscount of Darkness couldn’t help but roar. Just now, Chu Yunfan had killed several young supreme beings, which made him extremely afraid.","Even with his arrogance, he did not dare to say that he could easily deal with","Chu Yunfan.","Boundless darkness spread out, turning into a terrifying force that traversed the sky, piercing through the clouds in the sky.","A long sword flew out from it, and the sword light carried an invincible aura.","“Boom!”","This attack pierced through everything and instantly went straight for Chu Yunfan’s head. It far exceeded the absolute strength that ordinary peak middle empyrean young supreme beings could unleash.","Greater celestial. This strike was definitely at the level of a greater celestial.","It was so fast that no one could react in time. The black sword light had already arrived in front of Chu Yunfan.","This was the hidden killing move of the Viscount of Darkness, which far exceeded his own combat strength. Even if he was also a supreme youth, he would not be able to withstand this terrifying attack, just like the Blood Prince’s undying body, which was his trump card.","“Clang!","The sound of metal clashing could be heard. The Cauldron of Mountain and River protected Chu Yunfan above his head, blocking this terrifying attack.."]},{"number":2153,"title":"Chapter 2153: Viscount Darkness, Dead!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2153: Viscount Darkness, Dead!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Clang, clang, clang!","A series of crisp cracking sounds rang out as the flying sword in the darkness struck the Mountain River Cauldron, shattering it inch by inch.","“What is it? How is that possible?”","Viscount Darkness widened his eyes in the darkness. He could not believe it. Others might not know, but he knew very well that the quality of this Dark Flying Sword was not ordinary.","Otherwise, he wouldn’t have used it as his trump card. The attack that he had used all his strength to unleash was definitely at the level of a Major Arcane, yet it was easily blocked by Chu Yunfan’s cauldron. He could not even leave a mark on the medicinal cauldron. His expression immediately changed drastically.","Naturally, he did not know that the Mountain River Cauldron was a magic tool that the Alchemy Emperor carried with him before he reached enlightenment. Although it was not for offense or defense, it was impossible for them to break the Mountain River Cauldron in their current level.","“It’s my turn next!” Chu Yunfan looked at Viscount Darkness in the darkness. It was almost a black shadow, and the laws of darkness were vividly reflected on his body.","“It’s actually the Royal Dark Physique. I can’t believe I can see such a physique in this era!” Chu Yunfan seemed to have thought of something. He had seen through the physique of Viscount Darkness.","To be more precise, he learned from the Alchemy Sovereign’s memories that this was a top-notch emperor physique. In ancient times, there was once an emperor whose name shook the world. However, after that, this kind of physique never appeared again. He did not expect the world-famous Viscount Darkness to have this physique.","“You recognise my physique?” This time, it was Viscount Darkness’s turn to be shocked. He did not expect Chu Yunfan to be able to see through his physique.","Many people only knew that he had an emperor physique, but they didn’t know what kind of physique he had. Chu Yunfan only took a glance at him and actually saw through his physique. How could he not be shocked!","Chu Yunfan sneered. His eyes were like two sharp swords that could easily see through Viscount Darkness in the endless darkness. Like an immortal sword being unsheathed, the sword light streaked across the sky. His gaze evolved into a terrifying divine power.","“What a terrifying martial will!” someone said.","Everyone was shocked and their bodies turned cold. Many people gasped. Chu Yunfan’s aura was still increasing. If this continued, it would only be a matter of time before he reached the Middle Arcana Stage.","In fact, he did not even need to cultivate in seclusion for a year or so like ordinary people to break through. He could break through in an instant. This was the terrifying aspect of killing enemies and nurturing potental. Using one’s potential that had been nurtured to the extreme, bringing along the might of a great victory, one could complete a breakthrough.","Of course, Viscount Darkness wouldn’t just wait for death. He let out a breath of black gas that filled the sky. In an instant, it turned into a gale and swept toward Chu Yunfan. Even if a top-notch prodigy were to encounter this gust of wind, they would also die. Even the Supreme Youth did not dare to take it head-on.","Chu Yunfan sneered and reached out a hand to grab at the air. The black gas that filled the sky turned into a gale and disappeared. In an instant, the world regained its clarity.","“His combat strength has increased again!” someone exclaimed.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan took a step forward and appeared in front of","Viscount Darkness in a flash. Chu Yunfan simply threw a punch. The terrifying fist intent shattered everything and shattered all the darkness.","Viscount Darkness seemed to have condensed all the darkness in front of him into a wall of darkness that was thousands of feet tall. This was the divine power he was proud of. However, in front of this punch, everything was like floating clouds. This punch seemed to be able to break through all techniques.","The wall of darkness collapsed in front of everyone as Viscount Darkness screamed and flew out of the darkness. For the first time, everyone could see the visage of Viscount Darkness. It was a handsome young man in a gorgeous black robe. However, at this time, Viscount Darkness kept coughing up blood. He was seriously injured by Chu Yunfan.","However, the fact that he had been beaten to this extent had stimulated the boundless heroic spirit in his heart. Instead of etreating, he advanced and charged toward Chu Yunfan again. The boundless darkness turned into a black giant and charged toward Chu Yunfan. This black giant was able to execute an astonishing martial art, and it was not an ordinary divine power.","“It’s useless. In front of my strength, your strength is not worth mentioning,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently.","His strength had reached its peak by killing enemies and nurturing his power.","At the beginning, Viscount Darkness could still fight against him. After all, Viscount Darkness’s strength was not inferior to Green Wave’s. However, now, facing Chu Yunfan, who had cultivated his power to the extreme, any strong enemy could be defeated.","Just as many people had guessed before, this was a trap set by Chu Yunfan. If he had broken through normally, even if he pushed the boat with the current, he would have needed at least several months to break through to the Middle Arcana Stage. However, with the momentum he had gained from killing enemies, he only needed a short time to complete such a breakthrough.","Although he was stepping on the corpses of the Supreme Youths, Chu Yunfan’s heart was unmoved. If these Supreme Youths did not want to kill him, how could they have taken the bait and come here with hostility in their hearts? Since they had come, they must be enemies. Killing the enemy was like pulling grass, and there was no room for mercy.","Chu Yunfan’s simple punch directly broke the black giant’s attack, shattering the martial arts technique it had displayed and the black giant into pieces.","spurt!","Viscount Darkness spat out a mouthful of blood. The divine power he had used was shattered by Chu Yunfan, and he suffered an extremely serious backlash.upd@te by- newnovel.","‘l have to go!’ These words flashed through Viscount Darkness’ mind. Even someone as proud as him had to admit that there was a huge gap between him and Chu Yunfan. He no longer forced himself to endure. He directly transformed into a black light and disappeared into the horizon.","“It’s too late to leave now!” Chu Yunfan sneered, and the power of thunder in his hand turned into a spear.","The spear was blue in color, and the spear was wrapped in layers of thunder power. It had even evolved into a thunder seal, and the Great Dao of thunder power was engraved on it.","In the next moment, Chu Yunfan threw the spear.","Boom!","In the next moment, the spear hit Viscount Darkness. Even with his strength, he was unable to dodge the attack. He was pierced by the lightning spear and nailed to the ground.","Viscount Darkness was dead!"]},{"number":2154,"title":"Chapter 2154: Subduing the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow","paragraphs":["Chapter 2154: Subduing the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow","Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Boom!","After killing Viscount Darkness, the terrifying aura on Chu Yunfan’s body increased at a speed visible to the naked eye. He was just a hair’s breadth away from reaching the peak Middle Arcana Stage!","Everyone could see that Chu Yunfan was only a hair’s breadth away from the Middle Arcana Stage. Under normal circumstances, he would be able to enter the Middle Arcana Stage in the time it takes to brew a cup of tea.","This was the extreme of nurturing force!","“He’s so strong. In this state, he’s almost invincible. There’s no one who can match him!” someone exclaimed, “I’m afraid that any Supreme Youth in the same cultivation level as him is no match for him. After all, he’s only a Minor Arcane. Even after his breakthrough, he’s only a Middle Arcane. Yet, he possesses such shocking combat strength. If I hadn’t seen it with my own eyes today, I wouldn’t have believed it even if I were beaten to death.”","“That’s right. There’s actually such a person in the world. In the end, only the","Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow is left. As long as he kills the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow, he’ll be able to reach the peak Middle Arcana Stage,” someone cried out in surprise.","Chu Yunfan had planned for so long, so of course it wasn’t just for the sake of breaking through to the Middle Arcana Stage. Instead, he was planning to make use of these Supreme Youths to push himself all the way to the peak Minor Arcana Stage. By then, he would be ready to break through to the Middle Arcana Stage. At that time, his battle prowess would soar to another level. He wouldn’t even have to fear a Major Arcane, and he wouldn’t be a weakling even amongst Major Arcanes.","His real enemy was none other than Jun Tianci. If he didn’t use such an extreme method, how could he catch up to Jun Tianci in the shortest time possible, or even surpass him? He could kill Jun Tianci in one fell swoop, and take revenge for being severely injured and almost killed back then.","The Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow let out loud cries, turning the surrounding battlefield into a sea of fire. He kept trying to escape. Seeing Chu Yunfan kill everyone else, no matter how conceited he was, he was scared out of his wits. A Supreme Youth was invincible, but it didn’t mean that they weren’t afraid of death, especially in this situation where he was obviously courting death.","However, he had no way to escape. Chu Yunfan had killed those Supreme Youths, so Chu Yunfan’s followers had been freed one after another. At this moment, they had all gathered together to attack the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow.","The sparrow was indeed stronger than any of them, but it was suppressed by the combined forces of the ten of them. It was completely at a disadvantage. The sea of fire that filled the sky was unable to drive the dragon-headed crocodile and the others away. The sparrow was getting more and more agitated. Beside him was Chu Yunfan, who had unfathomable strength and was like a monster, eyeing him covetously. Thinking of this, the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow felt uneasy.","“It’s your turn next!”","Just as the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow was about to use its divine power to devour everyone, Chu Yunfan’s voice appeared on the battlefield without any warning.","“Why you...” The Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow’s fist-sized body trembled slightly as if he had seen a ghost.","He didn’t know why Chu Yunfan was so powerful, but he knew one thing. Chu Yunfan’s appearance meant that his last ally, Viscount Darkness, was dead. At this moment, he was extremely regretful. Why didn’t he escape when Chu Yunfan had just started killing? No, to be precise, he should not have gotten involved in this mess at all. If he had known that Chu Yunfan was so abnormal, he would not have come to the battle to besiege Chu Yunfan.","“Submit to me or die!” Chu Yunfan laughed coldly. He looked at the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow, and the thought of taming it suddenly appeared in his mind.","“You want to subdue me? That’s impossible!” the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow roared. He would rather die than be under someone else.","The sparrow was arrogant. His bloodline did not allow him to lower his head to others. He opened his mouth to the sky. Suddenly, boundless flames swept toward Chu Yunfan like burning clouds. These were not ordinary flames, but the true fire of life. It was something that the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow had cultivated for countless years. Normally, even a little bit of it was enough to make his heart ache, but now that Chu Yunfan had forced him to this point, he could no longer care about it.","A fierce look flashed in his eyes. No matter how powerful Chu Yunfan was, he would still be burned to ashes by this True Fire. However, something he never expected happened. Facing the sea of fire, Chu Yunfan didn’t dodge. He swallowed the sea of fire directly.","“Impossible!”","A look of complete disbelief flashed across the small eyes of the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow as if it had seen a ghost. That was the True Fire that it had cultivated from its Life Power. How could it be swallowed by an outsider?","Was Chu Yunfan’s body an alchemical furnace? He could swallow these flames anytime and anywhere!","“I’ll return it to you!” Chu Yunfan opened his mouth, and the flames that filled the sky swept over, enveloping the flaming the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow.","The speed was too fast. It was much faster than when the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow spat out flames. After a short while, the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow was burnt by the flames that filled the sky.","Everyone was dumbfounded as they looked at the Sky Devourer Flaming","Sparrow that was being burned by the sea of fire. The Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow was a flame spirit that was born from the sea of fire. It could be said that he was born with an extremely strong affinity for all kinds of flames. Not only would fire not burn it, but it would become a great tonic for him. However, he was now being burned by Chu Yunfan’s flame.","There was only one possibility, and that was that the flames released by Chu Yunfan were of a higher grade than the flames of the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow. How was this possible?","When a Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow grew to their peak, they could stand shoulder to shoulder with the emperors. They were at the peak of fire. Even the legendary phoenix was no more than this.","“What is the quality of the flame that Jian Wuchen spat out? It’s so terrifying!’ someone asked.","There was no lack of top-notch prodigies who used fire-type divine powers, but they were also dumbfounded. If others asked them, who would they ask?","“How about it? Follow me and I’ll teach you the Great Dao of Fire. It’s even more advanced than what you cultivate.”","Chu Yunfan put away the sea of fire and stood with his hands behind his back. He casually injected a cultivation technique into the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow’s mind.","The Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow hesitated for a long time before flying to Chu Yunfan’s side. “Greetings, Master,” he said. Everyone was dumbfounded.. What was going on?"]},{"number":2155,"title":"Chapter 2155: The Attack of a Major Arcane","paragraphs":["Chapter 2155: The Attack of a Major Arcane","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","A Supreme Youth submitting to another Supreme Youth?","Before this, no matter how crazy a person was, they would not dare to think in this direction. That was a Supreme Youth. They had never heard of a Supreme Youth submitting to the feet of another Supreme Youth.","Ordinary people would become the followers of these prodigies, top-notch prodigies, and even Supreme Youths, just to obtain better resources and transcend. These Supreme Youths, whether it was their background, resources, various inheritances, or aptitude, they were all top-notch. Even if they submitted to another Supreme Youth, they would not get anything better. Moreover, they had astonishing self-esteem. They would rather die than submit.","But Chu Yunfan somehow did it!","“How did he do it?”","Everyone was dumbfounded. Or had the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow been beaten silly?","However, it didn’t look like the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow was being forced. In fact, it was impossible for the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow to force him. At most, he would die.","Of course, the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow had heard everyone’s discussion and confusion. He naturally understood why everyone was puzzled. Under normal circumstances, he would rather die than submit to Chu Yunfan and become his follower. However, there was something more important than death now, and that was to break through the limitations of his original bloodline.","The Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow was a spirit born from fire. He was born with the ability to control all kinds of flames. It could even be said that he stood at the peak of fire divine powers. There were very few people who could compare to him. In fact, as long as he dug deep into his bloodline, he could become the strongest existence in the world with fire divine powers. He didn’t need to ask for help. As long as he dug out his own bloodline, he would be invincible. However, Chu Yunfan gave him another choice, which was to surpass his bloodline.","The Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow’s bloodline was unleashed to the extreme, and it was indeed rare in the world. However, there was another type of vicious bird that had a better control and understanding of fire than the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow. That was the Immemorial Dark Phoenix, known as the leader of the Ten Ferocities!","The Immemorial Dark Phoenix was a mutated phoenix of the phoenix species. Ordinary phoenixes were born as fire gods and had a top-notch grasp of fire god art. Even if the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow had dug out its bloodline to the extreme, it would be comparable to phoenixes.","However, the Immemorial Dark Phoenix was completely different. From the moment it was born, it was completely different from the other phoenixes.","Later on, it became the leader of the Ten Ferocities. Its ability to control fire could be said to be earth-shattering. It had completely surpassed the level brought by its own bloodline and reached an unprecedented realm.","Chu Yunfan was the first person to use such power since ancient times. These ordinary people did not know that Chu Yunfan had fused with the bloodline of the Immemorial Dark Phoenix. As time passed, he awakened more and more information about the bloodline.","This was originally an ability that only the demons possessed. After fusing with the ability of the Immemorial Dark Phoenix, Chu Yunfan could continue to dig out the bloodline information left behind by the Immemorial Dark Phoenix as his cultivation continued to increase. Among them were its experiences in controlling fire and cultivating fire-type divine powers.","As Chu Yunfan’s cultivation became more and more spirited, more of this information inherited in his bloodline awakened. In addition, Chu Yunfan still had the memories of the Alchemy Emperor. The Alchemy Emperor had achieved Dao through alchemy, so his control of fire divine powers was shocking. It was his forte.","There was no one else in the world who could guide the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow except Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan had only passed a small portion of his experience to the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow, and the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow immediately made a decision.","Of course, the most fundamental reason was that Chu Yunfan was too strong.","Even if he didn’t use his full strength, he could still beat the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow with one hand. There was no way he could survive. When he had a better choice, he chose to surrender instead of committing suicide for his pride. Moreover, he would become Chu Yunfan’s follower, not a slave. It was completely different from the Golden Roc.","Of course, the other people didn’t understand the details of this. They only saw Chu Yunfan easily subdue the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow without much effort. Many people even thought that the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow was afraid of death. Was it so easy to subdue?","After choosing to submit, the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow quickly adjusted its position and flew to Chu Yunfan’s shoulder. It was only the size of a fist, so it was not strange for it to fly to Chu Yunfan’s shoulder. With its cultivation and strength, no one dared to underestimate it because of its size.","“Where’s Jian Wuchen? Come and die!”","Suddenly, a terrifying aura swept over from afar. It was much stronger than the aura of those Supreme Youths when they arrived earlier.","Everyone in the city was stunned. They all thought that the battle would have ended after Chu Yunfan subdued the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow. Who would have thought that at the last moment, another expert would arrive?","“A Major Arcane! ”","Everyone’s expression changed. It was a Major Arcane!","As many people had thought before, as time passed, not only would the Supreme Youths from the central region rush over. Even the Major Arcanes at the core region would come over when they heard the news. It was only a matter of time.","Initially, everyone thought that Chu Yunfan’s actions were swift and decisive, killing the other Supreme Youths with lightning speed. They thought that he would be able to retreat in time. However, they did not expect that a Major Arcane would arrive at this moment.","Those Supreme Youths were already very terrifying. They could beat up ordinary peak Middle Arcanes like they were slaughtering chickens and dogs.","However, they were still inferior to the Major Arcanes. Even the normal Major Arcanes who had just broken through were more terrifying than these Supreme Youths.","This was why even with the pride of these Supreme Youths, they could only roam freely in the central region and would not easily step into the core region. That was because the people there were all Major Arcanes. Even Supreme Youths would die there.","Their talent made many people wary, wanting to take advantage of these Supreme Youths before they grew up to eradicate them like weeds. They also knew their limits and would not easily enter the core region.","The Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow on Chu Yunfan’s shoulder had a slight change in expression. The dragon-headed crocodile and the others were naturally shocked. If they were to break through to Major Arcana Stage, everything would be a piece of cake for them. However, right now was the most dangerous time for them.."]},{"number":2156,"title":"Chapter 2156: Breakthrough to the Middle Arcana Stage","paragraphs":["Chapter 2156: Breakthrough to the Middle Arcana Stage","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The Major Arcane seemed to be unwilling to waste any more time waiting. In an instant, he attacked.","A huge hand pierced through the sky, creating a huge hole in the clouds. The hand was coming down at Chu Yunfan at an astonishing speed. Wherever this hand passed, the entire sky was burning fiercely. Endless golden light turned into light spots that filled the sky. With a casual move, the entire world seemed to be about to be torn apart.","“Watch out. Master!” the dragon-headed crocodile cried out in alarm. He wanted to go forward, but he had no way to do so. The terrifying aura separated them.","Chu Yunfan didn’t move as if he had been scared silly. When the big hand fell, the entire place shook as if a terrifying power was boiling in the void, and even the sky seemed to be about to shatter.","“Hahaha! Just in time!”","Suddenly, the aura in Chu Yunfan’s body rose by a large margin as if he had suddenly broken through a certain barrier. The aura in his body was completely released, and a bolt of lightning appeared above his head. This bolt of lightning turned into a shocking sword light. The sword light split into countless sword lights and turned into a sword path in the air. In an instant, it blasted into the big hand.","Boom!","With a shocking explosion, the hand that was coming down from the sky was cut in half by Chu Yunfan’s sword light.","“What astonishing swordsmanship! He broke through!’","In the city, many experts were extremely shocked. Looking at the sword light that shot into the sky, it seemed to have split the clouds within a ten-mile radius with one sword strike.","“Eh?” At this moment, a doubtful voice came from afar. It seemed to be somewhat puzzled that their attack had failed.","“He actually broke through?”","On Chu Yunfan’s shoulder, the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow was extremely shocked. Just now, he wanted to dodge this attack, but he was firmly fixed on Chu Yunfan’s shoulder by an invisible force. He was just about to unleash his divine power to counter this giant hand. He was a Supreme Youth after all. Even though he was slightly weaker than an ordinary Major Arcane, he was still capable of fighting back.","Who would have thought that Chu Yunfan’s sword would shatter the palm that he had used all his strength to resist?","Of course, he could feel that there was only one reason why Chu Yunfan could do this, and that was that he had already broken through. He understood from the start that Chu Yunfan was killing his enemies and nurturing his strength, treating them as prey. If he had not surrendered earlier, he would have become Chu Yunfan’s nourishment. With his submission, Chu Yunfan’s cultivation had been completely completed, and he had naturally broken through to this step.","Chu Yunfan could now truly fight against Major Arcanes.","At this moment, the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow completely submitted to Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan’s strength had completely convinced him. If he was a proud prodigy in everyone’s eyes—a monster that had suppressed countless eras—then Chu Yunfan was undoubtedly the monster among the monsters. “Hmph!’","From afar, a cold voice rang out. A terrifying white light swept through the air, instantly transforming into a terrifying phantom. This phantom’s face couldn’t be seen clearly, one could only vaguely tell that it was a human figure. It slammed its palm down with great momentum. In an instant, it almost pierced through the sky.","“Is this the extent of light? Don’t even think about running away today!’","Chu Yunfan took a step forward and launched an attack as well. He grabbed at the aire, and a bolt of lightning turned into a long sword in his hand. The sword light swept out, and a terrifying sword light that was thousands of feet long swept across the sky and shattered the air. In an instant, it directly cut into the phantom.","Boom!","The phantom was shattered, and soon, a figure appeared. Everyone focused and saw that it was a young man who looked to be in his thirties. The mana fluctuations on his body were like burning flames.","“It’s him. That’s Fire Spirit, right?”","Some people saw clearly that the person in the sky was none other than Fire Spirit, who had awed the world.","“That’s right, it’s him!”","The top elites of the Flying Celestials exchanged glances and confirmed the identity of the young man in front of them. They had fought before, and Fire Spirit had been a formidable opponent. After that, Fire Spirit stepped into Major Arcana Stage first and headed toward the core region. From then on, they had no contact with each other. However, they still had lingering fears about Fire Spirit’s power.","“You’re pretty strong. No wonder Jun Tianci sent me a message to kill you while you’re in seclusion,” Fire Spirit said as his eyes grew cold.","Although he wasn’t a Supreme Youth, and Chu Yunfan was the legendary","Supreme Youth, he didn’t care. So what if Chu Yunfan was a Supreme Youth? The difference in strength was obvious. Even a Supreme Youth had no choice but to submit to his strength. They even had to hide when he saw him because there were no rules on the Prodigy Battlefield. Only strength was respected, and he was stronger than those usually high and mighty Supreme Youths.","The difference in strength was a difference. So what if he had potential? If he could not turn potential into strength, it would be useless. Countless talented people had fallen on the path of cultivation and become stepping stones for others to rise to power.","“So, it was Jun Tianci who sent you to kill me. I didn’t expect you to be a dog raised by Jun Tianci.” Chu Yunfan smiled coldly.","“You don’t have to try to anger me, because you’ll die today. I don’t think it’s","necessary to kill you while you’re in seclusion. Even if you’re not in seclusion, it’s still easy for me to kill you. Anyway, he’ll be here soon. I’ll kill you first and take your head to ask him for a reward. He won’t refuse.”","Fire Spirit looked at Chu Yunfan. He did not seem to be angered by Chu Yunfan’s words, but his eyes flickered with a terrifying light.","“Jun Tianci’s coming?”","Everyone in the city was shocked by these words, especially the elites of the Flying Celestial Alliance. The conflict between the Flying Celestial Alliance and the Monarch Alliance was no secret. On the contrary, they would kill each other whenever they met. Who knew if Jun Tianci would take the opportunity to attack them?","“Die!” Fire Spirit let out a roar, and the power in his entire body instantly boiled. In an instant, the world turned into a sea of fire as if it wanted to boil everything.."]},{"number":2157,"title":"Chapter 2157: Battling a Major Arcane","paragraphs":["Chapter 2157: Battling a Major Arcane","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“The Fire God Physique! It’s another person with the Fire God Physique!’","Chu Yunfan looked at Fire Spirit in front of him. He was very familiar with this king physique. It was the Fire God Physique that was once possessed by Li Qianyuan, Chu Yunfan’s mortal enemy. It was just that Li Qianyuan’s cultivation was not on the same level as Fire Spirit. The current Fire Spirit could kill Li Qianyuan with just a thought. Although they both had the Fire God Physique, Fire Spirit’s degree of development was dozens of times stronger than Li Qianyuan.","“You recognize the Fire God Physique?” Fire Spirit looked at Chu Yunfan, but then he frowned. “You killed someone with a Fire God Physique?”","As he said that, Fire Spirit’s eyes flashed with a terrifying killing intent. Although he originally had killing intent toward Chu Yunfan, he still did not put Chu Yunfan in his eyes. He only wanted to use his head to exchange for what he wanted from Jun Tianci. In essence, he did not have any special killing intent toward Chu Yunfan. However, since he had offended such a person, he might as well eliminate him.","However, it was different now. He looked at Chu Yunfan with deep hatred.","This was because Chu Yunfan had killed someone with a Fire God Physique.","Chu Yunfan thought for a moment and understood what Fire SDirit was thinking. This was a common problem for many people with special physiques. They knew from a young age that they were completely different. They had special physiques and were raised by ordinary people from a young age.","Naturally, they would not put ordinary people in their eyes, let alone treat ordinary people as their own kind. Only those with similar physiques could be regarded as their own kind, such as Li Qianyuan, who was also possessed the Fire God Physique and killed by Chu Yunfan.","Only such a physique would be recognized by them. In fact, there were even many people with similar physiques who came together to form a powerful alliance on the Prodigy Battlefield. Although these king physiques weren’t as precious as emperor physiques, two of them wouldn’t appear in the same era. Under normal circumstances, even if they had the same physique, it was impossible for them to meet each other. This was the so-called king doesn’t see the next king.","However, after countless prodigies sealed themselves, they crossed the river of time and had the possibility of meeting each other. Among them, there were even alliances that were famous throughout the entire Prodigy Battlefield. They all had the same physique and shared cultivation experience and cultivation techniques with each other.","Because they all had the same physique, it was easier for them to communicate with each other than ordinary people. The cultivation techniques they exchanged were also suitable for their cultivation. Thus, forming such an alliance became a choice for many people.","After all, 100,000 prodigies all had king physiques. It was normal for there to be many people with the same physique. There were high and low strength, but they were all not ordinary people.","Thinking of how Chu Yunfan had killed a Fire God Physique possesser, Fire Spirit’s eyes were filled with killing intent. He said coldly, “You don’t have to lie to me because it’s useless. You killed a Fire God Physique possesser, so naturally, there will be a flame halo on your body. It’s just that you can’t see it, but we Fire God Physique possesses can see it. You killed my people, so you can’t escape death today!”","“It’s just a Fire God Physique possesser. What can you do about it?” Chu Yunfan sneered.","Everyone was shocked. Now that the battle had developed to such an astonishing stage, it was obvious Fire Spirit would not let go of Chu Yunfan, who had killed a Fire God Physique possesser. Judging from Chu Yunfan’s performance, it seemed that he did not care at all.","“l will end you today!” Fire Spirit grabbed at the air and took out a fiery red feather fan.","“That magic treasure is a Five Birds True Fire Fan!” the Sky Devourer Flaming","Sparrow on Chu Yunfan’s shoulder cried out. Its voice was filled with uncontrollable anger.","“So, it’s a Five Birds True Fire Fan!” Chu Yunfan instantly remembered the origin of the Five Birds True Fire Fans. This was not a unique name for a feather fan, but a name for a series of feather fans.","The Five Birds True Fire Fans had been extremely famous since ancient times. It was said to be refined from the feathers of five types of fire-type divine birds, and its power was endless. Among them were the feathers of the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow. No wonder the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow had such a big reaction. If it were him, he would not be able to accept it either.","There was once an emperor who burned another emperor to death with the","Five Birds True Fire Fan. It was a famous event in ancient times. Of course, the Five Birds True Fire Fan in Fire Spirit’s hands couldn’t be compared to the original version, but it was still by no means ordinary.","“You have a good eye. It’s your honor to die under my Five Birds True Fire Fan!” Fire Spirit laughed. This was the first time he had used the Five Birds True Fire Fan.","He looked at the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow with surprise and laughed.","“I’ve finally found you. I’ve been searching for a Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow, but 1 couldn’t find one. I didn’t expect to see you here. I can kill you and use your feathers to further refine my Five Birds True Fire Fan. At that time, the power of my Five Birds True Fire Fan will increase by another level!”","“You’re courting death!” the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow chirped, almost turning into a terrifying ferocious bird.","Fire Spirit’s unbridled behavior had completely angered him. Although he had submitted to Chu Yunfan, it did not mean that he was a harmless little pet. He was still one of the few terrifying ferocious birds in the world, the overlord of the sky.","Fire Spirit laughed as he waved the Five Birds True Fire Fan in his hand. In an instant, countless flames spewed out from it, forming a terrifying sea of fire that spanned hundreds of miles.","“If you were to take out any other magic treasures, I might still be a little afraid. However, I’ m really not afraid of the Five Birds True Fire Fan!”","Chu Yunfan sneered and opened his mouth to absorb the boundless sea of fire. In an instant, the sea of fire disappeared without a trace.","“This is the second time. What kind of physique does Jian Wuchen have?”S?arch п?wпo??l .?rg on g??gle","Many people were shocked that Chu Yunfan could easily swallow the flames that could burn through the sky. What kind of physique did he have? How could he be so terrifying?","“I’ll kill you!","Fire Spirit didn’t completely rely on the Five Birds True Fire Fan. He tore the sky apart with both hands. The terrifying tearing force wanted to tear Chu Yunfan apart.","The Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow on Chu Yunfan’s shoulder sensed extreme danger. Just as it was about to spit out flames to resist, Chu Yunfan did not move. He waved and dissipated the terrifying tearing force without a trace.","“It’s such a pity that such a good treasure fell into your hands!”","Chu Yunfan let out a long roar. His figure flashed and instantly rushed toward Fire Spirit. He appeared and disappeared completely unpredictably. With a backhand, he threw a punch. The terrifying fist force swept out like a torrential wave.."]},{"number":2158,"title":"Chapter 2158: Kill All of Them With One Punch","paragraphs":["Chapter 2158: Kill All of Them With One Punch","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Fire Spirit was instantly enraged. The Five Birds True Fire Fan in his hand began to flap, and the endless flames began to transform into a giant flaming bird.","The giant flaming bird opened its bloody mouth and swallowed Chu Yunfan.","“Hahahaha, die!” Fire Spirit’s face revealed a sinister smile,","Suddenly, in the next moment, everyone saw two hands reach out from the giant flaming bird’s body. Immediately after, the two hands flashed with lightning so dazzling that people could not open their eyes.","Spurt!","The giant flaming bird was crushed by the two hands and torn into two halves in the air. Endless flames turned into sparks that filled the sky and fell from the sky.","“You dare to be impudent in front of me with your insignificant skills!” Chu","Yunfan sneered.","Fire Spirit’s expression finally turned serious because he realized that Chu Yunfan was not as easy to deal with as he had originally guessed. He thought that although Chu Yunfan was publicly acknowledged as the Supreme Youth, so what? He was only at the peak of the middle Arcana Stage and was not enough to compete with him.","Although each of these Supreme Youths was very difficult to deal with, as long as he was willing to make up his mind and pay a huge price, there was still a considerable chance of killing them. After all, killing was not the same as defeating. He was 100% sure that he could defeat a Supreme Youth. However, if he wanted to kill a Supreme Youth, the difficulty would be completely different.","After all, every Supreme Youth was a proud child of heaven and earth. It was very normal for several generations to not produce a Supreme Youth. If they were of the same realm, he could easily be beaten to death by the Supreme Youth. Even if his cultivation was higher by one major stage, he could not be underestimated.","But now, everything was completely different from his initial expectations. Chu Yunfan’s strength was far beyond his estimation. He could actually match him. Was he a monster?","“So what if he’s a monster? So what if he’s a Supreme Youth!”","Fire Spirit let out a low growl like an injured beast. The Five Birds True Fire Fan in his hand kept flapping, sweeping out terrifying flaming birds one after another. The flames that filled the sky condensed into ferocious birds of fire, which were the source of the raw materials for refining the Five Birds True Fire Fan.","Boom, boom, boom!","Chu Yunfan was not afraid at all and kept attacking. Punches, kickes, swordplay, spear techniques, all kinds of martial arts unique skills were displayed in Chu Yunfan’s hands. There was no restriction at all. All kinds of martial arts seemed to be perfectly integrated in his body.","Chu Yunfan’s casual moves were all extremely powerful. They seemed like simple moves, but this was the true transformation of something rotten into something magical.","Everyone in the city was mesmerized. Chu Yunfan’s moves were simple, but they all contained the principles of the Great Dao. However, they could not help but wonder how Chu Yunfan did it.","One had to know that a person’s time was limited. Even the Supreme Youth could not possibly have more time than others. With the talent of a Supreme Youth, he could infer many things from one instance. It could be said that he knew what he learned and was good at what he learned.","However, that also had to be divided into levels. It was impossible to learn all kinds of martial arts and divine powers in one go. Although the martial arts and supernatural powers that Chu Yunfan had displayed were only the tip of the iceberg, it was obvious that they were all very high-grade martial arts and divine powers.","Chu Yunfan could not only easily learn these martial arts and divine powers, but he could also completely integrate them. To be able to casually display one of the moves was not something that could be done under ordinary circumstances. It must be possible to have completely mastered this martial art.","The Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow on Chu Yunfan’s shoulder finally realized how terrifying Chu Yunfan was. When Chu Yunfan killed those Supreme Youths and forced him to surrender, he didn’t even use his full strength. He only relied on his tyrannical strength and astonishing physical cultivation to beat them up. He didn’t use any exquisite martial arts, nor did he rely on any magical treasures.","Even someone as arrogant as them could not help but feel a little depressed. This was simply a monster among monsters. Even these Supreme Youths had to admit defeat and sigh at their inferiority.","While everyone was in shock, Fire Spirit, who was opposite Chu Yunfan, felt a terrifying pressure. No matter how many times he fanned the Five Birds True Fire Fan, no matter how terrifying the ferocious birds were, they were all useless against Chu Yunfan. They were all killed with a punch. Moreover, he could even feel that Chu Yunfan!s aura was actually growing.","“How is this possible?” Fire Spirit was in disbelief. Chu Yunfan’s aura was still growing.","“He just broke through?” Fire Spirit could not believe it, but he could not help but be sure that Chu Yunfan had clearly just broken through.","He had just broken through and was actually able to compete with him. He couldn’t believe that Chu Yunfan could do this.","“How can you be so powerful? You’ve clearly only just broken through and entered this stage. How can you be so powerful? Is it because you’re a Supreme Youth? What a powerful emperor physique!” Fire Spirit let out a furious roar as the anger that had been suppressed in his heart for a long time finally erupted.","Although his Fire God Physique was impressive, it was only a king physique. Every time he participated in the Prodigy Battlefield, he would be suppressed by emperor physiques. The anger in his heart finally exploded.","“Fire God Clones!” Fire Spirit roared.","His figure instantly turned into ten figures, and each figure had strength similar to his original body. This was his true trump card and not the Five Birds True Fire Fan. It was equivalent to facing ten Major Arcanes at the same time. Including his true body, there were a total of eleven Major Arcanes.","“What a powerful divine power. Although it definitely can’t last long, just this move alone can easily defeat existences of the same stage!”","“It’s equivalent to increasing my combat strength by ten times in an instant.","The Fire God Physique can actually unleash such combat strength?”","“Is this the power of a Major Arcane? He’s indeed much stronger than a Middle Arcane! ”","Everyone in the city seemed to have exploded in an instant. They were shocked by the power of the Five God Clones.","“Fire God Clones? So what? You’re not my match to begin with, so it’ll be the same even if you send ten more!” Chu Yunfan’s gaze was at the same level as his, fearless.."]},{"number":2159,"title":"Chapter 2159: Killing the Fire God Clones","paragraphs":["Chapter 2159: Killing the Fire God Clones","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Fire Spirit looked at Chu Yunfan coldly. Clearly, this was his true trump card, a divine power evolved from his Fire God Physique. The ten fire god clones all had battle prowess comparable to the main body.","To any normal Major Arcane, this sort of combat power would undoubtedly send them into despair. There was no way they would be able to fight back against such a powerful technique.","“This is your last trump card, right? I’ll blow them all up, and I’ll also blow up your last delusion!”","Chu Yunfan’s eyes were filled with killing intent. Although there was no grudge between him and Fire Spirit before this, there was now.","“Beat me up?” At this moment, Fire Spirit was high and mighty, like a supreme god. After displaying the Fire God Clones technique, he regained his former confidence. So what if Chu Yunfan was a Supreme Youth? Facing ten experts of the same stage, even a Supreme Youth could not compete.","“In my eyes, you’re just an ant!” Fire Spirit said coldly.","“I’m an ant?” Chu Yunfan grinned. “Then you probably haven’t tried being beaten up by ants before!”","In the blink of an eye, Fire Spirit’s ten clones attacked Chu Yunfan at the same time. Each of the ten clones was as strong as Fire Spirit’s original body. The ten of them joined forces at the same time. What a shocking scene it was. The dancing flames in the sky seemed to have turned into a country of flames in an instant, directly enveloping Chu Yunfan.","“It’s useless. They are all fake. Unless there are a hundred times more of them, they a_re all fake in front of me!”","As Chu Yunfan spoke, he opened his mouth and swallowed all the flames in the sky. He was using the Celestial Devouring Art. When the Celestial","Devouring Art was cultivated to the extreme, it was just as its name suggested. It could swallow the heavens in one gulp, let alone some mere flames.","Chu Yunfan had fused with the bloodline of the Immemorial Dark Phoenix. Not only were these flames unable to pose any threat to him, but they would even become his nourishment.","“Watch me break your spell!”","Chu Yunfan laughed out loud. In an instant, his figure had traversed more than half of the world. In an instant, he had already rushed in front of one of Fire Spirit’s clones.","“What is false is still false. Break!”","Chu Yunfan shouted. With a simple punch, he pierced through the boundless flames spat out by Fire Spirit’s clones. A clone only had time to grunt before its body turned into flames that filled the sky and disappeared from the world. One of Fire Spirit’s clones were dealt with!","“Go, kill him!”","At the same time, the two clones closest to Chu Yunfan launched an astonishing attack at the same time. The two of them used their amazing divine powers and martial arts techniques to attack Chu Yunfan from two different directions.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at them. With a wave of his sleeve, he shattered the two attacks. They couldn’t cause any harm to Chu Yunfan.","A pair of lightning wings spread out from Chu Yunfan’s back, and the Prismatic Traveller movement technique was instantly unleashed. Endless lightning power was released from his body, turning into a sea of lightning that filled the sky.","“Amazing! Look at the lightning in the sky! Those lightning bolts are actually runes!”","Someone exclaimed because they saw that the power of lightning that pervaded the world was no longer ordinary. It was actually a lightning rune. Each of these lightning runes had terrifying energy fluctuations surging within them. When they landed on the bodies of the two Fire Spirit’s clones, they turned into terrifying explosions that shattered the two clones in the air.","Rumble!","The terrifying explosion drowned everything and shook the entire city.","“He actually turned the power of lightning into a rune. Just what level has he comprehended the lightning technique to?”","In the city, there was no lack of prodigies who cultivated lightning techniques.","Many of them even had the inheritance of top-notch lightning techniques. Many of them were the inheritances of ancient kings, and there were even some of the emperor’s techniques. They could be said to be knowledgeable and not ordinary people. Of course, they knew that turning the power of lightning into a rune meant that his mastery of lightning god art had reached an unimaginable level.","“Even among the Major Arcane Supreme Youths, there aren’t many who can comprehend elemental divine powers to such a level!”","Someone thought of something. On the Prodigy Battlefield, it was not that no one could do this. However, each of these prodigies came from an ancient era and had a huge reputation. They were the best among the best on the Prodigy Battlefield.","Not every Major Arcane was capable of turning elemental divine power into a rune. This was something that only those who had transcended the Arcana Stage could do. And even among the Major Arcanes, only a handful of Supreme Youths were able to achieve such a feat after stepping into the Major Arcana Stage.","Just like Fire Spirit, he couldn’t casually turn flames into flame runes like this. If he could, the flames he displayed would at least be more than twice as powerful. The increase in combat strength that this represented was even more incredible.","However, what could not be done was what could not be done. This was even seen by many as the dividing line between man and God. What was even more shocking was that many of them remembered that Chu Yunfan was only a","Minor Arcane. Even after breaking through, he was only in the Middle Arcana Stage.","Since ancient times, no one had ever heard of anyone being able to do such a","thing when they had just entered the Middle Arcana Stage. Even among the","Major Arcane Supreme Youths, not everyone could do such a thing.","“Since ancient times, there has never been such a person!”","When someone said that, everyone fell silent. That’s right. Since ancient times, there had never been such a person. It was enough to make them feel ashamed.","Opposite Chu Yunfan, Fire Spirit was even more shocked. He even felt a sense of fear enveloping his entire body.","At this time, Chu Yunfan didn’t stop at all. He grabbed a lightning spear. If one looked carefully, they would find that it was completely different from the lightning spear that Chu Yunfan had casually grabbed. The lightning spear that Chu Yunfan had grabbed was condensed into the shape he wanted with his divine power.","The power of lightning was only ordinary. However, it was different now. The lightning power that formed the lightning spears were all lightning runes. This was something that could only be mastered after one had comprehended the laws of thunder to another level. By forming thunder power into a rune in the form of a Great Dao, the power would more than double.."]},{"number":2160,"title":"Chapter 2160: Beating up Fire Spirit","paragraphs":["Chapter 2160: Beating up Fire Spirit","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This should be something that could only be done by a master who had surpassed the Arcana Stage. This was one of the symbolic abilities of a master who had surpassed the Arcana Stage.","When one’s comprehension of divine powers and Great Dao reached another level, they would automatically be able to comprehend nomological runes. As time passed, their cultivation would become deeper and their comprehension of Great Dao would reach a higher level. These runes would also become more and more complicated, and their power would also become greater.","Not all Supreme Youths could do this. Those who could do it were the only ones who could do it among the Major Arcanes. There might not even be such a person in an era. They had never heard of anyone in the Middle Arcana Stage who could reach this level. It was because of this reason that everyone was so surprised.","Everyone was guessing which thunder technique Chu Yunfan possessed since ancient times. Since ancient times, there had been more than one emperor physique related to the thunder technique, so no one knew which one Chu Yunfan belonged to. It was even possible that it had never appeared before and no one knew about it.","The world was vast. In the countless years of history, there were countless shocking physiques that were unknown to people. Many people did not even know that they had such physiques and had died of old age without cultivating.","This was naturally the effect of the Thunderclap Physique. Ever since he had transformed into the Thunderclap Physique, Chu Yunfan’s understanding of thunder divine powers could be said to have advanced by leaps and bounds. He could basically learn them at a glance and master them in a moment.","Once he mastered all kinds of lightning divine powers, coupled with the help of the godhead, his comprehension speed and degree of lightning techniques were far inferior to even Supreme Youths of the same stage.","Originally, he was only one step away from such enlightenment. After he entered the Middle Arcana Stage, his understanding of lightning techniques finally reached this level. It was enough for him to turn the lightning techniques he casually cast into runes.","“l don’t believe that you can resist my fire god clones!” Fire Spirit’s eyes were red as he roared angrily.","At this moment, he was like a gambler who had lost and was desperate to kill Chu Yunfan with one last blow. He flew into a rage and suddenly commanded the remaining fire god clones to attack Chu Yunfan. All kinds of terrifying attacks and fierce birds formed from flames swept toward Chu Yunfan. It had the power to destroy the world!","Every single one of these attacks could cause the heavens and earth to tremble. Any ordinary Supreme Youth would be defeated by such an attack.","Even ordinary Major Arcanes would have to take a step back or they would be killed instantly. Everyone in the city could imagine how terrifying it would be if such an attack landed on a person.","However, Chu Yunfan simply waved the lightning spear in his hand and swept","it out. One of Fire Spirit’s fire god clones was nailed to death in the air. Its body exploded into sparks that filled the sky.","Fire Spirit and his clones’ attacks were equally mighty and extremely terrifying, but they were unable to hurt Chu Yunfan. Everyone could see that Chu Yunfan’s body was filled with the power of lightning. It was the lightning armor transformed from countless lightning runes.","However, this layer of lightning armor was very thin. Everyone could only vaguely see that Chu Yunfan’s body seemed to be covered in a layer of blue crystals. However, even though it was only a thin layer, it had astonishing power. Even Fire Spirit and his many clones were unable to break through this thin layer of lightning armor.","On the contrary, Chu Yunfan was even more shocking. He didn’t dodge and collided with Fire Spirit’s clones. He didn’t use any shocking divine powers. He only used simple punches and kicks, and each move could easily kill Fire Spirit’s clones.","In just a moment, Fire Spirit’s clones, which had shaken the entire city, had been killed by Chu Yunfan. There was not a single one left.","“This is too terrifying. Is this Jian Wuchen’s strength? It’s simply crushing!’","Someone exclaimed, but more people were silent. They were shocked by Chu Yunfan’s straightforward combat strength.","“Not only is he powerful, but haven’t you noticed? His strength is constantly increasing, and the aura on his body is still increasing. As time passes, he becomes stronger and stronger, and the chances of Fire Spirit winning are getting smaller and smaller!”","Within the Flying Celestials, the top prodigy couldn’t help but speak. He was extremely shocked, and he even felt a little sad for the loss of the rabbit. After all, their aptitude and qualifications were similar to Fire Spirit. In the future, when they stepped into the Major Arcana Stage, their combat prowess would probably be on par with Fire Spirit.","But now, Fire Spirit was easily beaten by Chu Yunfan. This meant that if it were them, they would probably be the same. Thinking of this, they could not help but feel a little sad.","“If Fire Spirit was smart enough, he could have escaped in the chaos just now. Unfortunately, he didn’t. Now, he’s finished!” Lan Hao said as he shook his head. There was a tone of pity in his words.","At this moment, the changes in the scene seemed to confirm Lan Hao’s words. Fire Spirit finally realized that things were not good. Or rather, he finally admitted that he was inferior to Chu Yunfan, and far inferior. However, when he wanted to escape, he found that Chu Yunfan had blocked all his escape routes.","“Fire Spirit, didn’t you come to kill me? Are you like a stray dog now?” Chu Yunfan roared.","Fire Spirit almost vomited blood from anger. He had been arrogant all his life. He even dared to punch a Supreme Youth. He had never suffered such a big loss. But now, Chu Yunfan had forced him to this extent.","However, he also knew that this was definitely not the time to compete with Chu Yunfan. Only by running away could he have a chance to take revenge in the future. He threw out the Five Birds True Fire Fan in his hand, and it transformed into a peerless ferocious bird in the air. Its loud and clear cry shook the entire city. It was the manifestation of the Five Birds True Fire Fan’s weapon spirit, and it flew directly toward Chu Yunfan.","“Cutting off your tail to survive? Not a bad idea, but you underestimate me!”","Chu Yunfan instantly understood what Fire Spirit was thinking. He wanted to use the Five Birds True Fire Fan to cover the rear. However, he had underestimated Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan threw a punch.","Boom!","The Five Birds True Fire Fan’s weapon spirit let out a sorrowful cry and turned into a sky full of spiritual light and disappeared. Immediately after, the Five Birds True Fire Fan fell into Chu Yunfan’s hand. He easily erased Fire Spirit’s divine will inside and refined his own divine will into it, turning it into Chu Yunfan’s weapon.."]},{"number":2161,"title":"Chapter 2161: Squeezing Fire Spirit to Death","paragraphs":["Chapter 2161: Squeezing Fire Spirit to Death","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","How could Fire Spirit’s idea of cutting off his tail to survive be hidden from Chu Yunfan? In fact, his plan of cutting off his tail to survive could not even stop Chu Yunfan for enough time.","Chu Yunfan refined the Five Birds True Fire Fan at the fastest speed possible, but Fire Spirit had escaped more than 2,000 miles. This was the speed at which he had crazily increased after burning a certain amount of vitality.","Fire Spirit heaved a sigh of relief when he could no longer see Chu Yunfan behind him. However, he did not dare to stay any longer. After all, 2,000 miles seemed very far. However, in reality, for experts of their level, it was not too far away.","At this moment, Fire Spirit was feeling extremely aggrieved. He was a Major Arcane top notch prodigy. In terms of strength, he was definitely a hero in the entire Prodigy Battlefield.","He had never thought that he would be forced to this extent just because he was targeting a junior who had just entered the Middle Arcana Stage.","It could be said that he was in an extremely sorry state.","He was also extremely angry.","“Just you wait, I will make you die without a burial place!” Fire Spirit let out a low growl, like an injured beast.","Although he couldn’t defeat Chu Yunfan now, he didn’t need to kill Chu","Yunfan himself. He could let someone else do it. He could totally imagine how Chu Yunfan would be able to beat a Major Arcane like him into a sorry state once the others knew how terrifying he was.","There would probably be many people who wanted to kill Chu Yunfan. Many people would have the idea of pulling the weeds in advance and eliminating their opponents. The stronger the talent displayed, the more likely it was to attract the pursuit of others.","Moreover, it was not only limited to the Prodigy Battlefield. These prodigies were all treasures of various forces outside. Among these forces, even those whose inheritances had been destroyed, it was difficult to guarantee that there were not a few old monsters who sealed themselves to this era. If they really launched a crazy pursuit, Chu Yunfan would not be able to survive even if he had ten heads.","What he needed to do now was to spread Chu Yunfan’s name. Although he was unwilling, he understood that there was no other way to make Chu Yunfan die without a burial place. With his strength, he was not strong enough to kill Chu","Yunfan.","“There’s no other way. I can only lure the person in the alliance to attack. If that person is willing to attack, he should be able to kill Jian Wuchen!” Fire Spirit’s eyes flashed with a shocking light.","The alliance he had joined was the Fire God Physique Alliance. This alliance only recruited prodigies with the Fire God Physique as official members.","If it was in a normal era, there might not even be a Fire God Physique appearing in an era. It was simply wishful thinking to form such an alliance. However, on the Prodigy Battlefield, this became possible.","Previously, he had inspected Li Qianyuan, who was also a reserve member of their alliance. Unfortunately, he was killed and did not have the opportunity to join their alliance.","In this Fire God Physique Alliance, there were also extremely powerful experts. He was only one of them. The true experts were considered the top in the entire Prodigy Battlefield. Killing Chu Yunfan was naturally not difficult.","“Just you wait. I will make sure you die without a burial place!” Fire Spirit’s eyes flickered with shocking killing intent.","“If you want me to die without a burial place, then let’s see if you have the ability!’","Suddenly, just as Fire Spirit finished speaking, a cold voice sounded from the side.","“What? How is this possible?” A hint of fear flashed in Fire Spirit’s eyes. Then, he looked up and found that Chu Yunfan had already arrived in front of him.","“What fast speed. How can he be faster than me?” Fire Spirit was still in complete disbelief. He clearly remembered that he had used the Five Birds True Fire Fans to cut off his tail to survive and block Chu Yunfan. Even if it was only for a few seconds, it should be enough to escape from Chu Yunfan’s pursuit range.","With experts like them, running for a few seconds was enough for them to run a very long distance. It was simply wishful thinking to catch up with someone who ran first, unless Chu Yunfan’s speed was far above his.","However, he didn’t have time to think about this. Chu Yunfan was already in front of him. He used all his strength and turned into a terrifying fire lotus that swept toward Chu Yunfan. This fire lotus contained a terrifying energy fluctuation. That energy fluctuation seemed to be the creation of an era. It could easily injure a Major Arcane.","Boom!","The fire lotus exploded, turning into a huge mushroom cloud that slowly rose up. The dazzling light could be seen by everyone in the city thousands of miles away. The light that was like a small sun was really too shocking.","Spurt!","Fire Spirit kept retreating and spat out a mouthful of blood. He kept panting and almost couldn’t hold on. Even he himself couldn’t resist the explosive tide formed by the fire lotus flower. Although he had an amazing resistance to fire, the shock wave formed by the explosion was very shocking. If he hadn’t dodged at the crucial moment, he would have died here.","“You’re finally going to die...”","Before Fire Spirit could finish speaking, a large hand suddenly reached out from the terrifying mushroom cloud and grabbed his neck. The large hand suddenly exerted force, and Fire Spirit’s neck was broken. He struggled for a moment, but he could not resist and died on the spot.","Even if he died, he would never be able to imagine how Chu Yunfan had managed to dodge the attack of his fire lotus. Even if it was a Major Arcane, he would have been blown to death if he didn’t have a powerful defensive magic item. Even if he did, he would have been severely injured.","Even he himself was severely injured. How had Chu Yunfan survived?","A figure walked out from the explosion. Above Chu Yunfan’s head was a huge medicinal cauldron. It was the Mountain River Cauldron. At the critical moment, it protected Chu Yunfan.","Fire Spirit had overestimated the power of his fire lotus. Even though it was extremely powerful against normal Major Arcanes, and could even kill them in one strike, he had underestimated the power of his fire lotus.","But for Chu Yunfan, even without the Mountain River Cauldron, it was impossible for him to be killed by the explosion. With Chu Yunfan’s physical cultivation, he would at most be forced back a few steps. It was impossible to cause any harm to Chu Yunfan.","As time passed, Chu Yunfan’s aura continued to grow stronger. He was getting stronger every moment until he broke through to the peak Middle Arcana","Stage.."]},{"number":2162,"title":"Chapter 2162: Giving Away the Five Birds True Fire Fan and Leaving","paragraphs":["Chapter 2162: Giving Away the Five Birds True Fire Fan and Leaving","Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After a year of accumulation, Chu Yunfan’s strength had already undergone earth-shaking changes. Once he really broke through, it would be a complete leap in strength. Chu Yunfan could have broken through a year ago, but even if he did, he would at most be comparable to Fire Spirit.","But that was not what Chu Yunfan wanted. Although Fire Spirit was already considered invincible within those of the same stage, as long as he did not meet a Supreme Youth, he was almost invincible. There were not many who could stand shoulder to shoulder with him. However, Chu Yunfan clearly wanted to pursue more than just this kind of strength.","After killing Fire Spirit, Chu Yunfan crushed Fire Spirit’s body into a ball of flesh and threw it under the Brahma Tree in the Mountain River Diagram. On top of the Brahma Tree, a few Brahma Fruits that were emitting a human aura had gradually begun to ripen.","On Chu Yunfan’s shoulder, the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow was staring at CHu Yunfan with his mouth agape. Even though he was a Supreme Youth and had defeated and killed many top level prodigies, he had never seen anyone like Chu Yunfan, who could kill a Major Arcane prodigy so easily.","Unless he was facing a Major Arcane Supreme Youth, this Major Arcane who was dying of thirst should be invincible. However, when he faced Chu Yunfan, he was so vulnerable.","‘He really is a monster!’ the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow though.","At this moment, he was truly convinced. He had no choice but to admit that there were indeed people whose talent and strength were above ordinary Supreme Youths. They were true monsters.","‘However, I won’t fall behind either. When I completely comprehend the flame laws, even if I face the Supreme Youth, I’ll be able to fight several of them by myself!’ the Flaming Sky-Swallowing Sparrow thought.","With his strength, he had no hope of beating Chu Yunfan. He was already in complete despair. However, he did not care about the other Supreme Youths, let alone when he comprehended the flame laws that Chu Yunfan had taught him. He had a feeling that his strength would undergo a world-shaking change, and he would be above the other Supreme Youths.","“Let’s go!” Chu Yunfan waved and disappeared from where he was. He quickly returned to the city and met up with the dragon-headed crocodile and the others.","“Thank you for your help today, Brother. The Flying Celestial Alliance is extremely grateful. In the future, if you have any requests, just come to the Flying Celestial Alliance and find us!”","Seeing that Chu Yunfan had returned, the three top-notch prodigies of the Flying Celestial Alliance hurriedly went forward to say thank you. The previous incident had happened too suddenly. Many experts had arrived one after another, and the three famous experts had become background characters. Now that they finally got the chance, they quickly went forward to thank Chu Yunfan.","Many people looked at the three of them in surprise as if they didn’t understand. These were the three top prodigies of the Flying Celestial","Alliance. They were usually high and mighty, and they didn’t even bother to speak to ordinary prodigies. Not to mention lowering their stance like this, it was something that many people could not even imagine.","However, even if they knew what everyone was thinking, they wouldn’t take it to heart. Please, this was a monster that could beat up Supreme Youths. Even when facing an ordinary Supreme Youths, they had no choice but to lower their heads, let alone such a monster. The current Chu Yunfan was not the most terrifying. Once he grew up in the future, he would be the most terrifying when he was invincible. Now, they were just making friends with someone who would be invincible in the future. They were just saying some soft words, so there was no loss.","“It’s fine. I was just doing it because it was convenient. Green Wave challenged me to a battle, and I just brought it forward.” Chu Yunfan waved. He didn’t want to expose his identity yet, so he had been quiet until now.","“No matter what, we have to thank you for your help. We have already informed our alliance master, Huangfu Longhao. He said that we can meet in person to discuss the Dao when we are free in the future,” another top-notch prodigy from the Flying Celestial Alliance said.","“I’ve long heard of your alliance leader. We’ll definitely have the chance to meet in the future!” Chu Yunfan said.","He wasn’t talking nonsense. He was also a member of the Flying Celestials, and they would definitely meet again in the future. However, they did not know what Chu Yunfan meant. They only thought that Chu Yunfan would visit them in the future.","“Oh right, this little thing is useless to me. You can keep it for self-defense. Consider it a small greeting gift!” Chu Yunfan took out the Five Birds True Fire Fan and threw it to Chu Hongcai.","The might of the Five Birds True Fire Fan was not to be underestimated. Even a Major Arcane would have to avoid it, or else Fire Spirit wouldn’t have used it as a trump card. However, it was a pity that it wasn’t of much use to Chu","Yunfan.","With Chu Yunfan’s cultivation level, it didn’t matter whether he had the fan or not. It was useless to keep it. However, if he gave it to Chu Hongcai, it would be too useful. It could be used as a trump card.","Chu Hongcai took the Five Birds True Fire Fan excitedly. He was completely certain that the person in front of him was none other than his cousin. Other than him, no one else would treat him so well.","“Thank you, senior!” Chu Hongcai remembered that Chu Yunfan didn’t want to reveal his identity at this time and only addressed him as “senior.”","Everyone in the city stared at this scene with their eyes wide open. That was the Five Birds True Fire Fan. Although it was like a toy in Chu Yunfan’s hands, it was not that the Five Birds True Fire Fan was useless, but that Chu Yunfan was too strong.","This was why the Five Birds True Fire Fan seemed to be useless. In fact. if they were in their place, the Five Birds True Fire Fan could turn the entire city into a sea of fire. They would not be able to escape at all.","Now that the Five Birds True Fire Fan had fallen into Chu Hongcai’s hands, many people did not understand what kind of relationship Chu Hongcai had with Jian Wuchen to be so nice to him.","However, many people had different thoughts. If the Five Birds True Fire Fan was in their hands, they wouldn’t dare to find trouble with Chu Yunfan. However, if it was Chu Hongcai, they wouldn’t have much deterrence.","Even if they considered Chu Yunfan’s revenge after the incident and Chu Hongcai had the protection of the Flying Celestial Alliance, there were still many people who harbored evil thoughts.","Of course, this couldn’t escape Chu Yunfan’s eyes, but he didn’t show it. This could be considered a test for Chu Hongcai. The growth of any expert couldn’t be smooth sailing. If Chu Hongcai wanted to compete with the heroes of the world, he couldn’t expect others to show him mercy. He had killed his way to this position, and Chu Hongcai would have to do the same.","After giving away the Five Birds True Fire Fan, Chu Yunfan disappeared into the distance with his followers. And because of his battle, the entire Prodigy Battlefield was shook.."]},{"number":2163,"title":"Chapter 2163: Shocking the Entire Prodigy Battlefield","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan’s battle could be said to be earth-shattering. Even on the battlefield where there were as many prodigies as ants, there were still existences that stood above all of them. That was the Supreme Youths.","Every single Supreme Youth was the center of attention. Be it Minor Arcane, Middle Arcane, or even Major Arcane, they were all prodigies that were the center of attention. As long as they were willing, they could become very powerful in a very short time.","Every time a Supreme Youth died, it could be said that it shook the entire","Prodigy Battlefield. There were not many Supreme Youths on the entire Prodigy Battlefield. At least, compared to the endless number of young prodigies, there were too few.","Every one of them could be said to be familiar to everyone. It was already not bad for a few Supreme Youths to join an ordinary Prodigy Battlefield. It was impossible for so many Supreme Youths to appear at the same time.","Not to mention that the Supreme Youths had died at the same time in so many years. The commotion caused by this matter turned the entire Prodigy Battlefield upside down. And these Supreme Youths had not acted alone. Even if they usually acted alone, they often had a huge alliance behind them. Even though not everyone was like Jun Tianci, who had formed their own alliance, they often had their own alliance.","In the alliance, these Supreme Youths were either leaders or outstanding figures. Countless people were optimistic about the development of these Supreme Youths.","Now that so many of them had died, one could imagine how furious these alliances were.","Chu Yunfan had stirred up the entire Prodigy Battlefield with his strength. Even the Major Arcanes in the core region of the Prodigy Battlefield had to pay attention to Chu Yunfan.","As time passed, the news that Chu Yunfan was only in the Middle Arcana Stage spread. For a time, the entire world was completely silent. If Chu Yunfan was already a Major Arcane, then everything would make sense. No matter how powerful Chu Yunfan was, he was only one of the stronger ones among the ordinary Supreme Youths.","This was an existence that ordinary people could understand. However, if Chu","Yunfan was only a Middle Arcane, or even a Minor Arcane before this, this was completely unbelievable.","To these prodigies, fighting above their level was not unfamiliar. In fact, they","could even do it. However, to cross a major stage and tight an existence like the Supreme Youths, this kind of strength had completely exceeded the scope of everyone’s understanding. This was a monster-like existence.","They had seen many monsters. In the eyes of ordinary people, nobody could withstand a single blow from these monsters. However, it was still extremely rare for someone to be called a monster among the Supreme Youths.","“We can’t let him continue to grow. Otherwise, how can we display our abilities?”","After hearing about Chu Yunfan’s matter, many people’s eyes could not help but flash with some ruthlessness. Iin their hearts, Chu Yunfan had become an absolute threat. Even if Chu Yunfan was only in the Middle Arcana Stage, it was precisely because of this that Chu Yunfan was even more terrifying.","“Where did Jian Wuchen come from? In the past, he didn’t make a public announcement, so it’s fine if we don’t know his background. Why don’t we know what his background is now?” Many people seemed to be confused. They did not know what Jian Wuchen’s background was.","There were prodigies in the Prodigy Battlefield from all eras. Almost all of them were famous figures. The information they received was not something ordinary people could compare to. Under normal circumstances, even if some people did not know, it was impossible for everyone not to know Chu Yunfan’s background.","However, such a strange thing happened. Someone even personally went to the Mysteries Alliance formed by the Mysteries Pavilion and asked the Mysteries Alliance to deduce Chu Yunfan’s information. It represented the common wish of many factions, and the Mysteries Alliance could not refuse such a request.","A total of more than ten prodigies from the Mysteries Pavilion, who were extremely accomplished in divination, worked together to divinate. However, the result was that these ten top-notch prodigies and even a young supreme expert’s team spat out blood and retreated in defeat. They were unable to divinate even a little bit of information about Chu Yunfan.","Everyone was curious about what they had deduced that would actually force them to the point of being counterattacked. It was only later that everyone found out that when these prodigies of the Mysteries Pavilion had reached the limit of their divination, it was as if a figure had suddenly appeared from the chaos. That person was so majestic, powerful, and omnipotent as if he had awakened from the river of time. With just a glance, they were completely defeated, unable to resist this terrifying existence. They were almost killed by the terrifying power of karma.","It was only now that these young prodigies finally understood why the ancestors of the past had emphasized not to simply deduce an expert. Otherwise, the backlash they suffered was enough to make them die without a burial ground.","However, they got some information. Of course, that figure could not be Chu Yunfan. They had never seen such a great person in their lives. He might even be the legendary emperor.","Therefore, the news about Jian Wuchen quickly spread. He might have received the protection of an emperor. At the very least, he had an emperor’s inheritance and an emperor’s magic tool to block their deductions. Otherwise, they would not have been unable to deduce anything.","Suddenly, many people were in an uproar. That was the inheritance of an emperor. There were many Supreme Youths in the Prodigy Battlefield. These Supreme Youths also had king physiques, and each of them was stronger than the last. However, they could reach today mostly because of their cultivation talent and bloodline. It did not mean that they had the inheritance of an emperor.","It could be said that the number of emperors was far less than the number of Supreme Youths. Any of the emperors who had dominated a region in the ancient times could sweep through everything now and establish a powerful dynasty that no one had ever seen before or since.","Many people had only obtained a portion of an emperor’s inheritance. Some people had even only obtained half a move and relied on their extremely powerful aptitude to cultivate until now. They were invincible.","Many people could not help but be tempted. Just a little bit of an emperor’s inheritance was enough to make many people rise, let alone a complete emperor’s inheritance. This was enough to make many people lose their minds.."]},{"number":2164,"title":"Chapter 2164: In a Few Months, the Prodigy Battlefield Was Turned Upside Down","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Many people’s eyes turned red when they heard this news. There were countless young prodigies, top prodigies, and even young supreme prodigies on the battlefield. Among them, there were many who had the inheritance of an emperor. However, most of them only had one or half of the inheritance or some incomplete inheritance.","However, it wasn’t as if there weren’t any who had emperor physiques. For example, the royal family of Grand Xia was a faction that clearly had emperor physique possessers.","On the battlefield of prodigies, Grand Xia was an extremely huge existence. There were princes and princesses of Grand Xia in the past, as well as heaven-defying prodigies, who rose up in the distant royal families. In fact, everyone acknowledged that they were the true number one faction in the world that was even stronger than the Destiny Sect.","Among them, experts were as common as the clouds. The Grand Xia Alliance formed by the prodigies of the royal family was the strongest alliance on the battlefield.","The number of experts was several times that of an ordinary alliance. It was said that there were several Supreme Youths guarding them, and their strength was the strongest in the entire Prodigy Battlefield.","However, even though they knew that the imperial family had the complete inheritance of an emperor, no one dared to lay their hands on them. Unless they were desperate, who would dare to provoke such a monster alliance?","There were many powers like the royal family of Grand Xia that had the inheritance of an emperor. However, without exception, they all had many experts and were extremely powerful. If an ordinary person wanted to attack them, just thinking about their experts was enough to make them tremble in fear. They would lose the courage to attack.","Under such circumstances, Chu Yunfan had become a hot potato in many people’s eyes. He had the inheritance of an emperor, but he didn’t have a strong alliance to back him up. Wasn’t he like a fish waiting to be slaughtered?","Many people were tempted, especially those who were stuck at a bottleneck. If they could obtain the complete inheritance of an emperor, it would undoubtedly be beneficial to them. It could be said that they could break through in a short period. It was not difficult.","However, there were also many people who finally understood. No wonder Chu Yunfan was so terrifying. He was only a Middle Arcane, yet he could actually fight against and even kill a Major Arcane Supreme Youth.","Even though they didn’t know the difference in power between him and a","Major Arcane Supreme Youth, it was obvious that he wasn’t too weak.","As for the possibility of Chu Yunfan having an emperor behind him, it was just a very unreliable guess.","What kind of existence was an emperor? In ancient times, when martial arts were at their peak, not every era had one. Many emperors had to pay a huge price to seal themselves before they could meet the emperors who came after them.","If such a person was still around, there would be no problem for him to unify the world. Why would he hide? Therefore, no one thought about it at all.","In their eyes, Chu Yunfan was only lucky enough to obtain the inheritance of an emperor, which allowed him to rise up. It was impossible for an emperor to stand behind him.","Under such circumstances, Chu Yunfan’s name shook the entire battlefield overnight. Some of them were afraid of Chu Yunfan’s strength and powerful background, so they didn’t dare to take action against him.","There were people who wanted to get the bounty from the various factions. They even wanted to get the secret of the emperor on Chu Yunfan. In that case, their strength and cultivation would undergo an earth-shattering change.","For a time, all the major forces on the battlefield began to get busy, trying to find Chu Yunfan’s whereabouts. The Prodigy Battlefield was neither big nor small. When all the major forces wanted to find Chu Yunfan, it was naturally difficult for Chu Yunfan to completely hide his whereabouts.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t seem to care much about this. Although he was often caught, whenever many people wanted to surround him, they would find that he often disappeared without a trace. They had clearly set up an inescapable net, but at the last step, Chu Yunfan was no longer there. He had disappeared without a trace.","No matter if it was all kinds of deductions, barriers, or arrays, they could not find Chu Yunfan. It was as if he had disappeared from this world overnight.","On the other side, after receiving Chu Yunfan’s gift, Chu Hongcai’s reputation quickly rose, even though his strength was basically at the bottom among the many prodigies on the Prodigy Battlefield. Chu Hongcai could easily defeat any Arcane.","He had received the Five Birds True Fire Fan from Chu Yunfan. Although Chu Yunfan and the Flying Celestial Alliance supported Chu Hongcai, many people still chose to take the risk. There were even some who directly charged into the Flying Celestial Alliance base as if they did not put the Flying Celestial Alliance in their eyes.","Fortunately, Huangfu Longhao, who had just returned from the core region of the Prodigy Battlefield to inspect, was there. He attacked and killed all these people until their blood flowed like a river. In just one night, Huangfu Longhao’s reputation and the Flying Celestials’ reputation spread throughout the entire Prodigy Battlefield.","But even so, there were still many people who came after Chu Hongcai.","Although Huangfu Longhao was very powerful, many people understood that Huangfu Longhao couldn’t stay in the outer region to protect Chu Hongcai forever. Even though Chu Hongcai had displayed the stunning physique of a Supreme Youth, it was not enough to move him. After all, Huangfu Longhao did not enter the Prodigy Battlefield to be a nanny for the rookies. He would have to leave one day. When that time came, it would be time for them to make their move.","On the third day after Huangfu Longhao attacked, Huangfu Longhao rushed back to the core region. This became an opportunity that many people could take advantage of.","It wasn’t until a peak Middle Arcane was turned to ashes by Chu Hongcai’s fan and all the muscles on his body were burned to ashes, dying without a burial place, that many people realized that although Chu Hongcai was weak, he had a top-notch magic tool like the Five Birds True Fire Fan. However, in terms of current strength, he was not considered very weak. He definitely could not be underestimated!","Chu Hongcai was ambushed again. Although he was heavily injured, he used the Five Birds True Fire Fan to burn a peak Middle Arcane to ashes. Since then, the Five Birds True Fire Fan had truly made a name for itself, and Chu Hongcai had also truly made a name for himself on the Prodigy Battlefield.","A few months later, Chu Hongcai stepped into the Minor Arcane Stage in an astonishing manner. After killing several powerful beings who coveted his Five Birds True Fire Fan, his title as a Supreme Youth had been completely confirmed.","It was also at this time that Chu Yunfan, who had disappeared for several months, reappeared in the martial world.."]},{"number":2165,"title":"Chapter 2165: In a Few Months, All of Them Became Major Arcanes","paragraphs":["Chapter 2165: In a Few Months, All of Them Became Major Arcanes","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the past few months, many people tried their best to track Chu Yunfan down on the battlefield. Top experts from all walks of life had surrounded and intercepted him from all sides.","During this entire process, many of them had come up empty-handed. There was no way they could deduce Chu Yunfan’s whereabouts just by relying on divination. Even the strongest prodigies from the Mysteries Pavilion, or even the Major Arcane Supreme Youths, were unable to deduce Chu Yunfan’s whereabouts. This could only make them give up.","However, when the various large factions on the battlefield were searching for Chu Yunfan’s whereabouts, no matter how much he could hide, he would still be found from time to time, Every once in a while, someone would discover Chu Yunfan’s whereabouts, and then a shocking battle would erupt.","Chu Yunfan led his followers to fight in the core region. Even there, where there were many experts, there was still no way to stop Chu Yunfan. In just a few months, Chu Yunfan killed another five Major Arcanes.","Every single time Chu Yunfan appeared, it was just too coincidental. Those true major Arcanes, sucn as late mapr Arcanes and peak major Arcanes, nacl tried to find Chu Yunfan’s whereabouts, but to no avail. Those fledgling Major Arcanes would occasionally bump into Chu Yunfan and be killed by him. As time passed, even the dumbest person would be able to tell that this wasn’t a coincidence. Chu Yunfan had done this on purpose. He had avoided those truly powerful beings and had instead made a move against these newly ascended Major Arcane prodigies.","It was obvious that they were being treated like pushovers. They were naturally very angry in their hearts, but no matter how angry they were, there was nothing they could do. Because Chu Yunfan was the one who held the initiative, he didn’t attack frequently.","It was impossible for many people to search for his whereabouts. Moreover, Chu Yunfan’s strength was not weak. It could be said that he was a top-notch expert. If they were weak, they would be vulnerable against Chu Yunfan.","He didn’t seem like an ordinary expert at all. He killed people like he was slaughtering chickens and dogs. Basically, none of those he encountered survived. There were too few of those powerful experts. Even if there were so many experts, it was impossible for them to chase after Chu Yunfan at all times and ignore other things.","Although the inheritance of an emperor was shocking, it was not irreplaceable for these top prodigies and Supreme Youths. Many people were surprised to find that Chu Yunfan had been discovered a few times. In these years, his strength had increased significantly every time he appeared.","The experts that he had defeated and even killed were getting stronger and stronger. The last one that Chu Yunfan had killed was a Supreme Youth who had stepped into the Major Arcana Stage.","Many people could more or less deduce that Chu Yunfan’s strength was increasing at an astonishing speed. At this rate, it was only a matter of time before he broke through to the peak Middle Arcana Stage.","When they thought about how Chu Yunfan was only a Middle Arcane and not a Major Arcane, many of them couldn’t help but feel that they had wasted their time. Compared to Chu Yunfan, the difference was too great.","Under such circumstances, other than those who had a grudge against Chu Yunfan or those who were determined to obtain the emperor-level inheritance, everyone else had given up on searching for Chu Yunfan.","What kind of joke was this? Just the fact that Chu Yunfan was able to easily beat up a fledgling Major Arcane like Fire Spirit meant that his strength had already surpassed 99% of the elites on the Prodigy Battlefield. Even if the remaining people could defeat Chu Yunfan, it would be very difficult to kill him, not to mention finding Chu Yunfan’s whereabouts.","There were even people who were shocked to discover that not only Chu","Yunfan, but even his followers had also broken through to the Major Arcana Stage. This in itself represented a huge force.","In the center of the battlefield, Chu Yunfan and the others were standing on a huge mountain. On his shoulder stood a fist-sized bird that looked like a red sparrow. However, those who knew the bird’s identity dared not underestimate this bird.","This was a top-notch ferocious beast that swept across the entire Prodigy","Battlefield, the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow. However, when he was beside Chu Yunfan, he restrained all his aura and acted no different from an ordinary bird.","Behind Chu Yunfan, there were ten completely different figures, but all of them carried extremely shocking auras. These were the ten followers that Chu Yunfan had carefully selected.","Other than them, there should have been a Great Golden Roc. However, the Great Golden Roc was sent by Chu Yunfan to watch over Chu Hongcai. Although Chu Hongcai had to experience enough training, Chu Yunfan couldn’t just watch as Chu Hongcai was killed.","Chu Hongcai had experienced many battles in the past few months, and many of them could be said where he had narrowly escaped death. In fact, he should have been in a situation where he had almost died. It was only because of the Great Golden Roc’s secret attack that he had escaped death. However, Chu Hongcai didn’t know about these things. After all, Chu Yunfan didn’t want him to develop a dependent mentality.S earch ?ew?o?el. ?rg on g??gl?","“Now that all of you have stepped into the Major Arcana Stage, it’s time for us to show off our skills!” Chu Yunfan said loudly.","Just like what many people outside had guessed, after Chu Yunfan stepped into the Middle Arcana Stage, his followers also stepped into the Major Arcana Stage. As their cultivation bases were about the same, the time taken for them to break through was also about the same. Not long after, all of them had broken through to the Major Arcana Stage. Furthermore, they were much stronger than normal Major Arcanes.","Beside Chu Yunfan, the first person to step into the Major Arcana Stage was none other than the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow. He was a Supreme Youth to begin with, and with Chu Yunfan’s support and guidance in all aspects of his breakthrough, his breakthrough was practically like pushing a boat along the current, breaking through to Major Arcana Stage without any difficulty.","After breaking through to the Major Arcana Stage, the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow’s strength increased by several folds. The first thing it did after breaking through was to challenge Chu Yunfan.","He felt that after his breakthrough, his combat strength had completely changed. Naturally, he had renewed his confidence and wanted to defeat Chu Yunfan.."]},{"number":2166,"title":"Chapter 2166: This Is a Robbery!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2166: This Is a Robbery!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","However, his result was naturally very tragic. He was not Chu Yunfan’s match at all. He was defeated by Chu Yunfan with just a flip of his hand. After his breakthrough, his strength increased several times, but compared to Chu Yunfan, this improvement was completely insignificant.","After breaking through to the Major Arcana Stage, the gap between the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow and Chu Yunfan’s cultivation state did not narrow down. On the contrary, the gap between their cultivation states had widened even further.","Originally, Chu Yunfan would need to spend a lot of effort to deal with him, but now he could suppress him with a flip of his hand. This completely suppressed the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow’s restless heart. Chu Yunfan knew that a Supreme Youth like the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow had the chance to become an emperor in the future. It would not bow down so easily.","Even if he lowered his head for a moment, he might suffer a backlash at any time. However, Chu Yunfan did not care because he was confident that his strength would also undergo an earth- shattering change when the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow broke through.","The Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow was strong, but he was stronger!","In just a few months, the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow had already broken through to the Major Arcana Stage. Of course, Chu Yunfan had to make some progress. He had also broken through to the fledgling Middle Arcana Stage and was even breaking through continuously. He was already in the midst of breaking through. However, this breakthrough did not cause much of a commotion because his foundation was too solid. Therefore, even if he broke through, it was like pushing a boat with the current. He did not need to spend much effort.","Other than the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow, the dragon-headed crocodile, and the others had all broken through to Major Arcana Stage as well. Even the Great Golden Roc had broken through to the Major Arcana Stage. It was even stronger than the dragon-headed crocodile, second only to the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow.","Speaking of which, Chu Yunfan was amazed. After Chu Yunfan used the Great","Celestial Demon Art to dig out the bloodline of the Great Golden Roc in the Black- scaled Horned Eagle’s body, it had gradually transformed into a great golden roc. As the bloodline was continuously purified, his cultivation speed did not slow down.","On the contrary, as time passed, the roc’s cultivation speed became faster and faster. It even surpassed the dragon-headed crocodile and was only second to the sparrow.","One had to know that the crocodile and the others were constantly digging out the limits of their bloodlines. They could even be called pseudo-Supreme Youths for surpassing this limit. They were only a little inferior to Supreme Youths. However, it was still surpassed by the roc. One could imagine how shocking the bloodline in the roc’s body was.","If he continued to purify it, it would be comparable to the Sky Devourer","Flaming Sparrow in the future. It was even possible for him to surpass the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow. After all, this was one of the Ten Ferocities, a terrifying ferocious beast that was known to eat dragons.","In these few months, Chu Hongcai had blocked countless assassinations. Otherwise, even the Flying Celestial Alliance would not have been able to protect Chu Hongcai.","With such strength, Chu Yunfan naturally exited his cultivation immediately.","Including himself, he was equivalent to twelve extremely powerful Major Arcanes. With so many of them gathered together, what kind of power was that?","Of course, the first thing was to cause trouble.","Especially since so many experts had been chasing Chu Yunfan for months. It was not Chu Yunfan’s style to not take revenge. Not to mention, the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow, the dragon-headed crocodile, and the others had been hiding for months. Now, they could finally find them all.","Chu Yunfan and the others quickly disappeared from where they were and targeted those forces that had once targeted them. The entire battlefield was quickly turned upside down by them.","All the forces that had once targeted Chu Yunfan had become his targets, especially the Blood-Clothed Tower, the Evil Path Alliance, the Monarch Alliance, and the Destiny Alliance. These four behemoths that had been clinging onto Chu Yunfan had become the most popular targets in Chu Yunfan’s eyes.","The Destiny Alliance’s top prodigy, Zhang Yu, was extremely happy. Yesterday, he had just obtained the inheritance left behind by a prodigy from an unknown era. Such things were very common in the Prodigy Battlefield because countless people had entered the Prodigy Battlefield and it had been opened countless times. In fact, it could even be traced back to the end of the ancient era. Countless prodigies had entered the Prodigy Battlefield and died countless times.","Naturally, many people did not have time to take their inheritances away and left them on the Prodigy Battlefield. These prodigies on the Prodigy Battlefield would also occasionally obtain these inheritances, causing their cultivation to increase explosively. This was commonly known as picking up trash.","However, the trash on the Prodigy Battlefield was not ordinary trash. They","were all good things that ordinary people could only dream of. Of course, if they died here, the things on them would also become the targets of future prodigies on the battlefield.","Especially since the outer region of the Prodigy Battlefield had already been completely developed, it was very difficult to encounter an inheritance that was accidentally left behind. However, there were still many such inheritances in the Prodigy Battlefield.","After all, this was the most dangerous place. The number of prodigies who died here was the highest, and their strength was also the strongest. At the same time, not many prodigies dared to enter, so the inheritance here was also the highest.","As a prodigy from the Destiny Alliance, although his strength wasn’t the strongest, no one in the core region of the Prodigy Battlefield dared to provoke him. After all, he had the backing of a colossus like the Destiny","Alliance, and there were many factions that were on good terms with the Destiny Alliance. Among them, there was even the Monarch Alliance, which had ambiguous relationships with the Destiny Alliance.","With such a force as his backer, he did not feel that the core region of the Prodigy Battlefield was dangerous at all. He just had to be careful of some monsters that suddenly revived. However, he would come to remember this day as a nightmare.","Before he could digest the inheritance he had just obtained, a group of people descended from the sky and surrounded him.","“This is a robbery! Hand over the item and I’ll spare your life!”","Zhang Yu was instantly enraged. As a member of the Destiny Alliance, he had always been the one to target others. Since when could others target him?","“You’re courting death! ”","Zhang Yu didn’t even look, grabbed at the air, and took out a treasured saber. Then, he slashed out with his saber!","“Destiny Saber! ”","The moment the Destiny Blade was used, it could slash the heavens and cut the earth in half. It was a secret technique of the Destiny Sect. In his hands, its power was displayed to the extreme.","However, before he could rejoice, he saw that this terrifying blade was crushed inch by inch by a white palm.."]},{"number":2167,"title":"Chapter 2167: Charitable","paragraphs":["Chapter 2167: Charitable","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Zhang Yu was a little stunned. He could not understand how such a terrifying scene could happen.","His saber light had actually been casually crushed by someone. This was not a human at all. This was a monster.","It was only at this moment that he finally reacted. Just now, he had only slashed out instinctively, and it was only now that he realized how terrifying these people were.","Anyone here was more powerful than him. One had to know that he was already a top-notch prodigy. In the same stage, only a Supreme Youth could firmly suppress him.","However, all of the figures present were much stronger than him. Especially the person in the lead. He felt suffocated and unfathomable.","“You...You’re not a good person. Jian Wuchen!”","He widened his eyes as if he had seen the strangest thing.","He suddenly remembered who this person was. Wasn’t he the sworn enemy of the Destiny Alliance, Jian Wuchen?","Jian Wuchen was nothing to the top experts of the Destiny Sect. After all, no matter how powerful he was, he had only roamed the central region of the battlefield. This meant that Chu Yunfan’s strength had stopped at the Middle Arcana Stage.","A Major Arcane like him wouldn’t put him in his eyes.","However, who knew that in just a year and a half, Chu Yunfan’s strength had soared at an astonishing speed like a rocket.","Those experts who went to find trouble with Chu Yunfan and wanted to collect the bounty were repeatedly killed by Chu Yunfan.","It even made him known as the Supreme Youth. Even on the Prodigy","Battlefield, who knew how many prodigies wanted to become his followers.","In fact, a few months ago, there was even news that he had killed Fire Spirit, and that a few other Supreme Youths had died at his hands.","Thinking of this, Zhang Yu felt a chill down his spine. If it was Chu Yunfan, he would not have any chance of winning.","He knew about Fire Spirit. They had fought on the Prodigy Battlefield before. Although it was only a short fight, their cultivation levels were about the same.","They were basically the same. Even Fire Spirit was killed by Chu Yunfan even after using all his trump cards. It could be imagined that Chu Yunfan’s strength should be far above his.","This was news from a few months ago. If it was now, Chu Yunfan’s strength would probably have improved.","“Not bad, it’s good that you know me. If you know what’s good for you, quickly hand over your spatial bag. As long as you cooperate obediently, I won’t kill anyone today!” Chu Yunfan grinned and looked at Zhang Yu.","“Are you sure?” Zhang Yu stared at Chu Yunfan. He knew how terrifying this person was, and he also knew that the Destiny Alliance and the Destiny Sect had a deep hatred for Chu Yunfan.","He couldn’t believe that Chu Yunfan would let him go so easily after he was caught.","“Of course. I have a grudge against Jun Tianci, but I don’t necessarily have a grudge against everyone in the Destiny Sect. It’s just that you guys want to go against me, not that I want to kill you. Think about it, right?” Chu Yunfan said.","Zhang Yu was instantly speechless. He felt that what he said made sense, and he was actually speechless.","Indeed, Chu Yunfan was only targeting Jun Tianci in the beginning. However, with the pride of the Destiny Sect, it was no different for them to target Jun Tianci.","They were all challenging the dignity of the entire Destiny Sect. It was most appropriate to slap such a person to death.","Slowly, as Chu Yunfan rose to power, the number of prodigies from the","Destiny Sect who died in his hands and the experts recruited by the Destiny Sect increased. Many people couldn’t help but have complaints in their hearts.","After all, that was a life-and-death feud between Jun Tianci and Chu Yunfan. It had nothing to do with them. If Chu Yunfan was so weak that he could be slapped to death, then they wouldn’t mind slapping him to death to befriend Jun Tianci.","However, Chu Yunfan had become a porcupine. Whoever tried to attack him would be unlucky.","Under such circumstances, it was reasonable for many people to complain.","After all, this matter had nothing to do with them. However, they died one after another. Even if they did not die, many people suffered heavy losses.","Under such circumstances, many people had unconsciously separated themselves from Jun Tianci. There was no need to sacrifice their lives for Jun Tianci, right?","“Swear it!” Zhang Yu said immediately.","However, in the next moment, Chu Yunfan’s terrifying aura crushed him. It was as if he wanted to crush him in an instant.","“You can give it a try, or you can take a gamble. Let’s see if your spatial bag is more important or your life!” Chu Yunfan said, “You’re not the first, and you’re not the only one. If you don’t believe me, use your life to atone for your sins!”","“Alright, I’ll give it to you!” Zhang Yu said with difficulty.","He understood Chu Yunfan’s purpose. It must be for the wealth in his spatial bag. Each of these prodigies on the Prodigy Battlefield was a proud child of their era. Of course, they had enough wealth.","In fact, the wealth they had was enough to make all the small sects jealous. They were the cream of the crop.","Chu Yunfan obviously had designs on these people. If they hadn’t handed over their spatial bags voluntarily, even Chu Yunfan wouldn’t have been able to do anything to them.","After all, many of their spatial bags had been strengthened by special secret techniques. Unless Chu Yunfan’s strength was a hundred times stronger than theirs, it was impossible to open them by force.","When he heard Chu Yunfan say that he wasn’t the first, and he wasn’t the only one, he felt much better.","Although he felt heartache for the wealth in the spatial bag, he knew what was important. Compared to his life, this wealth was nothing.","Chu Yunfan took the money and opened the spatial bag smoothly. Then, he looked at Zhang Yu with satisfaction and said, “l didn’t expect you to be so charitable. You knew that we were lacking cultivation resources, so you came to us. Thank you so much!”","Chu Yunfan patted Zhang Yu’s shoulder. Zhang Yu looked like he wanted to cry, but no tears came out. He almost cried out, “Charitable my *ss! I was forced to do it.’","He hadn’t checked his fate before he went out today. The fortuitous encounter he had just obtained had fallen into Chu Yunfan’s hands before it even warmed up. He was really unlucky.","Fortunately, Chu Yunfan did not seem to have any intention of killing him. In fact, any one of Chu Yunfan’s group was stronger than him. He had no other choice but to take a gamble. He believed that Chu Yunfan and the others would keep their promise.."]},{"number":2168,"title":"Chapter 2168: The Prodigy Battlefield Turns Upside Down","paragraphs":["Chapter 2168: The Prodigy Battlefield Turns Upside Down","Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Seeing Chu Yunfan and the others leave on a ray of light, Zhang Yu heaved a sigh of relief. Chu Yunfan and the others had not gone back on their words.","It was too terrifying. He couldn’t understand how a junior like Chu Yunfan could be so powerful. He was completely suppressed by Chu Yunfan’s aura and couldn’t fight back at all.","“Damn it, damn it, this is really an unlucky year!’","Zhang Yu was extremely depressed. That spatial bag contained all his wealth. All the wealth he had accumulated over the years had been plundered by Chu","Yunfan.","But soon, he received other news. What Chu Yunfan said was true.","In a short time, a wave of evil wind blew in the battlefield. After Chu Yunfan and the others returned, they began to search everywhere.","Many of them had been targeted by Chu Yunfan and suffered heavy losses. They had worked hard for hundreds of years and returned to their original state overnight.","Before this, everyone had joined forces to hunt down Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan had been constantly dodging. When many people were already used to this pattern, Chu Yunfan suddenly turned around and attacked.","Those who were chasing after him had all become his targets. Chu Yunfan’s goal was very simple, which was to rob them of their resources and wealth, leaving nothing behind.","Many people who were robbed by Chu Yunfan wanted to cry but had no tears. They never expected Chu Yunfan to be so shameless.","He had actually turned around and didn’t bother Jun Tianci and the other top-notch experts. Instead, he went straight for them.","Their strength could not be compared to Jun Tianci and the others. There was a huge gap, but they were greedy for the bounty on Chu Yunfan and the legendary emperor inheritance.","It could be said that the entire core region of the battlefield was in an uproar because of Chu Yunfan’s inheritance. Countless Major Arcanes had begun searching for Chu Yunfan.","When ordinary people encountered such a situation, they would naturally walk as far as they could. They did not dare to approach at all.","But Chu Yunfan was different. He actually dared to turn around and attack.","In the short span of three days, more than ten Major Arcanes had already fallen into Chu Yunfan’s hands. All of their wealth had been plundered, leaving nothing behind.","Fortunately, Chu Yunfan kept his promise and did not kill them. This made many people heave a sigh of relief. After all, no matter how important those resources and wealth were, they were not as important as their lives.","There were also some smart people who knew Chu Yunfan’s purpose. It was obvious that he wanted them to hand over their wealth voluntarily and not resist.","After all, if they knew that they would definitely die, most people would not lack the courage to fight to the death. At the very least, they would not let Chu Yunfan get what he wanted.","However, if they knew that they could survive, no one would be willing to die for wealth.","After all, wealth could be accumulated again, but when a person died, they would really die.","Some people even speculated that Chu Yunfan didn’t know how to kill people, but soon, their speculations were slapped in the face.","Some people seemed to think that Chu Yunfan wouldn’t really kill people, so they stubbornly resisted and refused to hand over their wealth. The result was that they were beaten up by Chu Yunfan in front of everyone.","Chu Yunfan’s terrifying strength was undoubtedly displayed.","This made many people give up on the idea of getting lucky. Chu Yunfan did want to obtain more resources and wealth, but it did not mean that he did not have the courage to kill people and the city.","Chu Yunfan’s actions naturally attracted the anger of the core region experts. After all, many of the prodigies who were robbed by Chu Yunfan were the backbone of the various alliances. Now that they were robbed by Chu Yunfan, they suffered heavy losses.","These experts immediately put down their work and participated in the pursuit of Chu Yunfan. However, Chu Yunfan was as cunning as a loach. He did not give them a chance at all. As long as they appeared, they would not encounter Chu Yunfan at all.","Even these top experts had tried to use others as bait to lure Chu Yunfan into taking the bait. However, Chu Yunfan seemed to be able to see through it early on and did not fall for it. He did not give them any chance at all.","These top-notch experts were so angry that they gritted their teeth, but there was nothing they could do.","This was the first time that Chu Yunfan had fooled these top experts, even on the Prodigy Battlefield.","Among the many experts in the world, Chu Yunfan was definitely not the strongest. On the Prodigy Battlefield, there were many people who were stronger than Chu Yunfan.","However, these people often joined an alliance. After joining an alliance, they would have the help of the alliance and would not be alone.","But at the same time, they would also be restricted by the alliance. They wouldn’t dare to use their full strength.","Just like Huangfu Longhao, no matter how furious he was, it was impossible for him to massacre the entire Destiny Sect.","Chu Yunfan, who had no fixed residence and didn’t join any alliance, didn’t even have a reliable ally when he was surrounded. However, at the same time, he could avoid being dragged down by an alliance.","There was simply no way to grasp his roots, and it was impossible to deduce his whereabouts.","That was why he was so unscrupulous. Almost nothing could deal with him.","Under such circumstances, in just a short month, the entire core region of the battlefield had been turned upside down by Chu Yunfan. In this month, hundreds of fledgling Major Arcanes had been robbed clean. They wanted to cry but had no tears. They had suffered heavy losses.","It even caused these Major Arcanes to be paranoid every day, afraid that they would hear a robbery coming from the sky.","Even if they were to travel, they often needed several people to travel together.","Many people had no choice but to temporarily leave the core region of the Prodigy Battlefield and come to the central and outer regions of the Prodigy Battlefield.","However, they still couldn’t avoid Chu Yunfan’s pursuit. It was as if he had eyes. No matter where they appeared, Chu Yunfan would be watching them.","For a moment, everyone on the battlefield was in a state of panic. Fortunately, many people were surprised to find that although Chu Yunfan was ruthless, he was also shameless.","However, he seemed to only target those who had tried to kill him. He did not care about ordinary people who had nothing to do with him.","There was once a Major Arcane who had clashed head-on with Chu Yunfan, yet he had come out unscathed in the end. This had caused many to click their tongues in wonder.","However, knowing the pattern of Chu Yunfan’s attacks also made those experts who had not targeted Chu Yunfan breathe a sigh of relief. The experts who had targeted Chu Yunfan were shocked and afraid.."]},{"number":2169,"title":"Chapter 2169: Breakthrough, Intermediate Middle Arcana Stage","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In just a month, the battlefield was in chaos, especially since many people had targeted Chu Yunfan in the past. Among them, many had been dealt with by Chu Yunfan, and many had not been dealt with in time.","After all, because Chu Yunfan had an emperor level inheritance, many people wanted to kill him.","Now, without a doubt, they had all become Chu Yunfan’s targets.","“Damn it, I’ve never seen such a shameless person. Does this Jian Wuchen not dare to fight us head-on?” a late Major Arcane roared out in rage.","However, his roar was useless, because everyone knew that as long as Chu Yunfan was not stupid, he would not rashly attack them.","Because he needed time to develop!","Although he said so, in fact, no one really thought that Chu Yunfan was a coward. If he was a coward, he wouldn’t dare to declare war on so many forces at the same time.","In fact, everyone knew that he was just trying to provoke Chu Yunfan to come out, but it was useless.","Chu Yunfan disappeared from everyone’s sight again. However, after that, Chu Yunfan’s followers began to appear in the core area of the Prodigy Battlefield and were active in various places.","Although they were Chu Yunfan’s followers, Chu Yunfan did not ask them to stay by his side all the time.","Previously, Chu Yunfan’s brilliance was too strong, almost completely overshadowing their brilliance. However, as they continued to be active on the battlefield, everyone finally realized that these followers of Chu Yunfan were not ordinary people.","Now that they had stepped into the Major Arcana Stage, they could be considered the cream of the crop on this battlefield.","Especially the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow, who was originally a Supreme Youth. After he joined Chu Yunfan, he continued to break through his bloodline with Chu Yunfan’s help. Not long after he left Chu Yunfan, he encountered a big battle—a challenge from another Supreme Youth.","The last thing that made everyone’s jaws drop was that the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow had defeated this Supreme Youth with an overwhelming advantage, and his reputation soared.","Chu Yunfan’s other followers also displayed astonishing strength. They could exchange blows with Supreme Youths of the same stage. Although they were still not evenly matched, they still fought back and forth. They were not like ordinary top-notch prodigies who met the Supreme Youths.","There were even people who said that when they saw the golden light emitting from their bodies, they were further excavating the potential of their bloodlines. These people could only be considered as pseudo-Supreme Youths now. However, as time passed, they might even become true Supreme Youths.","If that was the case, then the lineup of Chu Yunfan’s followers in the future would be quite terrifying.","Therefore, although Chu Yunfan was not active, his popularity on the Prodigy Battlefield did not decrease because of his followers.","At this moment, in a valley in the core area of the battlefield, Chu Yunfan sat cross-legged in the valley. He held a great medicine in his hand and swallowed it.","Immediately, he felt the divine power in his body boil even more and soar into the clouds. At the same time, the cultivation that had originally stagnated in his body broke through the barrier and reached a new stage under the support of this medicinal power.","“The intermediate Middle Arcana Stage!” Chu Yunfan slowly spat out these words.","A month ago, Chu Yunfan was already on the verge of breaking through, but it was only now that he had finally broken through to the intermediate Middle Arcana Stage.","However, the energy waves emanating from his body were unimaginably thick. It was as if he was not an existence of the same cultivation state as him. In terms of combat prowess, he had even reached the astonishing level of intermediate Major Arcane. Even ordinary intermediate Major Arcanes were no match for him.","He could easily beat him up!","In just one month, Chu Yunfan had eaten countless medicines. He treated the medicines that could increase his strength like snacks and ate as much as he wanted.","These were hundreds of top prodigies, and even young supreme experts had been robbed clean by him.","In order to survive, these people naturally obediently handed over their spatial bags, and all the wealth in them naturally fell into Chu Yunfan’s hands.","Each of these top prodigies was once the hope of a large sect of an era. The wealth and resources they had were dozens of times that of experts of the same level.","If an expert of the same level encountered them, they would simply be courting death. They were not their match and would be easily beaten up. It was a pity that they had encountered Chu Yunfan, who was even more terrifying and monstrous than them.","Of course, their wealth had fallen into Chu Yunfan’s hands. Among them, there were countless great medicines that could increase one’s cultivation. Many of them made Chu Yunfan’s eyes turn red with envy. Many of them had even disappeared from the world and only appeared in a certain era.","If not for the fact that there were too many ancient prodigies gathered on the","battlefield, it was probably impossible for these great medicines to reappear.","Of course, Chu Yunfan wouldn’t let go of such a good opportunity. He picked out new seeds from these great medicines and planted them in the herb mountain to ensure that these great medicines wouldn’t be lost.","With the herb mountain and the large number of spirit stones seized, these great herbs grew very quickly. Every few days, a wave of great herbs would mature. Any one of these great herbs could increase the cultivation of a top prodigy for a few years. Some of them could even be called sacred herbs. If they were refined into suitable pills, they could increase the cultivation of a top prodigy for decades in one breath.","It could be said that one would save decades of bitter cultivation!","These were the accumulation of countless eras, years, and people. Now, all of them had fallen into Chu Yunfan’s hands, completing his path of cultivation. A portion of it was given to his followers, and the rest was in Chu Yunfan’s hands.","With this, Chu Yunfan wouldn’t be lacking in resources even if he cultivated all the way to Major Arcana Stage. Furthermore, he had obtained hundreds of millions of high-grade spirit stones. It could be said that Chu Yunfan had become rich overnight.","Otherwise, Chu Yunfan wouldn’t have had so much spirit energy to supply to the herb mountain, allowing those great herbs to mature in a few days. The spirit energy consumed was very shocking.","It was basically a consumption that only a large sect-level force could afford.","And these large sect-level forces had countless people sharing these benefits. Of course, they could not be compared to Chu Yunfan who monopolized these things.","“I’ve gained so much this time. It just so happens that I can refine them into medicinal pills. At that time, I’ll take medicine like I’m eating candy. Who can compare to me?” Chu Yunfan grinned.","It was the right choice for him not to kill those top prodigies.."]},{"number":2170,"title":"Chapter 2170: The Great Explosion of Prodigies","paragraphs":["Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","If it wasn’t for the sake of survival, those top prodigies wouldn’t have handed over all their wealth so easily.","He had chosen to let them go back then precisely for this moment.","As the saying went, a man would not be rich without a windfall, and a horse would not be fat without grass at night. How could one accumulate wealth through hard work be faster than directly robbing?","Although those top prodigies would be penniless because of this, and it could be said that it would greatly affect their cultivation, Chu Yunfan did not have the slightest sympathy.","These people were specially selected by him and had ill intentions toward him. If he fell into the hands of these people, he was afraid that extracting his soul and interrogating him day and night would be a light punishment. He might even be tortured day and night to force him to hand over all his secrets.","This was a world where the strong preyed on the weak. Everything was bloody!","Chu Yunfan was naturally very clear about this. Of course, he wouldn’t show mercy to them. The fact that they were able to live was already a mercy from","Chu Yunfan.","And this was merely the wealth of a hundred top-notch prodigies and Supreme Youths. If he robbed more, the benefits he would obtain would probably be immeasurable.","Of course, Chu Yunfan also understood the repercussions of doing so. Which of these top prodigies didn’t have a huge force behind them? Even if it was a sect that had already been extinct, who knew if there were a few old antiques who sealed themselves to this era? None of them were to be provoked.","Otherwise, how would those top figures on the battlefield possess such good methods?","They were not some kind men or women. The only thing that stopped them was their fear of the people behind these prodigies.","Only Chu Yunfan didn’t care. Anyway, he was using an alias. If this alias was thrown away, who would know who he was? Even if someone found out in the future, it should be a long time later. By then, he would probably have grown into an existence that could compete with those old antiques.","After breaking through to the Middle Arcana Stage, Chu Yunfan was only slightly happy for a moment before he returned to his calm state. He knew that although he could establish himself in the Prodigy Battlefield with his strength, it was far from enough. He wanted to dominate the Prodigy Battlefield.","To become the strongest prodigy, regardless of whether it was the prodigy of the ancient times or the prodigy of the present, one had to defeat all of them. Only by becoming the strongest could one have a chance of reaching the final divine throne.","This was the thought of every prodigy who entered the Prodigy Battlefield!","The only difference was whether they had the ability to achieve it.","After breaking through to the Middle Arcana Stage, Chu Yunfan stopped cultivating and turned to making pills. He had robbed too many great medicines this time, and there were also various supplementary medicines and various resources. It was too wasteful to just eat them as snacks. Many of them could be refined into top-notch pills. He had so many pills that he could eat them like candy. He didn’t even care about Jun Tianci.","He was just a skeleton in a coffin. Let him live for a few more days!","Time passed quickly. It had been half a year since Chu Yunfan broke through to the Middle Arcana Stage. During this half a year, huge changes had taken place in the battlefield, especially in the core region.","Many of the Major Arcanes who had been in secluded cultivation had started to move out. After digesting their gains from the previous wave, their powers had improved significantly, and they were all looking for the next wave of fortuitous encounters.","The entire core region of the Prodigy Battlefield was no longer as calm as before. The collisions between the various prodigies began to become frequent.","As a result, the collisions between the alliances behind these prodigies began to become more and more intense. In order to compete for the top-notch resources in the core region of the Prodigy Battlefield, these top-notch figures kept clashing.","All kinds of news spread on the Prodigy Battlefield.","“Do you know? Another shocking collision occurred between the Flying","Celestial Alliance and the Destiny Sect. Huangfu Longhao personally fought the vice alliance chief of the Destiny Alliance and seized a piece of aged metal essence! ‘t","“That’s nothing. Do you guys know about the Middle Era Twin Dragons? They’ve been reborn and their cultivation bases are even more terrifying. I heard that they’re infinitely close to breaking through to the Major Arcana Stage. However, they’ve been suppressing themselves!”","“There were too many monsters in the Middle Era, so many that it was hard to imagine. However, the Middle Era Twin Dragons were still the best among them. Although they didn’t join the Middle Era Alliance, their combined strength and their followers were enough to form a powerful alliance!”","“The countdown to the opening of the Prodigy Battlefield has already begun. Many people have begun to show no mercy. After all, it is rumored that a godhead will be born in this life. If they can’t make themselves strong enough before that, they won’t be able to compete with the heroes of the world!”","For a time, all kinds of rumors spread on the Prodigy Battlefield. However, many people realized that the opening of the Prodigy Battlefield this time was different from the past. In the past, when the Prodigy Battlefield opened, many prodigies would control their attacks and would not increase their","cultivation without limit.","This was because there was a restriction in the Prodigy Battlefield. They did not know what kind of existence had set such a restriction. Other than the age requirement, one’s cultivation base could not exceed the Major Arcana Stage. Once one exceeded the Major Arcana Stage, they would be automatically teleported out. They would not be able to enter the Prodigy Battlefield again.","That was why these prodigies had always been suppressing their cultivation state. Unless they could no longer suppress it, they would do their best to do so. Just like the famous Twin Dragons of the Middle Era, they were clearly peak Major Arcanes, yet they were still forcefully suppressing their cultivation state.","Without exception, they all wanted to enter the Prodigy Battlefield as much as possible to obtain more benefits.","However, this time was different. Many people speculated that this life would be the birth of a godhead. It would be a world of great competition, or even an unprecedented golden age.","If they continued to suppress their cultivation, they might not be able to keep up with those top-notch big shots and would be eliminated from the battle for the godhead.","When the time came for the godhead to appear, those who were not strong enough would not even have the qualifications to participate and would be eliminated.","It was precisely because of this consideration that news of a large number of prodigies breaking through could be heard almost every day. Among these 100,000 prodigies, the weakest one could rank in the top 30 of the Prodigy List of an era. Every one of them had a secret technique to increase their cultivation.","In just a short period, the strength of these prodigies had undergone earth-shattering changes compared to the beginning of the Prodigy Battlefield.","In fact, there were many Supreme Youths who had suppressed their cultivation bases, breaking through to Major Arcana Stage in the shortest amount of time possible.","For a time, the entire Prodigy Battlefield was filled with all kinds of news about these prodigies. Among them, a piece of news suddenly appeared and attracted everyone’s attention.","The final battle between the two generations of Princess Gushe was about to go down.."]},{"number":2171,"title":"Chapter 2171: Finally Seeing Tang Siyu Again","paragraphs":["Chapter 2171: Finally Seeing Tang Siyu Again","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This news undoubtedly attracted the attention of many people, especially over the second generation Gushe Princess, who was one of the best among many female prodigies. She had countless countless admirers and suitors.","This was especially true for many prodigies. With their talent, their future was limitless. In their eyes, ordinary women, even prodigies in the eyes of ordinary people, were not worthy of them.","Only these female prodigies were worthy of them.","The second generation Gushe Princess, who was one of the best among them, naturally attracted a large number of suitors.","Both of them were the cream of the crop. After the new Princess Gushe stepped into the Prodigy Battlefield, she had broken through to Major Arcana Stage at the fastest speed possible. The two of them fought intermittently, but never once did they stop.","Now, both of them were competing for this title.","Both of them had quite a number of fans on the battlefield. However, compared to the cold and unreasonable new Princess Gushe, the older generation of Princess Gushe was clearly more popular.","Three months later, this battle would determine who would become the only Princess Gushe.","Deep in the night, in a huge mountain range, a slim, snow-white, and peerlessly beautiful woman sat cross-legged in the air. A terrifying aura was surging around her, spreading in all directions.","However, as time passed, these rings of aura were absorbed into her body again.","She was making a difficult breakthrough in order to reach a higher stage.","Around this mountain range was an incomparably huge barrier. Around the barrier was an incomparably huge Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array. Around the formation were the Azure Dragon, White Tiger, Black Tortoise, and Vermilion Bird. The four divine beasts transformed into their figures and continuously attacked, repelling the hero spirits that were charging over.","These hero spirits were all from the core region of the battlefield. Compared to the hero spirits in the outer region, they were many times stronger. Even the weakest among them was at peak Middle Arcana Stage. There were even many Major Arcane hero spirits among them as they continued to attack.","However, no matter how they attacked, they were unable to break through the","Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array. The Azure Dragon roared, and countless trees grew crazily on the ground, turning into chains that locked down the hero spirits.","The White Tiger roared like a peerless swordsman. Wherever its golden sword light passed, it swept across undefeatable. No hero spirit could withstand the attack of this tiger.","The Vermilion Bird flew in the air and let out a cry, turning the world into a sea of fire. All the hero spirits were constantly reborn in the sea of fire and were constantly burned to death, reborn, and burned to death again.","This was a hellish process.","Finally, the Black Tortoise blew cold air, turning the north into a world of ice and snow. Countless hero spirits were directly frozen in it, instantly turning into pure Yin Energy that was absorbed by the formation.","This formation could actually use the supreme Yin Energy in the hero spirits to maintain the operation of the formation by continuously killing them. There was no need for anyone to manage it.","As long as it was not broken by anyone, this array could operate for a thousand years or even ten thousand years.","Suddenly, the woman in the array opened her eyes. In the distant sky, the array fluctuated as if someone was about to break in.","In the next moment, a figure had already arrived in this space.","“Who is it?” the woman shouted. At the same time, her cultivation base was completely raised, forming a terrifying tide. In an instant, it turned into a huge hand that slapped down on the person.","“It’s me, Siyu!” the man said.","Suddenly, just as this person finished speaking, that terrifying big hand disappeared. At the critical moment, it withdrew its strength. One could imagine how shocking the control of that woman’s divine power was.","Chu Yunfan smiled as he looked at Tang Siyu, who was even more beautiful than before. His eyes flashed with joy.","“Yunfan! It’s really you!” Tang Siyu said. Her eyes were filled with tears. It seemed that she had never thought that the person who came would be Chu Yunfan.","However, although the person in front of her looked different, Tang Siyu could feel his aura. It was indeed Chu Yunfan.","“Are you okay?” Tang Siyu wiped the tears from the corner of her eyes.","With her current cultivation and state of mind, it could be said that there were no ripples in an ancient well. There were very few things that could make her angry. Only seeing Chu Yunfan again could shock her.","She still remembered that a dozen years ago, she had received news that Chu Yunfan had been killed by Jun Tianci.","This matter had caused an uproar back then because the current top ranker of the Prodigy List had been killed by the previous top ranker of the Prodigy List. For a time, it had shocked the world.","It even caused the anger of many old antiques, not just the Flying Celestials, because to many old antiques, nothing was more important than inheritance.","Now, Jun Tianci was killing the younger generation recklessly just because he had cultivated for a longer time. If that happened, the rules of the world would be thrown into chaos.","In the future, who would dare to enter the Prodigy List? From now on, the inheritance of Grand Xia would be severed. This was a very bad start.","If it wasn’t for the fact that the Destiny Sect had such a powerful background, Jun Tianci would have been arrested long ago. As for the lack of evidence, it was just an excuse.","When she first received this news, her heart was also torn by a knife.","However, Chu Yunfan had not appeared for more than ten years after that, so many people silently agreed that Chu Yunfan had probably been killed. Even if he did not die right then, he would probably not be able to hold on and fall later.","It was because of this that she had chased Jun Tianci to the Prodigy Battlefield in a fit of rage. The two sides had fought several times, but Jun Tianci’s strength was still above hers. Although she had earned the title of Supreme Youth, she was still at a disadvantage when facing Jun Tianci, who had cultivated for a long time longer than her.","Jun Tianci had even schemed against her and set up an ambush to surround her, almost killing her.","Everyone knew about the feud between her and the other Princess Gushe. However, in reality, it was just a dispute of personal feelings for her. Her real mortal enemy was Jun Tianci.","All these years, she had been thinking of killing Jun Tianci and avenging Chu","Yunfan.","However, she did not expect Chu Yunfan to appear when she was unprepared.","“How did you become Jian Wuchen?” Tang Siyu was shocked.."]},{"number":2172,"title":"Chapter 2172: I Will Return to Him Double in the Future","paragraphs":["Chapter 2172: I Will Return to Him Double in the Future","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","She was very familiar with Chu Yunfan’s current appearance. During this period of time, Jian Wuchen had turned the entire battlefield upside down. Countless people hated him to the core, and countless people wanted to kill him.","That was because the reward was too tempting. Countless people had been tempted.","Even someone like her, who had been cultivating hard all year round, had heard of Jian Wuchen and seen his portrait. However, she had never expected that Jian Wuchen was actually Chu Yunfan, whom she had been thinking about day and night.","“You’re Jian Wuchen?” Tang Siyu had a look of disbelief. If it was an ordinary person, they would probably not believe it even if they were beaten to death.","However, she immediately thought of a lot of information about Jian Wuchen. It was really a blur. She only knew that he had just risen to power not long ago and had a deep hatred for Jun Tianci and the Destiny Sect. However, no one had ever heard of his existence before that.","Even if it was just the Prodigy Battlefield, theoretically speaking, the Prodigy Battlefield contained countless prodigies of the era. There should be people who had heard of him, but no one knew where he came from.","All of this made him look mysterious.","But now, after knowing Jian Wuchen’s true identity, everything that had puzzled her before was now clear.","Because Jian Wuchen was not a prodigy from ancient times, but a person of the current generation, it was only natural that no prodigies from ancient times knew him.","“That’s right, it’s me!” Chu Yunfan smiled. After his body swayed, he returned to his original appearance, He was dressed in black and had the appearance of a delicate young man.","When Tang Siyu saw the person she wanted to be with day and night, she could not help but go forward and hug him. She was afraid that what she saw was just an illusion and would disappear in the next moment.","Leaning against the familiar chest and feeling the familiar warmth, she finally confirmed that this was indeed the person she had been thinking about day and night.","“Why didn’t you come and find me?” Tang Siyu raised her head and looked at Chu Yunfan with a hint of anger.","“It’s not that I haven’t gone to look for you, but the Elder Princess said that you were in seclusion and didn’t want me to disturb you. Do you think I can barge in?” Chu Yunfan felt a little helpless. “You know what happened after that. I was troubled by all kinds of big and small matters. I was constantly chased by all kinds of enemies. I didn’t want you to be implicated either!”","“Am I afraid of being implicated by you?” Tang Siyu bit her lower lip and","stared at Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan smiled bitterly and shook his head. “Of course, you’re not afraid. But I didn’t want you to get involved in these things. 1 didn’t expect you to get involved. I heard that you tried to kill Jun Tianci several times.”","“That’s right. I wish I could tear him into pieces!” Tang Siyu’s eyes flickered with a terrifying light. “Besides, you were killed by him because of me!”","Tang Siyu had always believed that Jun Tianci had targeted Chu Yunfan because of her. Because of her, Maiden Donghua had targeted her, and Chu Yunfan had taken revenge for her. Later, he had even provoked Jun Tianci.","Chu Yunfan patted Tang Siyu’s little head and smiled. “So that’s what you think. If that’s what you think, then you’re very wrong. Or rather, you’ve underestimated Jun Tianci’s situation and his ruthlessness!”","When Chu Yunfan mentioned Jun Tianci, the smile on his face gradually disappeared. He said, “He’s an extremely cold-blooded person. Do you think he’s targeting me because of Maiden Donghua? He wants my heart blood. It seems that collecting it is useful. Even without your relationship, he won’t let me off!”","Tang Siyu was stunned because this was the first time she had heard about this. Previously, Chu Yunfan had been seriously injured and entered seclusion. Because the time was too short, there was too little news. She only knew that Jun Tianci was targeting Chu Yunfan.","However, in her opinion, Jun Tianci and Chu Yunfan had no grudges against each other. Wasn’t it because of her that Jun Tianci suddenly attacked Chu Yunfan?","Therefore, she had always blamed herself, but now Chu Yunfan told her that this matter had nothing to do with her.","However, at this moment, she could imagine how much danger Chu Yunfan had been in at that time. With Jun Tianci’s strength at that time, he was far more powerful than Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan couldn’t compare to him at all.","Under those circumstances, Jun Tianci was determined to take away Chu Yunfan’s heart blood. It was already very difficult for Chu Yunfan to survive.","It had been more than ten years since she had received any news, so it was easy to imagine how serious his injuries were. Thinking of this, she felt as if her heart was about to be torn apart, and she was extremely sad.","Chu Yunfan saw Tang Siyu clench her fists and grit her teeth. He smiled and patted her shoulder. “It’s all in the past. No matter how dangerous it was, I’ve survived it, haven’t l? What Jun Tianci gave me back then, I will return to him double in the future!”","“You don’t want to alert the enemy?” Tang Siyu suddenly understood why Chu Yunfan had changed his identity and entered the Prodigy Battlefield.","“That’s right. I just don’t want to alert the enemy. Although everyone knows that I have a grudge with Jun Tianci, he won’t care about me too much. But if my identity is exposed, it will be different. Many things will be difficult to carry out!” Chu Yunfan nodded. “If he knows my identity, he will definitely do everything he can to get rid of me first!”","“In that case, that’s good too!” Tang Siyu nodded.","This was probably the safest way. Chu Yunfan was in the dark, and Jun Tianci was in the light. As the saying went, it was easy to dodge an open spear, but difficult to defend against an arrow in the dark. This was the biggest advantage for them.","“But how did you find me?”","“Because of this Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array!” Chu Yunfan looked at the formation. “The formation I gave you back then has already evolved to this stage. It’s really amazing!’","Back then, Chu Yunfan had protected Tang Siyu with this formation. Now, on the basis of the original formation, Tang Siyu had developed it to a new height. It was the Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array.","If this formation was controlled by someone, even a peak Major Arcane would find it hard to break through. On the other hand, if it was used to trap someone, even a peak Major Arcane being would find it hard to escape. It could be said that it was a formation that could both attack and defend!","“Of course!” Tang Siyu nodded proudly. In front of Chu Yunfan, she finally had the innocence of a young girl, not the cold-faced goddess that everyone knew"]},{"number":2173,"title":"Chapter 2173: Break Through to the Peak Major Arcana in Three Months?","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array that Chu Yunfan had given Tang Siyu was only a semi-finished product. Even Chu Yunfan had not completely cultivated the Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array.","However, after decades of development, the Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array had completely taken shape. Tang Siyu was able to cultivate and develop in the core region of the Prodigy Battlefield in peace because of the defense of the Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array. She had even relied on the defense of the Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array to block fatal pursuits many times.","Tang Siyu’s effort in this process was evident.","In front of Chu Yunfan, Tang Siyu could put down all her pride and coldness and return to the girl she was when she first met him.","“l heard that you plan to fight with that Princess Gushe?” Chu Yunfan said.","“Yes.” Tang Siyu nodded. “l intend to have a final battle with her to determine the final victor!”","“Just for a title? I don’t think so!” Chu Yunfan smiled.","Tang Siyu smiled and shook her head. can’t hide anything from you. Of course, it’s not just for this title. Do you think she or I am that bored? She wanted me to be her whetstone and borrow my strength to help her break through, so she repeatedly found trouble with me and forced me to use all my potential. In the end, she defeated me and transcended in one fell swoop, becoming one of the strongest people in the small group!’","Tang Siyu’s smile was very clean, but it was also a little careless. However, how could Chu Yunfan not understand how dangerous it was behind the scenes?","Chu Yunfan had seen this kind of thing many times. Although the other party used Tang Siyu as a whetstone, if Tang Siyu could not afford to be a whetstone, this Princess Gushe would not mind killing Tang Siyu, who had the same title as her.","The saying that there could only be one Princess Gushe in the world was just an excuse to attack. In order to rise up, these ancient prodigies had never stopped using all means.","Some of them would deliberately indulge and nurture some opponents. When these opponents became strong to a certain extent, they would take action to eliminate them.","These people were extremely confident that even if their opponents became stronger, they would not be their match. Of course, there were also cases of people being killed by stronger opponents.","Obviously, Princess Gushe was planning to use Tang Siyu as a whetstone.","“What is her current cultivation level? How confident are you?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“She’s a later Major Arcane now. She’s only one step away from becoming a peak Major Arcane!” Tang Siyu said. “If she can kill me this time around, she will be able to complete her breakthrough and enter the peak Major Arcana!","She will then be able to fight against the strongest cultivators in the Prodigy Battlefield!”","“No wonder!” Chu Yunfan immediately understood Princess Gushe’ s intentions. Clearly, breaking through to peak Major Arcana Stage wasn’t what she was after. What she was after was full cultivation, to lay a solid foundation for the future!","“She had the chance to kill me a few times before, but she let me go. This is the last battle. Either she dies or I die!” Tang Siyu clenched her fists tightly,","and a hint of battle intent flashed through her eyes. “She wants to use me as a whetstone, but she doesn’t know who will be the whetstone in the end!”","“However, you should have just broken through to late Major Arcana Stage. How confident are you in facing her?” Chu Yunfan looked at Tang Siyu.","“Only 50%!” Tang Siyu replied, “Even though I’ve only just broken through to late Major Arcana Stage, I’ve already gained a certain level of understanding toward her after a few exchanges. 1 have a fifty percent chance of defeating","Princess Gushe had oppressed her several times. If she could defeat Princess Gushe, she would welcome a huge transformation.","Of course, Princess Gushe would not allow Tang Siyu to continue growing and would definitely kill her.","“That’s why 1 delayed the battle for three months. After three months, I can increase my chances by another ten percent!”","Chu Yunfan paused and frowned. “With your physique, you’re definitely at the level of a Supreme Youth. Your cultivation level is similar to hers, but you only have 50-60% confidence? Princess Gushe must also have an emperor physique then! ”","Tang Siyu nodded. “That’s right. She also has an emperor physique. If it was just an ordinary kin physique, she would not even be able to withstand a single blow from me! ”","Chu Yunfan shook his head and said, “50 – 60% is not enough. Since she dared to let you grow, she must have her own trump card. That’s why she has absolute confidence that she can defeat you in the end. So, even if you fight her with your current cultivation, I think you’ll still lose more than you win!”","“In three months, no matter how fast I improve, I can only be on par with her. It’s too difficult to improve further!” Tang Siyu shook her head. “She has accumulated so many generations of experience, and her foundation is unbelievably deep. A 50% chance of winning against her is already the limit!”","Chu Yunfan waved and stood with his hands behind his back. “That was before you met me. I came here specifically for this matter. In three months, I want you to break through to the peak Major Arcana. She wants to use you as a whetstone. I want her to know what it means to be trapped in a cocoon!”","“Three months to break through to the peak Major Arcana?” Tang Siyu’s beautiful eyes widened slightly as if she hadn’t expected Chu Yunfan to say such a thing.","With her body constitution, she was definitely an emperor. It wouldn’t be difficult for her to cultivate to the peak Major Arcana. However, it was impossible for her to break through to the peak Major Arcana within three months.","Princess Gushe would not give her the chance to do so. She had been tricked. No matter where she hid, she would be found eventually. Otherwise, the two sides would not have had so many head-on clashes.","She had nowhere to hide.","That was why there was such a battle after the breakthrough.","However, once she broke through to the peak Major Arcana Stage, she would no longer have to worry about anything else. She would be considered a powerhouse on the Prodigy Battlefield. She would be able to stand on equal footing with those prodigies from the ancient times.","“That’s right! Three months is more than enough for you to break through to the peak Major Arcana. I have absolute confidence!” Chu Yunfan nodded.","In the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, in the ancient era, there were many people who had been conferred the title of emperor in just a few decades or a hundred years. Other than their own talents, there were naturally all kinds of secret techniques.","“Recently, I’ve obtained a large batch of medicinal herbs. Among them, there are pills that can increase one’s strength. It’s enough to give them a big surprise!” Chu Yunfan grinned.","Obtained? Tang Siyu glanced at Chu Yunfan and smiled.."]},{"number":2174,"title":"Chapter 2174: Double Breakthrough in Three Months","paragraphs":["Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Obviously, Tang Siyu had heard about Chu Yunfan’s recent incident. It could be said that it had caused an uproar. In one breath, he had robbed hundreds of prodigies and robbed them of all their wealth.","These prodigies were not ordinary experts. The wealth of each of them might be dozens of times or even hundreds of times stronger than experts of the same stage.","Although there were only a hundred of them, Chu Yunfan’s wealth had expanded in one breath, which was why it caused such a huge uproar.","It even made people panic. Many experts formed groups and traveled together to avoid being attacked by Chu Yunfan.","In the past, this was very rare. Experts who could run amuck on the Prodigy Battlefield, whether they were prodigies from outside or prodigies from the natives, were all the best among the best. Usually, they would come and go alone.","Even the alliance chiefs would only summon them when they had something to do. Usually, they would look for opportunities on their own.","However, because of Chu Yunfan, these experts were forced to travel together. It was obvious that they had many thoughts.","If Chu Yunfan hadn’t restrained himself and only attacked the experts who had targeted him and chased him, he would have attracted the counterattack of countless experts.","Chu Yunfan chuckled and didn’t say anything.","“In three months, I want to make everyone look at me in a different light!”","Chu Yunfan said.","Tang Siyu’s beautiful eyes flashed with excitement. Originally, she only had a 50% chance of winning against Princess Gushe. Even after three months, she only had a 60% chance of winning.","However, if she could break through to the peak Major Arcana, then she would have a hundred percent chance of winning. No matter what kind of trump cards she had up her sleeve, they would never be able to escape her grasp.","If it was anyone else who told her that they could help her reach the peak Major Arcana within three months, she would never believe it. But this person was none other than Chu Yunfan.","“As long as you say it, I will believe it!”","Chu Yunfan nodded with a smile, Without hesitation, he grabbed the Mountain River Cauldron from the Mountain River Diagram. At the same time, he took out many mature medicines from the herb mountain.","“This time, the pill I’m going to make is called the Seven Treasure Black Yellow Pill. Using the precious medicine as the foundation, this pill can greatly increase one’s strength and battle prowess in a short time!” Chu Yunfan said,","“But this isn’t for you. I’m giving you this, the Brahma Fruit!”","Chu Yunfan took out a Brahma Fruit from the Brahma Tree on the herb mountain in the Mountain River Diagram and handed it to Tang Siyu.","Tang Siyu took the Brahma Fruit. She was no stranger to it. In fact, Chu Yunfan had given it to her more than once before.","However, it was obvious that the medicinal effects of the Brahma Fruit this time were more than a hundred times stronger than the previous ones.","At that time, Chu Yunfan had just obtained the Brahma Tree, but it was only in the seedling stage. The current Brahma Tree had grown at least a hundred times compared to before.","Chu Yunfan had hunted the blood essence of many experts over the years. Other than a portion that grew the Brahma Fruit, the rest had been absorbed by the Brahma Tree, accelerating its growth.","During this period of time, Chu Yunfan had killed many experts and watered them with a lot of blood essence, making the medicinal effects of the newly grown Brahma Fruit even more shocking.","Tang Siyu immediately consumed the Brahma Fruit. She immediately felt a terrifying energy flood merge into her limbs and bones.","She immediately began to circulate her cultivation and refine the energy within the Brahma Fruit.","Chu Yunfan was not idle either. As he made the pill, he also consumed a Brahma Fruit.","With the assistance of the godhead, he could naturally multitask. He made the medicinal pill while simultaneously refining the medicinal strength within the Brahma Fruit.","Time passed day by day, and the three months passed in the blink of an eye.","Inside the Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array, Chu Yunfan extinguished the flames in the Mountain River Cauldron with a serious expression. The top cover of the Mountain River Cauldron slowly opened, and a white fog immediately spread out. A threatening medicinal aura pervaded the entire Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array, and then a golden light broke through the white fog like a sharp sword, almost soaring into the sky.","If not for the Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array locking down all phenomena, it would probably have immediately alarmed the surrounding hundred miles.","However, a moment later, the shocking phenomenon disappeared without a trace.","Chu Yunfan waved, and a golden pill flew into the jade bottle in his hand.","“The Seven Treasures Black Yellow Pill is finally finished. I’ve made it to the final moment!” Chu Yunfan smiled.","After waiting for three months, there was finally a result.","Of course, just the Seven Treasures Black Yellow Pill alone did not require Chu Yunfan to spend three months to make. In fact, the Seven Treasures Black Yellow Pill only took Chu Yunfan a month.","In the remaining two months, Chu Yunfan made a large number of other pills. There were pills that increased one’s cultivation, healing pills, and pills that increased one’s combat strength. There were all kinds of pills.","For Chu Yunfan, this period was a rare leisure time. Hiding in the Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array, there was no need to fight and kill. Even if it was just a second with the person he loved, he would be satisfied.","Of course, his cultivation did not fall behind during this month. Although he was multitasking, he could still complete it steadily with the help of the godhead.","These were all basic operations!","Three months ago, he had only just reached the Middle Arcana Stage, but now, he had already reached the late Middle Arcana Stage.","After reaching the intermediate Middle Arcana Stage a month ago, he had been constantly consolidating his cultivation. With the help of the fully matured Brahma Fruit, Chu Yunfan’s advancement to the late Middle Arcana Plane was just a matter of pushing the boat along with the current. It was not difficult at all.","Then, he looked at Tang Siyu, who was sitting cross-legged in the air. Tang Siyu was on the verge of breaking through. The aura on her body was constantly strengthening and rising to the extreme.","Chu Yunfan could see that Tang Siyu was only one step away from breaking through.","One had to know that in these three months, not only had Tang Siyu completely refined the Brahma Fruit, but she had also received Chu Yunfan’s constant guidance. Although Chu Yunfan’s current cultivation was not stronger than Tang Siyu’s, with the help of the Alchemy Emperor’s memories and the godhead, his realm and vision were many times stronger than Tang Siyu’s.","Chu Yunfan could also make pills and cultivate at the same time. At the same time, he had time to guide Tang Siyu’s cultivation.","With the guidance of a great teacher, Tang Siyu’s breakthrough was just around the corner.","Suddenly, a terrifying aura turned into a wave of air and surged out of Tang","Siyu’s body.","Tang Siyu had finally broken through to the peak Major Arcana Stage!"]},{"number":2175,"title":"Chapter 2175: Wait for Me to Kill Him Personally","paragraphs":["Chapter 2175: Wait for Me to Kill Him Personally","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Thick jade-colored mana swept out in the air and turned into a phenomenon around Tang Siyu. Behind her, a jade-colored figure condensed. Upon closer inspection, wasn’t this jade-colored figure Tang Siyu?","Chu Yunfan could tell that this was Tang Siyu!s technique. He didn’t know if she had inherited it from the Elder Princess. This technique was based on one’s ovvn consciousness and was invincible. The more one believed that they were invincible, the more amazing the strength they could unleash.","Chu Yunfan had once seen an emperor using this method to vindicate his Dao in the Alchemy Emperor’s memories. Once he vindicated his Dao, he was invincible and extremely terrifying.","Behind this jade-colored figure was a bright moon hanging in the sky. The cold moonlight seemed to illuminate the earth.","The strange phenomenon quickly disappeared without a trace. Tang Siyu opened her beautiful eyes and restrained her aura very well.","The peak Major Arcana was the pinnacle of the Arcana Stage. Upon reaching this level, one’s entire being would undergo an earth-shattering transformation. They would be in an extremely perfect state, fusing with the heavens and earth.","“Three months, I’ve really reached Major Arcane peak state?” Tang Siyu said with a look of disbelief on her face. Even though she believed in Chu Yunfan, she was still shocked that he had truly reached the peak Major Arcana. “Naturally!” Chu Yunfan grinned.","He had used the godhead to calculate all of this, and there was no mistake.","“With our current battle prowess, we can dominate the vast Prodigy Battlefield!” Chu Yunfan said.","With Tang Siyu’s powers, even though she was just a new peak Major Arcane, the battle prowess that her emperor physique was capable of unleashing would definitely make her one of the top few.","On the other hand, Chu Yunfan was slightly weaker than Tang Siyu. However, he could still protect himself against a peak Major Arcane. With such combat strength, the two of them could definitely sweep through the entire place.","Tang Siyu paused and looked at Chu Yunfan. once fought with Jun Tianci. I was no match for him then. But now, I have a 50% chance of defeating him. I will go and kill him now!’","Tang Siyu seemed to have forgotten about the battle between her and Princess Gushe. It was not that she had forgotten, but that she did not care.","Princess Gushe wanted to force her to unleash her full potential so that she could kill her in one fell swoop and step into the peak Major Arcana Stage. She had the same thought as well. As long as she could defeat Princess Gushe, she would be able to break through to the peak Major Arcana with ease.","However, things were different now. She had already broken through to the peak Major Arcana. That meant that her motivation to fight with Princess Gushe was gone.","With her current strength, she was at least several times stronger than before. Originally, she only had a 50% chance of defeating Princess Gushe. Now, defeating Princess Gushe was just a flip of her hand.","She was not interested in such boring things.","She knew that Princess Gushe definitely wouldn’t be able to break through to the peak Major Arcana. This was the most difficult step in the entire Major Arcana Stage, or even the entire Arcana Stage.","A single step was equivalent to ascending to the heavens in a single step. It would be normal if one could not cross it!","It didn’t mean that the difficulty of breaking through to peak Major Arcana was that shocking. With Princess Gushe’s emperor physique, it was only a matter of time before she reached the peak Major Arcana.","However, that would require time, and not a short amount of time at that. That was why she had forced Tang Siyu to use her full strength to break through to the peak Major Arcana.","The peak Major Arcana was the pinnacle of the entire Arcana Stage. One needed to cultivate to the full cultivation state, and have perfect control over the powers of the Arcana Stage, allowing one to unleash all of their potential. Only then would one be able to take a step further and become an existence that surpassed the Major Arcana Stage.","This required a lot of effort, breaking through bit by bit. Only when one was close to full cultivation would one be able to step into the peak Major Arcana Stage.","In fact, ordinary people might even be stuck at the late Major Arcana for their entire lives, unable to step into peak Major Arcana Stage, Only an emperor physique possessor could guarantee that they would be able to step into peak Major Arcana Stage.","For someone with an emperor physique, it was only natural for Princess Gushe to reach the peak Major Arcana. It wasn’t difficult at all. The only thing she lacked was time.","However, in this world of great conflict, what everyone lacked the most was time. How could they cultivate at the normal speed step by step?","Since Tang Siyu was already a peak Major Arcane, there was no need for her to fight Princess Gushe.","“No need, wait for me to kill him personally!” Chu Yunfan said coldly. Ever since he started cultivating, he had never suffered such a huge loss. His blood essence was stolen and he almost died a tragic death. If it wasn’t for his special physique and the rebirth power of the Immemorial Dark Phoenix, he would have died there.","It could be said to be a life-and-death feud. He did not want to use Tang Siyu to take revenge!","He wanted to take revenge personally. He wanted to kill Jun Tianci on the Prodigy Battlefield to resolve this hatred!","“Your battle with Princess Gushe cannot be stopped!” Chu Yunfan said, “If you want to dominate the Prodigy Battlefield, such a battle is necessary. Moreover, she has targeted you time and time again. Although she has the intention of forcing you to use your full strength, she has also put you in danger several times and almost killed you. This revenge must be taken!”","Tang Siyu thought for a moment and nodded. She had never intended to let Princess Gushe go, but she did not plan to fight with such fanfare. With her strength, she could kill Princess Gushe anytime.","However, Chu Yunfan’s words made sense.","“Oh?” Suddenly, Tang Siyu remembered something and said, “When I broke through just now, I already felt the suppression of heaven and earth!”","“What is it? You feel the suppression of heaven and earth so early?” Chu Yunfan was a little stunned. He had the memories of the Alchemy Emperor, so he was no stranger to the suppression of heaven and earth.","The path of cultivation was a path that defied the heavens. One had to constantly break through oneself and conquer the world.","However, when one cultivated to a certain level, one would be able to clearly feel the suppression of heaven and earth on one’s body. This was the case for emperors. After cultivating to the emperor level, one’s comprehension of the laws of heaven and earth would almost reach the extreme. Similarly, one would also be suppressed by heaven and earth.","This was because emperors were too terrifying when they attacked. It was very common for them to destroy a world when they really attacked.","It was precisely because these emperors were so terrifying that heaven and earth would suppress them, preventing them from recklessly attacking. Rather than calling it a will, it was more like a law born from the law itself to protect heaven and earth.","However, the prodigies in the Prodigy Battlefield were only Major Arcanes at best. Even though every single movement of theirs was extremely powerful, they were still miles away from being able to threaten the heavens and earth.."]},{"number":2176,"title":"Chapter 2176: Going to the Meet for a Battle","paragraphs":["Chapter 2176: Going to the Meet for a Battle","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","A Major Arcane could merge with the world and borrow a portion of the powers of the world. However, they were still within the laws of the world. It was impossible for them to pierce through the world in one go, or even destroy it.","That was why he found it strange. With Tang Siyu’s level, how could she possibly attract the suppression of the heaven and earth’s laws?","“But I really feel the suppression of heaven and earth! It’s like I’ve already touched the ceiling! No matter how hard I try, I’ll only be able to circle around the peak Major Arcana! There’s no way for me to break through to a higher level!” Tang Siyu exclaimed.","Chu Yunfan frowned slightly. Suddenly, he seemed to have thought of something and quickly said, “l understand why. It’s because of the restrictions of this battlefield, not the restrictions of the real world!”","Chu Yunfan suddenly remembered that there were some interdimensional spaces that were like this. They only allowed some experts below the realm to enter, because if they exceeded this realm, the entire interdimensional space would collapse on the spot.","“That’s because the laws here aren’t perfect enough. Even though this Prodigy Battlefield is rich in resources, and the spirit energy here is unbelievably dense, just like a blessed land, I’m afraid that it’s not a naturally formed plane. Many of the laws were added in after its birth. However, at the same time, it’s not possible to compare it to the real world. Therefore, it’s only reasonable that it can only accommodate up to the peak Major Arcana!” Chu Yunfan said, “It’s also possible that there’s a supreme being who has set down the rules, preventing people from breaking through the Major Arcana!”","Chu Yunfan thought for a moment and felt that only these two possibilities were the most likely. Either the interdimensional space itself was not perfect, or although the interdimensional space was perfect, someone had set up rules that made it impossible for people to break through. It was like an inescapable net that firmly bound people,","Both of these possibilities were possible, but no matter which one it was, it would limit them from breaking through to higher levels.","Upon hearing that, Tang Siyu couldn’t help but come to a realization. “No wonder there were some prodigies in the ancient times who managed to break through to Major Arcane no matter how much they suppressed their strength. In the end, they never came back. From the looks of it, there should be a screening mechanism in the Prodigy Battlefield. It’s not an ordinary interdimensional space. It should be an interdimensional space with some special function. For example, it’s a stage specially provided for these prodigies to showcase themselves?”","“I’m afraid that’s possible.” Chu Yunfan nodded. ‘Didn’t you notice? The strongest of the natives here are only Major Arcanes. No matter how strong their cultivation base is, they can only cultivate to the peak Major Arcana at most. They can’t break through. That’s why they can only choose to rely on these foreign prodigies!’","Chu Yunfan finally understood what was going on. There were many things that he had found strange because the Prodigy Battlefield had existed for so many years, and many of the forces had extremely ancient inheritances. They were not inferior to the top ten forces outside, or even existed longer than the top ten forces.","Furthermore, many of the inheritances of these factions came from the descendants of the prodigies who had entered and never left.","Furthermore, the techniques they cultivated were not inferior to those of the outside world. In fact, they were even superior in many aspects.","However, even so, none of these forces could break through to a higher realm. It was as if there was a huge net that trapped all of them. No matter how they struggled, it was useless.","Chu Yunfan couldn’t help but suck in a breath of cold air when he thought of this. How sad was this? No matter how hard he cultivated, no matter how hard he struggled, he couldn’t advance further and reach a higher realm. This was the sorrow of the entire world, and also the sorrow of these native prodigies.","It was difficult to change the fact that so many native prodigies had chosen to seal themselves. Only when the Prodigy Battlefield opened would they choose to unseal themselves and appear to fight against foreign prodigies.","They were probably waiting. In the vast river of time in the future, there might be a chance to escape. This tragic fate would allow them to leave the Prodigy Battlefield.","If they couldn’t do it now, it was as if they were cursed. If they wanted to leave, they would be wiped out by the power of heaven and earth.","It was as if there was an invisible cage around them that locked them in. However, in the future, there might be someone who could break this invisible cage, whether it was the people in the Prodigy Battlefield or the people outside the Prodigy Battlefield.","Therefore, among the natives, as long as there was a prodigy’s talent, they would choose to seal themselves. Otherwise, there would not be so many native prodigies appearing in the opening of the Prodigy Battlefield this time. Their numbers were so many that they could compete with the prodigies of the outside world.","But if not for this, the battlefield of prodigies would have long since become","an unfathomable place. The heritage left behind by countless years of inheritance was enough to make this place an even more terrifying existence than the Central Plains.","“But this is good too. We won’t be too far behind them!” Chu Yunfan said.","Chu Yunfan couldn’t help but feel a little emotional. The person who created the battlefield was so terrifying. He might even be an emperor.","What was the purpose of this scheme that had been set up since the end of the ancient era?","“Since there’s no way to advance further here, then the value of this place to us will be greatly reduced. After the Prodigy Battlefield closes, we have to leave as soon as possible. Otherwise, we’ll be locked here for generations!” Chu","Yunfan said.","These natives in the Prodigy Battlefield were all descendants of those prodigies. However, the laws of this world were like maggots that were ingrained in their bones, preventing them from leaving.","If Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu couldn’t leave in time, the final outcome would be the same.","“But before that, I have to kill Jun Tianci. Otherwise, it will be much more difficult to kill him outside!” Chu Yunfan’s lips curled into a cold smile, and his eyes shone with a terrifying light.","If they were outside, Jun Tianci would definitely be protected by powerful experts, and there should be powerful protectors among them.","If Chu Yunfan wanted to do it then, it would be too difficult.","The best way was to kill him in the Prodigy Battlefield and end this cycle.","“That’s right, I can help you!” Tang Siyu nodded.","“Alright, let’s not talk about it for now. Let’s go and fight!” Chu Yunfan waved.","“Yes!” Tang Siyu nodded.","With a wave, the Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array disappeared. The two of them stepped on the light and disappeared into the horizon.."]},{"number":2177,"title":"Chapter 2177: Princess Gushe Arrives","paragraphs":["Chapter 2177: Princess Gushe Arrives","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the core region of the Prodigy Battlefield, in an incomparably huge","mountain range. Unlike the lush greenery in the mountain range outside, although the spirit energy in the core region of the Prodigy Battlefield was denser, this endless spirit energy transformed into a terrifying gale.","Even during the day, when there were no hero spirits wreaking havoc, there was still a large amount of violent winds. Even though these violent winds were all made up of spirit energy, the destructive power they brought was shocking.","Therefore, the core area of the Prodigy Battlefield was a desert. It was a desolate scene everywhere.","However, such a cruel scene tempered people further. Those who could dominate the core region of the Prodigy Battlefield were definitely the best among the prodigies.","Anyone who wasn’t a Major Arcane would find it extremely difficult to survive here,","On this day, outside this ordinary mountain range, figures with terrifying auras appeared one after another.","All of these figures were exuding an extremely terrifying aura, and the weakest among them were fledgling Major Arcanes. All of them were gathered in groups of three to five.","Most of them were men, and each of them was handsome and extraordinary. Although the clothes they wore were of different styles, it was as if they were from an extremely distant era.","These people were all powerful figures in the outside world. Now, they were all gathered in this mountain range. There was only one reason, and that was because today was the day where the ancient and modern Princess Gushe would fight to determine the winner.","The winner would become the only Princess Gushe, and the loser would have their dao heart broken even if they didn’t die.","Even if the dao heart of an emperor was broken, it would be difficult for them to move forward.","“After so many years, the fight for the title of Princess Gushe is finally coming to an end!”","“No one would have thought that Princess Gushe Modern would be so strong. Even when faced with repeated attacks from Princess Gushe Ancient, she still persisted!","“Princess Gushe Ancient is obviously using Princess Gushe Modern as a whetstone! ”","Many people discussed animatedly. It was obvious that many people had seen through Princess Gushe’s plan, but they didn’t expose it.","This method was not new. Many people had done this before. Although some people were overturned by the other party’s counterattack, the probability of that was too low.","“It’s like a seed planted in spring. Now, it’s finally time to reap the harvest. At that time, there will be another peerless figure among us!” a peerless figure said as they crossed their arms.","“If Princess Gushe Modern doesn’t dare to come, then what?” someone asked.","“She will come. She will definitely come. Although her strength is not as good as Princess Gushe Ancient, her talent is not inferior to her. She is very ambitious. She is a rare woman since ancient times. It is impossible for such a woman to not come because she is afraid, because if she doesn’t dare to come...”","“If she doesn’t dare to come, her dao heart will be broken. Without the belief of invincibility, no matter how powerful she is in the future, she won’t be worthy of being on par with us!” someone spoke with incomparable confidence.","To Supreme Youths like them, it was not terrifying to be defeated. Even if it was a temporary defeat, it did not mean that they would be defeated for the rest of their lives.","However, if they were afraid, it would leave an eternal shadow.","The belief of invincibility was only established after defeating countless powerful enemies. It was extremely difficult to establish, but to destroy it was only a matter of an instant.","Therefore, they were certain that Tang Siyu would come. If she didn’t, the loss would be unimaginable.","“What a powerful trap. Princess Gushe Ancient must have used this situation to force Princess Gushe Modern to reveal herself and become her whetstone. What a terrifying woman, she has calculated everything!’","“However, if Tang Siyu’s strength has a new breakthrough, I’m afraid that even Princess Gushe Ancient might be overturned!” Another person grinned.","“Impossible!” Someone shook his head. “It must be Princess Gushe Ancient’s plan. Tang Siyu was allowed to grow to the point where she can fight. But it’s impossible to let her grow to the point where she can threaten Princess Gushe Ancient. That’s too dangerous!”","“That’s right. This time, Princess Gushe Ancient has a 70% chance of winning, while Princess Gushe Modern only has a 30% chance of winning. The difference between their strengths is too great. It’s a pity. Tang Siyu had the hope of becoming one of us, but she was targeted by Princess Gushe Ancient and was chosen as her whetstone. It’s really unfortunate!”","Another person said, “Luck is also a part of strength. If Princess Gushe Modern died in this battle, it means that her luck is not enough. No matter how talented she is, she is not worthy of being the last one. Since ancient times, have we not seen enough amazing people? In the end, there a_re only a few who can stand side by side with us!”","The crowd discussed animatedly. However, most of them were not optimistic about Tang Siyu. They were more optimistic about Princess Gushe. No matter which aspect one looked at, Princess Gushe was more powerful and terrifying.","They did not think that Tang Siyu’s talent and aptitude were inferior to Princess Gushe, but she lacked the time and environment to grow.","Suddenly, at this moment, amidst a commotion, a person came from afar in a carriage.","Looking from afar, nine phoenixes were pulling the chariot. Each phoenix was shining with a dazzling light. It was extraordinary. Around the chariot, there were shadows of angels protecting it.","It was as if the empress of the world had come to inspect the scene.","“Princess Gushe Ancient is here!”","Someone called out, but the carriage had already arrived above the mountain range. Sitting on the carriage was a woman in a red dress. This woman was very beautiful, her skin was whiter than snow, and she was tall. She was like an angel from the heavens who had descended to the mortal world. She did not step on the mortal world and was not tainted by the mortal world.","Many people’s eyes were fixed on her. One had to know that many people present were suitors and fans of Princess Gushe.","Now that they saw her appearance, she was like an angel from Heaven who had descended to the mortal world, causing them to feel even more admiration for her.","However, many people also understood in their hearts that this Princess Gushe had outstanding looks, but what was even more terrifying was her strength and talent. Other than a few people present, most people were probably not her match.","Even if it was a peak Major Arcane, as long as it wasn’t a Supreme Youth, they wouldn’t be able to do anything to her.."]},{"number":2178,"title":"Chapter 2178: Suppressing the Terrifying Chu Yunfan","paragraphs":["Chapter 2178: Suppressing the Terrifying Chu Yunfan","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“It’s indeed as the rumors say. She’s so beautiful!”","There were people who saw Princess Gushe for the first time and felt amazed.","“My era was closer to hers, and there was a legend of Princess Gushe. There were gods living in the mountain of Gushe, and her skin was like ice and snow, and she was like a virgin.","“Now that I look at it, it is indeed true. However, it is said that Princess Gushe is not only beautiful, but she has also fought on the battlefield many times. In that era, she once made the king sigh. Unfortunately, she’s not a man. Otherwise, she would be a hero of the era!”","“What a powerful aura! She’s indeed on the verge of enlightenment! Her cultivation base is only one step away from the peak Major Arcana! Even without today’s battle, she would definitely be able to step into the peak Major Arcana within a year at the earliest, or three years at the latest! But, is she not even willing to wait for three years?”","“If I were you, 1 wouldn’t want to wait three years either. The shocking change is happening right now. You should have heard the rumors before. If you are three years behind, you might not be able to reach the final stage of enlightenment. Who would be willing to accept that?” someone immediately said.","Everyone was silent. If it were them, the result would be the same. They couldn’t possibly wait three years, or else they wouldn’t have come to the Prodigy Battlefield. If they didn’t have the heart to prove their dao, with their talent and resources, as long as they cultivated seriously, they could be conferred the title of king. Even the title of emperor wasn’t impossible.","Many people wanted to go up and greet her, but they were all forced back by the icy temperament of Princess Gushe. Everyone could see that Princess","Gushe was adjusting her final state to prepare for this most important battle.","If she lost, she would become the laughing stock and be turned around by a junior. Therefore, everyone understood and did not go forward. They just waited silently.","All of a sudden, everyone felt that Princess Gushe’s aura was slowly increasing. On the phoenix carriage, her aura alone was enough to crush mountains, crack mountains, and change the color of the world.","It was as if a real angel had descended from the heavens.","“How terrifying! ‘","Some people could not help but be secretly surprised. Only a few people present could withstand the suppression of such an aura. The rest had no choice but to raise their own divine power to resist. There were even many people who had no choice but to retreat to avoid being injured by this aura.","“She’s nurturing her aura. When her aura is nurtured to the limit, she’ll be able to kill gods and buddhas in her way!” someone said.","Everyone could see that the reason why Princess Gushe had come earlier was to raise her aura to the extreme. This was the so-called recuperation of energy.","It was just that the commotion caused by her recuperation was too big, and it was a little shocking.","Suddenly, at this moment, two figures appeared in front of everyone.","“Princess Gushe Modern has arrived!” someone shouted when they saw Tang Siyu.","However, they immediately saw Chu Yunfan walking side by side with Tang","Siyu.","“What is it? Is that Jian Wuchen?”","Some people looked at the person who had appeared in front of them in surprise, Wasn’t he the person who had turned the entire Prodigy Battlefield upside down during this period?","“That’s right, it’s him!”","Some people turned pale with fright. One had to know that Chu Yunfan had been extremely ferocious some time ago. He had robbed over a hundred Major Arcanes, causing many people to suffer heavy losses and regret their actions.","Suddenly, a terrifying aura locked onto Chu Yunfan, and the terrifying gazes almost pierced through Chu Yunfan.","During this period of time, Chu Yunfan had been too high-profile and offended too many people, Many people wanted to tear him into pieces.","Those Major Arcanes who were robbed by Chu Yunfan all had the support of supreme beings. Naturally, they wouldn’t let this matter rest so easily.","However, they could not find Chu Yunfan’s whereabouts. They could not deduce Chu Yunfan’s whereabouts just by divination, so they had no choice but to give up.","However, he did not expect Chu Yunfan to reappear on the battlefield where the two generations of Princess Gushe fought.","This immediately aroused the killing intent of many people.","Suddenly, in the crowd, two figures rushed up and charged at Chu Yunfan.","They wanted to kill Chu Yunfan here.","“Strike first! ”","The strength that Chu Yunfan had displayed earlier was only at the level of a middle Major Arcane. Naturally, he was much stronger than any other fledgling Major Arcane. However, compared to them, he was still a far cry from them.","In just two lessons, he had already stepped into the middle Major Arcana.","They had absolute confidence that they could kill Chu Yunfan.","There were plenty of late Major Arcanes and even peak Major Arcanes present. This made them realize that if they didn’t make the first move, they wouldn’t be able to snatch the food from the tiger’s mouth.","Chu Yunfan’s emperor inheritance was something that many people were envious of, and the wealth he had robbed from so many experts had made countless people go crazy.","One of them opened his mouth and roared, and a terrifying sword light slashed out like a celestial river.","Wherever the sword light passed, the sky cracked. Even the world seemed to be about to collapse on the spot under this terrifying attack.","This was a terrifying prodigy of the sword, a supreme existence among the demons. The sword light seemed to borrow the power of heaven and earth to sweep away all powerful enemies.","Chu Yunfan looked coldly at the two people who were charging at him and sneered. “How dare you act so presumptuously in front of me!”","He no longer concealed his aura and faintly released some of it. It gave people the feeling that he was like a divine mountain, towering and steep, majestic and tall.","Even the shocking sword light that the other party had slashed out couldn’t shake Chu Yunfan.","This sword was like the end of the world. It made the sky tremble, but it couldn’t cut into Chu Yunfan’s body.","At the same time, Chu Yunfan simply pointed out with a finger. This finger carried blue lightning and instantly hit the supreme prodigy of the demons.","The supreme demon screamed when he saw the prodigy. His body instantly shattered and his body was covered in blood. In an instant, he turned into a bloody mist and died miserably in Chu Yunfan’s hands.","All of this happened too fast, so fast that the other figure who attacked at the same time didn’t have time to react. His speed was also very fast. His fist was like a mountain, pressing down on Chu Yunfan. The fist force was vast and endless, which was really rare.","However, Chu Yunfan’s punch shattered his fist.."]},{"number":2179,"title":"Chapter 2179: Late Major Arcana!","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan’s punch shattered the fist of the attacking prodigy.","That person was sent flying. His entire arm had actually already cracked inch by inch.","“You’re just a bunch of clowns. You can’t even withstand a single blow. How dare you appear in front of me!”","Chu Yunfan’s expression was extremely cold. His robe fluttered in the wind, like a god from Heaven.","Everything had happened too suddenly, and no one had the time to react. Two powerful Major Arcanes had only exchanged a single blow, yet one of them had been killed and the other heavily injured. It was simply too shocking.","Updɑted on BοX?0VEL.cοm","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan attacked again. He grabbed at the air and the power of lightning turned into a sword. The sword light slashed out a terrifying light that was 30,000 feet long. In an instant, half of the man’s body was cut and instantly exploded. The remaining half of the body was taken away by Chu Yunfan. It seemed that he would not be able to survive.","Things had changed too quickly. Many people had not reacted at all. It had actually developed to such an extent.","In fact, many people thought that it would be a piece of cake for these two to deal with Chu Yunfan. However, the truth was that these two were killed by","Chu Yunfan in a single move.","He was too strong!","‘Jian Wuchen’s strength has increased again?’ Many people couldn’t help but have this thought. In their opinion, this was the only possibility.","However, it had only been a short time since he had broken through to the Major Arcana, and he had already reached such a level. If he was given a little more time, just how much more could he have reached?","Even in the Prodigy Battlefield where prodigies and monstrous prodigies were everywhere, such a growth rate was still very shocking.","Many people still remembered that when Chu Yunfan first entered the battlefield, he was only a Minor Arcane. Now, even a Major Arcane was no match for him.","Even in the Prodigy Battlefield, everyone’s improvement speed was very fast, but this speed was really too shocking.","“Hmph, how dare you kill people in front of us!”","All of a sudden, another powerful being made his move, A late Major Arcane struck out in an instant. He stretched out a huge hand and grabbed toward Chu Yunfan as if he wanted to kill him.","“They are just clowns. So what if they’re killed?” Chu Yunfan sneered. He did not move, but the terrifying aura on his body was as majestic as a divine mountain.","He made his move. He pointed out with his finger, and wherever his fingertip passed, everything was completely shattered. The terrifying palm that was grabbing over was broken by his finger, turning into a rain of light that filled the sky.","Rumble!","The entire world was shaking violently. This was a terrifying battle, a battle between Major Arcanes.","“What?” Many people were shocked. Chu Yunfan could even fight against such a terrifying late Major Arcane? What kind of shocking strength was this?","This was completely out of everyone’s expectations. After all, when Chu Yunfan was able to kill a middle Major Arcane so easily, it had already shocked many people.","Now that he had actually displayed the ability to fight against a late Major Arcane, everyone could not help but feel their jaws drop.","“He’s actually so monstrous? The strongest Supreme Youth? We can’t let him grow! ”","At this time, a few of the Supreme Youths in the crowd flashed a cold expression. The current Chu Yunfan already had the strength to make them look askance. They could not let him continue to grow. Otherwise, what would happen?","All of a sudden, the late Major Arcane jumped out. It was a young man who looked to be in his thirties. He was dressed in a luxurious robe and looked extremely wealthy.","His attack seemed to shake the world. It was many times stronger than the two people who had attacked just now.","“Arrogant junior, who do you think you are? Where do you think you are standing? The young man sneered.","In an instant, countless wood spirit power surged out, transforming into an endless forest. In this place where it was absolutely impossible for trees to grow, the surrounding 100 miles turned into a boundless forest. This forest turned into an ancient array, drowning the entire world.","“What a terrifying power! What a terrifying array!’","Many people’s hearts were pounding with fear. This was an ancient killing array. In his hands, it displayed an extremely shocking power.","Chu Yunfan was now trapped in it, and it was not something that Chu Yunfan could break out of.","Everyone could not help but fall silent. Seeing that Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu were already submerged in the endless array, they could not help but be shocked.","It was shocking.","“He actually managed to do it! To think that he could conjure such a Wood Spirit Array with the power of wood spirit at such a fast speed! This is too terrifying! I’m afraid that he’s not too far away from being a peak Major Arcane!” someone said.","However, as soon as his voice fell, a terrifying sword light tore apart","everything in the array. In an instant, this terrifying array was torn apart from the middle.","Following which, the sword light slashed toward the late Major Arcane.","The late Major Arcane could not react in time at all. He was struck by the sword, and half of his body was torn apart in the air, his flesh and blood splattering everywhere.","The late Major Arcane screamed out in pain as half of his body was sliced into pieces. He almost died on the spot. However, even though he hadn’t died on the spot, he was already close to dying.","His eyes were filled with disbelief. In fact, if he hadn’t suddenly felt a sense of danger and dodged it, he would have been split into two by the sword light from the middle, and his head would have been chopped to death.","“Not good, save him!”","At this moment, someone at the side seemed to have realized something and hurriedly shouted.","Judging from Chu Yunfan’s unrestrained attack just now, it was obvious that he had no fear at all and attacked as he said.","However, there was no way they could make it in time. Another blue lightning bolt swept across the sky, instantly piercing through the head of this late Major Arcane.","Splat!","The late Major Arcane’s head was like a watermelon that had been blown up, turning into a rain of blood that filled the sky.","The world was dead silent.","Many people finally realized that Chu Yunfan was different from what they had imagined. He dared to kill people.."]},{"number":2180,"title":"Chapter 2180: On the Verge of Exploding","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This was a little different from the impression many people had before. In fact, during this time, Chu Yunfan could be said to have caused a huge commotion in the entire Prodigy Battlefield, robbing hundreds of prodigies in one go.","This caused the hundreds of prodigies to suffer heavy losses, but it also made many people reach a rigid impression. It seemed that Chu Yunfan did not dare to kill people and only dared to force others to surrender.","But now, Chu Yunfan had shattered their fantasies with this sword!","Not only did Chu Yunfan dare to attack, but his decisiveness far exceeded their imagination. It was as if there was no one he did not dare to kill.","“How did he cultivate? How can he be so terrifying? He’s like a veteran Major Arcane who has cultivated for countless years!” someone couldn’t help but say in shock.","Updɑted on BοX?0VEL.cοm","“His strength is like reaching the heavens in a single step to reach such a level! He’s simply a freak!”","Many people couldn’t believe it. Chu Yunfan’s speed of improvement made them feel like they had lived a worthless life. Otherwise, how could their cultivation be so slow?","“There are rumors that he was the strongest Supreme Youth in the central region of the Prodigy Battlefield. I used to think that it was nothing much. After all, that was only the central region of the Prodigy Battlefield. No matter how strong he was, he was just a monkey in a mountain without a tiger. But now, I feel that perhaps that rumor is not wrong!” someone said in disbelief.","Just as Chu Yunfan was about to kill the late Major Arcane, another figure stepped out. It was a young marine folk who looked to be around 16 or 17 years old. His eyes were cold and filled with killing intent.","His aura locked onto Chu Yunfan, so powerful that it made people tremble.","He was definitely one of the purest members of the marine folks. Compared to the many experts of the marine folks that Chu Yunfan had killed before, he was much stronger.","“A late Major Arcane! ”","Chu Yunfan could instantly determine the cultivation state of this marine folk youth. In terms of cultivation state, he was a late Major Arcane. However, his actual combat strength was at least twice as strong as the late Major Arcane from before.","The absolute difference in combat strength between the two of them made it seem that they were not on the same level, but that there was a difference of at least one level in combat strength.","However, Chu Yunfan was certain that they were indeed of the same cultivation level. The reason why there was such a huge difference in their battle prowess was because the late Major Arcane from before was just an ordinary prodigy, while this marine folk youth before him was a Supreme","Youth.","“A Supreme Youth? Interesting!” Chu Yunfan grinned. It was as if the malice of the crowd could not pose any threat to him in front of everyone.","There was no doubt that this was a Supreme Youth of the marine folks. In terms of strength, there was no doubt about it.","It could be said that he was the strongest marine folk Chu Yunfan had ever met. However, he did not know which lineage of royal marine folk family he belonged to.","This was because the royal family of the marine folks was divided into many factions. The Sea Prince, who was killed by Chu Yunfan, was one of the rising stars.","However, the difference between the Sea Prince and this marine folk youth was simply too great.","If this marine folk youth wanted to kill the Sea Prince, he could crush the Sea Prince with just a finger.","The difference in bloodline and physique made it so that even if the Sea Prince grew to his limit, he still did not have the qualifications to compete with this marine folk youth.","“Too many clowns have appeared, and I’m no longer interested. However, if it’s a Supreme Youth, he’s qualified enough for me to make a move,” Chu Yunfan said calmly.","“How arrogant!” The marine folk youth looked at Chu Yunfan with a cold expression. He held a blood-red trident in his hand. He looked very special. He looked like a demon god from hell and began to emit a monstrous power.","“Come here and accept your death!” the marine folk youth said coldly.","After this marine folk youth was about to attack, the other Supreme Youths also stopped in their tracks. They did not intend to compete with this marine folk youth for the opportunity to kill Chu Yunfan.","“A Supreme Youth battle! It’s another Supreme Youth battle!” Many prodigies felt that they were about to suffocate. One had to know that this was a Supreme Youth battle.","There were only a few Supreme Youths present. The rest were mostly top-notch prodigies and some ordinary prodigies.","To them, Supreme Youths were existences that could be seen but could not be reached.","Even with their strength and talent, it was not easy to see a battle between Supreme Youths.","“Jian Wuchen has the reputation of being the strongest Supreme Youth, but that’s Hai Wuya of the marine folks. He’s a Supreme Youth of the marine folks. In his era, he suppressed the prodigies of the humans, demons, and other powerful races on the land by himself. He killed his way through the world and no one dared to claim to be supreme!”","“That’s right. I’ve heard of Hai Wuya’s name before. He’s known as the most talented prince of the marine folks in a thousand years. However, after his bloodline was overthrown and someone succeeded in seizing his power, he disappeared. I thought he was secretly executed atter his regime was overthrown. I didn’t expect to see him here again!” a prodigy from the monsters said. His eyes were filled with fear as he looked at Hai Wuya. His era was quite close to Hai Wuya’s era, so he knew how terrifying Hai Wuya was.","It was precisely because of this that he was particularly wary of Hai Wuya’s existence.","However, there were also many people who felt relieved. No matter which Supreme Youth it was, they were not ordinary people. They must have shocking backgrounds and illustrious military achievements.","The only person who violated this rule was probably Jian Wuchen, who had appeared out of nowhere.","“Wait!","Just as the two sides were about to engage in another battle between the Supreme Youths, Princess Gushe, who had been silent in the phoenix carriage, spoke. Her voice was cold and pleasant to the ears, but there was a hint of resistance in her tone.","Princess Gushe came between the two of them and said, “Everyone, you seem to have forgotten that today is the battle between me and Tang Siyu. No matter what kind of grudges you have, it will be after the battle between me and her. At that time, 1 have no objections if you want to fight to the death!","But for now, please show me some respect!”","Her gaze swept between Chu Yunfan and Hai Wuya as if she would deal with whoever did not agree.","“Since the princess has spoken, I will respect you and let him live a little longer!’","A moment later, Hai Wuya broke the silence and spoke first.."]},{"number":2181,"title":"Chapter 2181: The Battle Between Supreme Youths","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Hai Wuya’s expression was calm, and his gaze was cold. It was as if defeating Chu Yunfan was just a simple matter.","“Let me live a little longer?” Chu Yunfan’s lips curled into a cold smile. It was still uncertain who would let who live longer.","“It’s fine. Let me deal with her first before you attack!” Tang Siyu said.","Hearing Tang Siyu’s words, everyone’s expression changed slightly. Even now, Tang Siyu did not show any weakness. On the contrary, she became even more domineering. It could even be said that her dominance was somewhat unexpected.","“What big words!” Princess Gushe slowly said.","Updɑted on BοX?0VEL.cοm","On the other side, Tang Siyu only sneered and said, “Who do you think you are? Do you think defeating you is a big deal?”","Who do you think you are?","Who could say such words?","One had to know that Princess Gushe was a Supreme Youth. Even the Supreme Youths present had to admit that Princess Gushe’s strength and talent were not inferior to theirs in the slightest. She might even be an existence who could reach enlightenment in the future.","They could feel Tang Siyu’s confidence. It was completely beyond their imagination. She was like a dormant war dragon.","It wasn’t that the crowd didn’t think that Tang Siyu would be able to reach this stage. It was just that this situation had been set up by Princess Gushe from the very beginning, and Tang Siyu was just passively accepting the challenge.","Under such circumstances, Tang Siyu’s strength should not be bad. Otherwise, she would not have let Princess Gushe start harvesting. However, since Princess Gushe was so confident, her chances of winning were naturally higher than Tang Siyu’s.","But looking at Tang Siyu’s expression, it seemed that she had no idea that she had become a whetstone.","Many people were puzzled. However, no matter what, many of them could not help but retreat silently. Even though they were all Major Arcanes who had gone through thousands of battles and crushed an entire era and were considered the absolute prodigies of a certain era, in the face of the battle between Tang Siyu and Princess Gushe, they had to watch the battle carefully. They might even die. This was something that they had never seen before,","Hearing Tang Siyu’s words, Princess Gushe merely raised her eyebrows. Her beautiful eyes seemed to shoot out a shocking sword light that pierced through the void and suppressed one’s divine soul.","The rest of the people stepped aside and formed a battlefield for them.","As for Chu Yunfan, he had also retreated to the side, He could feel that many terrifying auras were locking onto him from all directions. Even though Chu Yunfan had displayed an astonishing strength just now, easily taking out a late Major Arcane terrifying existence, there was more than one Supreme Youth present. To these Supreme Youths, Chu Yunfan was nothing to be afraid of.","If it wasn’t for the fact that this was a battle that would determine the outcome of the two generations of Princess Gushe, many people would have","taken action on the spot.","However, even though they didn’t make a move now, they still enveloped Chu Yunfan with an absolute aura. It was as if all his escape routes were locked in an instant, making him unable to retreat.","Chu Yunfan crossed his arms and looked relaxed as if he didn’t know that he was being held back by these Supreme Youths.","Everyone was secretly surprised. Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu were more confident than the other as if they did not take the threat of the others to heart at all.","Many people were even more curious about the relationship between Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu.","One had to know that the two of them were famous for being alone in the Prodigy Battlefield. Other than Tang Siyu who had some contact with the imperial family of the Grand Xia Alliance and could be considered an expert of the Grand Xia Alliance, Chu Yunfan had always been alone and had never joined any alliance.","Naturally, there was no way for others to see through his background.","However, no one had time to think about it, because at this moment, Princess Gushe had already made her move.","A powerful aura swept out in all directions like a river bursting its banks or the sky exploding.","It was Princess Gushe who had attacked!","“So strong!’","Many of them could not help but feel their hearts skip a beat. They could not even imagine how powerful Princess Gushe was when she attacked. She was way stronger than the late Major Arcane from before.","“Is this a Supreme Youth? As expected, she’s unimaginably powerful. She’s completely different from top-notch prodigies like us!” a top-notch prodigy could not help but mutter to himself. Whether he was willing to believe it or not, he had to admit that some people were indeed far above them.","Even the Supreme Youths who were originally high and mighty could not help but widen their eyes. With her strength, Princess Gushe could be on par with them or slightly weaker than them. However, they all had emperor physiques and were all Supreme Youths. There was no fundamental difference.","In the future, they could catch up to her at any time and be on equal footing with her.","As for Hai Wuya, he was watching this battle and seemed to be thinking about the feasibility of nurturing an opponent like this.","This powerful aura became more and more intense and swept out continuously. Many prodigies in the distance could not help but retreat. Their faces were pale and they even staggered a little. Their faces were filled with fear as if they had seen a ghost.","The terrifying killing intent surged like a tidal wave, causing the space to tremble violently.","When this killing intent swept over Tang Siyu, she seemed to not feel it at all. It was as if a breeze had brushed past her face and she was not moved at all.","“You forced me to this point. Didn’t you want to raise me like a parasite and then turn me into nourishment for your progress?” Tang Siyu said coldly. Her eyes were calm as she saw through everything. “If you hadn’t cultivated for a few years, I would have killed you as easily as uprooting weeds!”","Everyone’s heart was pounding. It was not that Tang Siyu did not understand, but she still did not lose her courage. This was the most rare thing.","However, they were still not optimistic about Tang Siyu’s chances. After all, she was fighting passively, and the situation was in the hands of others.","“Cut the crap. I want to see how many moves you can take from me. Don’t disappoint me!” Princess Gushe’s gaze was calm. In her eyes, Tang Siyu was already a dead person.","She had chosen the perfect timing to make Tang Siyu strong enough, but not so strong that she could threaten herself.","Everything had been calculated. How could she allow Tang Siyu to turn the tables?","The phoenix carriage under her feet emitted a dazzling light. The rainbow light turned into a rain of light that filled the sky and shook the entire sky.."]},{"number":2182,"title":"Chapter 2182: If You Go Too Fast, You Will Trip","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This was definitely not an ordinary chariot. On the contrary, this phoenix chariot was an extremely powerful magic tool. It was found in a certain inheritance she obtained when she was young. It was a magic tool left behind by a very powerful female cultivator in ancient times.","It had accompanied her in the war until now and was invincible!","The Nine-Headed Phoenix on the chariot was crying, emitting a supreme aura among birds, incomparably violent.","Many prodigies outside the battlefield couldn’t help but change their expressions. Just a single phoenix carriage was enough to make many people feel that they couldn’t contend against it. If Princess Gushe were to make a move, what kind of shocking existence would she be?","“Although I know it’s fake, I still feel that the Nine-Headed Phoenix is real!” someone exclaimed.","Updɑted on BοX?0VEL.cοm","“If it really is a carriage pulled by a Nine-Headed Phoenix, then the value of this phoenix carriage is immeasurable! I’m afraid it can even fight the emperors! ”","Many people felt fear in their hearts, and they only felt a chill run down their spines.","In an instant, the phoenix carriage swept across the sky, leaving a long trail of rainbow light behind it. It swept across the sky in an instant, sweeping through everything and heading straight for Tang Siyu.","While many people were waiting to see how Tang Siyu would respond, four phantoms suddenly appeared around her and surrounded her.","The phoenix carriage that was charging straight at them crashed into the four phantoms. It could not break through the four phantoms, but it caused a terrifying explosion.","Boom!","The two sides were like comets crashing into the earth, and the sky shook. It was terrifying to the extreme. The terrifying light formed by the collision of the two sides turned into a rain of light that scattered in all directions.","Immediately after, layer after layer of battle shockwaves spread out, sweeping in all directions. Almost everyone was about to be blasted into pieces. There were only a few people present who could still stand steadily.","“What’s that?” someone exclaimed.","The four phantoms around Tang Siyu were not shattered. On the contrary, they became clearer and clearer.","“Those are the True Four Guardians Spirits! It is indeed the Heavenly","Guardians Sealing Array. I have heard that Tang Siyu relied on this Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array to escape the pursuit of Princess Gushe several times!” Someone took a look and immediately recognized what the four phantoms were.","The Azure Dragon, White Tiger, Vermilion Bird, and Black Tortoise surrounded Tang Siyu. The True Four Guardians Spirits formed the Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array, protecting her within.","The phoenix chariot and the Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array kept clashing in the sky. Terrifying auras were destroying each other, emitting a terrifying aura that made everyone shudder.","Princess Gushe was not surprised that her attack was blocked. She had fought with Tang Siyu so many times. If Tang Siyu did not even have this bit of ability, she would not have been chosen to be her whetstone. Tang Siyu would have died in her hands long ago.","Princess Gushe leaped up from the phoenix carriage, her body emitting a colorful glow. The dense mist from the steamer made her look like a angel from the sky, covering the sky and sweeping across the world.","Tang Siyu was not any worse. Her body also emitted waves of cold jade light.","Boom!","The collision between the two of them was like the collision of two incomparably huge stars, tearing apart the sky.","In a short period, the two of them had already exchanged more than a hundred moves. The sky was blasted open again and again.","Everyone was dumbfounded. “This is too scary! The powers of these two are definitely late Major Arcana! They’re only half a step away from the peak Major Arcana! ”","“l don’t find it strange that Princess Gushe has such strength. Her strength was originally like this. However, Princess Gushe Modern is a little too strong. She is so young, yet she has such combat strength!”","Many people recalled Tang Siyu’s words. If they were of similar cultivation age, Tang Siyu could kill Princess Gushe as easily as pulling out weeds.","Previously, they thought that she was bragging, but now that they looked at it, it might not be bragging.","With Tang Siyu’s strength, it was not surprising that she could really do it!","If she was given a few more years, if she had cultivated for as long as Princess Gushe, she might really be able to kill Princess Gushe easily.","Many people couldn’t help but wonder why there were so many prodigies in this generation. First, there was Jun Tianci, and then there was Tang Siyu. Each of them hadn’t cultivated for long, but they had all erupted with astonishing combat strength.","Was it really as Jun Tianci said, ancient or not?","The sky continued to explode, and endless winds were blown up. Both sides were launching an astonishing battle.","However, this balance of power was quickly broken. Tang Siyu became more and more powerful the more she fought. On the other side, Princess Gushe’s beautiful face was cold and seemed to be a little solemn.","However, all of this was within her expectations. If Tang Siyu was so easy to defeat, she would not have chosen Tang Siyu as her target.","“You’re just so-so. You raised me like a parasite to be your whetstone. Didn’t you think that if you go too fast, you will trip?” Tang Siyu said loudly. Her voice pierced through the dense fog and the rain of light that filled the sky, reaching everyone’s ears.","“l originally wanted to see what other trump cards you had, but I didn’t expect you to be so weak. You’ve cultivated for so long and all your cultivation has been spent on nothing!” Tang Siyu’s voice became colder and colder, but there was a hint of pleasure in it.","After such a long time, she had been constantly suppressed ever since she entered the Prodigy Battlefield. Now, she had finally turned the tables and let out a fierce sigh.","Suddenly, just as Tang Siyu finished speaking, before everyone could see what was happening, the sky suddenly exploded. It was Tang Siyu who had made her move. With a simple palm strike, the crystalline palm struck down and the sky collapsed.","This palm passed through everything at an astonishing speed and instantly landed on Princess Gushe.","Princess Gushe was shocked. She had fought with Tang Siyu for more than a hundred rounds and had thought that she had already figured out Tang Siyu’s strength. At most, she was only on par with her.","Who would have thought that Tang Siyu would suddenly change the intensity of her attack? The power was far stronger than before.","Bam!","This palm hit her chest accurately. Princess Gushe screamed and her body flew out like a kite with a broken string.","Spurt!","Princess Gushe coughed up a mouthful of blood. She was severely injured and she fell into the mountain range below. Like a comet hitting the earth, a huge hole was created. With her body as the center, cracks spread out for more than ten kilometers.."]},{"number":2183,"title":"Chapter 2183: A Massive Shock","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This shocking turn of events shocked everyone present!","This scene might have been in their imagination, but it should be the opposite.","They could all guess that this was a trap set up by Princess Gushe and that she was using Tang Siyu as a whetstone. Therefore, they almost subconsciously felt that Princess Gushe was the one who wanted to be stronger.","Although there was no lack of people who could turn the tables since ancient times, there were too few such people. Otherwise, it would not be called a miracle.","There were still too few people like that!","But now, reality had given them a big slap in the face. Tang Siyu was even stronger than Princess Gushe. It was simply unbelievable.","“This is an absolute suppression of strength. If Princess Gushe doesn’t have any other tricks up her sleeve, I’m afraid it will be difficult to turn the tables!” a prodigy said in shock.","Before this, he would never have believed such a scene.","However, even he could see that there was no trickery in this. It was purely a","crushing power.","A Supreme Youth narrowed his eyes and said, “If Princess Gushe is only at this level, then I would be very disappointed. She set up such a trap, but in the end, someone else turned the tables. She is simply a laughing stock for the ages!”","“How is this possible?” Princess Gushes eyes widened as if she had seen a ghost. She had clearly calculated Tang Siyu’s strength. Although she would not be able to easily crush Tang Siyu, she was confident that she could kill her.","Who would have thought that Tang Siyu would give her a huge surprise the moment they met!","Tang Siyu’s expression remained unchanged. Under normal circumstances, this battle would indeed be a bitter one for her.","Even if she tried her best, she would not be able to achieve such an effect. However, everything had changed!","“Use your full strength. Otherwise, you won’t have a chance,” Tang Siyu said with a calm expression, but the arrogance in her words was shocking.","Many people could tell that the absolute confidence in Tang Siyu’s words was definitely not faked.","‘Could it be that this is not her full strength?’ someone thought in shock.","There were even some people who were secretly speculating what trump card Tang Siyu had that she was actually so impressive.","When Princess Gushe heard this, she immediately frowned and her gaze turned cold. This high and mighty attitude made her extremely uncomfortable.","Once upon a time, she thought that the person who was so high and mighty should be herself, not Tang Siyu.","“Very well.” Princess Gushe gritted her teeth. “Since you want to see it, I’ll fulfill your wish!”","Princess Gushe had a cold smile on her face. The divine power on her body boiled, and she threw away all her previous embarrassment.","Boom!","A power that was nearly twice as powerful as Princess Gushe’s earlier burst was released.","Princess Gushe’s robe fluttered in the wind. She was expressionless, like an empress conquering the world.","Many people could not help but be dumbfounded when they saw this scene. So this was Princess Gushe’s hidden strength.","If she was only a late Major Arcane before this, then she was practically one foot into the peak Major Arcana now.","She had already stepped into this realm. This was the most terrifying thing. Stepping into this realm and not stepping into it were two completely different concepts. They could not be mentioned in the same breath.","At this moment, Princess Gushe had a monstrous divine might on her body. In an instant, she charged in Tang Siyu’s direction.","It was just one person, but she had actually killed her way out with the might of a thousand troops. It had the smell of golden spears and iron horses.","Boom!","A terrifying aura rushed toward Tang Siyu. It was an ordinary tidal wave that covered the sky and earth.","However, Tang Siyu was unflustered. She displayed a set of punch techniques as if she had transformed into a celestial being from Heaven. Her posture was elegant as if she was dancing.","“I’ve seen this punch technique before. It’s the punch technique that the Elder Princess of Grand Xia once used! Princess Gushe Modern is actually the Eldest Princess’ successor?” a top-notch prodigy said with his mouth agape as if he was completely in disbelief.","After this reminder, everyone finally remembered that there was once a woman who had stunned them with her shocking strength.","However, unlike them who chose to seal themselves, that woman was now one of the top experts in the world that even they had to look up to.","While they were still discussing, the two Princess Gushes .had already collided on the battlefield.","Princess Gushe had the intent realm of the Golden Axe Metal Horse. She actually relied on her martial arts intent realm to evolve into a battlefield.","Tang Siyu was different. The punch technique she displayed was like an angel Heaven, landing on the mortal world and the battlefield.","In an instant, the two sides collided fiercely. To everyone’s surprise, the angel shattered the battlefield with a single punch. She had an invincible might.","Spurt!","Princess Gushe’s martial intent realm was broken and she suffered a terrible backlash. She immediately spat out a mouthful of blood and her face was pale. She was obviously seriously injured.","Her martial intent realm was broken and she was severely injured. Her entire person was like a kite with a broken string, flying backward.","“This is impossible!” Princess Gushes beautiful face was filled with disbelief and malevolence.","Even now, she still didn’t know what had happened!","Why was everything completely out of her control? It was completely different from what she had imagined.","“You still don’t understand?” Tang Siyu sneered. “My strength is far above yours. I could have killed you in one move, but I didn’t!","“Don’t you like to play this game of cat and mouse? I’ll let you experience what despair is,” Tang Siyu said calmly.","Only now did everyone understand what she was thinking. It was probably to take revenge on Princess Gushe for toying with her like a mouse.","“But I’m no longer interested. You can die in peace!”","Tang Siyu threw a punch. This punch was like an angel descending from Heaven, shaking the entire world.","Princess Gushe felt that the world was so big, but there was no place for her to stay. It was an endless despair.","At this moment, she finally understood the desperate situation that Tang Siyu had faced back then. No, it was even more desperate than that.","“This feeling... A peak Major Arcane!” Princess Gushe’s eyes widened.","She finally understood why she had failed so miserably.. Tang Siyu had actually broken through to the peak Major Arcana! This was a state that she had always dreamed of, a state that she would break through to no matter what!"]},{"number":2184,"title":"Chapter 2184: Peak Major Arcana Battle","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Princess Gushe could clearly sense that Tang Siyu’s current cultivation state was the peak Major Arcana that she had been longing for day and night.","She had been thinking about it day and night, all for the sake of pushing her cultivation base to peak Major Arcana. But now, Tang Siyu had already done it.","What right did she have?","Princess Gushe’s eyes flashed with a shocking light. She seemed to be extremely angry. Why was Tang Siyu able to take this step?","All of this should have been within her control, but reality had given her a hard slap in the face. Since ancient times, she had encountered something that had only been rumored to have overturned.","It was just that those people who failed in the past were mostly like emperors who dared to use emperor physique possessers as whetstones. They didn’t expect emperor physique possessors to grow at such a shocking speed.","However, she was different. She also had an emperor physique, and Tang Siyu also had an emperor physique. How could she fail?","Thinking of this, she gritted her teeth and roared. Her divine power evaporated like a fog. From afar, it looked like a dense immortal aura. In an instant, her combat strength recovered to the peak, and her injuries also recovered.","However, half of her hair had already turned white, Although her face did not change, her eyes suddenly had a hint of vicissitudes.","One could imagine that this should be a forbidden move. It would burn one’s life force and would not be used under normal circumstances. There would be irresolvable side effects. However, at this point, she had nothing to lose.","Princess Gushe’s eyes were cold as she stared at Tang Siyu. “Either I kill you and reach enlightenment, or 1 die here today and become a part of the hero spirits! ”","Hearing Princess Gushe’s words, Tang Siyu could not help but reveal a surprised expression. Then, a cold smile appeared on her face. “Only now can you be my opponent. You were too ugly before!”","The corners of Princess Gushes lips twitched as the aura around her grew increasingly terrifying. She was breaking through her limits continuously, and she was actually going against the flow all the way up to the peak Major Arcana.","This was not a temporary breakthrough, but a true step into this field. However, the price was too great.","She could have smoothly broken through to this step normally, but now she had to use a secret technique to break through to this step—at the cost of burning half of her vitality.","It could be said that this time, she had really suffered a double loss. However, at this point, she absolutely could not give in again. Otherwise, everything would be for naught.","At this moment, she had been forced into a desperate situation. She had burned half of her life force. Perhaps she could make up for it in the future. However, if she was defeated by Tang Siyu, how would she face Tang Siyu in the future?","Therefore, she had no other choice but to kill Tang Siyu in front of her. This obsession was too much and was about to turn into a demon in her heart. Only by killing Tang Siyu could she resolve this obsession.","“A battle between peak Supreme Youths!” a prodigy from afar said in shock. His eyes flickered with shock.","The two of them had both broken through to the peak Major Arcana, and were both Supreme Youths with astonishing legacies. Wasn’t this a battle between peak Supreme Youths?","At least in the battlefield of prodigies, this was the peak.","Tang Siyu was eager to try. Not only did she become Princess Gushe’s inner demon, but on the contrary, Princess Gushe had forced her many times during this period and even almost killed her. She also wanted to kill Princess Gushe.","At this point, both parties wanted to settle their grudges and karma.","“This peak battle is rare in the Prodigy Battlefield!”","“l didn’t expect this. Before this, everyone knew that the two of them were fighting for the chance to enter the peak Major Arcana. That was why they decided to have this duel. Who would have thought that now that they’ve both broken through to Major Arcana and achieved their goal ahead of time, they would still have to fight to the death!”","“Both of them are equally talented and we can’t compare to them. Although Princess Gushe has already burned half of her life force, it should not prevent her from being at her peak state. Princess Gushe Modern should have just entered this realm not long ago. It can be considered a fair battle between the two sides!”","Many prodigies discussed animatedly. Even the Supreme Youths present could not help but cast sidelong glances at them. No matter who won or lost, as long as they survived, they would be the top existences on the Prodigy Battlefield.","“I will kill you!” Princess Gushe laughed loudly. Her laughter was wild and cold as if she was a peerless goddess of death. She had an imposing manner that said that she was the only one in the world.","After stepping into the peak Major Arcana in one go, she had regained her confidence, the confidence that she could fight against all the heroes in the world.","She sat in the phoenix carriage pulled by the Nine-Headed Phoenix. Like a war chariot, it rushed in Tang Siyu’s direction.","At the same time, Tang Siyu’s body also had a shocking divine power that transformed into an immortal fog that spread out, making her look like an angel from Heaven who had descended to the mortal world.","Boom!","In the next instant, both parties clashed against each other viciously. The aura of peak Major Arcanes was unleashed, and the energy waves that were formed from the arcane energy shook the skies, deafening everyone’s ears.","The two of them were too fast. In an instant, they had already traveled hundreds of miles. Peerless fighting spirit spread. The two of them were like two female goddess of war who had awakened.","Many of the prodigies’ faces changed when they saw this scene. Most of them had yet to reach the peak Major Arcana. However, there were quite a few of them who were just one step away from it.","Hence, they felt it the most. Emperor physique possessers were terrifying. It was enough to defeat a king physique possesser in the same level.","Even though a king physique possessor was considered a child of the era, it was still too far away from a terrifying monster like an emperor physique possessor that might not even appear in several eras.","Any one of them could easily kill a large number of them. Even in this place where prodigies were as common as clouds, they could be considered outstanding. If an alliance did not even have a Supreme Youth to guard it, it would undoubtedly be a huge joke.","Even the aftermath of the battle between the two of them was enough to heavily injure them. It was not something they could hope to catch up to.","“A battle at the peak. This is a true battle at the peak!” a Major Arcane said excitedly.","“I’ve gained a lot just by watching such a great battle, but I’m not willing to accept it. I admit that I’ve been talented for thousands of years, but now I’m not as good as these people. Could it be that physique really determines everything?” a top prodigy muttered unwillingly.."]},{"number":2185,"title":"Chapter 2185: Destroying a Supreme Youth With a Finger","paragraphs":["Chapter 2185: Destroying a Supreme Youth With a Finger","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","When these top-notch geniuses who were only a step away from the level of Supreme Youth heard this, they felt a little dejected. In their era, they were invincible existences in the world. Not every era had a Supreme Youth who could crush everything.","Many eras did not have Supreme Youths, and in the absence of Supreme Youths, these top-notch geniuses were the most supreme geniuses. They had always been confident that they could continue to be invincible until they verified their Dao and became emperors, and maybe even fight for the last","immortal and long-lasting godhead.","However, everything changed after they reached the Prodigy Battlefield. Even with their aptitude and talent, although they did not fall to the level of ordinary people, they fell to the mortal world and were no longer high and mighty.","From divine dragons in the sky in the past, they became ants on the ground.","Those Supreme Youths were the ones who could dominate this era. Within the same level, although they had king physiques, they could not withstand the attacks of Supreme Youths.","As for the experts of the same level with ordinary physiques outside, they could not even withstand a single blow from a Supreme Youth.","What was a Supreme Youth? That was the name of many emperors when they were young. No matter which emperor, they were invincible existences in their era. In ancient times, they were supreme existences throughout the world.","If they hadn’t sealed themselve to this era, it was possible to never have met any other Supreme Youths in their lifetime.","At this moment, they could finally understand the despair of ordinary people facing them. How difficult it was for ordinary people to cultivate, but for them, cultivating was as simple as eating and drinking. They could easily break through.","And these emperors were even worse. They could even breakthrough in their","They were not afraid of comparing goods, but they were afraid of comparing people.","Suddenly, just as everyone continued to watch the battle, a blue figure flashed. Then, everyone saw Hai Wuya arrive before Chu Yunfan.","“You’re courting death!” His eyes gleamed as he stared at Chu Yunfan. “Come and accept your death!”","“Can’t you just wait awhile?” Chu Yunfan looked at him and grinned.","“You stole my brother’s spatial bag,” Hai Wuya said coldly, “There’s an emperor scripture of the marine folks in it. Hand it over, and I might be able to leave your corpse intact.”","Chu Yunfan tilted his head and said, “So it’s an incomplete emperor scripture. Do you think I’ll covet it?”","After Hai Wuya’s reminder, Chu Yunfan suddenly remembered that among the many things he had seized, there was indeed an emperor scripture of the marine folks, known as the Ocean Emperor Scripture, but it was only an incomplete version.","There was only a portion of it that had been cultivated to the Major Arcana. The other parts were missing. Or rather, when someone first obtained it, it was already incomplete.","He had obtained too many things like this. Those hundreds of geniuses had obtained hundreds of completely different inheritances. How could an inheritance that could nurture such a top-notch genius be ordinary?","Even though it was not as profound as the ancient marine folks, many cultivation techniques were not inferior to this incomplete Ocean Emperor Scripture.","If it was anyone else, they would definitely feel as if they had obtained a treasure. After all, this was the foundation of many sects and factions for countless years.","This was the fundamental reason why so many people wanted to kill Chu Yunfan. Ordinary resources might not be enough for these people to care about, let alone envy.","However, these various classics and martial arts manuals were enough to make them envious.","However, they didn’t know that Chu Yunfan didn’t care about these ancient books at all. The Mighty Emperor Battle Book in his mind had recorded countless shocking unique skills. There were at least a hundred complete emperor scriptures, all of which were left behind by the emperors who were killed by the Emperor Supreme.","The Emperor Supreme integrated the classics of these experts into himself and created an invincible cultivation technique.","Chu Yunfan already had these emperor scriptures in his mind, and he also had the Mighty Eternal Emperor Method that was above these emperor scriptures. Of course, he didn’t care about these emperor scriptures.","However, these cultivation techniques could still have the effect of improving jade by improving Chu Yunfan’s knowledge. Therefore, for him, the gains were not small, but not as great as many people thought.","For Hai Wuya, this was not the case at all. The Ocean Emperor Scripture was a secret that was not passed down among the marine folks. Even among the royal tribe of the marine folks, only the most talented members could cultivate it.","Only the members of the royal family of the marine folks who possessed the Oceon Emperor Scripture were worthy of being called the royals of the marine folks.","One could imagine how important it was for him to have the Ocean Emperor Scripture wandering outside.","Seeing Chu Yunfan’s disdainful look, Hai Wuya’s eyes became even angrier. “I’ll kill you first!” he said.","Hai Wuya immediately attacked. Azure mana surged around his body, and his figure was like an azure sea dragon. In an instant, he appeared before Chu Yunfan as if he could tear the sky apart. The crimson trident in his hand slashed down fiercely at Chu Yunfan.","Hai Wuya’s speed was simply too fast, and his aura was so overbearing that he could even kill any ordinary peak Major Arcane who wasn’t a prodigy.","The power of this attack could be imagined. In an instant, endless blue light sqrept out, turning into a sea that covered the sky and crushed everything.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at it. He just flipped his sleeve on the spot. Wherever the sleeve passed, the endless blue light disappeared without a trace. It couldn’t cause any damage to Chu Yunfan at all.","The crimson trident fell straight down, but it was grabbed by a jade-like palm. No matter how blood-red light the trident emitted, it could not break free from this palm as if it had encountered its natural nemesis.","“What great strength!” Hai Wuya’s eyes were filled with shock. He had the Ocean Emperor Physique and was an emperor physique possessor. There was once a member of the marine folks who became an emperor because of this. He was one of the best among the marine folks’ many physiques. His strength was also outstanding.","Even an almighty beast king in the deep sea would be easily torn apart by him.","But now, even though he was holding the trident with both hands, he was still unable to suppress Chu Yunfan, who was holding the blood-red trident with one hand.","“Ocean Emperor Physique? That’s all!”","Chu Yunfan only grinned and pointed out with his finger. Suddenly, a terrifying light crossed the sky and pierced through Hai Wuya in an instant.","Boom!","Hai Wuya’s head exploded in the air and turned into a rain of blood that filled the sky. Chu Yunfan grabbed his body and threw it into the Mountain River","Diagram.","Hai Wuya was dead!"]},{"number":2186,"title":"Chapter 2186: Surrounded by Supreme Youths","paragraphs":["Chapter 2186: Surrounded by Supreme Youths","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Powerful! Invincible!","Everyone could not help but have this thought in their minds. What was power? This was power!","What was invincible? This was invincible!","Many people couldn’t help but suck in a breath of cold air. They felt a chill run down their backs. Chu Yunfan’s strength was too shocking. With Hai Wuya’s strength, there weren’t many people present who could defeat him.","Even normal peak Major Arcanes who weren’t prodigies wouldn’t be a match for him.","However, when Hai Wuya faced Chu Yunfan, he was so vulnerable that he could kill him with a single finger.","Everyone understood the meaning behind this.","This meant that another giant was about to rise in the Prodigy Battlefield. What was even more terrifying was that there was no limit to the growth of this giant. This was the most terrifying thing.","That was because Chu Yunfan was only a Middle Arcane. With a Middle Arcane cultivation base, he could easily kill a Major Arcane. How shocking was that?","There was no longer any possibility for them to advance any further. Even if they were the Supreme Youths, they would only be peak Major Arcanes. There was a limit to how much their powers could grow. Unless they broke through to a whole new level, they would not be able to raise their battle prowess any further.","That had already exceeded the requirements of the Prodigy Battlefield. This was why they kept suppressing their cultivation.","However, Chu Yunfan was different. He was only a Middle Arcane, and he could still grow to a Major Arcane in the future.","The current him was already so terrifying. Once he reached the Major Arcana Stage, there was no doubt that he would be a threat in the future.","At that time, even if they joined forces, they would not be able to escape Chu Yunfan’s attack and would be easily killed.","They did not even dare to imagine such a scene. It was as if a plesiosaur had appeared in a pool of sharks—a monster among monsters.","“We have to kill him before he grows up. Otherwise, we won’t have a future!”","The Supreme Youths’ eyes flashed with a bright light. If it was just because of the inheritance of an emperor or the hundreds of geniuses that Chu Yunfan had robbed, then now it was to kill a terrifying monster that might appear in the future.","There was no need to say anything more. The few Supreme Youths present had already made the same judgment.","They didn’t care who won between Tang Siyu and Princess Gushe. No matter who won or lost, it was just another person who could stand shoulder to shoulder with them.","However, they were determined to kill Chu Yunfan.","“Jian Wuchen, kill yourself and I’ll leave your corpse intact!”","At this moment, a Supreme Youth stood out. This Supreme Youth looked to be only eleven or twelve years old. He was dressed in coarse linen clothes and looked rather shabby. However, his entire body emitted a threatening saber intent. The saber intent swept up into the sky and actually sealed Chu Yunfan from head to toe.","“Saber Child! He actually made a move!” someone exclaimed, “Saber Child looks like he’s only in his teens, but in fact, his physique has changed because he consumed some heavenly and earthly treasures when he was young. Since then, no matter how much his age has changed, his figure has not changed at","“That’s right. I’ve heard of him before. He’s a peerless genius hundreds of years before me. It’s said that he’s a peerless genius in the saber path.","However, he’s different from ordinary Supreme Youths. Ordinary Supreme Youths usually come from wealthy families. However, he’s different. He only relied on one person and one saber to make his invincible reputation. His sect is just a small sect!” another top genius said. His expression was solemn, and he did not look down on this Supreme Youth just because he saw that he was a child.","“Saber Child?” Chu Yunfan had heard others’ comments about Saber Child. His body was full of sword bones, which was similar to Chu Hongcai’s Indestructible Sword Physique.","However, Chu Hongcai’s Indestructible Sword Physique was cultivated after birth, but this Saber Child was born with sword bones. It was as if he was the reincarnation of a treasure saber. His body was filled with a threatening saber aura that didn’t look like a living person but like a human-shaped weapon.","An ordinary person would feel as if their entire body was about to be split into pieces at a glance.","Evidently, Blade Child’s strength was extraordinary. He was one of the strongest among the peak Major Arcanes and was one of the strongest figures in the entire Prodigy Battlefield.","He should be one of the strongest.","And now, such an expert had locked onto him with his entire body’s aura. Just by relying on that astonishing saber intent, it was enough to make ordinary people lose all their fighting spirit.","Chu Yunfan said calmly, “It seems that you are not the only one who wants to kill me. Who else is there? Come out and let me see who else is there.’","“Jian Wuchen, even though Brother Saber alone is enough to kill you, I can’t be too careful with a scourge like you. Count me in!”","At this moment, a cold voice sounded. A young man in a white robe stood up. This young man had a handsome face and eyes like stars. He looked handsome and extraordinary. In addition, he was dressed in luxurious clothes and held a folding fan in his hand. He looked like an elegant young master.","The only thing he didn’t look like was a martial artist.","However, Chu Yunfan could feel a terrifying aura from the white-robed youth’s body. Although it was well suppressed by him, Chu Yunfan could still feel the terrifying aura that was like a volcano that was about to erupt.","“It’s Master Hundred Flower, the legendary young master of Hundred Flower Palace. Hundred Flower Palace is too mysterious. Even in the distant times, it was still a mysterious legend. It is said that there will only be one successor in each generation of Hundred Flower Palace, and each successor is a peerless master. I don’t know how many goddesses have become their followers and admirers. However, these successors of Hundred Flower Palace appear in a hurry and disappear suddenly in each generation. I didn’t expect that even he couldn’t help but attack Jian Wuchen!” Someone recognized this young master. He was the legendary young master of the Hundred Flower Palace.","“But speaking of which, this Jian Wuchen is way too terrifying. He’s only a Middle Arcane, yet he’s able to defeat us Major Arcanes. That’s just too terrifying! ‘","“Jian Wuchen, it’s impossible for you not to die today!”","Suddenly, someone appeared behind Chu Yunfan and blocked his path of retreat.","Everyone looked over. It was a man in an ancient military uniform. He was dressed in an iron robe and held an iron spear in his hand. He looked like he was on a punitive expedition.","However, this square-faced young man was not wearing the military uniform of Grand Xia, but the military uniform of an even more ancient dynasty.."]},{"number":2187,"title":"Chapter 2187: Still Smiling at the Brink of Death","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Obviously, this was not a general from Grand Xia, but a general from an ancient dynasty before Grand Xia. His body also carried a boundless will of conquest. The golden spears and iron horses seemed to have pulled the world back to the battlefield of conquest.","Boundless blood and boundless killing intent fused together, turning into a terrifying killing intent.","Obviously, this young general had used his full strength from the beginning and his killing intent toward Chu Yunfan was the deepest.","However, the background of this ancient young general was too mysterious.","None of the prodigies present recognized this young general. They could only judge from his military uniform that he was not a general of the current generation.","There were some dynasties before Grand Xia. Among them, there were countless peerless geniuses and Supreme Youths from the military. Even those who had seen and experienced many things didn’t know who this person was.","The three Supreme Youths surrounded Chu Yunfan. The three of them had unintentionally formed the Three Talents Formation, trapping Chu Yunfan within.","With their strength, any one of them was enough to run amok on the Prodigy Battlefield. Now, the three of them had joined forces to target Chu Yunfan. In the past, they would have disdained to do this with their pride, but now they had joined forces. One could imagine how much they feared Chu Yunfan.","“Oh no!”","In the sky, Tang Siyu, who was fighting with Princess Gushe, caught a glimpse of the three of them attacking Chu Yunfan.","“Bullying the few with numbers! Despicable!”","Tang Siyu wanted to pull out and help, but Princess Gushe would never give her the chance. She only sneered and said, “If you want to pull out, you have to see if I’ll let you. Today, I’ll make you watch him die!”","Princess Gushe could see that the three Supreme Youths had joined forces to target Chu Yunfan. In her opinion, Chu Yunfan had no chance of winning. Now, she could use Chu Yunfan’s death to shake Tang Siyu’s will and defeat her.","At this moment, her mind was blinded by hatred. There was only one thing on her mind, and that was to tear Tang Siyu into pieces.","“Get lost!”","Tang Siyu’s palm struck Princess Gushe. Sparks flew out from her red battle robe as if she had been struck by a long sword countless times.","The surrounding space was collapsing and splitting into countless pieces.","However, in the face of such a peerless cultivation technique, Princess Gushe had blood flowing out of the corner of her mouth. She was not seriously injured and only had some light injuries. Under her secret technique, she recovered in a moment.","She firmly blocked Tang Siyu’s footsteps, making it impossible for her to save Chu Yunfan.","“If you want to get past me, you will have to step over my dead body!” Princess Gushe sneered. She had finally realized that the originally fearless Tang Siyu had one more weakness. This mysterious and terrifyingly talented Chu Yunfan was her biggest weakness.","If she had discovered it earlier, she could have used it to deal with her. It was such a pity.","“Stubborn! You’re courting death!”","Tang Siyu saw that she couldn’t get through, so she couldn’t care less about Chu Yunfan. She gritted her teeth and attacked Princess Gushe.","At the same time, the battle between Chu Yunfan and the others below them erupted.","The three Supreme Youths were all peak Major Arcanes. They were much stronger than Hai Wuya.","Any one of them was an opponent that Hai Wuya would need all his strength to escape. Although they were all Supreme Youths, the difference in strength between them was just that big.","Chu Yunfan was extraordinary. He was able to kill Hai Wuya with a single finger. Compared to these Supreme Youths, he could be said to be very close.","The four of them fought. In an instant, the entire sky collapsed. Many geniuses retreated frantically. The battle between the four of them was much more terrifying than the battle between the two Princess Gushes.","They didn’t even dare to get close. Otherwise, the aftershocks of the four people’s battle might kill them.","The core of the four-man battlefield had turned into a terrifying hurricane that tore everything apart. Even if everyone used their divine wills to capture it, it was difficult to see what was happening in the middle of the battle. “It’s such a pity for Jian Wuchen. He had a chance to reach the top!’","“So what? Don’t tell me we’ve seen too few talented people who died in the end. Haven’t we killed talented geniuses before?”","“He appeared too early, and at the same time, he’s too arrogant. If it weren’t for so many Supreme Youths wanting to kill him, I’m afraid he might not have been able to take him down by himself!”","“Three Supreme Youths. I’m afraid no one can resist such a lineup on the Prodigy Battlefield! ”","Everyone discussed animatedly, but their eyes kept rolling, trying to catch the figures fighting. However, the speed of the four was too fast. Even if they opened their heavenly eye, they could not catch them with their divine wills.","Suddenly, at this time, a figure fell out of the hurricane, Everyone looked closely and saw that it was Chu Yunfan.","Spurt!","Chu Yunfan spat out a mouthful of blood, but he only looked a little embarrassed. Obviously, he had suffered some losses under the joint efforts of the three Supreme Youths.","“Hahaha, this is great! It’s been a long time since I’ve had such a great battle!” To everyone’s surprise, not only did Chu Yunfan not show any signs of decline, but he even revealed a somewhat ecstatic smile.","“Is he crazy?”","“You’re about to die, yet you still dare to be so arrogant?”","“If not, how would he dare to rob hundreds of geniuses at the same time?”","Chu Yunfan stared at the three figures who rushed out of the hurricane. Although he was injured in this series of exchanges, he recovered in a short time with his amazing physique.","At the same time, it also allowed him to gauge the strength of these Supreme Youths. These three were, after all, veteran Supreme Youths. They were slightly stronger than Princess Gushe and Tang Siyu.","However, they did not have an overwhelming advantage over Chu Yunfan.","The three of them had only managed to injure Chu Yunfan slightly. If it had been a one-on-one fight, Chu Yunfan could have easily retreated.","“You’re still smiling at the brink of death!”","Saber Child was the first to rush over. His body was like a treasure saber that had left its body, slashing and shattering everything. There was only boundless destruction in his saber intent.","As the saber fell, the entire sky was split into two, setting off endless airwaves.","Facing this terrifying attack, Chu Yunfan swallowed a pill. He didn’t dodge and slapped out with one hand.","Bam!","When the saber light landed on Chu Yunfan’s arm, the sound of metal clashing and sparks flew everywhere.."]},{"number":2188,"title":"Chapter 2188: Let’s See if Their Lives Are Difficult Enough","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Bam!","The sword light from Saber Child made a sound like metal clashing against Chu Yunfan’s body, but it was unable to break through Chu Yunfan’s defense.","“Hmm?”","Saber Child saw that his attack was ineffective. His eyes moved very quickly, and then his pupils constricted slightly. He saw that his knife did not cut Chu","Yunfan’s skin, but the boiling divine power on Chu Yunfan’s body.","The most terrifying part was that this attack did not manage to cut through Chu Yunfan’s protective divine power!","His saber could even split a city in half. It was even easier to break through protective energy shield, but now it couldn’t even break Chu Yunfan’s protective energy shield.","This divine power was endless. No matter how his saber energy slashed down, it would continue to emerge. Instead, his saber energy was mostly worn down.","Boom!","Before Saber Child could think further, Chu Yunfan’s aura suddenly swept up crazily, like a terrifying pillar of air that soared into the sky. His divine power was like a swimming dragon wandering around his body, and soon turned into a terrifying hurricane.","The terrifying hurricane sent Saber Child, the young general, and Young Master Hundred Flower flying.","“This is?” The young general looked at Chu Yunfan coldly, his eyes filled with disbelief. He still could not believe that Chu Yunfan had such terrifying strength.","“He just swallowed a medicinal pill. Now, the medicinal effects are acting up!’","Young Master Hundred Flower’s expression was grave. He recalled seeing Chu Yunfan swallow a pill just now. Obviously, Chu Yunfan’s sudden outburst was related to the pill he had swallowed.","“But even so, the medicinal properties of his medicinal pill are a little too strong!” The young general still had a look of disbelief.","“You want to kill me? Do you think that’s possible?” Chu Yunfan grinned. “Do you really think I would come here to take the risk without absolute confidence?”","Chu Yunfan’s words caused everyone’s heart to skip a beat, especially when they finally realized what was wrong. Chu Yunfan clearly knew that the entire world was hunting him down, and that there were countless peak Major Arcane Supreme Youths who wanted to kill him.","What right did he have to appear, especially when the difference in strength was huge?","All of this revealed a strange feeling, but they had not thought about it in detail before, and no one had thought in this direction.","Now that Chu Yunfan had pointed it out, their hearts skipped a beat.","“Today, I will use your heads to tell everyone that I’m not someone to be trifled with. If they want to provoke me, let’s see if they’re tough enough!” Chu Yunfan sneered.","“It doesn’t matter. No matter what kind of pill you take, it’s meaningless in front of absolute strength. I don’t believe you can last long!” Saber Child’s small face was cold. He looked like a terrifying human-shaped weapon, not a living person.","“It has nothing to do with you whether you can last long or not, because you will not be able to escape death!” Chu Yunfan grinned. “Little friend, let’s start with you!’","Boom!","In an instant, Chu Yunfan’s boundless divine power swept out. In an instant, it turned into a terrifying power of lightning. His speed was extremely fast. After launching the Prismatic Traveller, he almost felt that time in the world had stopped.","In an instant, it had already swept in front of Saber Child.","Saber Child’s lips were tightly shut, and a terrifying killing intent burst out from his eyes. He suddenly shouted, “Kill!”","A terrifying saber intent burst out from the Saber Child’s hand. The saber intent cut through the entire world and slashed straight at Chu Yunfan. However, Chu Yunfan continued to charge forward in a straight line.","Clang!","Chu Yunfan clenched his fist, and the terrifying fist force turned into a terrifying tornado. Then, he suddenly smashed everything with his fist and hit the long saber.","Immediately after, a terrifying metallic sound swept out, turning into a terrifying flood of sound that destroyed everything.","“Today, you can’t escape death!”","Saber Child roared and kept injecting divine power to cut Chu Yunfan into pieces. However, at this moment, an even more terrifying force pushed back from the saber light and swept into his body.","Spurt!","Saber Child spat out a mouthful of blood. His entire body flew out like a kite with a broken string. His figure could not stand steadily at all.","“So strong!’","Saber Child couldn’t believe that Chu Yunfan’s punch could contain such a terrifying fist force. It almost tore apart everything and shattered everything.","Just as Chu Yunfan was about to continue his pursuit, countless flowers fell from the sky. It was like a world of flowers. It was Young Master Hundred Flower who made a move at the critical moment.","Rumble!","A series of terrifying explosions followed. The world of flowers exploded crazily. Every flower was a terrifying bomb.","A small mushroom cloud rose up, and the terrifyinq aftershock of the explosion swept across the entire battlefield.","Obviously, Young Master Hundred Flower had used all his strength and did not hold back. However, even so, his expression was not relaxed at all because the impression Chu Yunfan had given him was too strong. Even if he was wrapped in the Hundred Flower World, he was not sure that he could easily kill Chu Yunfan.","Around him, an incomparably huge lotus flower protected him from the terrifying explosion.","Sure enough, at this moment, a figure swept out at an astonishing speed. His speed was too fast, so fast that it was like a blue lightning bolt.","“Come down! ”","Chu Yunfan roared and threw a backhand punch. The force of the punch swept across the sky, causing ripples in the sky. It was as if even the plane could not withstand such damage. It was like the wind blowing on the surface of the water, causing crazy fluctuations.","“Oh no!”","Young Master Hundred Flower immediately knew that this was not good. He knew that the probability of killing Chu Yunfan was not high. If Chu Yunfan was so easy to deal with, he would not have been able to stop the three of them just now and would have died long ago.","However, to his surprise, Chu Yunfan was not affected at all. There was no injury on his body at all.","This was the most terrifying part.","His Hundred Flowers World did not pose the slightest threat to Chu Yunfan. Was there anything more terrifying than this?","However, time didn’t allow him to think too much. Chu Yunfan’s punch pierced through the sky and shattered the huge lotus behind Young Master Hundred Flower.","Boom!","The lotus flower shattered, and Young Master Hundred Flower suffered a backlash. He coughed up blood and fell from the sky.."]},{"number":2189,"title":"Chapter 2189: Beating Up Three Supreme Youths Alone","paragraphs":["Chapter 2189: Beating Up Three Supreme Youths Alone","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Everything happened too quickly. Many people didn’t even have time to react before they saw the two Supreme Youths being sent flying by Chu Yunfan’s punch.","“So fast, so strong!’","Many people’s eyes were fixed on the battle, but they could not keep up with the speed and intensity of the battle.","It was too shocking!","“What kind of medicinal pill did Jian Wuchen take? Why haven’t 1 heard of it before?” a prodigy said.","They naturally knew that Chu Yunfan’s explosive strength was definitely related to the pill he had consumed. However, they did not know what pill Chu Yunfan had consumed.","“Who is this Jian Wuchen? Why does he seem so strange? If such a powerful figure had appeared in the past, it would be impossible for him to be unknown. However, in the entire battlefield, there are so many top-notch prodigies, but no one knows who Jian Wuchen is!” a top-notch prodigy could not help but say in disbelief.","With Chu Yunfan’s talent, as long as he appeared once, it would be impossible for people to forget him. Such a person was born to be the center of attention on the stage. It was impossible for him to be unknown.","It was like a giant beside an ant. No matter how low-key this giant was, the ants would never forget how terrifying this existence was.","Just like how they were right now. Even if another 10,000 years had passed, they would never forget that there was once such a monster. A Middle Arcane who could actually beat up a Major Arcane Supreme Youth.","This was no longer a prodigy. He was simply a monster.","At this moment, the battlefield suddenly changed. Just as Chu Yunfan was about to continue chasing after Young Master Hundred Flower, a terrifying light swept across from behind him, aiming at the back of Chu Yunfan’s head, wanting to smash his head into pieces.","It was a terrifying spear light. Wherever the spear light passed, the sky collapsed and the earth cracked. It had a terrifying might.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at it. At the critical moment, he turned around and looked straight at the owner of the spear. It was the young general.","“What is it? How can he be so fast?!”","The young general’s cold face finally revealed a shocked expression. He did not expect Chu Yunfan’s reaction speed to be so fast. He was able to react before his attack arrived.","Chu Yunfan’s eyes were cold as he raised his hand. The terrifying spear light pierced into Chu Yunfan’s palm.","Boom, boom, boom!","With a loud explosion, the terrifying spear light shattered inch by inch when it touched Chu Yunfan’s palm.","“D*mn it!”","The young general immediately pulled back his spear, but it was too late. Chu Yunfan’s Prismatic Traveller created ripples under his feet. His speed soared to the extreme, and in an instant, he had already turned into a ray of light and rushed in front of the young general.","“Golden Axe Metal Horse, give it to me!”","The young general did not have time to react. He only relied on his instincts and blasted out with his spear, turning the entire sky into a world of golden spears and iron horses, turning it into a battlefield.","On this battlefield, he was the only god of war, the only god.","However, just as the battlefield appeared and took shape, a terrifying fist force tore through everything and shattered the battlefield, hitting the young general’s chest.","Boom!","A terrifying explosion occurred in the chest of the young general. His iron suit was shattered by Chu Yunfan’s punch and he was sent flying.","His battle suit protected him. Otherwise, he would have been pierced through by Chu Yunfan’s punch.","But even so, he did not feel good. Several of his ribs were shattered by Chu Yunfan’s punch. He coughed up blood and flew out like a meteor in the air.","It was simply too tragic. Just a simple punch had forced him to this point.","“He has become stronger!’","Many of the prodigies in the distance were dumbfounded. Today, the three Supreme Youths had been beaten up too miserably. Chu Yunfan had only used one punch to seriously injure the three of them. The three Supreme Youths had been beaten up.","Chu Yunfan was simply too fierce, and many of them suddenly realized that Chu Yunfan’s aura was even stronger. Compared to when he punched the knife-throwing boy, it was much more terrifying.","“I’ll kill you!” Chu Yunfan shouted. He couldn’t control the force in his body, and it swarmed out in all directions.","“How are you so strong?!” The young general managed to stabilize himself with great difficulty. His entire body was burning with blood-red flames. At this moment, his incomparably powerful physique was finally exposed.","“That’s the War Overlord Physique!’","Some people recognized this special physique. It was the War Overlord Physique that was very rare since ancient times. This War Overlord Physique was naturally very compatible with the battlefield. It could even be said that as long as one absorbed the evil aura on the battlefield, even if one did not cultivate much, they could grow into a very terrifying existence.","Since ancient times, although such people were rare, there were still some.","“l finally know who he is now. I once heard a legend. At the end of a dynasty, there was once a War Overlord Physique who rose up on the battlefield at the speed of a meteor. He conquered all directions and could be said to have shone brightly!” a top-notch prodigy said with a solemn expression, “Later, after the dynasty he was loyal to was destroyed by many rebel armies, he disappeared without a trace. Everyone thought that he was dead, but they didn’t expect that not only did he not die, but he was still alive!”","“I’ve also heard of his legend. Back then, he defeated all the existences of his generation. The prodigies of his generation, whether it was the last dynasty, the various rebel armies, the demons, the marine folks, and many other foreign races, none of them were a match for him. He single-handedly killed an entire era!” another top genius said.","“Jian Wuchen, you should be proud of yourself for forcing me to this point.","However, you’re going to die next!”","At this moment, the young general roared in anger. Ever since he started cultivating, he had never been in such a sorry state. He had been forced into a dead end, and he was both shocked and angry.","Under the urging of the secret technique, the divine power in his entire body was actually half as strong as before.","His strength was increasing rapidly, but the rate at which his vitality was draining was also increasing.","The boiling blood-red battle energy turned into a long dragon and protected him. His eyes were cold as he took the initiative to attack Chu Yunfan.."]},{"number":2190,"title":"Chapter 2190: Killing a Supreme Youth","paragraphs":["Chapter 2190: Killing a Supreme Youth","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The young general was forced to this point, and he could not contain his anger. He had never thought that he would be in such a sorry state, especially when he thought that he would be able to take down Chu Yunfan. Who would have thought that he was not Chu Yunfan’s match?","The blood-colored dragon was like a true dragon, shaking the entire sky and sweeping across the boundless sky.","“It’s too late!” Chu Yunfan roared. His aura was still rising. The powerful power brought by the pill was wreaking havoc in his body. The terrifying medicinal power of the Seven Treasure Black Yellow Pill was wreaking havoc in his body.","This was a powerful medicinal pill recorded in the Alchemy Emperor’s memories. It was a terrifying medicinal pill researched by the Alchemy Emperor to increase one’s cultivation base. Back then, the Alchemy Emperor was able to successfully break out of the encirclement of many experts with the alchemy path and prove his Dao as an Alchemy Emperor. Naturally, it was impossible for him not to have the means to conquer the world.","Under normal circumstances, Chu Yunfan was not willing to rely on the power of these pills, but at this point, he had no other choice.","Chu Yunfan clenched his fist and punched out. A terrifying fist force swept out, shaking the entire world. The blood-red dragon was pierced through by","Chu Yunfan’s punch.","Immediately after, the fist force swept in front of the young general.","The spear in the young general’s hand swept out and collided with Chu","Yunfan’s fist.","Clang!","The sound of metal clashing spread out in all directions, turning into a powerful sound wave that caused the sky to tremble violently.","Bam!","In the next moment, the spear in the young general’s hand was sent flying. It seemed to have turned into a shooting star and dissipated in the sky.","Crack!","At this moment, the young general’s arm let out a crisp cracking sound. He retreated frantically, his entire body covered in blood. His entire palm had exploded.","Chu Yunfan’s punch exploded.","Blood splattered out and turned into a bloody mist that filled the sky.","The young general screamed and staggered backward.","Chu Yunfan’s eyes were cold as he continued to press forward. At this time, the young general was finally afraid. He had been conquering the world for so many years, but he had never encountered such a situation. Among his peers, there had never been anyone who could inflict such a degree of damage on","him. There was even a high possibility that he could be killed.","The various top-notch geniuses watching from afar were almost scared to death. Everyone was scared silly. This contrast was too great.","Just now, when they saw the three Supreme Youths surrounding Chu Yunfan, they all guessed that Chu Yunfan might not be able to survive this round. Who would have thought that in such a short period of time, Chu Yunfan would counterattack and seriously injure the three Supreme Youths. Now, he was even going to force one of them into a dead end.","“This is simply a monster. Even if he relies on the power of the medicinal pill, this combat strength is real. I’m afraid that even among many Supreme Youths, this is the first!”","“Now I feel that it’s not appropriate to call him Supreme Youth. Among so many Supreme Youths, he’s unique. It should be him or the other Supreme Youths!”","These Major Arcanes were all shocked by Chu Yunfan’s strength. With his current strength, he was indeed strong enough to sweep through the entire battlefield.","“Hurry up and save me!” At this moment, the young general was finally afraid. He hurriedly shouted and asked the other two to come and save him.","“Save you? That’s impossible!”","Chu Yunfan stood in the sky like a god.","He rushed in front of the young general, grabbed a sword from the void, and suddenly slashed down.","Slice!","The young general screamed as he was cut in half. His entire body was convulsing and shaking crazily.","The divine power that had just soared and the power that had risen also flowed away crazily along with his severed body. A famous and terrifying existence that had once killed through an era was actually cut in half by a sword just like that.","His eyes flickered with shock and unwillingness. Chu Yunfan clearly relied on the power of the pill to burst out with such combat strength. He was unwilling to lose here.","However, he didn’t have time to think about it, because in the next moment, Chu Yunfan activated the Nine Netherworld Stomps. As his foot landed, the terrifying netherworld water flooded the entire sky and crushed the young general’s head.","This young general who had once shaken an era and amazed countless people had died.","His corpse was put into the Mountain River Diagram by Chu Yunfan.","All of this happened at the critical moment. Saber Child and Young Master","Hundred Flower had just arrived.","They had just arrived when they saw the young general’s death. They immediately felt alarmed. At this moment, Chu Yunfan gave them an extreme sense of danger.","It was just like when they were still ordinary people and encountered wild beasts in the mountains. It was extremely dangerous.","However, what made them speechless was that Chu Yunfan’s aura was still rising. The series of combat strength just now had not exhausted the medicinal power in his body.","Wasn’t this medicinal pill too terrifying? Were all alchemists so terrifying?","A top-notch prodigy could not help but think.","However, they didn’t know that for Chu Yunfan, this was much more peaceful than the One-Stripe Gold-Purple Pill, the Three-Stripe Gold-Purple Pill, and the Six- Stripe Gold-Purple Pill.","Especially the Six- Stripe Gold-Purple Pill, which had increased his strength by a level, but at the same time, it almost tore his body apart. Compared to it, the medicinal strength of the Seven Treasure Black Yellow Pill was far inferior. It was simply incomparable.","One had to know that it was a simplified version of the Nine-Stripe Gold-Purple Pill. Even emperors would drool over it.","“Attack! This is a disaster! If he doesn’t die, we will!” Young Master Hundred Flower said with a serious expression. He no longer looked like a handsome young master, but was filled with an astonishing fighting spirit.","If the three of them had their own ulterior motives and didn’t do their best, now that they saw that the young general had died in Chu Yunfan’s hands, they didn’t dare to show any mercy. Otherwise, the result waiting for them would be no different from that of the young general.","Saber Child said nothing, but he agreed with Young Master Hundred Flower. There was no way out for both sides. They had to fight to the death. One side had to fall.","Especially since they had only wanted to kill Chu Yunfan at the last minute, and Chu Yunfan had clearly come prepared. He wanted to use them as tools to establish his might and intimidate the Supreme Youths on the entire Prodigy","Battlefield.."]},{"number":2191,"title":"Chapter 2191: Young Master Hundred Flower and Saber Child Dies","paragraphs":["Chapter 2191: Young Master Hundred Flower and Saber Child Dies","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","At this point, it was impossible for them not to understand that Chu Yunfan had clearly come prepared. He had set up a trap, and the target of the trap was them, the Supreme Youths.","This could be said to be rare since ancient times. With their talent and strength, it was simply impossible for anyone in the same generation to specifically target them.","Any one of them could sweep away a group of experts of the same level, and it was effortless.","Back then, Green Wave alone had almost forced the entire Flying Celestial Alliance into despair. Among them, there were two top-notch prodigies of the same level.","However, both of them were forced to a dead end by Green Wave. One could imagine how big the gap between a Supreme Youth and a top-notch prodigy was.","And under the circumstances of the same level, it was too difficult for a Supreme Youth to kill another Supreme Youth.","Which one of these Supreme Youths was not a top figure? Which one of them did not have absolute life-saving means? Wanting to kill these Supreme Youths was almost impossible.","Therefore, very few people dared to point their conspiracy at them, the Supreme Youths.","However, someone had done it.","Thinking of this, the killing intent in their bodies became even stronger. Chu","Yunfan came prepared. If he didn’t die, they would die. It was that simple. There was no third way, only the choice of life and death.","Suddenly, in the next moment, Saber Child made his move. The treasured saber in his hand emitted a dazzling light. The saber light flickered and actually transformed into terrifying talismans. The talismans transformed from the saber light were Saber Child’s understanding of the saber path.","It was as if the entire world could be torn apart.","Saber Child was doing his best!","Swoosh!","In the next moment, the long saber in Saber Child’s hand swept out. The entire world shook as this saber slashed at Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan didn’t move. His expression didn’t change. He slapped forward with one hand, trying to block this terrifying blade with his body.","“l don’t believe it!” Saber Child’s childish voice contained astonishing anger.","He felt that he had been underestimated by Chu Yunfan.","This slash of his was a set of saber techniques that could destroy the world.","Bam!","The palm and the saber light collided in the air.","The saber light cut, as if it wanted to cut Chu Yunfan’s palm. At this point, Saber Child pushed his strength to the extreme, Compared to the previous saber light, it was much more terrifying. Even if a Supreme Youth of the same level was cut by this saber light, it would still be difficult to escape death.","Every time the saber light came down, there would be a metallic sound that turned into a terrifying sound wave. It made people feel as if their hearts were being cut by a knife, and their heads were about to explode.","However, this saber light could not break through Chu Yunfan’s palm. Every pore on Chu Yunfan’s palm was spewing out shocking divine power. This divine power turned into a terrifying protective aura, blocking this amazing saber light.","Chu Yunfan had relied on his unimaginably dense divine power to contend against these top Supreme Youths.","“Saber Annihilation! ”","Saber Child roared and poured all his divine power into it. Terrifying saber light wreaked havoc, turning the surrounding sky into a sea of saber dao, It was obvious that the power of the saber light had more than doubled.","Chu Yunfan sneered and widened his eyes. He clenched his fist and punched out. The eight dragons behind him were faintly discernible, but they were covered by Chu Yunfan’s own mana fluctuations.","Unless one was a Major Arcane, it was impossible for them to see through Chu","Yunfan’s Eight Astonishing Punches that he had been hiding.","Boom!","This punch landed on Saber Child’s saber light. Cracks appeared on this treasure saber, and it exploded inch by inch in the air.","Spurt!","Saber Child spat out a mouthful of blood and staggered backward. He had suffered a great loss in the collision, and the palm that he held the saber in was covered in blood. The web between his thumb and forefinger had been torn.","Everyone could see that Saber Child had suffered a great loss in the collision.","“Didn’t you want to kill me? Isn’t this a little too embarrassing?” Chu Yunfan said loudly and approached him.","Saber Child was so angry that he almost spat out another mouthful of blood. He had been arrogant all his life. Although he was born in a small sect, he had the reputation of being a Supreme Youth. There was no prodigy in his generation who was his match.","How could such a character be ordinary?","However, he did not expect to suffer a huge loss at Chu Yunfan’s hands today.","Just as Chu Yunfan was about to chase after Saber Child, Young Master Hundred Flower glared at him from the side. The folding fan in his hand kept producing terrifying gales, each of which could easily tear a Major Arcane into pieces.","The Major Arcanes and peak-level prodigies were all trembling in fear. Every single one of these Supreme Youths had struck fear into their hearts. Of course, the truly terrifying one was none other than Chu Yunfan.","“Humph!’","Chu Yunfan’s nose was like thunder. After a cold snort, he tore the air with both hands and instantly tore the winds apart. It did not affect him at all.","Then, Chu Yunfan threw another punch. The force of the punch pierced through the sky and landed in front of Young Master Hundred Flower. Young Master Hundred Flower kept retreating, trying to dodge the punch.","However, the fist force of this punch had already locked onto him. Even if he wanted to escape, there was no possibility of escaping at all.","“Let’s go all out!”","Young Master Hundred Flower had no other choice. He used all kinds of terrifying divine powers and martial arts to resist this terrifying punch.","However, there was no use. These skills and martial arts transformed into countless flower petals, each of which was enough to heavily injure a Major Arcane. Young Master Hundred Flower was giving it his all.","However, these petals were completely destroyed by Chu Yunfan’s punch.","Bam!","The fist force hit Young Master Hundred Flower’s chest. Before Young Master Hundred Flower could react, a big hole appeared in his chest. His internal organs exploded and he died instantly.","All of this took a long time to describe, but it only took a moment. Saber Child finally realized what was going on. He wanted to escape. He didn’t dare to confront Chu Yunfan head-on. He had been defeated until his courage was broken.","However, there was no time for that. In an instant, Chu Yunfan caught up to him and looked down on him.","Chu Yunfan once again used the Nine Netherworld Stomps. His foot pierced through the sky as if it was destroying the world and instantly stepped on Saber Child.","Saber Child only had time to let out a scream before his entire body was trampled into pieces, and he died tragically at Chu Yunfan’s feet.."]},{"number":2192,"title":"Chapter 2192: Shocking the Prodigies","paragraphs":["Chapter 2192: Shocking the Prodigies","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","They watched as Young Master Hundred Flower, Saber Child, and the young general were killed by Chu Yunfan. All of this seemed to have happened in a short period of time.","Many people did not even have time to react. There were still shadows of the battle between the two sides in the sky, and all the battles had already ended.","“Another titan has risen!” a top genius said with a complicated expression.","There was no doubt that Chu Yunfan had become another big shot in their eyes. Not all Supreme Youths could be called the titans of a region. In fact, only those who had cultivated to the peak Major Arcana Stage could be called the titans of the Prodigy Battlefield.","Titans could dominate a region. A Supreme Youth who had yet to cultivate to peak Major Arcana Stage might be extremely powerful, and no ordinary person would dare to provoke them. However, in reality, they were still not enough to suppress the entire Prodigy Battlefield. Naturally, they could not be considered a titan.","Everyone had witnessed Chu Yunfan’s cultivation level. He was only in the Middle Arcana Stage, but his combat strength made everyone ignore his cultivation level.","In fact, at this stage, cultivation level was meaningless. The true combat strength was the standard to measure everything.","Chu Yunfan’s rise was too fast. A few years ago, when he entered the Prodigy Battlefield, they could still look down on this mysterious prodigy who had made a name for himself the outer region.","However, in just a few years, Chu Yunfan’s growth rate had already reached a level that ordinary people could not compete with.","Although Chu Yunfan’s current combat strength clearly relied on the power of the pill, the pill was not a power that fell from the sky. Everyone had to admit that Chu Yunfan’s strength was not something that ordinary people could compare to.","Even in normal combat strength, only a few Supreme Youths who had already become titans could firmly suppress Chu Yunfan.","However, he managed to suppress them. From the situation where the three","Supreme Youths surrounded Chu Yunfan, it could be seen that they could not immediately suppress him.","As time passed, Chu Yunfan improved further and became another top-notch titan on the battlefield in the future.","What was even more terrifying was that many people thought that Chu Yunfan could continue to improve while the other Supreme Youth titan’s combat strength had already reached the limit.","It probably wouldn’t be long before the entire Prodigy Battlefield would become his stage. There was no one who could control him.","Even if the other geniuses joined forces, they might not be able to do anything to him.","One person could probably take away all the benefits from the Prodigy Battlefield.","This was undoubtedly a huge threat to the other Supreme Youths.","This was also the reason why the three Supreme Youths had joined forces without any hesitation.","There was no doubt about the reason behind this. Everyone could see that once Chu Yunfan rose, he would be a shocking threat to them.","And their competition was definitely not just a competition on the Prodigy Battlefield. It would also spread to the goodhood path.","However, everyone realized that it was too late to suppress Chu Yunfan now. Chu Yunfan had already grown to the point where he could resist their suppression.","As time passed, Chu Yunfan’s strength would only increase further. At that time, it would not be the so-called suppression of Chu Yunfan, but to prevent Chu Yunfan from killing him.","Based on their estimations of Chu Yunfan’s strength after he stepped into the Major Arcana Stage, it wasn’t impossible.","Among the prodigies, signlehandedly suppressing several eras with one person’s strength was already considered rare. If one could singlehandedly suppress the entire Prodigy Battlefield, it would be equivalent to singlehandedly suppressing the ancient era.","They will suppress countless eras!","Since ancient times, no matter how tyrannical a person was, no one had been able to achieve such a shocking level.","“I’m afraid that no one can suppress him on the Prodigy Battlefield. Unless all the Supreme Youths and prodigies join forces and take him down at all costs, even if they have to sacrifice many talented people, then it’s possible to suppress Jian Wuchen’s rising momentum!” a top-notch genius spoke.","His words also set many prerequisites. In fact, there were so many that many people understood that this was simply impossible.","Even if these Supreme Youths wanted to restrain Chu Yunfan, It was impossible for them to join forces. After all, these Supreme Youths had countless grudges against each other. Just like the mutual hostility between Huangfu Longhao and Jun Tianci, it had never stopped.","It was possible to make these Supreme Youths give up all their grudges, but it was only limited to a few people. It was impossible for all of them to do so.","Not to mention that more than ten Supreme Youths might fall. Everyone wanted others to fall, not themselves.","“It’s not possible in the Prodigy Battlefield, but it’s possible in the outside world. After all, no matter how strong he is now, he’s only a Supreme Youth and not a Supreme. There are plenty of people in the world who can kill him!”","“That’s right. I’m afraid that with his strength, many old monsters will come out to target him personally after he goes out!”","“If the old monsters don’t take action, it will be too difficult for his peers to do anything to him!","Many prodigies discussed animatedly, but they were not surprised. They all regarded Chu Yunfan as the most terrifying monster. He had already surpassed the level of prodigies and Supreme Youths.","Many people had even thought of using external methods to invite old monsters who were still in seclusion or self-proclaimed to target Chu Yunfan.","They had already lost all their confidence in the competition between their peers. Even the Supreme Youth could not do anything to Chu Yunfan, let alone them.","“Who is it?!” someone exclaimed, “Look, the two Princess Gushes are about to fight!”","With this exclamation, everyone looked up and saw that the battle between Tang Siyu and Princess Gushe seemed to have been decided.","The two sides fought to the point of madness. Their entire bodies were emitting golden light, and their blood and energy shook the entire void. They fought with a might that ordinary people would not dare to imagine. Even though both of them were women, they were not inferior to male Supreme Youths. In fact, they were even superior.","After thousands of exchanges, the victor was finally decided. Princess Gushe coughed up blood and retreated.."]},{"number":2193,"title":"Chapter 2193: Princess Gushe Ends up in a Dead End","paragraphs":["Chapter 2193: Princess Gushe Ends up in a Dead End","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","When Chu Yunfan killed the three Supreme Youths—Young Master Hundred Flower, Saber Child, and the young general—the battle between the two Princess Gushes was about to end.","Under Tang Siyu’s continuous attacks, Princess Gushe was forced to retreat repeatedly. The gap between the two sides’ foundations was revealed.","Originally, it had always been Princess Gushes foundation that had the upper hand. She was much older than Tang Siyu and had entered the Prodigy Battlefield more than once. Her name had been known in the Prodigy Battlefield for many years.","Tang Siyu, as a prodigy of the current generation, was far inferior to Princess Gushe in terms of strength and foundation.","But now, Tang Siyu had overtaken her in the shortest time possible and had the upper hand.","The most important thing was, of course, Chu Yunfan’s help. He had the complete memories of the Alchemy Emperor and the Mighty Emperor Battle Book written by the Emperor Supreme. In terms of foundation, no one could compare to Chu Yunfan.","With Chu Yunfan’s help, Tang Siyu made up for the gap in her foundation in a short time.","In addition, Tang Siyu had broken through to the peak Major Arcana Stage normally, while Princess Gushe had forcefully broken through to peak Major Arcana.","For a short time, she was able to contend with Tang Siyu and not fall into a disadvantage. She did not seem to be too bad.","However, as time went on, the problems caused by her breaking through to peak Major Arcana would be exposed. Of course, she would not be as calm as Tang Siyu.","Princess Gushe kept retreating and coughing up blood. Then, she kept looking at Chu Yunfan as if she was trying to determine whether Chu Yunfan would interfere in this shocking battle.","Although she was fighting with Tang Siyu just now, she had been paying attention to Chu Yunfan and saw Chu Yunfan easily kill the three Supreme Youths.","These three Supreme Youths were all veteran peak Major Arcanes. In terms of strength, they were even stronger than her by a notch. Yet, they were all killed by Chu Yunfan.","How could she not be scared out of her wits?","It could be said that her mind was trembling violently. Coupled with the fact that her strength was beginning to fall, Tang Siyu seized the opportunity and","dealt her a heavy blow.","It could be said that she had to guard against two people at the same time, which was why Tang Siyu seized the opportunity. Although Chu Yunfan did not make a move, he was watching from the side. His terrifying aura had not dissipated.","What made Princess Gushe frightened was that the terrifying divine power fluctuation brought by the pill on Chu Yunfan’s body had not dissipated.","This was undoubtedly very incomprehensible to her. One must know that she also knew of some medicinal pills that could increase one’s strength. However, the problem was that they would generally dissipate in a very short time, and there would be extremely serious aftereffects.","However, the medicinal properties of Chu Yunfan’s pill had lasted until now. It was very shocking. At least, it was more shocking than any pill she knew.","Looking at Chu Yunfan, it seemed that the medicinal effect of the pill had not dissipated. Even without the pill, the combat strength that Chu Yunfan had displayed was enough to pose a threat to her, let alone now.","“The two of you joining forces is an unfair victory!” Princess Gushe roared in anger. She was extremely unwilling to give up.","“l don’t intend to interfere,” Chu Yunfan said coldly, “You can have a fair one-on-one fight! ”","Of course, Chu Yunfan was not soft-hearted. In fact, he had never planned to let Princess Gushe off from the beginning. Just the fact that she had put Tang Siyu in a life-and-death situation several times made Chu Yunfan not want to let it go so easily.","However, he had no intention of interfering. The reason was simple. He believed that Tang Siyu!s strength was enough to kill Princess Gushe. He didn’t need to do anything.","“Don’t worry. I said I won’t interfere, and I won’t interfere!”","Chu Yunfan’s words made Princess Gushes pupils shrink slightly, and her face revealed a bit of anger. How could she not understand the meaning in Chu Yunfan’s words? He might not interfere, but it was not because of other reasons, but because Tang Siyu was enough to kill her.","“You actually dare to underestimate me to this extent. You will regret it!” A hint of madness flashed across Princess Gushes beautiful eyes. “Ever since my debut, no one has ever dared to look down on me like this!”","“So what if 1 look dovvn on you? If we had cultivated for the same amount of time, killing you would be as easy as pulling grass!” Tang Siyu took a step forward, her face full of confidence.","Her invincible momentum was formed step by step. This time, it was a counterattack. Her state of mind naturally improved. In her eyes, even a Supreme Youth could be killed.","This was a level that even ordinary Supreme Youths could not reach, because","it was very difficult for ordinary Supreme Youths to defeat experts of the same level.","Not to mention killing them. That was almost impossible.","“I’ll kill you!” Princess Gushe roared.","Immediately, shouts rang out, shaking the heavens and earth. Thousands of troops and horses appeared, charging toward Tang Siyu without fear of death.","Among them, Princess Gushe led the way on her phoenix carriage. At this point, she did not hold back. She went all out and swept in Tang Siyu’s direction.","At this time, she had no time to pay attention to Chu Yunfan who was observing the battlefield not far away. If she could not defeat Tang Siyu, she would be killed by Tang Siyu. She had no way to care about Chu Yunfan.","Meanwhile, Tang Siyu soared into the sky. Around her, the Green Dragon, White Tiger, Vermilion Bird, and Black Tortoise materialized and charged into the battlefield. The True Four Guardians Spirits swept through everything and pierced through the entire battlefield.","The shockwaves from the collision of the two earth-shattering items shook the entire sky, causing many of the prodigies watching from afar to feel like their souls had left their bodies.","The sword in Tang Siyu’s hand slashed across the sky. The sword light was earth-shattering. It swept out for 30,000 feet, tearing the void apart and shattering the sky.upd?t? ?t ?ew?o?el. ?rg","It collided with the halberd in Princess Gushes hand, shattering the sky.","Princess Gushe’ s blood and energy surged like raging waves as she fought. She was not any weaker than a male Supreme Youth.","Meanwhile, Tang Siyu remained calm as she continued clashing with Princess Gushe. The clash between the two was not as fierce as it had been at the beginning, and the speed of their exchange had slowed down to a point where even ordinary prodigies could see it. However, it was even more terrifying. The terrifying ripples that were casually released were enough to kill any ordinary peak Major Arcana Stage prodigies.","In reality, other than the few Supreme Youths, there were other peak Major Arcanes present. However, none of them dared to make a move. They knew the difference between them and these Supreme Youths.","“If she keep going, she’ll be exhausted. There’s not much time left for Princess Gushe,” a top-notch prodigy muttered to himself. His gaze was fixed on the two people fighting in the air.."]},{"number":2194,"title":"Chapter 2194: Princess Gushe Is Dead","paragraphs":["Chapter 2194: Princess Gushe Is Dead","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The rest of the prodigies looked solemn. They understood that there was not much time left for Princess Gushe. As the saying goes, if you continue to work hard, you will be exhausted. Princess Gushe was only able to fight evenly with Tang Siyu because of her last breath.","However, once this anger was dispelled, there would be nothing left.","Only by severely injuring or even killing Tang Siyu in the shortest time could she have a certain chance of escaping from Chu Yunfan’s hands.","To defeat Chu Yunfan? It didn’t exist!","Chu Yunfan stood with his arms crossed, but his body emitted an extremely dangerous aura. No one would think that his threat was fake.","Even the three Supreme Youths who were stronger than Princess Gushe had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands, let alone Princess Gushe who had just broken through to peak Major Arcana Stage.","The strength of both sides were not on the same level!","Therefore, even if Princess Gushe could defeat Tang Siyu, she would have to face Chu Yunfan, who was even more terrifying than Tang Siyu. It was impossible for her to win.","Her only chance was to escape from Chu Yunfan, which was very difficult.","It was even more impossible to win!","The two people in the battle had obviously realized that this was the final battle. Princess Gushe became more and more anxious, but Tang Siyu became more and more calm. Because victory was in her hands. As long as she persisted, it would be the death of Princess Gushe.","Fresh blood splattered across the sky, outlining an extremely tragic scene.","Princess Gushes red dress had already turned into an iron robe. It clanged and turned the entire world into a battlefield.","On the other hand, Tang Siyu was like an angel who had descended from the heavens. She was alone with her sword, and she killed her way through the entire battlefield. As she advanced, blood and bones splattered. At this point, both sides had already fought until their eyes were red. They were fighting with their lives on the line.","“Die, die, die!” Princess Gushe roared loudly.","She had never been forced to this extent before. This was the first time she had been forced to this extent in all her years of cultivation.","She had been forced to such a state by a person who had been cultivating for a much younger age than her. This was a dazzling sight for the invincible confidence she had built up with great difficulty.","The halberd in her hand slashed across the sky, splitting the world apart. The world shattered, and the terrifying halberd light turned into a rain of light that filled the sky and scattered between heaven and earth.","Clang!","The halberd and the sword collided in mid-air, producing a terrifying metallic sound that swept out like a storm.","Spurt!","Another shocking collision occurred, and Princess Gushe was forced back, coughing up blood.","Blood stained the armor she wore. She had gone mad front he fighting. Her entire body was spasming.","Tang Siyu chased after her. She took a step forward and then slashed down with her sword.","Boom!","The sword light tore through the sky, and blood splattered everywhere. Princess Gushe grunted, and blood sprayed out of her body. This sword almost cut her in half.","It was thanks to her pushing back a hundred miles at the most critical moment that she managed to avoid the most fatal blow.","But even so, she was still heavily injured!","To kill Princess Gushe with one strike, Tang Siyu continued to move forward, creating pressure and not giving Princess Gushe any time to heal.","Bam!","Bam!","Bam!","The fight between the two sides continued. After being severely injured by Tang Siyu’s sword, Princess Gushe screamed repeatedly and was almost forced into a corner.","She was already at a complete disadvantage, and now, she was completely forced into a dead end. The more it was like this, the more difficult it was for her.","In the sky, she was being beaten back. To be more precise, Princess Gushe was constantly being chased by Tang Siyu.","Everyone looked at this scene from afar and looked at each other. Although they had expected this, they still felt incredulous when they saw Princess Gushe being chased.","“As expected of the Princess Gushe Ancient who became famous in the distant past. Her strength is indeed tyrannical, but it’s a pity that she met Princess Gushe Modern! ”","“The current generation’s prodigies are each stronger than the last. This is definitely not the end times that some people are joking about!”","Many prodigies had this feeling. It was completely different from when they were in the Federation. The Federation had developed continuously from an extremely bad situation, so they believed in the ancient times and not the present.","Each generation was stronger than the previous.","Every generation was stronger than the previous generation, whether it was in terms of physique, martial arts theory, or the powerful cultivation path that the predecessors did not have.","It could be said that each generation was stronger than the previous. This was the truth.","But in the Central Plains, it was a completely different matter. Because of its glorious past, the current era was far inferior to the glorious era of the ancient emperors.","Therefore, they believed that the present was not as good as the past. Whether it was in terms of physique, inheritance, various treasures, or various resources, it was the same. The older it was, the more powerful it was.","In the eyes of many prodigies who had survived from the distant ancient era or even the end of the distant ancient era, they could not be compared to the glory of that era.","The fact that Princess Gushe possessed such astonishing battle prowess and was able to persist until now caused many people to feel their jaws drop. They looked at each other in dismay. Princess Gushe did not live up to her reputation.","Princess Gushe was forced into a corner. She used all her strength, and her entire body was glowing. She was constantly recovering from her injuries. It was obvious that she had used a secret technique. Her hair was even whiter now, and it was obvious that her life force had been absorbed.","However, she had no other choice. At this point, she was going to die anyway. She could only fight to the death to have a chance of winning.","Slash!","Just as she was trying to recover, Tang Siyu’s terrifying sword light pierced through the huge battlefield formed by her martial arts intent.","Almost half of her body was torn apart.","“Ugh!” Princess Gushe screamed and roared. At this moment, she was forced to a dead end. Her expression was extremely ferocious.","The glow on her body became even brighter, and she wanted to heal her injuries. However, at the same time, the shocking sword light that pierced through her became even more terrifying, constantly tearing apart her","recovering wounds.","After a long while, Princess Gushe finally stopped struggling because she was already dead. She waited for her eyes to open, and her entire body was covered in blood. She died in extreme pain as she struggled to die.","Princess Gushe was dead!"]},{"number":2195,"title":"Chapter 2195: The Shock of the Prodigies","paragraphs":["Chapter 2195: The Shock of the Prodigies","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After killing Princess Gushe, Tang Siyu collected her corpse expressionlessly. She knew that the body would be useful to Chu Yunfan.","The Brahma Tree was a secret to others, but Chu Yunfan would not hide it from Tang Siyu. The two of them had lived and died together for so many years, and their relationship had long surpassed everything else.","They were each other’s lifelong support!","The ancient geniuses in the distance finally came back to their senses. Many of them had unknowingly been drenched in a cold sweat.","With their cultivation, it was impossible for them to not be able to control their sweat. However, their backs were already wet without them knowing. One could imagine how shocking this matter was to them.","Even though Princess Gushe had shown signs of defeat before, she was actually killed by Tang Siyu after she lost to her.","Everyone was extremely shocked!","This result was something that they had never thought of before.","Before this, almost everyone had a one-sided view of Princess Gushe and not Tang Siyu.","This was because Tang Siyu could not defeat Princess Gushe in any way. At most, she only could fight with Princess Gushe.","And just like that, she had only managed to break through to the late Major Arcana after being pushed to the limit by Princess Gushe.","At most, this would put pressure on Princess Gushe. It would be impossible to defeat her.","Truth be told, the terrifying battle prowess that Princess Gushe had displayed had proven everyone’s thoughts. Princess Gushe was indeed standing at the peak of this realm. Not counting a monster like Chu Yunfan, she was the strongest below the peak Major Arcana Stage.","Furthermore, she had one foot in the peak Major Arcana Stage. If necessary, she could even step into the peak Major Arcana Stage.","No matter how many trump cards Tang Siyu had, it was impossible to turn the tables under the absolute difference in strength.","However, Tang Siyu had turned the tables. One could imagine how shocking this was for everyone.","Moreover, she did not defeat Princess Gushe with much difficulty. Instead, she crushed Princess Gushe all the way until the latter could not fight back at all.","Before this, the best scenario that everyone had imagined was that Tang Siyu would barely be able to tie with Princess Gushe, and both of them would be able to break through to the peak Major Arcana. From there, they would be able to fight against Princess Gushe, and both of them would be on the same starting line.","This was already very shocking!","But the truth had given them a huge slap in the face!","“A big shot... Another big shot has risen. This time, even the alliance behind Princess Gushe might not be willing to step forward!” someone muttered to himself.","It was impossible for Princess Gushe to be a lone backer. In fact, she was one of the giants of the alliance she was in.","It was an alliance established by the ancient geniuses of the destroyed dynasty in the modern era.","They had flourished for a time back then, but now that the dynasty they belonged to had been destroyed, they naturally had no choice but to join forces. Although they belonged to different eras, they had joined forces in this era.","Among them, there were peak Major Arcanes!","If Tang Siyu hadn’t broken through to the peak Major Arcana, that peak Major Arcane might have personally taken action against her after today’s incident.","However, the situation today was different. Tang Siyu had already broken through to the peak Major Arcana Stage, and she possessed the ability to stand on equal footing with the other powerhouses. She was now one of them.","She could even create a powerful alliance with her strength. Not many people would dare to easily go against such a person.","After all, no one could guarantee that they could kill Tang Siyu, who had already broken through to the peak Major Arcana Stage. Even if several powerful beings of similar cultivation states joined forces, they would not be completely confident.","In fact, if Chu Yunfan hadn’t blocked all the escape routes of Princess Gushe, she wouldn’t have chosen to fight to the death. Seeing that she couldn’t win, she would have chosen to escape.","She couldn’t stay and fight to the death. She chose to fight to the death now because she was forced into a corner by Chu Yunfan.","As for the three of them being killed by Chu Yunfan, that was an exception and could not be used as a reference.","Therefore, it could be said that at this point, Tang Siyu was standing at the peak of the entire Prodigy Battlefield.","“To think that there are actually two monsters in this generation who could become peak Major Arcanes after only participating in the Prodigy Battlefield once! Compared to them, all our years of cultivation are nothing but a waste!” a top-notch prodigy said gloomily. He was obviously referring to Tang Siyu and Jun Tianci.","Even though they were on the battlefield with many Supreme Youths, Jun Tianci and Tang Siyu’s progress was so fast that many people found it unbelievable and dazzling.","Especially Tang Siyu, who had shocked many people. When Jun Tianci had entered the Prodigy Battlefield, he was already a Major Arcane. Now that he had stepped into the peak Major Arcana Stage, it was still acceptable even though it was shocking.","When Tang Siyu first entered the Prodigy Battlefield, she had barely entered the Middle Arcana Stage.","The starting point of both sides was completely different.","In comparison, it was naturally Tang Siyu who gave them a greater shock.","“However, what I’m more concerned about is Jian Wuchen. Who is he exactly?","His strength is simply too terrifying. He’s only a Middle Arcane, yet he can kill peak Major Arcanes so easily. He’s simply a monster!”","Many people looked at Chu Yunfan in confusion. It was definitely not something that could be answered with a simple sentence like swallowing a pill. After all, they knew very well that it would be a huge joke if an ordinary person could contend with them or even kill them just by casually consuming a divine pill.","It was simply impossible!","This made Chu Yunfan even more terrifying!","“But what’s more interesting is that both of them seem to have a grudge against Jun Tianci. Tang Siyu has caused trouble for Jun Tianci more than once, and Jian Wuchen seems to be coming for Jun Tianci as well. He has killed everyone in the Monarch Alliance. I’m afraid it won’t be long till three of them","“That’s right. These two don’t look like people who will let things go easily.","They will definitely find trouble with Jun Tianci!’","“I’m looking forward to seeing that scene. Jun Tianci isn’t someone to be trifled with. His strength is unfathomable. As one of the best among the new titans, he has even defeated other Supreme Youth titans.. I’m afraid it will be another great battle!”"]},{"number":2196,"title":"Chapter 2196: The Overturned Prodigy Battlefield","paragraphs":["Chapter 2196: The Overturned Prodigy Battlefield","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu left the battlefield, but the results of this battle spread throughout the entire battlefield overnight.","No matter what, even in the battlefield of 100,000 geniuses, there weren’t many who could become Supreme Youths. At most, there were only 200 to 300 of them. Among them, those who could cultivate to the peak Major Arcana were even rarer.","A person like that could be considered a titan of a region, a big shot who was in charge of an alliance. If an alliance didn’t have a peak Major Arcane Supreme Youth in charge, then this alliance would at most be a second-rate alliance. This was something that everyone acknowledged.","One could only imagine how important a peak Major Arcane Supreme Youth was to the entire battlefield.","Not to mention, behind these Supreme Youths, each of them had an extraordinary background. They weren’t really commoners without any background.","In fact, if they did not have any background, it was impossible for them to cultivate to this extent.","Even among Supreme Youths, if they had the chance to kill each other, they would often have many considerations. It was extremely rare for Chu Yunfan to attack without holding back.","“What kind of killing star is Jian Wuchen? How many Supreme Youths have died in his hands since he became famous?” someone said in shock.","“That’s right. Just the death of one Supreme Youth is like a huge tree, not to mention the death of ordinary prodigies. The number of deaths and injuries of top-notch prodigies is countless!”","Countless geniuses gasped. Chu Yunfan’s actions were undoubtedly piercing through the heavens.","In the Prodigy Battlefield, he was indeed invincible. However, the Prodigy Battlefield was only open for some time. After he went out, he would have to see how powerful those old antiques were.","Now, there was no doubt that once Chu Yunfan went out, he would face a terrifying ambush.","The existence behind these Supreme Youths was unimaginable, especially since many of them were the last hope of these destroyed sects. They were the hope of reviving their sects, families, or empires.","Now that they had fallen here, those old antiques and old monsters would probably go completely crazy.","“No matter who he is, he must die. Only his flesh and blood can be used to worship my lord!”","Many of the subordinates and followers of the Supreme Youth who had been killed by Chu Yunfan were crying.","In particular, many of the troops were the descendants of the troops that these Supreme Youths had subdued countless years ago. Their ancestors had followed these Supreme Youths, but now they had died in Chu Yunfan’s hands.","To them, they were like gods, but now, they had ended in their batch.","These people had begun to mobilize, and they wanted to take revenge on Chu Yunfan like crazy. With the strength that Chu Yunfan had displayed, even the big shots among the Supreme Youths would think twice about whether to make a move on Chu Yunfan.","They might fail miserably. Was it worth it to do so?","However, these people didn’t care. They were the loyal subordinates of the Supreme Youths who had been killed. Some of them had forbidden methods that could be used to deal with Chu Yunfan.","“If Chu Yunfan hadn’t left, I’m afraid he would’ve been found soon. At that time, there would’ve been another great battle!”","“That’s right. These people are all the loyal subordinates and followers of those Supreme Youths. They have some forbidden methods in their hands. Even the titans among the Supreme Youths might fall if they’re not careful!” someone said.","“l also heard that someone has left the Prodigy Battlefield and invited forbidden methods from those old monsters who are in seclusion outside to specifically target Jian Wuchen! ”","Many people received more news. As time passed, more and more top geniuses entered the battlefield with forbidden methods to kill Jian Wuchen.","The fall of these Supreme Youths had alarmed the extremely terrifying old antiques and old monsters behind them.","The hope of a sect’s future being cut off was enough to drive these old antiques crazy.","“There has to be a reason. Jian Wuchen must die. Otherwise, everyone or anything related to him will die. The world will be bathed in blood!” someone said coldly.","They couldn’t find Chu Yunfan, so they pointed the spearhead at the people related to Chu Yunfan.","Without a doubt, the first to bear the brunt were Chu Yunfan’s followers, including the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow. They became a thorn in the side of those who were eager to take revenge.","However, these people were not simple people. Although they were taken in as followers by Chu Yunfan, it did not mean that they were simple people, especially the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow. It was a Supreme Youth, a Supreme Youth from the supreme royal family among the flying beasts of the demons.","When many people wanted to target the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow, many monster experts stood up and personally stood up for the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow. Especially in the Ferocious Bird Clan, several Supreme Youths appeared.","The Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow could die in a battle between Supreme Youths, but it couldn’t be targeted, especially by ordinary Arcanes.","Otherwise, they would be going against the Ferocious Bird Clan.","Many people were stunned. There were not many races that could become royalty among the Ferocious Bird Clan. The competition between them was fierce. There was even a competition to lead the Ferocious Bird Clan.","They didn’t have a good relationship with the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow, but at this moment, they put aside their past grudges and stood behind the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow.","However, many people understood that it was not that they had abandoned their past grudges. It was just that everyone was afraid that such taboo methods would spread.","Especially in a situation where one was in a hurry, one would have no scruples.","They were worried that they would be targeted like this. They were not afraid of competition among people of the same cultivation level, but they were afraid that some people would use such tricks, especially when many people had ulterior motives and attacked in secret.","Due to the influence of the Ferocious Bird Clan, no one dared to touch the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow. Other than that, there were also other forces behind the dragon-headed crocodile and others, and they were all extraordinary.","However, there was a huge gap between them and those forces that had produced a Supreme Youth. In addition, these forces that had produced Supreme Youths had joined forces to take revenge, so they were still suppressed.","Even if they didn’t use any tricks, it would still pose a huge threat to them.","They were forced to retreat in defeat.","Everything related to Chu Yunfan was targeted.."]},{"number":2197,"title":"Chapter 2197: Several Months Passed","paragraphs":["Chapter 2197: Several Months Passed","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","There were even people who had their claws on Chu Hongcai. Although there was no clear evidence that Chu Hongcai had a direct relationship with Chu Yunfan, everyone thought that Chu Yunfan’s identity was Jian Wuchen.","No one knew where Jian Wuchen had come from. Other than Tang Siyu and Chu Hongcai, no one knew where Chu Yunfan had come from.","However, because Chu Yunfan had saved Chu Hongcai twice, in the eyes of many people, this was already a reason for Chu Hongcai to die.","There were even peak Major Arcanes who used forbidden methods to kill Chu Hongcai, charging straight into the city where the Flying Celestial Alliance was located.","The city was almost destroyed. If Huangfu Longhao had not come personally at the critical moment, the matter would probably have reached an irreparable state.","This was another world-shaking battle. These peak Major Arcanes were here to avenge their young lord, and they had come here personally with forbidden methods. To the geniuses in the outer regions, this was undoubtedly a disaster.","This shocked countless people.","In the end, it was during this battle that Huangfu Longhao personally killed off a few peak Major Arcanes. Only then did the commotion finally come to an end.","At the same time, he also warned the subordinates and followers of the Supreme Youths that although the Flying Celestial Alliance wasn’t as powerful as the Destiny Alliance, they definitely couldn’t afford to offend them.","They had forbidden methods in their hands that could threaten the big shots among the Supreme Youths. However, Huangfu Longhao also had the forbidden methods sent by the Flying Celestials that could contend with the forbidden methods in their hands.","It was because of this that they gave up on this idea.","“From today onwards, if anyone dares to have any ideas about the Flying Celestial Alliance, then don’t blame me, Huangfu Longhao, for being impolite!”","Huangfu Longhao single-handedly suppressed these people’s restlessness. However, they were not mainly targeting Chu Hongcai. It was only because they could not find Chu Yunfan’s whereabouts that they went crazy and took the risk.","Now, with Huangfu Longhao’s warning, they no longer attacked Chu Hongcai. Instead, they began to hunt down Chu Yunfan’s followers.","The dragon-headed crocodile and the others were also being pursued relentlessly. In fact, many peak Major Arcanes had even decided to go after them personally.","If not for the fact that they had forbidden methods sent by their clans and sects to protect themselves, they would have probably died long ago.","In the following month, it was as if the entire world was hunting them down.","But after that, Chu Yunfan seemed to be unable to hold back any longer and personally began to hunt down those who were chasing after them.","Even though these subordinates of the Supreme Youths were powerful, and there were even many peak Major Arcanes among them, they still had no chance of winning against Chu Yunfan.","They were easily killed, and Chu Yunfan no longer held back. He was not like the hundreds of prodigies from before, who would let them off as long as they handed over their wealth.","These people had completely angered Chu Yunfan. He wasn’t the kind of person who would let this and that go every day.","In the next few months, the entire Prodigy Battlefield fell into a bloodbath.","All kinds of killings continued. Then, Chu Yunfan single-handedly beat the subordinates of the Supreme Youths. They did not have any strength to fight back.","These subordinates of the Supreme Youths scattered throughout the entire battlefield to search for Chu Yunfan’s whereabouts, which gave Chu Yunfan the opportunity to attack one by one.","Chu Yunfan killed more than a hundred people at lightning speed. His movements were so fast that they didn’t even have the chance to use forbidden methods.","This shocked the subordinates and followers of the Supreme Youths. After all, although they wanted revenge, they would not disregard their lives.","During this period, Jun Tianci, who had been rumored to have a great battle with Chu Yunfan, did not stay idle. Although he was in seclusion, he had someone spread the word.","“If Jian Wuchen comes, I’ll kill him like an ant!”","Jun Tianci’s words were cold, heartless, and overbearing.","Chu Yunfan had killed more than one Supreme Youth, and his strength was simply unfathomable in the eyes of everyone.","When Jun Tianci faced Chu Yunfan, he still didn’t show the slightest fear. It was as if he was waiting for Chu Yunfan to personally come and kill him.","“Jun Tianci finally couldn’t take it anymore? Although he is in seclusion, he is still very well-informed about the outside world!”","“After Jun Tianci comes out of seclusion this time, I’m afraid he will become a top Supreme Youth. Previously, he was already able to fight evenly with Supreme Youths of the same level. After such a long time, his cultivation should have improved further! ”","“Although Jian Wuchen’s performance is extremely shocking, in my opinion, he is still inferior to Jun Tianci!”","In a place that no one knew about, Chu Yunfan, who had become a famous figure in everyone’s eyes, was sitting cross-legged in the air, cultivating in seclusion.","Not far from him, Tang Siyu was protecting him. After several months, Tang Siyu’s appearance had not changed, but her strength seemed to have become even more shocking.","A few months ago, when Tang Siyu had just broken through to the peak Major Arcana Stage, she was capable of killing Princess Gushe. However, after a few months, her aura was clearly much more mellow than before.","If she was like an unsheathed sword, everyone could feel her power and sharpness. Now, she was like a sword that had returned to its sheath and all its sharpness had been restrained.","Hiding deep in the shadows was her current state.","If she were to fight with Princess Gushe now, Tang Siyu was confident that she would be able to defeat Princess Gushe within a hundred moves at most. Her strength was incomparable to before.","At the same time, she had also reached the peak of the Arcana Stage, the complete stage.","However, she was not in a hurry to break through. She continued to consolidate her foundation and make her foundation firm. After all, the rules on the Prodigy Battlefield seemed to have been artificially modified, not allowing anyone to break through to a higher level.","If she wanted to break through, that would be after she left the Prodigy Battlefield. Now, she was only laying a firm foundation for the future.","But Chu Yunfan was different. After months of training, his cultivation level was extremely stable, and he was on the verge of breaking through to the peak Middle Arcana Stage.","Once he reached the peak Middle Arcana Stage, his strength would have a shocking leap. At that time, it would be the time for him to fight Jun Tianci.","“Hmm?” Tang Siyu’s eyes flew open, looking shocked. With a leap, she left the Mountain River Diagram.."]},{"number":2198,"title":"Chapter 2198: Breakthrough, Peak Middle Arcana Stage","paragraphs":["Chapter 2198: Breakthrough, Peak Middle Arcana Stage","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Tang Siyu leaped out and saw that the entire sky was dark. Above the sky, an incomparably huge barrier was opened.","At the same time, chains fell from the sky like raindrops. They shot out from the depths of the sky and landed on the ground. One of them shot straight into Tang Siyu.","“Not good! ”","Tang Siyu knew that this was bad, but she had no way to dodge the chains. She quickly returned to the Mountain River Diagram and began to circulate her energy.","After a long time, a sound like metal breaking came from her body. Tang Siyu opened her eyes and let out a long sigh.","“Were those the Karma Chains mentioned in the ancient records on the Prodigy Battlefield?”","Tang Siyu remembered that before she left, the Elder Princess had summoned her and mentioned some things to take note of on the battlefield. One of them were the Karma Chains on the battlefield.","The Prodigy Battlefield opened once every few hundred years. Why were there some prodigies who could not leave in time and could not leave again?","With their cultivation, it was not a problem for them to live for hundreds of years. However, they could never leave the Prodigy Battlefield again.","The natives on the Prodigy Battlefield were the descendants of these prodigies.","It was precisely because of these Karma Chains that every time the Prodigy Battlefield was about to close, Karma Chains would fall from the sky. As time passed, more and more Karma Chains would fall.","These Karma Chains did not harm people, but they would cause karma","between people and the Prodigy Battlefield. The more Karma Chains accumulated, the more they would be unable to leave the Prodigy Battlefield.","They would be locked in the battlefield by the Karma Chains and would never be able to leave.","The natives on the Prodigy Battlefield already had these Karma Chains in their bodies, so they had no way of leaving the Prodigy Battlefield.","And every time this happened, it meant that it was time for these foreign prodigies to leave the Prodigy Battlefield. Because there were only one or two Karma Chains, she could still break them with a secret technique.","However, if there were thousands of Karma Chains, she would not be able to break them. At that time, she would be left in the Prodigy Battlefield forever.","Tang Siyu frowned slightly and glanced at Chu Yunfan, who was in seclusion.","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan’s aura became stronger and stronger, turning into a terrifying storm around him.","Chu Yunfan was on the verge of breaking through. The mana fluctuations on his body were getting stronger and stronger, and the last bit of the Brahma Fruit in his body was being dissolved.","It became nourishment for his breakthrough!","Boom!","A terrifying aura suddenly erupted from Chu Yunfan’s body. After a moment, the raging aura was completely restrained.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan opened his eyes again and looked straight ahead. A bright light shot out from them.","“Finally, I’ve reached the peak Middle Arcana Stage!’","Chu Yunfan stretched, and his entire body crackled.","After breaking through to the peak Middle Arcana Stage, he would be able to put up a fight even against peak Major Arcanes.","He even had absolute hope of winning.","He was able to protect himself from peak Major Arcane Supreme Youths. Now, he could defeat them, or even kill them.","His combat strength had increased by more than two times. It could even be said that it had increased by at least three times.","This threefold increase was not just an increase on the surface. In reality, his combat strength had increased exponentially compared to before.","Originally, he was not Tang Siyu’s match, but now, Tang Siyu was definitely not his match.","However, he immediately sensed the changes in the world. That feeling of oppression even made him feel a little depressed.","“What’s going on?” Chu Yunfan leaped out and appeared in the Prodigy Battlefield.","At this moment, the Karma Chains were still falling from the sky. One of the Karma Chains instantly sank into Chu Yunfan’s body.","However, Chu Yunfan showed no fear and instantly cut off the Karma Chain.","This Karma Chains could not do anything to him.","Unlike Tang Siyu, who needed to hide and meditate to break the Karma Chains, Chu Yunfan was much stronger than her, so he could easily break the Karma Chains.","The gap between the two sides was incomparable.","“Those are Karma Chains. The Prodigy Battlefield is about to close!” Tang Siyu came up behind Chu Yunfan. Only then did Chu Yunfan know that the Prodigy Battlefield was about to close.","“In that case, we don’t have much time left!” Chu Yunfan frowned slightly. “l don’t care about the others, but Jun Tianci must die. If he gets out, it will be very difficult to kill him. We have to kill him before he leaves!’","Chu Yunfan was very clear that once Jun Tianci left the battlefield, he would definitely be protected by the Destiny Sect. The Destiny Sect would not allow such a rare Supreme Youth to be in danger.","At that time, Chu Yunfan would have to wait for a long time to find another opportunity to kill him.","“But the Prodigy Battlefield is huge. It’ll be difficult to find him!” Chu Yunfan mused.","Everything was under his control, but the sudden closure of the Prodigy Battlefield was beyond his expectations. “l have a way to find him!” Tang Siyu said.","“How?” Chu Yunfan said.","“I’ve fought him before,” Tang Siyu said calmly, “Although I lost miserably, I left a secret mark on him. I just never activated it because once I activated it, he would immediately notice it. So I never activated that secret mark. But now we can activate it. We don’t have much time anyway!’","It turned out that Tang Siyu had already planned to fight Jun Tianci again, and even kill him in the future. Therefore, she had a backup plan.","However, she had never used this backup plan because Jun Tianci would immediately notice it once it was used. But now, there was not much time left for them.","“It doesn’t matter if the time is short. Although the Prodigy Battlefield is huge, with our speed, we can get to him quickly!” Chu Yunfan said. He had the Prismatic Traveller, so he was naturally as fast as lightning.","“Okay.” Tang Siyu nodded and hurriedly formed a seal.","A wave of divine power swept out from her body and turned into a faint line in the sky. The other end of the line was naturally Jun Tianci’s direction.","“Let’s go and kill Jun Tianci!” Chu Yunfan said.."]},{"number":2199,"title":"Chapter 2199: Who Is the Prey and Who Is the Hunter?","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","At this moment, the world was in chaos as if it was the dusk of the gods.","From time to time, Karma Chains would fall from the heavens and earth, piercing into the bodies of those prodigies like sharp arrows.","The ordinary natives on the battlefield were fearless. These Karma Chains would not harm them. They would just be locked in this world and could not leave.","There were already many Karma Chains in their bodies. It didn’t matter if they had more.","To the prodigies from outside, this was a fatal threat. Once they accumulated too many Karma Chains, they would not even be able to leave the battlefield.","These natives were the best proof. Their ancestors were all prodigies who could not leave the Prodigy Battlefield due to various accidents.","Naturally, none of these foreign prodigies were willing to stay and become a part of the Prodigy Battlefield.","As time passed, more and more Karma Chains fell, faster and faster, and more and more densely packed.","Many foreign prodigies rushed out frantically at the first moment, wanting to leave the Prodigy Battlefield as soon as possible.","The more Karma Chains fell, the more difficult it would be for them to leave the Prodigy Battlefield.","However, because the closing of the Prodigy Battlefield was different every time, even if these prodigies wanted to leave early, it would be difficult. If they left early, they wouldn’t be able to get a share of many fortuitous encounters.","In the middle of a desert, an incomparably huge array slowly activated. Around the array, many powerful figures were pacing back and forth, maintaining the array in different corners.","“Stop them! We can’t let the two of them leave the battlefield! The young lord has ordered them to be killed!” one of the figures said loudly.","These people were natives of the Prodigy Battlefield, and the target they were blocking were clearly outsider prodigies.","In the end, the plot was revealed.","However, just as he finished speaking, a bolt of lightning turned into an arrow and shot him in the head, causing him to collapse.","In the sky. more and more Karma Chains fell down. Many of them landed on","these different figures. They were all fearless and weren’t afraid of these Karma Chains.","However, immediately after, a loud rumble sounded from the array formation. Terrifying explosions surged out one after another.","Spurt!","One of the figures spat out a mouthful of blood. His body was like a kite with a broken string as he flew backward.","After the first one, there was a second and a third. Everyone was sent flying one after another, spitting out blood as they were heavily injured.","Boom!","A massive explosion sounded out as the array formation finally could not bear the burden. It could not withstand the internal damage of someone and exploded with a bang, turning into a rain of light that filled the sky and dissipated.","In the rain of light, a man and a woman appeared. They were Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu.","The two of them were trapped in the array. They had chased after Jun Tianci’s trail, but they had fallen into a trap and were surrounded by the native experts.","To think that all of these natives were Major Arcanes! Such a lineup was truly shocking! Even if an ordinary prodigy was a peak Major Arcane, they would still be defeated by such a formation.","Even a Supreme Youth had a very high chance of dying here.","They were caught off guard.","Unfortunately, they had met Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu.","Tang Siyu’s divine power alone was immeasurable. She was already one of the very few Supreme Youths.","Not to mention Chu Yunfan. After breaking through to the peak of the Middle Arcana Stage, his strength had reached a level that ordinary experts could not imagine.","Although they were trapped in the array, they shattered the array in a short time. The experts who were in charge of the array suffered a backlash and were instantly heavily injured.","Chu Yunfan’s expression was cold as he looked at these native experts who were attacking him. At first, he was a little puzzled as to why he was so coincidentally blocked by these native experts.","However, Tang Siyu’s words made him instantly understand that these native experts were not necessarily here to capture him. Instead, they were here to capture all the foreign geniuses who passed by. Whoever passed by would be trapped in the activated array formation.","They didn’t have a specific target, and Chu Yunfan was only targeted by coincidence.","And these native experts did this naturally not because they had lost their minds or gone crazy. They were all acting under the orders of their masters behind them.","The masters behind them were powerful prodigies, and most of them were foreign prodigies.","The Prodigy Battlefield had been opened countless times, and many rules had long been understood. Therefore, many people had left behind a backup plan. In the Prodigy Battlefield, who knew how many factions had developed? Every time they entered the Prodigy Battlefield, they could mobilize these factions.","In particular, they mobilized the elites to specifically kill those prodigies who tried to leave the Prodigy Battlefield. If they could not kill them, they would be trapped until the Prodigy Battlefield closed.","This was considered eliminating the opponent and pulling out the weeds in advance.","Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu just happened to enter their hunting area and became their prey.","However, they did not expect their prey to be so ferocious. Now that they were being hunted, it was a complete reversal of who was the hunter and who the prey.","Chu Yunfan opened his arms, and his blue lightning power turned into a longbow. On the longbow, dozens of powerful lightning bolts turned into arrows.","Whoosh!","Whoosh!","Whoosh!","The terrifying arrow light pierced through the sky and instantly killed these native experts. They were instantly blown up by Chu Yunfan.","“Let’s get out of here quickly. My senses are getting weaker and weaker. Jun Tianci must have discovered the mark I left behind and is removing it. The mark 1 left behind won’t last long!” Tang Siyu said urgently.","Chu Yunfan grabbed Tang Siyu’s waist and disappeared from the spot.","A moment later, many prodigies who were passing by saw the messy battlefield and were shocked. Clearly, someone had set up an ambush here. However, from the mess on the battlefield, it could be seen that they had clearly kicked a hornet’s nest and were wiped out.","However, they did not have the mood to think too much about it. They hurriedly stepped on the light and left the scene one after another, swarming toward the exit of the Prodigy Battlefield.."]},{"number":2200,"title":"Chapter 2200: Jun Tianci’s Sense of Crisis","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu traveled as fast as lightning. In just a moment, they stopped in front of a huge mountain range.","“Since you’re already here, why don’t you come out and face me?” Chu Yunfan called out.","Tang Siyu was also expressionless as she looked ahead.","As soon as Chu Yunfan finished speaking, dozens of figures appeared in the sky. Each figure had a power that could destroy the world.","Each of them looked so terrifying, like gods in the sky.","“Peak Major Arcana Stage!’","Chu Yunfan looked at the people before him. Every single one of them was a peak Major Arcane.","Usually, it was rare to see such experts on the Prodigy Battlefield. However, there were actually so many of them now.","There were at least 30 peak Major Arcanes here. Such a lineup was enough to scare anyone to death.","Among them, the leader was none other than Chu Yunfan’s mortal enemy, Jun Tianci.","Beside Jun Tianci stood a tall man with stern eyebrows and twinkling eyes.","This man’s cultivation was not inferior to Jun Tianci’s.","“It’s Lu Yixian!” Tang Siyu said.","Chu Yunfan immediately knew who the person in front of him was. The leader of the Destint Alliance was a prodigy of a certain generation in the distant past. His strength and talent were not inferior to Jun Tianci. In fact, he was even more experienced than Jun Tianci.","Chu Yunfan instantly understood where Jun Tianci had found so many top-notch experts. It turned out that the Destiny Alliance and the Monarch Alliance had joined forces.","Jun Tianci had just formed the Monarch Alliance. Even though there were some powerful beings in the alliance, it was impossible for them to gather so many peak Major Arcanes. The only way to do so was to make use of the Destiny Alliance’s connections.","Unlike the Monarch Alliance, the Destiny Alliance had been established for countless years, and they were extremely powerful in the Prodigy Battlefield. With the accumulation of so many generations, it was only normal for them to have so many peak Major Arcanes.","Chu Yunfan looked around. Apart from Jun Tianci and Lu Yixian, everyone else was a native of the battlefield.","They were all experts that the Destiny Sect had accumulated over the years. Now, to surround and kill Chu Yunfan, they had all appeared.","As for the other prodigies from the Destiny Sect, they didn’t appear. They knew that with their strength, it was impossible for them to do anything to","Chu Yunfan.","Obviously, Jun Tianci had taken action after Tang Siyu activated the secret mark to track him down. He had joined forces with Lu Yixian to set up an ambush.","“I didn’t expect you to be so bold!” Chu Yunfan sneered. “Even though you knew you were being tracked, you didn’t leave quickly and set up an ambush instead!”","Even Chu Yunfan couldn’t help but sigh. Jun Tianci’s courage was indeed boundless. He was so bold when he didn’t even know who was tracking him.","It also showed how confident he was!","In addition to Lu Yixian and the dozens of peak Major Arcanes, it was more than enough to kill any of the Supreme Youths. It would be useless even if there was one more.","“That’s still not as bold as you!” Jun Tianci glared. He sized up Chu Yunfan and confirmed that he had never met him before.","A person’s appearance could be changed, but it was difficult to change one’s aura. Everyone was unique. As long as he had met Chu Yunfan, he would remember it.","However, he didn’t know that Chu Yunfan had a secret technique that could change his aura. Unless he willingly exposed himself, there was no danger of being exposed.","This was the question that Jun Tianci had been wondering about. He had heard of Jian Wuchen’s name a long time ago.","After all, Jian Wuchen dared to cause trouble for the Destiny Sect. No matter what the reason was, this was undoubtedly something that ordinary people wouldn’t even dare to think about.","The strength of the Destiny Sect in the Prodigy Battlefield was outstanding. However, compared to the strength of the outside world, it was simply the tip of the iceberg.","As the number one sect in the world, the Destiny Sect could be said to be able to cover the sky with one hand in the outside world. They were incomparably powerful.","Jian Wuchen wouldn’t have chosen to fight against such a huge force as long as he wasn’t stupid.","However, from the moment Jian Wuchen appeared before everyone, he had been attacking the Destiny Sect.","Ever since then, the Destiny Sect had kept checking the records of various eras, but they had never heard of this person called Jian Wuchen.","In the end, he could only conclude that Jun Tianci had offended a prodigy.","Now, Jun Tianci had personally confirmed that he didn’t know him. At least, he hadn’t met him before. It was possible that some of Jian Wuchen’s friends and family had died at Jun Tianci’s hands.","Even Jun Tianci himself wasn’t clear about this. Too many people had died at his hands, and many of them were prodigies who had once fought against him.","There were simply countless of them. Since that was the case, there was no need to calculate so clearly.","“I’m curious. I don’t think I know you, and I don’t know why you’re chasing after me. But it doesn’t matter. I’ll just get rid of you all!” Jun Tianci shrugged.","He didn’t care why Chu Yunfan was chasing after him. What he really cared about was Chu Yunfan’s rocket-like speed of improvement.","Both he and Tang Siyu were the cream of the crop among the current generation of prodigies. Among this generation of prodigies, both of them were as rare as phoenix feathers and qilin horns. It had taken them such a long time to reach the peak Major Arcana Stage.","However, Chu Yunfan’s cultivation base was even lower than his at the start, and he had only entered the Prodigy Battlefield many years later. Now, his cultivation base was on par with peak Major Arcane Supreme Youths.","If he continued to grow, his future would be limitless. The other Supreme Youths were afraid of him. They might become competitors in the future. However, to him, it was an existence that threatened him.","For him, this was the first time. Even the previous top ranker of the Prodigy List, Chu Yunfan, who had boasted of being able to compete with him in the future, was not in his eyes. After entering the Prodigy Battlefield, he dared to shout such an ancient slogan.","What kind of proud person was he? Now, he was even more shocked by the speed of Chu Yunfan’s rise.","A strong sense of crisis arose.","To him, this was a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity. No matter what kind of grudges he had in the past, he could end it here.."]}]);
